# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-09-24 20:05

# game/Story04.rpy:22
translate chinese story05_e71892f9:

    # "Two hours until the operation begins."
    "距离行动开始还有两小时。"

# game/Story04.rpy:26
translate chinese story05_a2a44756:

    # k "Brings back memories, huh, sis?"
    k "勾起回忆了吧，姐妹？"

# game/Story04.rpy:27
translate chinese story05_86b2eee3:

    # a "Hmpf..."
    a "哼……"

# game/Story04.rpy:29
translate chinese story05_e2ec82b9:

    # Fl "I know I have no right to ask you for this."
    Fl "我知道我没资格求你们做这件事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:30
translate chinese story05_621b15bc:

    # Fl "This mission is practically suicide, and-"
    Fl "这次任务基本就是送死，而且——"

# game/Story04.rpy:32
translate chinese story05_74fe7873:

    # mc "Flora, that’s enough."
    mc "弗洛拉，够了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:33
translate chinese story05_c821c7fa:

    # mc "Every one of us made our choice long before we walked into this room."
    mc "我们每个人，早在踏进这间屋子之前就做完了选择。"

# game/Story04.rpy:34
translate chinese story05_7e421a4f:

    # h "Saving a planet… yeah, that’s definitely a first for us, right, [mc]?"
    h "救一颗星球……是啊，这对我们来说绝对是头一回，对吧，[mc]？"

# game/Story04.rpy:35
translate chinese story05_cf1adef2:

    # mc "Yeah."
    mc "是啊。"

# game/Story04.rpy:40
translate chinese story05_141247b5:

    # Fl "All right. Then we begin."
    Fl "好。那就开始。"

# game/Story04.rpy:42
translate chinese story05_fee9d9a4:

    # Fl "The Peacekeepers will act as the decoys. They’ll draw the main strike."
    Fl "维和部队负责当诱饵。他们会吸引主力打击。"

# game/Story04.rpy:43
translate chinese story05_4a7ab27a:

    # Fl "The Syndicate teams will evacuate survivors to the lower city."
    Fl "辛迪加小队负责把幸存者撤往下城。"

# game/Story04.rpy:46
translate chinese story05_3c1abf65:

    # Fl "My father’s special units will move into the gas chambers with cryo-units-"
    Fl "我父亲的特种小队会带着冷冻装置进入毒气室——"

# game/Story04.rpy:47
translate chinese story05_48b3c9fa:

    # Fl "to freeze the enemy all at once."
    Fl "一口气把敌人冻住。"

# game/Story04.rpy:48
translate chinese story05_8f5baec2:

    # a "Not confident in the plan?"
    a "对这计划没信心？"

# game/Story04.rpy:49
translate chinese story05_41da62cb:

    # Fl "..."
    Fl "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:53
translate chinese story05_f197dd9e:

    # Mi "What is our role?"
    Mi "我们的任务是什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:54
translate chinese story05_ceb183de:

    # Fl "Meanwhile, your squad will head for the tower."
    Fl "同时，你们小队去高塔。"

# game/Story04.rpy:57
translate chinese story05_89bf4f90:

    # Fl "If what we learned is true, if they really plan to turn us into an energy source..."
    Fl "要是我们查到的是真的，要是他们真打算把我们变成能量源……"

# game/Story04.rpy:58
translate chinese story05_da8db7f9:

    # Fl "then whatever it costs, you have to stop them."
    Fl "那不管代价是什么，你们都得阻止他们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:60
translate chinese story05_d4b52993:

    # mc "How do we get into the tower?"
    mc "我们怎么进高塔？"

# game/Story04.rpy:61
translate chinese story05_ebfd83de:

    # Fl "By air."
    Fl "走空中。"

# game/Story04.rpy:62
translate chinese story05_b83c377b:

    # a "The main tower, an impregnable fortress."
    a "主塔，一座攻不破的堡垒。"

# game/Story04.rpy:63
translate chinese story05_0271bbcc:

    # a "Any unauthorized ship will be shot down by the internal AA system."
    a "任何未经许可的飞船都会被内部防空系统击落。"

# game/Story04.rpy:64
translate chinese story05_8f067e9a:

    # Fl "You’ll go in through the lower cargo routes-"
    Fl "你们从下层货运通道进去——"

# game/Story04.rpy:65
translate chinese story05_f4bbc62b:

    # a "No chance."
    a "没戏。"

# game/Story04.rpy:66
translate chinese story05_e6d7945a:

    # a "Too slow. Too dangerous."
    a "太慢。太危险。"

# game/Story04.rpy:68
translate chinese story05_72c76da9:

    # Fl "Arcana’s unit will cover you with fire support. We’ll disable part of their AA."
    Fl "阿卡纳的部队会给你们提供火力掩护。我们会瘫痪他们一部分防空。"

# game/Story04.rpy:70
translate chinese story05_2d3140aa:

    # Fl "And… Ember has offered her personal cruiser."
    Fl "还有……恩伯提供了她的私人巡洋舰。"

# game/Story04.rpy:71
translate chinese story05_629d25eb:

    # Fl "With it, you’ll break through. Any questions?"
    Fl "靠它，你们能突进去。有问题吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:72
translate chinese story05_bb8e4b4e:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:75
translate chinese story05_ed2fe8c7:

    # Fl "Good. Then one last thing."
    Fl "好。那最后一件事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:76
translate chinese story05_4a7166e1:

    # Fl "Your most important mission."
    Fl "你们最重要的任务。"

# game/Story04.rpy:78
translate chinese story05_336880a4:

    # Fl "Come back alive."
    Fl "活着回来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:79
translate chinese story05_05a37188:

    # Fl "All of you."
    Fl "你们所有人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:81
translate chinese story05_cbab612b:

    # h "We’ll do everything we can, but-"
    h "我们会尽全力，可是——"

# game/Story04.rpy:82
translate chinese story05_da3fdbf1:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:83
translate chinese story05_cf1adef2_1:

    # mc "Yeah."
    mc "嗯。"

# game/Story04.rpy:84
translate chinese story05_a31c8b7e:

    # k "Pff. What happened to all that fire? Come on, this is where the fun starts."
    k "噗。那股火呢？来吧，好戏这才开场。"

# game/Story04.rpy:85
translate chinese story05_e93cc8aa:

    # h "Crazy…"
    h "疯子……"

# game/Story04.rpy:87
translate chinese story05_e1ae7e88:

    # k "If you’re that scared, you can hide behind my back. Actually, nah. You’d just keep whining."
    k "你要是那么怕，可以躲我背后。算了，不行。你只会一直哼哼。"

# game/Story04.rpy:88
translate chinese story05_78486174:

    # h "Huh?"
    h "啊？"

# game/Story04.rpy:89
translate chinese story05_f53bb6a4:

    # k "In the end… if not us, then who?"
    k "说到底……要不是我们，还能是谁？"

# game/Story04.rpy:92
translate chinese story05_e61ade48:

    # mc "Everyone here has something they’re trying to protect."
    mc "这儿的每个人都有想护住的东西。"

# game/Story04.rpy:93
translate chinese story05_ed8f611a:

    # mc "We can’t let them down."
    mc "我们不能让他们失望。"

# game/Story04.rpy:94
translate chinese story05_f15422b6:

    # L "Yes. If they’re putting in that much effort… then we should, too."
    L "对。既然他们付出了那么多……我们也该如此。"

# game/Story04.rpy:96
translate chinese story05_714de269:

    # Fl "(They don’t owe us this. If anything, it’s we who should be...)"
    Fl "（他们不欠我们的。真要说，该是我们……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:97
translate chinese story05_4e0689d9:

    # Fl "(And yet…)"
    Fl "（可即便如此……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:99
translate chinese story05_1e67f78f:

    # Fl "(No. Not now. Focus. You can repay them later, when this is over.)"
    Fl "（不。不是现在。专注。等这事结束，你再报答他们。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:100
translate chinese story05_b2b7a84b:

    # Fl "(Right now we need to do everything we possibly can… and we succeed.)"
    Fl "（现在我们得把能做的都做尽……然后成功。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:102
translate chinese story05_65c709cc:

    # Fl "(whisper) Yes… we will succeed. All of us."
    Fl "（低声）对……我们会成功。我们所有人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:105
translate chinese story05_61306a86:

    # g "Good luck."
    g "祝好运。"

# game/Story04.rpy:111
translate chinese story05_05dda99f:

    # mc "Likewise."
    mc "彼此彼此。"

# game/Story04.rpy:112
translate chinese story05_1e6136ef:

    # g "It’s been an honor working with you."
    g "跟你们共事，是我的荣幸。"

# game/Story04.rpy:116
translate chinese story05_987c2bdd:

    # "Ten minutes until the operation begins."
    "距离行动开始还有十分钟。"

# game/Story04.rpy:117
translate chinese story05_b69d5494:

    # g "Miss Flora."
    g "弗洛拉小姐。"

# game/Story04.rpy:118
translate chinese story05_bfcb6309:

    # Fl "Y-yeah… it’s time."
    Fl "嗯、嗯……时间到了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:122
translate chinese story05_9dbb7b13:

    # Fl "Attention, everyone."
    Fl "所有人注意。"

# game/Story04.rpy:123
translate chinese story05_1ca6c560:

    # Fl "The western front is moving. Your task is to cover the evacuation, hold the line, and execute the plan."
    Fl "西线已经动了。你们的任务是掩护撤离、守住阵线、执行计划。"

# game/Story04.rpy:125
translate chinese story05_63124ae9:

    # Fl "Mistakes are unacceptable. You know your roles, act fast and act precise."
    Fl "不许出错。你们清楚各自的职责，动作要快，要精准。"

# game/Story04.rpy:127
translate chinese story05_6b98cccf:

    # Fl "The fate of many is at stake. We can’t afford hesitation."
    Fl "很多人的命运系于此。我们没有犹豫的余地。"

# game/Story04.rpy:129
translate chinese story05_884e5813:

    # Fl "Begin the operation."
    Fl "行动开始。"

# game/Story04.rpy:134
translate chinese story05_ce985e4b:

    # "One hour into the operation."
    "行动开始一小时后。"

# game/Story04.rpy:139
translate chinese story05_77e85994:

    # aa "Sixty-Three to command… We’re not holding! There’s too many of them!"
    aa "六十三号呼叫指挥部……我们顶不住了！它们太多了！"

# game/Story04.rpy:142
translate chinese story05_2db6b80d:

    # a "Command to Sixty-Three. Status?!"
    a "指挥部呼叫六十三号。报告状态？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:146
translate chinese story05_bbf346a0:

    # aaa "Mission failed, enemy numbers are overwhelming! Requesting evac-!"
    aaa "任务失败，敌军数量压倒性！请求撤离——！"

# game/Story04.rpy:150
translate chinese story05_c684e829:

    # a "Sixty-Three? …Sixty-Three!!"
    a "六十三号？……六十三号！！"

# game/Story04.rpy:152
translate chinese story05_164b07a0:

    # a "Connection to Squad Sixty-Three is lost."
    a "与六十三号小队的连接已中断。"

# game/Story04.rpy:156
translate chinese story05_131392a3:

    # aaaa "Iron Dome to command. We’ve spotted survivors. Orders?"
    aaaa "铁穹呼叫指挥部。我们发现幸存者。请指示？"

# game/Story04.rpy:157
translate chinese story05_b072667f:

    # a "Sending transport to the marked coordinates."
    a "派运输船前往标记坐标。"

# game/Story04.rpy:158
translate chinese story05_0d019945:

    # a "Continue your route."
    a "继续你的路线。"

# game/Story04.rpy:162
translate chinese story05_683a3671:

    # a "Miss Flora, western sector made contact with the enemy. Heavy resistance."
    a "弗洛拉小姐，西区已与敌接触。抵抗激烈。"

# game/Story04.rpy:163
translate chinese story05_3f5fc691:

    # a "They’re calling for backup, numbers are too high."
    a "他们在呼叫增援，敌人数量太多。"

# game/Story04.rpy:166
translate chinese story05_ed5e33db:

    # Fl "Send a few squads from the east. They need to hold until backup arrives."
    Fl "从东边调几个小队过去。他们得撑到增援抵达。"

# game/Story04.rpy:167
translate chinese story05_1703b7e0:

    # Fl "(I thought I was ready. I really did. I thought it would be like the simulations.)"
    Fl "（我以为我准备好了。真的。我以为会跟模拟一样。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:168
translate chinese story05_570e3496:

    # Fl "(I thought Mom was wrong, but-)"
    Fl "（我以为妈妈错了，可是——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:171
translate chinese story05_e1845ba2:

    # aa "Thirty-Eighth reports AA guns northwest!"
    aa "三十八号报告，西北方向有防空炮！"

# game/Story04.rpy:174
translate chinese story05_334ced28:

    # Fl "Arcana platoon, transmitting the coordinates."
    Fl "阿卡纳排，传送坐标。"

# game/Story04.rpy:175
translate chinese story05_d3003e87:

    # aaa "Copy. Working."
    aaa "收到。执行中。"

# game/Story04.rpy:184
translate chinese story05_9bfcd75b:

    # aaa "Target neutralized. Runway is clear for the bird."
    aaa "目标已清除。跑道已为大鸟清空。"

# game/Story04.rpy:185
translate chinese story05_7467db5a:

    # Fl "Good work."
    Fl "干得好。"

# game/Story04.rpy:186
translate chinese story05_275207dc:

    # Fl "(The screaming. The pain. All of it…)"
    Fl "（那些尖叫。那些痛苦。所有的一切……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:187
translate chinese story05_f2679feb:

    # Fl "(I’m sorry, Dad. I can’t, I can’t take this.)"
    Fl "（对不起，爸。我受不了，我真的受不了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:188
translate chinese story05_4834e3f8:

    # Fl "(whispering) I want to run."
    Fl "（低声）我想跑。"

# game/Story04.rpy:191
translate chinese story05_8592b5dd:

    # Fl "Any updates from the other sectors? Did anyone respond to our signal?"
    Fl "其他区有消息吗？有人回应我们的信号吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:192
translate chinese story05_d8cdd4ae:

    # a "Nothing, Miss Flora. Might be something else jamming them."
    a "没有，弗洛拉小姐。可能是别的东西在干扰他们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:195
translate chinese story05_04f36b31:

    # Fl "(This is bad. We’re short on people, short on supplies. They’re holding on morale alone… and that runs out.)"
    Fl "（糟了。人手不够，物资不够。他们全靠士气撑着……而士气会用完的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:196
translate chinese story05_fd01d515:

    # Fl "(Everything’s against us… Hope-)"
    Fl "（一切都跟我们作对……希望——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:198
translate chinese story05_41da62cb_1:

    # Fl "..."
    Fl "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:201
translate chinese story05_2d61269a:

    # Fl "(whispering) Focus. We still have a chance."
    Fl "（低声）专注。我们还有机会。"

# game/Story04.rpy:202
translate chinese story05_bbb05453:

    # Fl "([mc], please… don’t let me down.)"
    Fl "（[mc]，求你……别让我失望。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:216
translate chinese story05_72615205:

    # mc "(As long as I can remember, I wanted a quiet, peaceful life.)"
    mc "（从我记事起，我就想要一种安静、平静的生活。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:217
translate chinese story05_1b253083:

    # mc "(When I came back from the army, I really thought I could make it real.)"
    mc "（退伍回来的时候，我真以为我能把它变成现实。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:218
translate chinese story05_f5ed906e:

    # mc "(A loving wife. A good family. A big house. Maybe a dog... the American dream done.)"
    mc "（一个爱我的妻子。一个好家庭。一栋大房子。也许再养条狗……美国梦齐活了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:220
translate chinese story05_5f067948:

    # mc "(But now I’m here. At the ass end of the galaxy. Why?)"
    mc "（可现在我在这种地方。在星系的屁眼里。为什么？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:221
translate chinese story05_39f3737c:

    # mc "(Because of Lora? ...Or because of the memories of her?)"
    mc "（因为洛拉？……还是因为关于她的那些记忆？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:222
translate chinese story05_c928614d:

    # mc "(Maybe because of Norman? So his sacrifice wouldn’t be for nothing?)"
    mc "（也许是因为诺曼？好让他的牺牲不白费？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:223
translate chinese story05_c924218f:

    # mc "(Or because of my own damn ego?)"
    mc "（还是因为我这该死的自尊？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:225
translate chinese story05_c2565da4:

    # mc "Olivia?"
    mc "奥利维亚？"

# game/Story04.rpy:227
translate chinese story05_40463722:

    # h "What do you want?"
    h "干嘛？"

# game/Story04.rpy:229
translate chinese story05_007b6cb2:

    # mc "How do you manage... not to lose your mind in all this?"
    mc "你是怎么……在这一切里没疯掉的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:232
translate chinese story05_de2ad01e:

    # h "Hold on, what makes you think that?"
    h "等等，你凭什么这么想？"

# game/Story04.rpy:233
translate chinese story05_ac9c80f2:

    # mc "I thought… you were the only one holding it together."
    mc "我以为……你是唯一一个还撑得住的人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:234
translate chinese story05_65d9a8ae:

    # mc "Acting like nothing’s worth worrying abou-"
    mc "装得好像没什么值得操心——"

# game/Story04.rpy:235
translate chinese story05_d39892ac:

    # h "Okay, stop right there. That was kinda rude."
    h "行了，打住。这话有点不客气。"

# game/Story04.rpy:237
translate chinese story05_8a8382ee:

    # h "Out of all the things you could’ve said… you went with THAT? Seriously?"
    h "那么多话你都能说……你偏偏挑了这句？认真的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:238
translate chinese story05_c67191ce:

    # h "You really think you’re the only one having a hard time here?"
    h "你真以为这儿就你一个人难过？"

# game/Story04.rpy:239
translate chinese story05_19260812:

    # h "Come on, don’t play the victim."
    h "得了吧，别演受害者。"

# game/Story04.rpy:240
translate chinese story05_ef002e09:

    # h "(What the hell are you doing, Olivia? Get a grip. He’s the guy who literally saved your life.)"
    h "（你干什么呢，奥利维亚？稳住。他可是实打实救过你命的人。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:241
translate chinese story05_17f52562:

    # h "Just pull yourself toge-"
    h "你就不能振作——"

# game/Story04.rpy:244
translate chinese story05_5541027e:

    # h "(Still… that stung.)"
    h "（不过……那话还是扎人。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:245
translate chinese story05_3a756648:

    # h "(I’m trying so damn hard to keep it together, doing everything I can, and that`s what I get back…?)"
    h "（我拼了命在撑，能做的都做了，换回来的就是这个……？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:246
translate chinese story05_1cb3e59c:

    # h "(He didn’t even mean it like that, so why am I getting pissed…?)"
    h "（他根本不是那个意思，我干嘛还上火……？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:250
translate chinese story05_9173c01d:

    # mc "(She’s… right, in a way.)"
    mc "（她……某方面说得对。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:251
translate chinese story05_ce159fb6:

    # mc "(For some reason, I thought I was the only one struggling, blind to everyone else’s feelings.)"
    mc "（不知怎么，我以为只有自己在挣扎，看不见别人的感受。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:252
translate chinese story05_4a71cf62:

    # mc "(And the worst part… I took their help for granted.)"
    mc "（最糟的是……我把他们的帮忙当成了理所应当。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:254
translate chinese story05_2b1982b6:

    # mc "You’re right."
    mc "你说得对。"

# game/Story04.rpy:255
translate chinese story05_b4697a8d:

    # mc "I really did start thinking I was the only one suffering here."
    mc "我确实开始觉得，这儿只有我一个人在受苦。"

# game/Story04.rpy:256
translate chinese story05_0ea2afe3:

    # h "No, that’s not what I meant-"
    h "不，我不是那个意思——"

# game/Story04.rpy:258
translate chinese story05_f5b634ed:

    # mc "I act like a damn superhero."
    mc "我表现得像个该死的超级英雄。"

# game/Story04.rpy:259
translate chinese story05_355c6886:

    # mc "Charging straight through, not thinking about consequences… not thinking about the people close to me."
    mc "一路往前冲，不想后果……也不想想身边的人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:260
translate chinese story05_2fded262:

    # h "..."
    h "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:261
translate chinese story05_cfff3b47:

    # mc "And the funniest part? From the very beginning…"
    mc "最可笑的是？从一开始……"

# game/Story04.rpy:262
translate chinese story05_636990c0:

    # mc "I never even thank you."
    mc "我连一句谢谢都没说过。"

# game/Story04.rpy:263
translate chinese story05_938720d6:

    # mc "Not once."
    mc "一次都没有。"

# game/Story04.rpy:265
translate chinese story05_7682655e:

    # h "Hey, hey! Cut the dramatic speech, will you? Did your age finally catch up with you or what?"
    h "喂，喂！别来这套煽情，行吗？你终于上年纪了还是怎么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:267
translate chinese story05_bf5792c7:

    # mc "I don’t know, Olivia. I really don’t. But… thank you."
    mc "我不知道，奥利维亚。真不知道。不过……谢谢你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:268
translate chinese story05_e68f167a:

    # mc "From the bottom of my heart. Thank you for always being there. For having my back…"
    mc "发自内心地。谢谢你一直在。谢谢你挺我……"

# game/Story04.rpy:270
translate chinese story05_2fded262_1:

    # h "..."
    h "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:274
translate chinese story05_cffc88e6:

    # h "{b}Doesn’t matter what’s happening around you, what matters is how YOU deal with it.{/b} Something like that. Take a page outta Anya’s book."
    h "{b}你周围发生什么不重要，重要的是你怎么应对。{/b}差不多是这个意思。跟安雅学学。"

# game/Story04.rpy:276
translate chinese story05_aedbbc76:

    # h "(She’s the one who kept us going more than anyone…)"
    h "（最让我们撑下去的人，其实是她……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:277
translate chinese story05_a1c6a1e6:

    # mc "{b}Everything depends on how you choose to look at it.{/b}"
    mc "{b}一切都取决于你选择怎么看。{/b}"

# game/Story04.rpy:278
translate chinese story05_03096016:

    # mc "You know… there’s something real in that."
    mc "你知道吗……这话里有真东西。"

# game/Story04.rpy:279
translate chinese story05_f0a464a7:

    # h "One thing she was always good at, talking sense into people. I’ll give her that."
    h "她一向擅长这个，把人给说通。这点我认。"

# game/Story04.rpy:281
translate chinese story05_69c25b65:

    # mc "Yeah..."
    mc "是啊……"

# game/Story04.rpy:282
translate chinese story05_1d1da93c:

    # mc "I wonder how she’s doing…"
    mc "不知道她过得怎么样……"

# game/Story04.rpy:284
translate chinese story05_b75a8170:

    # h "I… try not to think about it. But I’m sure she’s doing great. No doubt in my mind!"
    h "我……尽量不去想。但我确信她过得好。我心里一点都不怀疑！"

# game/Story04.rpy:286
translate chinese story05_7e6ab025:

    # mc "That’s a mindset."
    mc "这心态可以。"

# game/Story04.rpy:289
translate chinese story05_fb449025:

    # h "But you know… sometimes…"
    h "可你知道吗……有时候……"

# game/Story04.rpy:290
translate chinese story05_86a3cc0e:

    # h "I’m scared. Thinking we might not make it back. That Anya could end up al-"
    h "我怕。怕我们回不去。怕安雅最后孤零零——"

# game/Story04.rpy:291
translate chinese story05_9443bce4:

    # mc "At least she’s got Alexandro and his damn “crocodiles.” They won’t leave Anya to rot, that’s for sure."
    mc "至少她还有亚历杭德罗和他那帮该死的“鳄鱼”。他们不会扔下安雅不管，这点肯定。"

# game/Story04.rpy:295
translate chinese story05_2cdbea86:

    # h "Yeah… you’re right. {w}Right now, we need to focus on staying alive."
    h "嗯……你说得对。{w}现在，我们得先想着活下来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:296
translate chinese story05_fb8d9604:

    # h "And still, with all this chaos, I can’t wrap my head around one thing: out of all the people out there, why us?"
    h "可即便这么乱，我还是想不通一件事：那么多人，为什么偏偏是我们？"

# game/Story04.rpy:298
translate chinese story05_6a4e126d:

    # mc "I don’t know. I thought if I’d find Lora… I’d finally get answers. At least a piece of the truth."
    mc "不知道。我以为找到洛拉……就能得到答案。至少能拼出一点真相。"

# game/Story04.rpy:299
translate chinese story05_38562f03:

    # mc "In the end, nothing solid. Nothing real."
    mc "结果，什么都没有。没有一样是真的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:301
translate chinese story05_9b7815f0:

    # mc "They brought me back to life. On one hand… I’m grateful. On the other, this life isn’t any better than the last one."
    mc "他们把我救活了。一方面……我感激。另一方面，这条命也不比上一条好。"

# game/Story04.rpy:302
translate chinese story05_1a5cba91:

    # mc "In some ways… it’s worse."
    mc "某些方面……还更糟。"

# game/Story04.rpy:303
translate chinese story05_68271251:

    # mc "Sleep is a luxury. Every day could be my last. My body aches nonstop-"
    mc "睡觉都是奢侈。每一天都可能是最后一天。身体一直疼——"

# game/Story04.rpy:304
translate chinese story05_d418be5d:

    # mc "But the real question is… what the hell are we fighting for?"
    mc "但真正的问题是……我们到底他妈在为什么而战？"

# game/Story04.rpy:306
translate chinese story05_cfc6e3f1:

    # "At the same time, Miriel was reading a book, while quietly eavesdropping on their conversation."
    "与此同时，米莉尔一边看书，一边悄悄听着他们的对话。"

# game/Story04.rpy:307
translate chinese story05_f581d648:

    # "Deciding to stay silent, she went on reading… until her eyes caught a line."
    "她决定不出声，继续读着……直到目光落在一行字上。"

# game/Story04.rpy:308
translate chinese story05_1d6a1cfc:

    # "{b}It’s damn hard to talk calmly and kindly about pain…"
    "{b}要平静而温柔地谈论痛苦，真他妈的难……"

# game/Story04.rpy:311
translate chinese story05_d4640804:

    # Mi "({b}…until you’re free from her.{/b})"
    Mi "（{b}……直到你从她手里解脱。{/b}）"

# game/Story04.rpy:312
translate chinese story05_db1bfa5e:

    # Mi "(Whispering) Free..."
    Mi "（低声）解脱……"

# game/Story04.rpy:314
translate chinese story05_23e14c0b:

    # Mi "(He proved his worth… he did so much… and all he got was pain in return.)"
    Mi "（他证明了自己的价值……做了那么多……换回来的只有痛苦。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:316
translate chinese story05_8c5ccd66:

    # Mi "(whispering) Is this really what you taught me, Teacher…?"
    Mi "（低声）这就是你教我的吗，老师……？"

# game/Story04.rpy:318
translate chinese story05_9775b795:

    # Mi "(All my life, I followed your plans. And even now… I want to trust you, but-)"
    Mi "（我一辈子都在遵循你的计划。即便现在……我想信你，可是——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:321
translate chinese story05_c82b6010:

    # Mi "(No. This can’t keep going. They’ve proven enough. They deserve to know.)"
    Mi "（不。不能再这样下去了。他们已经证明够了。他们有权知道。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:322
translate chinese story05_9ade45e0:

    # h "Mir? Something wrong? You look way too serious."
    h "米尔？怎么了？你这表情太严肃了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:325
translate chinese story05_9bf04579:

    # Mi "(Even if just a part… I have to choose for myself.)"
    Mi "（哪怕只有一部分……我也得自己选一次。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:327
translate chinese story05_3455e181:

    # Mi "[mc]?"
    Mi "[mc]？"

# game/Story04.rpy:328
translate chinese story05_3f871f46:

    # mc "Hmm?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/Story04.rpy:329
translate chinese story05_e3978e0b:

    # Mi "When we were on the Ark… you touched a certain sphere."
    Mi "我们在方舟上的时候……你碰过一个球体。"

# game/Story04.rpy:330
translate chinese story05_4a89ad3c:

    # Mi "After that, you passed out. Do you remember?"
    Mi "那之后你就昏过去了。记得吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:332
translate chinese story05_ff3b3682:

    # mc "(Too sudden. Why is she bringing up the Ark now?)"
    mc "（太突然了。她怎么现在提起方舟？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:334
translate chinese story05_3c7bee43:

    # mc "(Sphere?)"
    mc "（球体？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:335
translate chinese story05_3f72f13f:

    # mc "Yeah. I remember. Not everything, but enough."
    mc "嗯。记得。不是全都记得，但够多了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:336
translate chinese story05_e69e1e7c:

    # Mi "When you left the team to look for the keycard, you wandered into the technical sector."
    Mi "你离队去找钥匙卡的时候，走进了技术区。"

# game/Story04.rpy:338
translate chinese story05_d2c45d6f:

    # mc "How do you… Yeah. I remember something like that."
    mc "你怎么……嗯。有这么回事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:339
translate chinese story05_2aa723f4:

    # mc "(The feelings I had back then… those memories…)"
    mc "（当时那些感觉……那些记忆……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:341
translate chinese story05_f9f9f109:

    # mc "(Memories?)"
    mc "（记忆？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:342
translate chinese story05_757a8ac4:

    # mc "(Wait… Could it be… the implants are back to normal?)"
    mc "（等等……难道……植入体恢复正常了？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:344
translate chinese story05_09f7e512:

    # h "Hold on, hold on, what are you two talking about? I was there too-"
    h "等等，等等，你们俩在说什么？我当时也在场——"

# game/Story04.rpy:346
translate chinese story05_b73e2d86:

    # Mi "No. Not that place. Another one. Where the experiments were actually conducted."
    Mi "不。不是那个地方。是另一个。真正做实验的地方。"

# game/Story04.rpy:348
translate chinese story05_11c1ae42:

    # mc "Experiments again? Because of this “immortality” crap?"
    mc "又是实验？因为那套“永生”的鬼话？"

# game/Story04.rpy:350
translate chinese story05_bddc88bb:

    # Mi "Yes."
    Mi "是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:351
translate chinese story05_ac76c981:

    # Mi "What they were experimenting on there… is the reason you suddenly became so important to everyone."
    Mi "他们在那里实验的东西……就是你突然对所有人变得这么重要的原因。"

# game/Story04.rpy:353
translate chinese story05_16b6005f:

    # mc "(That masked guy… he said something like this. Said I was connected to this? No way this is just about that sphere…)"
    mc "（那个戴面具的……他说过类似的话。说我跟这事有关联？不可能只是因为那个球体……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:354
translate chinese story05_4267080e:

    # mc "(The Abyss… Astoria’s younger “sister”… some other force with its own agenda…)"
    mc "（深渊……阿斯托里亚那个更年轻的“妹妹”……还有别的势力，打着自己的算盘……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:355
translate chinese story05_9781bb7c:

    # mc "(And somehow I’m stuck in the middle of this mess.)"
    mc "（而我不知怎么，就卡在这团乱麻正中间。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:358
translate chinese story05_bfc13893:

    # h "Okay, nope. I don’t like where this is going."
    h "好，不行。我不喜欢这走向。"

# game/Story04.rpy:359
translate chinese story05_8dc8f948:

    # h "What’s so damn special about this… sphere, or whatever it is, that everyone suddenly wants it?"
    h "这个……球体，管它是什么，到底他妈有什么特别，让所有人突然都想要？"

# game/Story04.rpy:360
translate chinese story05_51b80692:

    # Mi "That sphere was connected to the Gate."
    Mi "那个球体跟门相连。"

# game/Story04.rpy:361
translate chinese story05_73430d91:

    # Mi "And after you touched it, the Gate started reacting to you."
    Mi "你碰过之后，门就开始对你产生反应。"

# game/Story04.rpy:362
translate chinese story05_38a44d67:

    # h "What? That one?"
    h "什么？那道门？"

# game/Story04.rpy:364
translate chinese story05_cb611e72:

    # mc "(Think, [mc]. Think. I'm connected, but to what?)"
    mc "（想，[mc]。想。我有关联，可跟什么有关联？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:365
translate chinese story05_2e189f9a:

    # mc "(Ember… back then, in her room… she said they made it back to Earth through a gate. Is it inside the tower?)"
    mc "（恩伯……那时候在她房里……她说他们是通过一道门回到地球的。那道门在高塔里？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:367
translate chinese story05_3ee17288:

    # h "(And he’s spacing out again… whatever. Let him. We’ll give him a few minutes.)"
    h "（他又走神了……随便吧。让他去。给他几分钟。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:369
translate chinese story05_9ea75e1b:

    # mc "(I’m connected to the Gate?)"
    mc "（我跟门有关联？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:370
translate chinese story05_31c6064e:

    # mc "(whispering) No. That’s not it. Doesn’t add up."
    mc "（低声）不。不是这样。说不通。"

# game/Story04.rpy:371
translate chinese story05_5b59d25b:

    # mc "(The words of the white mask… the Abyss… a gate to the Abyss?)"
    mc "（白面具的话……深渊……一道通往深渊的门？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:373
translate chinese story05_d99fafb8:

    # mc "Can I actually get into the Abyss… somehow?"
    mc "我能真的进入深渊……某种方式？"

# game/Story04.rpy:375
translate chinese story05_bddc88bb_1:

    # Mi "Yes."
    Mi "能。"

# game/Story04.rpy:377
translate chinese story05_23c75bfb:

    # h "I’m losing the plot here, what are we talking about? The Abyss? Experiments? All that weird crap?"
    h "我跟不上了，我们在说什么？深渊？实验？那些鬼东西？"

# game/Story04.rpy:379
translate chinese story05_76542e04:

    # Mi "You and I… we’ve already spent time studying this."
    Mi "你和我……我们已经花时间研究过这个了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:381
translate chinese story05_62f21525:

    # h "You only mentioned the Abyss, like, twice! That’s it!"
    h "你就提过深渊，大概两次！就这些！"

# game/Story04.rpy:382
translate chinese story05_b394e43b:

    # h "And now I’m suddenly hearing that-"
    h "现在我突然听到说——"

# game/Story04.rpy:384
translate chinese story05_baa2b23b:

    # h "(No, no, calm down. She’s the first, maybe the only one, who actually told you the truth about what’s going on.)"
    h "（不，不，冷静。她是第一个，也许是唯一一个，真跟你说实话的人。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:385
translate chinese story05_7ad254b7:

    # h "(If you snap at her now… yeah, you’d look like a complete idiot.)"
    h "（你现在要是冲她发火……对，你就是个彻头彻尾的蠢货。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:387
translate chinese story05_97b9144b:

    # h "Alright. Fine."
    h "行。好吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:388
translate chinese story05_41119933:

    # h "So we’re going to this tower of yours… not to save the planet?"
    h "所以我们去你那个高塔……不是为了救星球？"

# game/Story04.rpy:390
translate chinese story05_64ebe67d:

    # Mi "We’ll prevent the gate from opening. We’ll save the planet."
    Mi "我们会阻止门打开。我们会救这颗星球。"

# game/Story04.rpy:392
translate chinese story05_24a516e0:

    # mc "What happens after that?"
    mc "那之后呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:394
translate chinese story05_642df0c2:

    # Mi "I’ll take you back home."
    Mi "我会带你们回家。"

# game/Story04.rpy:396
translate chinese story05_277629bc:

    # mc "(Home… but what about Lora… No. Don’t go there.)"
    mc "（家……可洛拉怎么办……不。别想这个。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:397
translate chinese story05_656c9ebe:

    # mc "(Lora seems like she belongs here now anyway.)"
    mc "（反正洛拉现在看着像是属于这儿的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:398
translate chinese story05_3244e6ee:

    # mc "(And yet… I can’t just leave her like this… Or can I?)"
    mc "（可……我没法就这么扔下她……还是能？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:400
translate chinese story05_afd74152:

    # mc "What do you think?"
    mc "你怎么想？"

# game/Story04.rpy:401
translate chinese story05_7ea22281:

    # h "I’m in. This place is… fine, I guess, but I don’t wanna have anything to do with it anymore. No offense, Mir."
    h "我加入。这地方……还行吧，我猜，但我不想再跟它有任何瓜葛了。别介意，米尔。"

# game/Story04.rpy:403
translate chinese story05_f0ddcf5c:

    # Mi "I understand."
    Mi "我理解。"

# game/Story04.rpy:404
translate chinese story05_49a3aa6b:

    # Mi "(whispering) If it were my choice… I would’ve left this place long ago."
    Mi "（低声）要是能选……我早就离开这地方了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:406
translate chinese story05_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:408
translate chinese story05_ccce457f:

    # mc "Then come with us."
    mc "那就跟我们走。"

# game/Story04.rpy:409
translate chinese story05_99475aef:

    # Mi "I…"
    Mi "我……"

# game/Story04.rpy:411
translate chinese story05_61ec77c1:

    # mc "I’m not forcing you. But I’m serious, think about it."
    mc "我不是逼你。但我是认真的，考虑一下。"

# game/Story04.rpy:413
translate chinese story05_bbd9e8af:

    # h "Totally agree."
    h "完全同意。"

# game/Story04.rpy:415
translate chinese story05_db1500bd:

    # Mi "I’ll think about it."
    Mi "我会考虑的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:419
translate chinese story05_da3fdbf1_1:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:420
translate chinese story05_e1f098e0:

    # mc "(They’re nervous. Both of them.)"
    mc "（她们紧张。两个都是。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:421
translate chinese story05_1497d60c:

    # mc "(And I’m no exception… We need a break.)"
    mc "（我也不例外……我们需要歇口气。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:424
translate chinese story05_c2565da4_1:

    # mc "Olivia?"
    mc "奥利维亚？"

# game/Story04.rpy:425
translate chinese story05_a82ed3b0:

    # h "Yeah?"
    h "嗯？"

# game/Story04.rpy:426
translate chinese story05_57e5ccbf:

    # mc "Remember when you used to run around the city, dragging people into that bar? Acting like it was the end of the world."
    mc "还记得你以前满城跑，把人往那家酒吧里拽？搞得好像世界末日一样。"

# game/Story04.rpy:428
translate chinese story05_4c2d36cf:

    # h "That bar had a name! But yeah, I remember. And honestly…"
    h "那家酒吧有名字的！不过，嗯，我记得。而且说实话……"

# game/Story04.rpy:429
translate chinese story05_b1debd95:

    # h "I'd still think that way! That time was pure hell!"
    h "我现在也这么想！那阵子简直是地狱！"

# game/Story04.rpy:432
translate chinese story05_cbc9ba48:

    # mc "Yeah? I thought you hated this little “adventure” of ours more than anything else."
    mc "是吗？我还以为你最讨厌的就是我们这趟“小冒险”。"

# game/Story04.rpy:436
translate chinese story05_c641ef77:

    # h "Let’s just say this little trip has its perks."
    h "这么说吧，这趟小旅程也有点好处。"

# game/Story04.rpy:438
translate chinese story05_3a005232:

    # h "(Running around the city sure as hell didn’t.)"
    h "（满城跑可绝对没有。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:439
translate chinese story05_67bbde61:

    # h "Help!"
    h "救命！"

# game/Story04.rpy:441
translate chinese story05_335a0d7b:

    # h "I just wanna relax, [mc]… run a hot bath… and stay in it for an hour. Or two."
    h "我就想放松一下，[mc]……放一缸热水……泡上一个小时。或者两个小时。"

# game/Story04.rpy:442
translate chinese story05_31a51070:

    # h "Maybe even with someone who owes me…"
    h "也许还带上一个欠我人情的人……"

# game/Story04.rpy:444
translate chinese story05_a0a35daa:

    # mc "Hm… I thought I cleared all my debts."
    mc "嗯……我以为我债都还清了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:446
translate chinese story05_d5246c18:

    # h "And what makes you think it’s gonna be YOU? You’ve got Lora, remember?"
    h "你凭什么觉得会是你？你有洛拉，记得吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:447
translate chinese story05_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:450
translate chinese story05_2545a0d0:

    # h "Mm-hm. Honestly, I don’t mind either way. But do me a favor and sort things out between you two."
    h "嗯哼。说实话，我怎么样都行。但帮个忙，把你俩之间的事理清楚。"

# game/Story04.rpy:451
translate chinese story05_0b49bdd9:

    # h "We’re adults, right? So why act like a couple of kids?"
    h "我们都是成年人了，对吧？干嘛还跟俩小孩似的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:453
translate chinese story05_16685a49:

    # Mi "I agree."
    Mi "我同意。"

# game/Story04.rpy:455
translate chinese story05_53a8fef4:

    # h "Right?! For a second I thought it was just me."
    h "对吧？！有一瞬间我还以为只有我这么想。"

# game/Story04.rpy:457
translate chinese story05_cc5eda65:

    # Mi "One of you is trying to protect what once was. The other is desperate to bring it back."
    Mi "你们一个想守住过去的样子。另一个拼命想把它拉回来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:458
translate chinese story05_fbf6a775:

    # Mi "But neither of you wants to look the truth in the eye."
    Mi "可你们俩谁都不肯直视真相。"

# game/Story04.rpy:459
translate chinese story05_055610b0:

    # Mi "You’re living in the present, not the past."
    Mi "你们活在当下，不是过去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:460
translate chinese story05_2e060fdd:

    # Mi "So maybe you should think about your future… instead of clinging to nostalgia."
    Mi "所以也许你该想想未来……而不是抱着怀旧不放。"

# game/Story04.rpy:462
translate chinese story05_713dcdf2:

    # h "That’s how it is."
    h "就是这么回事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:464
translate chinese story05_32278279:

    # mc "Present… {w}Miriel? Tell me, why are you helping us?"
    mc "当下……{w}米莉尔？告诉我，你为什么帮我们？"

# game/Story04.rpy:465
translate chinese story05_11621c32:

    # h "Hey! Don’t change the subject!"
    h "喂！别转移话题！"

# game/Story04.rpy:467
translate chinese story05_76dd631a:

    # mc "(You care about the elves… yet you follow us instead of protecting them.)"
    mc "（你在乎精灵……可你跟着我们，而不是去保护他们。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:468
translate chinese story05_125e0d63:

    # mc "(So why? You’re terrified of opening up. That moment on the ship… and before that…)"
    mc "（那为什么？你怕敞开心扉怕得要命。船上那一刻……还有更早之前……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:472
translate chinese story05_10a8f3f3:

    # Mi "(What am I supposed to do? Tell the truth?)"
    Mi "（我该怎么办？说实话？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:473
translate chinese story05_c2a5a161:

    # Mi "(But would they believe it? If I were in their place… I wouldn’t.)"
    Mi "（可他们会信吗？换成我在他们的位置……我不会信。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:475
translate chinese story05_4d188007:

    # h "Okay, nope. I don’t like this silence. At all."
    h "好，不行。我不喜欢这种沉默。一点都不喜欢。"

# game/Story04.rpy:476
translate chinese story05_dff7e054:

    # Mi "(Fine.)"
    Mi "（行吧。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:478
translate chinese story05_c298dbd3:

    # Mi "No reason. I just want all of this to end. As soon as possible."
    Mi "没什么原因。我只是想让这一切结束。越快越好。"

# game/Story04.rpy:479
translate chinese story05_7fca0fad:

    # Mi "(You’ve spent so much time with them… and still-)"
    Mi "（你跟他们相处了这么久……可还是——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:481
translate chinese story05_748781db:

    # mc "(Her eyes keep moving. Nervous. Truth… or a lie?)"
    mc "（她眼睛一直动。紧张。是真话……还是谎话？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:482
translate chinese story05_da3fdbf1_2:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:484
translate chinese story05_4baebf6b:

    # mc "That’s enough. Thank you, Miriel."
    mc "够了。谢谢你，米莉尔。"

# game/Story04.rpy:486
translate chinese story05_f97fa573:

    # Mi "(What…?)"
    Mi "（什么……？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:487
translate chinese story05_8e545a44:

    # mc "(Truth or lie, she’s helped us more than anyone here.)"
    mc "（真话也好谎话也好，她帮我们比这儿任何人都多。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:488
translate chinese story05_07876293:

    # mc "(At least she’s not hiding in the corner anymore. She takes part now.)"
    mc "（至少她不再缩在角落里了。她现在参与进来了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:489
translate chinese story05_138fa782:

    # mc "(That’s progress. Isn’t it?)"
    mc "（这是进步。对吧？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:491
translate chinese story05_e7274b02:

    # Mi "You’re not going to… ask?"
    Mi "你不打算……问？"

# game/Story04.rpy:492
translate chinese story05_c566a763:

    # mc "Would that really change anything? I can already see enough in your eyes."
    mc "问了又能改变什么？你眼里已经写得够多了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:493
translate chinese story05_2ea261af:

    # Mi "I..."
    Mi "我……"

# game/Story04.rpy:495
translate chinese story05_9458bd79:

    # h "Stop it, [mc], you’re scaring her. Don’t mind him, Mir. He means well. Mostly."
    h "别这样，[mc]，你吓到她了。别理他，米尔。他没恶意。大部分时候。"

# game/Story04.rpy:496
translate chinese story05_4c055e68:

    # mc "{b}Mostly{/b}? I’m the definition of calm."
    mc "{b}大部分时候{/b}？我就是冷静的化身。"

# game/Story04.rpy:497
translate chinese story05_ee37db5c:

    # h "Oh really? You jumped on poor Mir like you were interrogating her, and now you’re acting all wise and enlightened!"
    h "哦，是吗？你刚才扑向可怜的米尔，跟审问似的，现在又开始装明智开悟了！"

# game/Story04.rpy:499
translate chinese story05_34d554d8:

    # Mi "(What is this feeling in my chest? It’s… warm.)"
    Mi "（胸口这是什么感觉？……暖暖的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:500
translate chinese story05_e6f0a681:

    # mc "Did you notice? Your face got softer. More relaxed."
    mc "注意到了吗？你脸松下来了。放松多了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:502
translate chinese story05_e9b7287b:

    # h "Actually… yeah. I kinda relaxed there for a moment…"
    h "其实……是啊。刚才有一瞬间我确实放松了……"

# game/Story04.rpy:503
translate chinese story05_e07ccfc9:

    # mc "Glad to hear it."
    mc "很高兴听到这个。"

# game/Story04.rpy:504
translate chinese story05_11a8c6cb:

    # Mi "By the way… Kalestra was looking for you."
    Mi "对了……卡莱斯特拉在找你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:519
translate chinese story05_1_aa95a4cb:

    # L "(Maybe… maybe it’s not too late to turn back, to stay with them just a little longer?)"
    L "（也许……也许现在回头还不算太晚，再跟他们多待一会儿？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:520
translate chinese story05_1_5d2df400:

    # L "(No. If we’re going to move even a single step forward, it has to be now.)"
    L "（不。要是想哪怕往前挪一步，就得是现在。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:521
translate chinese story05_1_11ae28a3:

    # L "(Sigh) It hurts…"
    L "（叹气）好疼……"

# game/Story04.rpy:523
translate chinese story05_1_e6f4a5c9:

    # k "Lor- Len- whatever. One eye or two, you’ll manage."
    k "洛——伦——随便吧。一只眼还是两只眼，你都应付得来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:524
translate chinese story05_1_9f195ed0:

    # k "Tell me. What did mistress say?"
    k "告诉我。女主人怎么说？"

# game/Story04.rpy:525
translate chinese story05_1_f5f4b248:

    # L "(Why would she ask that all of a sudden?)"
    L "（她怎么突然问这个？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:527
translate chinese story05_1_9fa5386d:

    # L "You already have the information. Why ask?"
    L "你已经有情报了。还问什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:531
translate chinese story05_1_5808d58d:

    # k "I’m curious how different our goals really are."
    k "我好奇我们的目标到底差多少。"

# game/Story04.rpy:533
translate chinese story05_1_f6bc53d7:

    # k "I’ve got this feeling… that someone here isn’t being entirely honest with me."
    k "我有种感觉……这儿有人对我没完全说实话。"

# game/Story04.rpy:534
translate chinese story05_1_9b262fb0:

    # k "And I really don’t like that."
    k "而我非常不喜欢这点。"

# game/Story04.rpy:536
translate chinese story05_1_86865e63:

    # a "Kalestra. Stop."
    a "卡莱斯特拉。停下。"

# game/Story04.rpy:538
translate chinese story05_1_bda007ef:

    # k "(Stop? Hm… Do I want to? Nah.)"
    k "（停下？嗯……我想停吗？不想。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:540
translate chinese story05_1_219deb61:

    # k "(I was wondering why, out of the whole group, only you sisters were sent. Together with her.)"
    k "（我就在想，整队人里为什么只派了你们姐妹俩。还跟她一起。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:541
translate chinese story05_1_25604ece:

    # k "(You’re a shooter, that makes sense. But a scientist? That’s a different conversation.)"
    k "（你是枪手，说得通。可一个科学家？那就是另一回事了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:542
translate chinese story05_1_fedfccff:

    # k "Enough with the ‘Kalestra this, Kalestra that’. Time-out, sweetheart. It’s honesty time."
    k "别再来“卡莱斯特拉这个、卡莱斯特拉那个”了。暂停，甜心。现在是坦白时间。"

# game/Story04.rpy:544
translate chinese story05_1_75fe4c88:

    # k "So keep quiet, little sister. The grown women are talking."
    k "所以闭嘴，小妹妹。大女人在说话。"

# game/Story04.rpy:545
translate chinese story05_1_4fcb2098:

    # k "Now, you. Are you going to talk, or not?"
    k "那么，你。说不说？"

# game/Story04.rpy:547
translate chinese story05_1_00bea8f0:

    # L "(What is she doing? …No. There’s no point in answering her.)"
    L "（她在干什么？……不。回答她没意义。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:548
translate chinese story05_1_1d0f6b4b:

    # k "Decided to play cat and mouse? Oh, what a pity."
    k "决定玩猫捉老鼠？哦，真可惜。"

# game/Story04.rpy:549
translate chinese story05_1_51346708:

    # k "Such a shame you won’t get to see your husband’s face when he learns about you."
    k "真遗憾，你见不到你丈夫知道真相时的表情了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:550
translate chinese story05_1_f385b85b:

    # k "Oh, I {b}wonder{/b} how he’ll react when he finds out his wife isn’t quite who she claims to be."
    k "哦，我{b}真好奇{/b}，等他发现自己的妻子并不像她说的那样，会是什么反应。"

# game/Story04.rpy:551
translate chinese story05_1_468bc314:

    # L "(“Not who I claim to be”? What do you even know about me?)"
    L "（“不像她说的那样”？你究竟知道我什么？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:553
translate chinese story05_1_3f7b302f:

    # L "(I don’t see her stepping in… am I really on my own here?)"
    L "（她没插手……我在这儿真就一个人？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:554
translate chinese story05_1_bb8e4b4e:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:555
translate chinese story05_1_445eece1:

    # L "(So be it. Looks like I’ll have to deal with her myself.)"
    L "（那就这样。看来我得自己对付她。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:557
translate chinese story05_1_f9943112:

    # L "Fine. I agree. What is it you want to hear?"
    L "行。我配合。你想听什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:560
translate chinese story05_1_3758b764:

    # k "First. How did you find us?"
    k "第一。你怎么找到我们的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:561
translate chinese story05_1_c84722c0:

    # k "Your dear husband might buy that story, but I won’t."
    k "你那亲爱的丈夫也许会信那套说辞，我可不会。"

# game/Story04.rpy:562
translate chinese story05_1_3ca68a6a:

    # L "(Her tone… I don’t like it. “Buy it”? Go to hell.)"
    L "（她那语气……我不喜欢。“信”？去死吧。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:564
translate chinese story05_1_2cd7f482:

    # k "(whispering) You know… for once, I actually enjoy your company."
    k "（低声）你知道吗……难得，我还真喜欢跟你待着。"

# game/Story04.rpy:565
translate chinese story05_1_dcc66119:

    # k "(whispering) And you have no idea how delightful it is to watch your face when I talk about him…"
    k "（低声）你也不知道，我提到他的时候看你的脸有多享受……"

# game/Story04.rpy:567
translate chinese story05_1_9bac25ae:

    # L "(Endure it. Endure it… She’s provoking you. You can’t break.)"
    L "（忍住。忍住……她在激你。你不能崩。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:568
translate chinese story05_1_4b4f0482:

    # k "Well? I’m waiting."
    k "怎么样？我等着呢。"

# game/Story04.rpy:570
translate chinese story05_1_c4fa59b1:

    # L "Yong. Yong sent out a distress signal. We were the closest. That’s all."
    L "勇。勇发出了求救信号。我们离得最近。就这样。"

# game/Story04.rpy:572
translate chinese story05_1_2d20ac76:

    # L "(So she can’t read minds after all? Or there are conditions?)"
    L "（所以她并不能读心？还是有条件？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:573
translate chinese story05_1_0946a363:

    # L "(Either way… I’ll stick to the truth. Until it starts to smell like fire.)"
    L "（不管怎样……我就咬住真话。直到它开始冒烟。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:574
translate chinese story05_1_1c54de93:

    # k "Hmmm...."
    k "嗯……"

# game/Story04.rpy:577
translate chinese story05_1_33e2fa19:

    # k "(Something doesn’t quite line up with the truth.)"
    k "（有什么跟真相对不上。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:578
translate chinese story05_1_fd28f6aa:

    # k "(Yes, it’s his duty, but something tells me there’s more.)"
    k "（是，这是他的职责，可我感觉不止这么简单。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:579
translate chinese story05_1_24b65f2e:

    # k "Second! What’s your objective?"
    k "第二！你的目标是什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:580
translate chinese story05_1_a41ce4d4:

    # L "(My husband’s safety.)"
    L "（我丈夫的安全。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:581
translate chinese story05_1_59b13f7a:

    # L "Save the planet?"
    L "救这颗星球？"

# game/Story04.rpy:585
translate chinese story05_1_4a206934:

    # k "Ah, right, details. I always forget those."
    k "啊，对了，细节。我老是忘。"

# game/Story04.rpy:586
translate chinese story05_1_6c46bf8c:

    # k "So tell me… what exactly is inside that tower?"
    k "那告诉我……那高塔里到底是什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:588
translate chinese story05_1_950e458b:

    # a "I don’t recall you having clearance for that information."
    a "我不记得你有那个权限。"

# game/Story04.rpy:590
translate chinese story05_1_f6ee646e:

    # k "And what’s the problem? I’m curious."
    k "有什么问题？我好奇。"

# game/Story04.rpy:591
translate chinese story05_1_3a3508e7:

    # k "Or are {b}you{/b} against it?"
    k "还是{b}你{/b}反对？"

# game/Story04.rpy:592
translate chinese story05_1_529e1e08:

    # L "(She doesn’t know? Nonsense. She’s playing with us. She knows perfectly well.)"
    L "（她不知道？胡说。她在耍我们。她清楚得很。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:593
translate chinese story05_1_7d2909f3:

    # L "What’s the point of this performance?"
    L "这出戏演给谁看？"

# game/Story04.rpy:596
translate chinese story05_1_e765ce07:

    # k "Out of boredom, I suppose? Time’s ticking. Tick-tock. Tick-"
    k "大概因为无聊吧？时间在走。滴答。滴答——"

# game/Story04.rpy:598
translate chinese story05_1_08d40bc4:

    # L "(She’s starting to get on my nerves. Really on my nerves…)"
    L "（她开始让我烦了。真的很烦……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:599
translate chinese story05_1_fe800eb4:

    # L "A mechanism. One that can move anything… anywhere. For a price."
    L "一个装置。能把任何东西……运到任何地方。有代价。"

# game/Story04.rpy:601
translate chinese story05_1_814c85f4:

    # k "Ohhh, so that’s why there are so many corpses."
    k "哦哦，所以才有那么多尸体。"

# game/Story04.rpy:602
translate chinese story05_1_87996065:

    # k "I see. I see."
    k "懂了。懂了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:603
translate chinese story05_1_9acf9e36:

    # k "(Someone’s trying to bring someone back.)"
    k "（有人想把某个人弄回来。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:604
translate chinese story05_1_ae82070d:

    # k "So. What exactly are they planning to move, and where? I smell something big."
    k "那么。他们打算运什么，运到哪儿？我闻到大动静了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:606
translate chinese story05_1_bdee70d9:

    # L "Your mistress is plan-"
    L "你的女主人打算——"

# game/Story04.rpy:607
translate chinese story05_1_efda2023:

    # a "She might let something slip."
    a "她可能会说漏嘴。"

# game/Story04.rpy:609
translate chinese story05_1_20c66b94:

    # k "No, no, go on. Keep talking. What is mistress planning?"
    k "别，别，继续说。女主人打算干什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:611
translate chinese story05_1_9993b94e:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:612
translate chinese story05_1_7ac1f1d7:

    # k "(Oh? Now you’ve decided to play the silent game?)"
    k "（哦？现在改玩沉默了？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:615
translate chinese story05_1_f18eb2bb:

    # k "I see. Well then, where’s [mc]? Time for him to-"
    k "明白了。那好，[mc]在哪儿？该让他——"

# game/Story04.rpy:617
translate chinese story05_1_bcb03e4c:

    # L "Wait!"
    L "等等！"

# game/Story04.rpy:618
translate chinese story05_1_23d9bf55:

    # L "Fine. I agree."
    L "行。我配合。"

# game/Story04.rpy:619
translate chinese story05_1_134c610d:

    # L "Bring her sister back. That’s it. No more questions. And you keep your mouth shut."
    L "把她妹妹带回来。就这样。别再问了。还有，你闭嘴。"

# game/Story04.rpy:622
translate chinese story05_1_35891f1f:

    # k "Third!"
    k "第三！"

# game/Story04.rpy:624
translate chinese story05_1_051223cf:

    # L "No. I said everythi-"
    L "不。我说了所有——"

# game/Story04.rpy:626
translate chinese story05_1_3d65635f:

    # k "Can I sleep with your husband?"
    k "我能跟你丈夫上床吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:628
translate chinese story05_1_9993b94e_1:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:629
translate chinese story05_1_bb8e4b4e_1:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:632
translate chinese story05_1_155adbb3:

    # L "Are you serious?"
    L "你说真的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:635
translate chinese story05_1_b510fde4:

    # k "Well? What do you say?"
    k "怎么样？你怎么说？"

# game/Story04.rpy:637
translate chinese story05_1_369134a5:

    # L "You’re insane."
    L "你疯了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:639
translate chinese story05_1_e631c89a:

    # k "Thank you!"
    k "谢谢夸奖！"

# game/Story04.rpy:640
translate chinese story05_1_505e2a10:

    # k "(whispering) And now…"
    k "（低声）那么现在……"

# game/Story04.rpy:641
translate chinese story05_1_b8edd1eb:

    # k "(whispering) Be a good girl, and no one finds out. Deal?"
    k "（低声）当个好姑娘，就没人会知道。成交？"

# game/Story04.rpy:642
translate chinese story05_1_2c6487a7:

    # L "(Go to hell.)"
    L "（去死吧。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:643
translate chinese story05_1_9993b94e_2:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:645
translate chinese story05_1_cc8aa8ec:

    # k "I’ll take that as a yes."
    k "我就当你是答应了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:646
translate chinese story05_1_979e145d:

    # k "And don’t worry, I’ll keep my mouth shut."
    k "别担心，我会闭嘴的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:647
translate chinese story05_1_7ff2a02a:

    # k "For now. Cheers."
    k "暂时。干杯。"

# game/Story04.rpy:649
translate chinese story05_1_da647e3a:

    # L "(She’s completely unhinged. And the worst part is… I can’t do anything about it.)"
    L "（她完全失控了。最糟的是……我拿她没办法。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:650
translate chinese story05_1_37a7efeb:

    # a "Was that really your smartest decision."
    a "那真是你最聪明的决定？"

# game/Story04.rpy:652
translate chinese story05_1_6055b60c:

    # L "You could’ve stepped in, if you disliked that idea so much."
    L "你要是那么不喜欢这主意，本来可以插手的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:653
translate chinese story05_1_09ebb2a9:

    # a "In her current state, she’s unpredictable. Provoking her further would be unwise."
    a "她现在这状态，难以预料。再激她不明智。"

# game/Story04.rpy:654
translate chinese story05_1_30e8f10c:

    # L "What are her weaknesses?"
    L "她的弱点是什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:656
translate chinese story05_1_d376288e:

    # a "You intend to pressure her? That won’t work."
    a "你想压她？没用的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:658
translate chinese story05_1_9fcc09cb:

    # L "If she doesn’t keep her mouth shut, we’ll have problems."
    L "她要是管不住嘴，我们就有麻烦了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:660
translate chinese story05_1_44349462:

    # a "The problem isn’t that I don’t want to."
    a "问题不是我不想。"

# game/Story04.rpy:661
translate chinese story05_1_38730005:

    # a "The problem is that it’s impossible."
    a "问题是这根本不可能。"

# game/Story04.rpy:662
translate chinese story05_1_faf376b6:

    # L "What do you mean?"
    L "什么意思？"

# game/Story04.rpy:666
translate chinese story05_1_bb8e4b4e_2:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:668
translate chinese story05_1_e4427e68:

    # a "…It’s a long story."
    a "……说来话长。"

# game/Story04.rpy:670
translate chinese story05_1_b9e1f726:

    # L "We have plenty of time ahead."
    L "我们前面时间多的是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:671
translate chinese story05_1_a8c83de0:

    # a "Not now."
    a "不是现在。"

# game/Story04.rpy:672
translate chinese story05_1_19416fb3:

    # L "(Sigh) Fine. I’ll stay silent this time."
    L "（叹气）行。这次我不问。"

# game/Story04.rpy:673
translate chinese story05_1_47a9fd06:

    # L "But I {b}will{/b} expect an explanation."
    L "但我{b}一定{/b}会要个解释。"

# game/Story04.rpy:694
translate chinese story05_2_61a822d3:

    # mc "So, why did you want to see me?"
    mc "那么，你找我干什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:695
translate chinese story05_2_f0e59c8a:

    # k "Hmm... no real reason. Thought I’d have a little face-to-face talk. Kill the boredom, maybe?"
    k "嗯……没什么特别原因。想面对面聊聊。顺便解解闷，也许？"

# game/Story04.rpy:698
translate chinese story05_2_a50b5d91:

    # mc "Alright then. I’ve got a couple questions, and I’d really like some answe-"
    mc "那好。我有几个问题，而且我很想要点答——"

# game/Story04.rpy:700
translate chinese story05_2_f8f343ef:

    # k "Have you ever died? Physically."
    k "你死过吗？身体上的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:701
translate chinese story05_2_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:702
translate chinese story05_2_64b8553a:

    # mc "(That… was unexpected. Where did that even come from?)"
    mc "（这……真没想到。她怎么突然问这个？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:704
translate chinese story05_2_f800bed0:

    # mc "Yes."
    mc "死过。"

# game/Story04.rpy:706
translate chinese story05_2_4bc576b8:

    # k "And how did it feel?"
    k "什么感觉？"

# game/Story04.rpy:708
translate chinese story05_2_1a12f068:

    # mc "Lame. If I can put it like that."
    mc "很烂。要这么说的话。"

# game/Story04.rpy:709
translate chinese story05_2_74ccebdc:

    # mc "But… I don’t get the point."
    mc "不过……我不明白你想问什么。"

# game/Story04.rpy:710
translate chinese story05_2_1d7a7b22:

    # k "(I don’t even know why I asked that...)"
    k "（我都不知道自己为什么问这个……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:714
translate chinese story05_2_315f3772:

    # mc "(What the-?!)"
    mc "（搞什么——？！）"

# game/Story04.rpy:718
translate chinese story05_2_5e747d73:

    # k "Good reflexes. Not good enough, though."
    k "反应不错。不过还不够好。"

# game/Story04.rpy:721
translate chinese story05_2_aadd7216:

    # mc "You’re crazy. Why?!"
    mc "你疯了。为什么？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:724
translate chinese story05_2_b9ee2a94:

    # k "I just wanted to see what you’re capable of."
    k "我就是想看看你有几斤几两。"

# game/Story04.rpy:725
translate chinese story05_2_bd99d004:

    # mc "We’ve spent enough time together, isn’t that enough?"
    mc "我们相处得够久了，还不够？"

# game/Story04.rpy:726
translate chinese story05_2_c845f493:

    # k "Where we’re going… that place is different."
    k "我们要去的地方……不一样。"

# game/Story04.rpy:727
translate chinese story05_2_2bdfdd62:

    # k "And honestly... you’re a pretty good toy. I’d rather not lose you."
    k "而且说实话……你是个挺好玩的玩具。我可不想把你弄丢了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:729
translate chinese story05_2_0c3dad4c:

    # mc "(There’s truth in her words. Besides, a good spar wouldn’t hurt.)"
    mc "（她话里有真东西。再说，打一场也没什么坏处。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:730
translate chinese story05_2_9858c291:

    # mc "Don’t regret it later. I’ll be fighting for real."
    mc "别后悔。我会认真打。"

# game/Story04.rpy:732
translate chinese story05_2_c7a45608:

    # k "Hmph..."
    k "哼……"

# game/Story04.rpy:744
translate chinese story05_2_50eeb23f:

    # k "Caught you."
    k "抓到你了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:747
translate chinese story05_2_9308e71d:

    # mc "Arkgh..."
    mc "咳啊……"

# game/Story04.rpy:749
translate chinese story05_2_d77b8b10:

    # k "Is that it? That’s all you’ve got? I expected more."
    k "就这？你就这点本事？我还指望更多。"

# game/Story04.rpy:750
translate chinese story05_2_3ce3fbe1:

    # mc "This definitely isn’t my best performance..."
    mc "这绝对不是我最好的状态……"

# game/Story04.rpy:751
translate chinese story05_2_38c3917b:

    # k "Old man, you should’ve retired long ago instead of storming towers in this condition."
    k "老头，你早该退休了，而不是拖着这副身子去闯高塔。"

# game/Story04.rpy:753
translate chinese story05_2_7f2db866:

    # mc "I can’t."
    mc "我不能。"

# game/Story04.rpy:754
translate chinese story05_2_c66f9925:

    # k "Oh? And why’s that?"
    k "哦？为什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:756
translate chinese story05_2_f2416177:

    # mc "(I’ve gone too far. Too many sacrifices... There’s no way back.)"
    mc "（我走得太远了。牺牲太多了……回不了头了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:757
translate chinese story05_2_560ac6e8:

    # mc "(Now.)"
    mc "（现在。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:763
translate chinese story05_2_27236b13:

    # k "(Huh? ...Am I looking at the ceiling?)"
    k "（啊？……我是在看天花板？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:766
translate chinese story05_2_75c26826:

    # k "(And now I’m on the floor...)"
    k "（现在我又在地上了……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:771
translate chinese story05_2_5cc5e72d:

    # mc "Because I made a promise."
    mc "因为我许过一个承诺。"

# game/Story04.rpy:774
translate chinese story05_2_c14daa04:

    # mc "A promise that I’d do everything in my power to stop this apocalypse."
    mc "一个承诺：我会竭尽全力阻止这场末日。"

# game/Story04.rpy:776
translate chinese story05_2_e8259e98:

    # mc "Yeah, compared to you and everyone else, I’ve got no strength. Just a dumb old man who wagered everything and lost."
    mc "是，跟你们所有人比，我没什么力气。就是个把一切都押上、然后输光的老蠢货。"

# game/Story04.rpy:778
translate chinese story05_2_5730f9cd:

    # mc "And still, as long as I’m breathing, I’ll keep trying."
    mc "可只要我还喘着气，我就会一直试下去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:780
translate chinese story05_2_f5c90f21:

    # k "(The toy’s really going wild. Then again... isn’t that why he’s always fun?)"
    k "（这玩具还真撒开欢了。不过……这不就是他总那么有意思的原因吗？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:781
translate chinese story05_2_282fefb9:

    # k "(Fun...)"
    k "（有意思……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:784
translate chinese story05_2_0bf6473f:

    # k "When I first met you, that’s exactly what you looked like. Unremarkable. Weak. A stupid old man."
    k "我第一次见你的时候，你就是这副样子。平平无奇。软弱。一个蠢老头。"

# game/Story04.rpy:785
translate chinese story05_2_f02e9718:

    # k "I could’ve killed you at any moment."
    k "我随时都能杀了你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:787
translate chinese story05_2_e35c7818:

    # mc "But you didn’t kill me. Why? Because of Astoria?"
    mc "可你没杀我。为什么？因为阿斯托里亚？"

# game/Story04.rpy:792
translate chinese story05_2_85349341:

    # k "Because of myself."
    k "因为我自己。"

# game/Story04.rpy:793
translate chinese story05_2_f76f7330:

    # k "In you, I saw a part of myself. One I thought I’d lost a long time ago."
    k "在你身上，我看见了曾经的自己。我以为早就丢掉了的那部分。"

# game/Story04.rpy:796
translate chinese story05_2_9e609435:

    # k "(That’s when I got curious... what kind of feeling crawled back into my chest.)"
    k "（那时候我好奇了……是什么感觉又爬回了我胸口。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:798
translate chinese story05_2_7fd3923e:

    # k "(Painfully familiar. Disgusting.)"
    k "（熟悉得让人难受。恶心。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:799
translate chinese story05_2_58d1e296:

    # k "(Attachment.)"
    k "（是牵挂。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:802
translate chinese story05_2_806ba2f9:

    # k "Looks like someone got a little too excited. Your little friend’s practically poking at me."
    k "看来有人太兴奋了点。你那位小朋友都快戳到我了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:804
translate chinese story05_2_bf781fed:

    # mc "What are yo-"
    mc "你干什——"

# game/Story04.rpy:808
translate chinese story05_2_7dba3ccb:

    # mc "(Dirty move...)"
    mc "（下三滥的招……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:809
translate chinese story05_2_d9d6d038:

    # mc "Cheap."
    mc "下作。"

# game/Story04.rpy:810
translate chinese story05_2_7e90da36:

    # k "Oops. Did I hurt your ego?"
    k "哎呀。伤到你的自尊了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:813
translate chinese story05_2_5c54a2b3:

    # mc "(She’s insane, that’s a fact. Crazier than anyone I’ve ever met… but even she-)"
    mc "（她疯，这是事实。比我见过的任何人都疯……可连她——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:814
translate chinese story05_2_4ac932fd:

    # mc "Attachment, huh."
    mc "牵挂，是吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:816
translate chinese story05_2_064c04f4:

    # k "You heard that? Thought I’d disabled that implant."
    k "你听见了？我以为我把那个植入体关了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:817
translate chinese story05_2_dc0ff26a:

    # mc "Sorry."
    mc "抱歉。"

# game/Story04.rpy:819
translate chinese story05_2_b7987f4c:

    # mc "How did you end up in the Inquisition?"
    mc "你是怎么进审判庭的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:821
translate chinese story05_2_a1bef0c8:

    # k "I don’t see the point in answering. And besides… it’s a boring story."
    k "我看不出有什么好答的。再说……这是个无聊的故事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:822
translate chinese story05_2_c38cb9c4:

    # mc "Boring? And how many people have you told it to?"
    mc "无聊？你跟几个人讲过？"

# game/Story04.rpy:823
translate chinese story05_2_ae84fca0:

    # mc "You just never found someone who’d appreciate it."
    mc "你只是没遇到懂得欣赏的人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:826
translate chinese story05_2_cc68a856:

    # k "Eow... Did I seriously damage something when I hit you?"
    k "呃……我打你的时候是不是真把你哪儿打坏了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:828
translate chinese story05_2_db2bf8a2:

    # mc "Oh, go to he-"
    mc "哦，去你——"

# game/Story04.rpy:831
translate chinese story05_2_2ea0f582:

    # k "Get up, old man."
    k "起来，老头。"

# game/Story04.rpy:835
translate chinese story05_2_e83c20ce:

    # k "So you do want to hear how I ended up in the Inquisition, huh?"
    k "所以你是真想听我怎么进的审判庭，是吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:837
translate chinese story05_2_bf8d7b32:

    # mc "It would be useful. You’re the one I know the least here."
    mc "会有用。这儿我最不了解的就是你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:838
translate chinese story05_2_ee110046:

    # mc "Paired with that loudmouth you call a sister."
    mc "再加上你那个被你叫做妹妹的大嗓门。"

# game/Story04.rpy:841
translate chinese story05_2_58c21a17:

    # k "And why exactly are you so interested in my past?"
    k "你到底为什么对我的过去这么感兴趣？"

# game/Story04.rpy:843
translate chinese story05_2_0b15ac36:

    # mc "Tradition in our squad. You share your story, we repay you with a couple jokes and saving your ass."
    mc "我们小队的传统。你讲你的故事，我们回你几个笑话，外加救你的命。"

# game/Story04.rpy:845
translate chinese story05_2_343f1cd0:

    # k "Does that mean I’ll have to sit through your tear-soaked life story too?"
    k "那是不是意味着我还得坐着听完你那泡在眼泪里的人生故事？"

# game/Story04.rpy:847
translate chinese story05_2_09dfd8d2:

    # mc "Unfortunately, yes."
    mc "不幸的是，是的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:857
translate chinese story05_2_957ded91:

    # k "Boring… But fine."
    k "无聊……不过行吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:861
translate chinese story05_2_0adf8cfa:

    # k "So. Where do I start?"
    k "那么。从哪儿说起呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:867
translate chinese story05_2_216b38d0:

    # k "(You know, the place where I grew up... some would’ve called it hell.)"
    k "（你知道，我长大的那地方……有人会管它叫地狱。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:868
translate chinese story05_2_065dffa4:

    # k "(An orphanage where the strong did whatever they wanted, and the weak only learned how to obey.)"
    k "（一所孤儿院，强者为所欲为，弱者只学会服从。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:869
translate chinese story05_2_0c2389ae:

    # k "(We weren’t an exception.)"
    k "（我们也不例外。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:870
translate chinese story05_2_59c48c55:

    # k "(Me, and the one who now walks right behind your dear wife, Veyra.)"
    k "（我，还有现在跟在你亲爱的妻子身后的那个——薇拉。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:873
translate chinese story05_2_d6b5b9f5:

    # v "You never stop surprising me. I honestly thought you’d go beat up those idiots from the next class again today."
    v "你总让我意外。我真以为你今天又去揍隔壁班那帮白痴了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:874
translate chinese story05_2_f3417768:

    # v "Though I have to admit, your ridiculous reputation finally started working in your favor."
    v "不过我得承认，你那荒唐的名声终于开始帮你了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:877
translate chinese story05_2_1d19208d:

    # k "Yeah, yeah, about those big-headed idiots. Did they start bothering you again?"
    k "是啊是啊，那帮大头白痴。他们又来找你麻烦？"

# game/Story04.rpy:878
translate chinese story05_2_7fdfc7e0:

    # v "They wanted a rematch. You really did a number on their fragile egos."
    v "他们想再来一场。你可把他们那点脆弱的自尊伤得不轻。"

# game/Story04.rpy:879
translate chinese story05_2_8bec4f52:

    # k "They got off easy with me."
    k "落我手里算他们走运。"

# game/Story04.rpy:882
translate chinese story05_2_53204b78:

    # v "I already told them that. Can’t say it stopped them."
    v "我已经跟他们说过了。可没拦住。"

# game/Story04.rpy:885
translate chinese story05_2_7c08dcc3:

    # k "Should’ve broken more fingers..."
    k "就该多掰断几根手指……"

# game/Story04.rpy:886
translate chinese story05_2_955e8a04:

    # k "(But in practice, most people were too scared to touch us. And the ones who tried… ended very, very badly.)"
    k "（可实际上，大多数人怕得不敢碰我们。试过的人……下场都非常、非常惨。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:887
translate chinese story05_2_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:890
translate chinese story05_2_86c7fac2:

    # k "Usually this is where people start squirming. You’re taking it surprisingly calm."
    k "一般到这儿，人就该坐不住了。你倒是出奇地镇定。"

# game/Story04.rpy:892
translate chinese story05_2_62435bf6:

    # mc "I’ve seen worse sights."
    mc "我见过更惨的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:897
translate chinese story05_2_61bb1d32:

    # v "You’re seriously unhinged, you know that?"
    v "你是真的失控，你知道吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:898
translate chinese story05_2_8a9da599:

    # k "I knew you’d like it."
    k "我就知道你喜欢。"

# game/Story04.rpy:899
translate chinese story05_2_12c11497:

    # k "(Cruel? Don’t care. What mattered was that it worked. And most of the time, no one touched us.)"
    k "（残忍？不在乎。重要的是管用。而且大多数时候，没人敢碰我们。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:901
translate chinese story05_2_ad544c72:

    # a "Silence."
    a "安静。"

# game/Story04.rpy:902
translate chinese story05_2_2826ca76:

    # k "(From a very young age, we were taught a few simple things. Strength and dominance over your enemy, lead to victory.)"
    k "（从很小的时候起，他们教我们几件简单的事。力量和对敌人的压制，带来胜利。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:903
translate chinese story05_2_9024f98d:

    # k "(And the second one.)"
    k "（还有第二件。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:905
translate chinese story05_2_8b6ed410:

    # a "An order is absolute. And our purpose is to see it carried out."
    a "命令是绝对的。而我们的存在，就是为了让它被执行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:906
translate chinese story05_2_401f3fd5:

    # k "(Every lecture started with that phrase. They drilled it into our heads our whole lives.)"
    k "（每堂课都以那句话开头。他们一辈子都在往我们脑子里灌。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:907
translate chinese story05_2_52f5e71b:

    # k "(Soulless. No creativity. No freedom.)"
    k "（没灵魂。没创造力。没自由。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:909
translate chinese story05_2_fcf7e6fc:

    # k "(Just like the rest of the training. We were being prepared as cannon fodder.)"
    k "（跟其他训练一样。他们是在把我们往炮灰里练。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:910
translate chinese story05_2_25f14d50:

    # k "(Oh right, “peacekeepers.” I always forget that part.)"
    k "（哦对，“维和部队”。我老忘了这个说法。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:912
translate chinese story05_2_0458f6e3:

    # k "(And among all the others… I was-)"
    k "（而在所有人当中……我是——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:921
translate chinese story05_2_f6894116:

    # k "(I was the worst of the worst. Aside from minor scuffles, I was only good at two things.)"
    k "（我是最差里的最差。除了小打小闹，我只擅长两件事。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:922
translate chinese story05_2_57782e05:

    # k "(Talking. And shattering expectations.)"
    k "（说话。还有打碎别人的期待。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:923
translate chinese story05_2_2185c95b:

    # v "You’re getting worse every time."
    v "你一次比一次更糟。"

# game/Story04.rpy:924
translate chinese story05_2_80ad726f:

    # k "Love you too, sis."
    k "我也爱你，姐妹。"

# game/Story04.rpy:925
translate chinese story05_2_a774496d:

    # k "(Still, my heart was always set on something else.)"
    k "（不过，我心里一直想的是别的事。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:927
translate chinese story05_2_a78a429d:

    # k "(Becoming an actress. Ironic, isn’t it?)"
    k "（当演员。讽刺吧？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:928
translate chinese story05_2_18041114:

    # k "(Born for creation. Sentenced to violence.)"
    k "（生来为了创造。却被判给暴力。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:929
translate chinese story05_2_cb6120e7:

    # k "(I spent almost all my free time rehearsing in one of the art bars near the campus.)"
    k "（我几乎所有空闲时间都泡在学院附近的一家艺术酒吧里排练。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:931
translate chinese story05_2_0295c82a:

    # k "(It helped during stress. Or when I was bored. That’s when I actually felt alive.)"
    k "（压力大的时候管用。无聊的时候也管用。只有那时候，我才真觉得自己活着。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:932
translate chinese story05_2_07893017:

    # k "(That happiness didn’t last long.)"
    k "（那种快乐没持续多久。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:935
translate chinese story05_2_6e17058b:

    # a "It doesn’t matter who you are, or what you hoped to become. In the face of a threat, everyone is equal. Life is short. Death is inevitable. That’s a fact."
    a "你是谁，你曾希望成为什么，都不重要。面对威胁时，人人平等。生命短暂。死亡无可避免。这是事实。"

# game/Story04.rpy:936
translate chinese story05_2_2a58135a:

    # a "But there is one thing we {b}can{/b} control - the meaning of our actions."
    a "但有一样东西我们{b}能{/b}掌控——我们行为的意义。"

# game/Story04.rpy:937
translate chinese story05_2_21ff4cef:

    # a "The lives of our fallen were not wasted. We give their deaths meaning."
    a "倒下的人没有白死。我们赋予他们的死以意义。"

# game/Story04.rpy:939
translate chinese story05_2_e03e88bc:

    # a "And we will do the same for ourselves."
    a "我们也会为自己这么做。"

# game/Story04.rpy:940
translate chinese story05_2_dc1d646e:

    # a "Will we die? Maybe."
    a "我们会死吗？也许。"

# game/Story04.rpy:942
translate chinese story05_2_7fae70dc:

    # a "But if we fall, we will leave a mark, one future generations will turn into a lesson, and into strength."
    a "但要是我们倒下，我们会留下印记，后代会把它变成教训，变成力量。"

# game/Story04.rpy:943
translate chinese story05_2_1508fde6:

    # a "So stop hesitating. Move. Fight with resolve."
    a "所以别再犹豫。动起来。带着决心去战。"

# game/Story04.rpy:945
translate chinese story05_2_8b22e3b7:

    # a "Show the enemy we do not bow to fear. Fight so the world knows this: we are here, and we prevail."
    a "让敌人看看我们不向恐惧低头。战到全世界都知道这一点：我们在这儿，我们必胜。"

# game/Story04.rpy:947
translate chinese story05_2_90058651:

    # k "(Our commander knew how to speak. For us, she became something like a mother, one we never asked for, but desperately needed.)"
    k "（我们的指挥官很会说话。对我们来说，她成了某种母亲，我们没求过，却拼命需要。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:948
translate chinese story05_2_14d77ecb:

    # k "(That day, though... was when I first met what others called war.)"
    k "（可就是那一天……我第一次见识了别人所谓战争的东西。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:955
translate chinese story05_2_5037d4aa:

    # k "(Total shock. Bang!)"
    k "（彻底震住了。砰！）"

# game/Story04.rpy:957
translate chinese story05_2_74937961:

    # k "(I just stood there, terrified, watching someone I’d studied with for half my life fall to the ground with a hole in their head.)"
    k "（我就那么站着，吓傻了，看着跟我同窗半辈子的人脑袋上多个洞，倒在地上。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:961
translate chinese story05_2_5cd08c6f:

    # k "(I would’ve been next, if not for the commander.)"
    k "（要不是指挥官，下一个就是我。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:962
translate chinese story05_2_24ee3a88:

    # a "What the hell are you doing?! Get a grip!"
    a "你他妈在干什么？！给我稳住！"

# game/Story04.rpy:965
translate chinese story05_2_488dcddc:

    # k "(I didn’t even hear her back then. My head was full of something else.)"
    k "（那时候我根本听不见她。我脑子里全是别的东西。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:966
translate chinese story05_2_68f6d51e:

    # k "(That was the first time I truly felt fear.)"
    k "（那是我第一次真正感觉到恐惧。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:968
translate chinese story05_2_d1c610d3:

    # k "(And the funniest part? When I saw his corpse, I just pissed myself. Hilarious, right?)"
    k "（最可笑的是？看到他的尸体时，我直接尿了裤子。好笑吧？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:969
translate chinese story05_2_75da4cd1:

    # k "(Like that was all I was good for.)"
    k "（好像我就这点出息。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:973
translate chinese story05_2_43a1d18a:

    # k "You could at least flinch, for appearances’ sake. Most people are already running out of the room at this point."
    k "你至少装一下，皱个眉也行。换别人这会儿早跑出屋了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:975
translate chinese story05_2_909e0dbd:

    # mc "All I’m seeing right now is a broken kid. Nothing more."
    mc "我现在看到的只是个碎掉的孩子。没别的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:977
translate chinese story05_2_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:979
translate chinese story05_2_7eb3bbd5:

    # k "Yeah. Sure. Whatever you say."
    k "是啊。行。随你怎么说。"

# game/Story04.rpy:980
translate chinese story05_2_8e44ea45:

    # k "Keep your concern to yourself, I’m doing just fine without it."
    k "你的关心自己收着，我不需要也过得好好的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:983
translate chinese story05_2_1c4c0849:

    # k "(Truth is, after that moment I couldn’t eat properly for a whole week.)"
    k "（事实是，那之后我整整一周没好好吃过东西。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:984
translate chinese story05_2_be5c86c9:

    # k "(Every time a steak hit the table, I saw guts.)"
    k "（每次牛排一端上桌，我看见的都是内脏。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:986
translate chinese story05_2_7f9f6449:

    # k "(And that’s really not what you want on your mind while eating.)"
    k "（吃饭的时候脑子里想这个，可真不怎么样。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:992
translate chinese story05_2_89e53b71:

    # v "Kali?! Again?!"
    v "卡莉？！又来？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:993
translate chinese story05_2_7d9fc4ec:

    # k "(In one week, I even managed to drop two kilos. Impressive, right?)"
    k "（一周里我还瘦了两公斤。厉害吧？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:995
translate chinese story05_2_e72f83e6:

    # k "Sorry, sis. Not the prettiest thing to watch."
    k "抱歉，姐妹。这画面不太好看。"

# game/Story04.rpy:997
translate chinese story05_2_ef6d034e:

    # v "Yeah. True."
    v "是啊。确实。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1001
translate chinese story05_2_57bd49dd:

    # v "Hey… you okay?"
    v "喂……你没事吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1003
translate chinese story05_2_63bf224a:

    # k "I’m perfectly fi-!"
    k "我好得很——！"

# game/Story04.rpy:1006
translate chinese story05_2_884cf08b:

    # k "Bleeegh-"
    k "呕——"

# game/Story04.rpy:1007
translate chinese story05_2_6a6eb034:

    # k "(Yeah… I’ve been better.)"
    k "（是啊……我状态好过。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1018
translate chinese story05_2_f5fac18c:

    # v "You know shooting really isn’t your thing. Maybe you should try something else?"
    v "你知道射击真不是你的菜。也许你该试试别的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1020
translate chinese story05_2_dc2a618c:

    # k "Easy for you to say. Best shot in the academy and all…"
    k "你说得倒轻松。全校第一神枪手什么的……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1022
translate chinese story05_2_97744a28:

    # v "Well, unlike someone, my hands actually grow from the right place."
    v "嗯，不像某人，我的手是从对的地方长出来的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1026
translate chinese story05_2_e59a85bd:

    # k "Next time someone comes to ‘settle things’ with you, don’t drag me to the shooting range."
    k "下次有人来找你“算账”，别把我拽去靶场。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1027
translate chinese story05_2_5327e76c:

    # v "Hey, hey, that’s against the rules."
    v "喂，喂，那违反规则。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1030
translate chinese story05_2_eb8a11ef:

    # k "And who said I’d play by them?"
    k "谁说我按规则玩了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1032
translate chinese story05_2_611b21a7:

    # v "Oh, you just wait. I’m definitely getting back at you for that."
    v "哦，你等着。这事我一定找你算回来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1034
translate chinese story05_2_994c13e6:

    # v "Another duel?"
    v "再来一场？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1037
translate chinese story05_2_c81bb574:

    # k "(We were inseparable back then. Had each other’s backs however we could. Honestly, not much has changed.)"
    k "（那时候我们形影不离。能怎么挺对方就怎么挺。说实话，现在也没变多少。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1038
translate chinese story05_2_b4e55bab:

    # k "(Except she used to be a lot more talkative.)"
    k "（除了她以前话多得多。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1043
translate chinese story05_2_347dabe8:

    # a "Kalestra Elverin Ord’Laria. A word."
    a "卡莱斯特拉·艾尔维林·奥德·拉里亚。说句话。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1045
translate chinese story05_2_83c51b56:

    # k "(whispering) By my full name? Yeah… this won’t end well. I can feel it."
    k "（低声）叫我全名？是啊……这不会有好结果。我能感觉到。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1046
translate chinese story05_2_4b2e00d5:

    # v "(whispering) What did you do this time?"
    v "（低声）你这次又干了什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1047
translate chinese story05_2_bf7be01b:

    # k "(whispering) I didn’t do anything… at least, not this time."
    k "（低声）我什么都没干……至少这次没干。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1049
translate chinese story05_2_6e83b043:

    # a "This is about your future training."
    a "这是关于你今后的训练。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1052
translate chinese story05_2_850ef128:

    # b "..."
    b "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1055
translate chinese story05_2_a71bf4d4:

    # k "(That moment probably became the one that turned my whole life upside down.)"
    k "（那一刻大概就是把我整个人生掀翻的那一刻。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1058
translate chinese story05_2_6c80b5ec:

    # k "So why exactly did you drag me out here in this shit, this gray weather?"
    k "所以你干嘛非把我拖到这鬼天气里来？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1062
translate chinese story05_2_022642b5:

    # a "Answer me this. What is a warrior’s most important trait?"
    a "回答我。一个战士最重要的品质是什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1065
translate chinese story05_2_8a6e09dd:

    # k "Sorry? A warrior’s quality? Is this some kind of philosophical question or what?"
    k "什么？战士的品质？这是哲学问题还是什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1067
translate chinese story05_2_da246c1b:

    # a "Just answer."
    a "回答就行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1069
translate chinese story05_2_7c971390:

    # k "Devotion to the cause. That’s what you taught us, isn’t it?"
    k "对事业的忠诚。这是你教我们的，对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1071
translate chinese story05_2_bb8e4b4e:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1072
translate chinese story05_2_ce30ec0a:

    # k "(Honestly, I have no idea what she was thinking back then, but her look said enough.)"
    k "（说实话，我不知道她当时在想什么，但她的眼神说明了一切。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1075
translate chinese story05_2_748920eb:

    # a "Let me give you some advice."
    a "我给你个建议。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1078
translate chinese story05_2_b4334c52:

    # a "Leave the Peacekeepers."
    a "离开维和部队。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1079
translate chinese story05_2_a2fadd0c:

    # k "(At the time, I actually thought she was joking.)"
    k "（当时我真以为她在开玩笑。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1082
translate chinese story05_2_587a8f4d:

    # k "I-I... This is a joke, right? You’re joking?"
    k "我、我……这是开玩笑吧？你在开玩笑？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1083
translate chinese story05_2_2d223903:

    # k "I’ve spent my whole life on th-"
    k "我一辈子都在那——"

# game/Story04.rpy:1086
translate chinese story05_2_b489fc5f:

    # a "You’re the worst of them all. You cause problems, you’re lazy, incompetent, and you put everyone else at risk."
    a "你是所有人里最差的。你惹麻烦、懒散、无能，还让所有人跟着冒险。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1087
translate chinese story05_2_0de4faee:

    # a "There is nothing in you that belongs in a real warrior."
    a "你身上没有一点属于真正战士的东西。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1089
translate chinese story05_2_82091822_1:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1090
translate chinese story05_2_4859eade:

    # k "(Her words... That was when I learned words can cut deeper than steel.)"
    k "（她的话……就是那时候我明白，话能比钢更深地割进去。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1091
translate chinese story05_2_f7ee7f68:

    # a "This isn’t for you."
    a "这不是你该走的路。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1095
translate chinese story05_2_b271498a:

    # a "Do what you’re actually good at. Good luck."
    a "去做你真正擅长的事。祝你好运。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1096
translate chinese story05_2_acd250aa:

    # k "(I was shattered. Completely.)"
    k "（我碎了。彻底碎了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1098
translate chinese story05_2_be515b4c:

    # k "(Funny, isn’t it? I was against the idea of becoming one of them, but something inside me just... clicked.)"
    k "（讽刺吧？我本来反对成为他们中的一员，可心里有什么东西……咔哒一声。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1100
translate chinese story05_2_03a0f89e:

    # k "(I kept thinking: how dare they? I can’t stand it when someone decides my fate for me.)"
    k "（我一直在想：他们凭什么？我最受不了别人替我决定命运。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1102
translate chinese story05_2_ba1d9209:

    # k "(That’s when I decided to go all in. To put everything I had on the line.)"
    k "（就是那时候我决定豁出去了。把一切都押上。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1106
translate chinese story05_2_ff5e4bf6:

    # k "Please... Give me one last chance!"
    k "求你……再给我一次机会！"

# game/Story04.rpy:1107
translate chinese story05_2_c56f65e7:

    # k "(I dropped to my knees and screamed it across the whole street. God, the shame... I wouldn’t wish that on anyone.)"
    k "（我跪在街上，冲着整条街喊。天哪，那种羞耻……我不希望任何人尝到。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1109
translate chinese story05_2_0f16d65f:

    # k "(But the need to prove I was worth something outweighed my pride.)"
    k "（可证明自己有价值的需求，压过了我的自尊。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1110
translate chinese story05_2_a87160d2:

    # k "(Still, most of that was on the commander. One word from her, and my future was decided.)"
    k "（不过，这大多还是取决于指挥官。她一句话，我的未来就定了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1113
translate chinese story05_2_32f79864:

    # k "(And now the important part, how the hell I ended up in the Inquisition. The selection process was... weird, honestly.)"
    k "（现在到关键部分了，我他妈怎么进的审判庭。选拔过程……说实话，挺怪的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1114
translate chinese story05_2_c74b6353:

    # k "(First, you go into the peacekeepers. And after that, that’s it. Do whatever you want. Go wherever. Nobody gives a damn.)"
    k "（先进维和部队。之后就这样了。想干什么干什么。想去哪儿去哪儿。没人管。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1115
translate chinese story05_2_c73d6ed4:

    # mc "(So then, how did you end up there?)"
    mc "（那你是怎么进去的？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1118
translate chinese story05_2_51235383:

    # k "(Honestly? No idea. They said there was a selection, but how or by what criteria, nobody ever really knew.)"
    k "（说实话？不知道。他们说是选拔，可怎么选、按什么标准，谁都不清楚。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1119
translate chinese story05_2_ca576ef1:

    # k "(But that’s for later. Right now, I was just patching up my reputation.)"
    k "（不过那是后话。眼下，我只是在修补名声。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1120
translate chinese story05_2_0c3ada23:

    # k "(Got my shit together back then. More or less. Some results showed up.)"
    k "（那时候我把自己收拾起来了。差不多吧。出了点成绩。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1121
translate chinese story05_2_33eaa0db:

    # k "(Except shooting. At that, I still sucked.)"
    k "（除了射击。那方面我还是稀烂。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1123
translate chinese story05_2_5dc100a9:

    # k "(So our commander decided to teach me something else.)"
    k "（于是指挥官决定教我点别的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1125
translate chinese story05_2_b848c535:

    # k "So. Why are we here?"
    k "那么。我们来这儿干嘛？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1126
translate chinese story05_2_453c35c6:

    # a "I’ve been ordered to train you in close combat."
    a "我奉命训练你近身格斗。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1130
translate chinese story05_2_4e207aa8:

    # k "Close combat? Right. So, death then. Well… doesn’t sound too bad."
    k "近身格斗？行。那就是死路一条了。嗯……听着也不算太坏。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1131
translate chinese story05_2_1a11e8f5:

    # a "Catch."
    a "接着。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1134
translate chinese story05_2_dc651647:

    # k "(Funny thing, that “small blade” she handed me felt like it weighed forty sbards.)"
    k "（好笑的是，她递给我的那把“小刀”，感觉有四十斯巴德那么重。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1135
translate chinese story05_2_7470d495:

    # k "(I remember thinking: how the hell am I supposed to fight with this club if I can’t even lift it?)"
    k "（我记得当时想：这玩意儿我抬都抬不起来，怎么拿它打架？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1138
translate chinese story05_2_eb1abd5e:

    # k "(Didn’t have a choice though. I had to lift it somehow. Pain, tears, sheer stubborn will, and somehow, I did.)"
    k "（可我没得选。怎么着都得抬起来。疼、眼泪、死倔的意志，反正我做到了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1139
translate chinese story05_2_6b760e3d:

    # k "(And then training. Lots of training. Way too much.)"
    k "（然后是训练。大量训练。多得离谱。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1141
translate chinese story05_2_dfa208af:

    # k "(Oh, and trust me, I regretted every damn minute of that decision. But my glorious ego...)"
    k "（哦，信我，那决定我每一分钟都在后悔。可我那光荣的自尊……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1143
translate chinese story05_2_454d6fef:

    # k "(The idea that the commander herself was training me, that alone gave me fuel. And barely, just barely…)"
    k "（指挥官亲自训练我，光这个念头就是我的燃料。差一点，就差那么一点……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1146
translate chinese story05_2_789c32ef:

    # k "(I failed.)"
    k "（我失败了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1147
translate chinese story05_2_74f98914:

    # k "(I had no talent. None at all. Well... okay. Some tiny bit. But nowhere near enough.)"
    k "（我没天赋。一点都没有。好吧……有那么一丁点。但远远不够。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1148
translate chinese story05_2_a3002d0a:

    # k "(Nowhere near enough to be the best of the best.)"
    k "（远不够成为最顶尖的那种人。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1149
translate chinese story05_2_723d6d90:

    # mc "(And yet somehow, you still managed to pull it off.)"
    mc "（可你不知怎么，还是办到了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1152
translate chinese story05_2_77d73e48:

    # k "(Yeah. But not alone. If I’m being honest, I’d have quit a long time ago by myself.)"
    k "（是啊。但不是一个人。说实话，要是我一个人，早放弃了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1153
translate chinese story05_2_48705489:

    # k "(But with her faith in me, that was a different story.)"
    k "（可她信我，这就是另一回事了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1155
translate chinese story05_2_28e71a29:

    # v "Wow. Look at you, absolutely glowing."
    v "哇。看看你，容光焕发啊。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1156
translate chinese story05_2_9bbce492:

    # k "Bruises and bumps? Yeah… call it bruised and battered, I’m shining like a damn Christmas tree."
    k "青一块紫一块？是啊……要说伤，我浑身上下跟棵该死的圣诞树一样亮。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1157
translate chinese story05_2_c957b56d:

    # v "Dreams always come with a price. But in your case… The whole squad’s rooting for you."
    v "梦想总有代价。不过你这情况……全队都在挺你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1159
translate chinese story05_2_8743b74a:

    # k "(Honestly, I didn’t really need anyone else’s support... but gotta admit, it felt damn good to hear it.)"
    k "（说实话，我并不需要别人的支持……但得承认，听到这话真他妈舒服。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1160
translate chinese story05_2_e583dedf:

    # a "On your feet. Break’s over."
    a "站起来。休息结束了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1163
translate chinese story05_2_0f1b7a03:

    # a "We’re not leaving until you land a hit."
    a "你没打中一次，我们就不走。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1165
translate chinese story05_2_59c3acaa:

    # k "(And like that, a few months just… vanished.)"
    k "（就这么着，几个月……就那么没了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1176
translate chinese story05_2_4d689079:

    # k "(Until my sister and I were sent on a new assignment.)"
    k "（直到我和我妹妹被派去执行新任务。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1177
translate chinese story05_2_5080f87c:

    # k "(Eliminate someone. Or something like that. Honestly, I don’t even remember anymore.)"
    k "（除掉某个人。或者类似的事。说实话，我都记不清了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1179
translate chinese story05_2_720e1ce5:

    # k "You know, sis… I’m happy you made it far enough to look down on everyone else."
    k "你知道吗，姐妹……我很高兴你爬得够高，能俯视所有人了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1180
translate chinese story05_2_24ef8837:

    # k "Just… not from the bottom of my heart."
    k "只是……不是发自内心。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1182
translate chinese story05_2_00f64c70:

    # v "If anything, you’re the one who’s been stuck at the bottom for way too long."
    v "真要说的话，是你在最底下卡太久了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1183
translate chinese story05_2_18e8a173:

    # v "What about the target?"
    v "目标呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1186
translate chinese story05_2_0d1eded5:

    # k "I don’t see anyone. Are you sure we’re even in the right place?"
    k "没人。你确定我们来对地方了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1187
translate chinese story05_2_8b2f1489:

    # v "Patience. That guy handles blood shipments for the elves."
    v "耐心点。那家伙负责给精灵运血。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1188
translate chinese story05_2_4721673b:

    # k "Oh. So an important asshole, huh? Got it."
    k "哦。所以是个重要的混蛋，是吧？懂了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1191
translate chinese story05_2_731dd8ce:

    # k "Yeah. Arachnid Eyes listening."
    k "是。蛛眼在听。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1192
translate chinese story05_2_82091822_2:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1193
translate chinese story05_2_2c66f0ca:

    # mc "(You okay?)"
    mc "（你没事吧？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1194
translate chinese story05_2_a5839e3b:

    # k "(Uh… yeah. Yeah. Just a bad memory.)"
    k "（呃……嗯。嗯。就是段糟糕的回忆。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1196
translate chinese story05_2_7f7f16dc:

    # a "Get out of there, now! You’ve been spotted!"
    a "马上撤出来！你们被发现了！"

# game/Story04.rpy:1197
translate chinese story05_2_d551fa11:

    # k "(Back then, we either overestimated ourselves, or seriously underestimated the enemy.)"
    k "（那时候，要么是我们高估了自己，要么是严重低估了敌人。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1202
translate chinese story05_2_a0ecd35c:

    # k "(The result…)"
    k "（结果是……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1205
translate chinese story05_2_d0d074c3:

    # k "(And that’s the moment I thought I’d finally become stronger, when my sister got her head blown off.)"
    k "（就在我以为自己终于变强的那一刻，我妹妹的脑袋被打爆了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1206
translate chinese story05_2_70c30325:

    # k "(Bang, and all those old injuries, from the first time, came rushing back.)"
    k "（砰，然后第一次的那些旧伤，全都涌回来了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1210
translate chinese story05_2_d0287d62:

    # k "(This time it was worse than ever. No commander to save my ass.)"
    k "（这次比以往都更糟。没有指挥官来救我了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1211
translate chinese story05_2_c2577c02:

    # k "(My sister, instead of that kid backdays. Yeah. That was… worse. I was left alone.)"
    k "（倒下的是我妹妹，不是当年那个小孩。是啊。那更糟。我一个人被留下了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1214
translate chinese story05_2_a09ac3f5:

    # k "(Seeing that hole in her head, my insides clenched. Not from fear. From rage. From bitterness.)"
    k "（看到她脑袋上的那个洞，我五脏六腑都绞紧了。不是因为怕。是因为怒。因为恨。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1217
translate chinese story05_2_6a512ea6:

    # k "(Losing the one you called family...)"
    k "（失去那个你称作家人的人……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1219
translate chinese story05_2_14e4c948:

    # k "(What was going on in my head back then? Heh…)"
    k "（那时候我脑子里在想什么？呵……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1221
translate chinese story05_2_e7f1eeb7:

    # k "No… This is a dream. Anyone but her…"
    k "不……这是梦。谁都可以，就是别是她……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1223
translate chinese story05_2_0c765a15:

    # v "You know shooting really isn’t your thing. Maybe you should try something else."
    v "你知道射击真不是你的菜。也许你该试试别的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1225
translate chinese story05_2_c241fa9f:

    # a "You’re the worst of them all. You cause problems, you’re lazy, incompetent, and you put everyone else in danger."
    a "你是所有人里最差的。你惹麻烦、懒散、无能，还让所有人跟着冒险。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1229
translate chinese story05_2_58456168:

    # k "I just wanted to…"
    k "我只是想……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1232
translate chinese story05_2_0de4faee_1:

    # a "There is nothing in you that belongs in a real warrior."
    a "你身上没有一点属于真正战士的东西。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1236
translate chinese story05_2_2185c95b_1:

    # v "You’re getting worse every time."
    v "你一次比一次更糟。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1238
translate chinese story05_2_2b166874:

    # k "I wanted to prove it…"
    k "我想证明……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1240
translate chinese story05_2_b7dd357d:

    # v "Dreams come at a cost. But in your case..."
    v "梦想总有代价。不过你这情况……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1242
translate chinese story05_2_a68cad38:

    # a "Do what you’re actually good at. Take care."
    a "去做你真正擅长的事。保重。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1244
translate chinese story05_2_82091822_3:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1246
translate chinese story05_2_9e15a3b8:

    # k "(Funny, right? All it took was one person dying to break me. Hilarious.)"
    k "（好笑吧？死一个人就把我压垮了。真好笑。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1248
translate chinese story05_2_7a0239a3:

    # k "(And yet… my whole body filled with energy. I swore to myself I’d endure. I’d get out of that place.)"
    k "（可……我全身反而充满了力气。我对自己发誓要撑住。要离开那地方。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1249
translate chinese story05_2_d0a90b76:

    # k "(And the funniest part…)"
    k "（最好笑的是……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1251
translate chinese story05_2_f026fe66:

    # k "(I decided to get out with her.)"
    k "（我决定带着她一起出去。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1252
translate chinese story05_2_a79b1d89:

    # k "(Most people would call it stupid. Insane. I didn’t give a damn.)"
    k "（大多数人会说这蠢。疯。我一点都不在乎。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1253
translate chinese story05_2_3529473c:

    # k "(I wasn’t leaving my sister behind. Not even her corpse.)"
    k "（我不会把我妹妹丢下。连她的尸体也不行。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1255
translate chinese story05_2_9b93fcc3:

    # k "(That’s when the real fun began. Me. Alone. With my sister’s body. Against a whole crowd.)"
    k "（真正的乐子从那儿开始。我。一个人。背着我妹妹的尸身。对着一整群人。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1257
translate chinese story05_2_4e236112:

    # k "(But I had nothing left to lose. So I acted. Pushed all feelings aside. Everything I knew, shoved to the back.)"
    k "（可我已经没什么可失去的了。所以我动手了。把所有感情推到一边。学过的所有东西，全塞到脑后。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1258
translate chinese story05_2_5f8908dc:

    # k "(And when I saw my first target…)"
    k "（然后我看到了第一个目标……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1261
translate chinese story05_2_1b59e9d8:

    # k "(I didn’t hesitate. I lunged at him with every ounce of rage I had.)"
    k "（我没犹豫。带着我所有的怒火扑了上去。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1262
translate chinese story05_2_98097e30:

    # k "(They’d call it animalistic. Even by my standards, yeah. It was too much.)"
    k "（他们会说那是野兽行径。就算按我的标准，也是。太过头了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1265
translate chinese story05_2_d607489c:

    # k "(My first kill…)"
    k "（我的第一次杀人……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1266
translate chinese story05_2_030fe8b6:

    # k "(And there was nothing great about it. Ugly. Animal. Absurd.)"
    k "（一点都不光彩。丑陋。兽性。荒唐。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1270
translate chinese story05_2_a704886b:

    # k "(That’s when I carved it into my skull: Either me, or them. How? Didn’t matter.)"
    k "（就是那时候我把它刻进脑子里：要么是我，要么是他们。怎么做到？不重要。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1271
translate chinese story05_2_49a9cace:

    # k "(...)"
    k "（……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1275
translate chinese story05_2_61b24aec:

    # k "(By some miracle, I made it out alive. How? No idea. But facts are facts.)"
    k "（靠着某种奇迹，我活着出来了。怎么出来的？不知道。但事实就是事实。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1276
translate chinese story05_2_3479ed1d:

    # k "(I took my sister with me.)"
    k "（我把我妹妹带出来了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1278
translate chinese story05_2_743c22ff:

    # k "(Later, thankfully, I found out she was alive. The bullet went straight through, missed the brain.)"
    k "（后来，谢天谢地，我发现她还活着。子弹穿过去了，没打中脑子。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1279
translate chinese story05_2_3921df4b:

    # k "(I remember thinking how lucky she was… And at the same time, how glad I was I didn’t leave her.)"
    k "（我记得当时想她真走运……同时，又庆幸自己没把她丢下。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1288
translate chinese story05_2_be304793:

    # k "(And just like that, my whole life flipped upside down. All those old dreams, becoming an actress, gone. Just like that.)"
    k "（就这么着，我整个翻了面。那些旧梦，当演员，全没了。就这么没了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1289
translate chinese story05_2_3999e248:

    # k "(Do I regret it? Yeah. I do. But at the same time... I’m glad for what I have now.)"
    k "（后悔吗？后悔。真的。可同时……我也感激现在拥有的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1291
translate chinese story05_2_18f4ac20:

    # a "What you did was absurd… and at the same time, noble."
    a "你做的事很荒唐……可同时又很高尚。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1292
translate chinese story05_2_055c9b8e:

    # k "I didn’t really have a choice."
    k "我其实没得选。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1293
translate chinese story05_2_f692bdb7:

    # a "I know."
    a "我知道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1295
translate chinese story05_2_be237585:

    # a "The young lady asked to see you."
    a "那位小姐要见你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1296
translate chinese story05_2_30fd9647:

    # k "What? Why?!"
    k "什么？为什么？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:1297
translate chinese story05_2_bb8e4b4e_1:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1298
translate chinese story05_2_3be8089a:

    # a "I’m glad you survived."
    a "我很高兴你活下来了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1303
translate chinese story05_2_cc265445:

    # k "(And by sheer coincidence, I met her. Evrelia. The head of the Inquisition herself.)"
    k "（纯属巧合，我见到了她。艾芙蕾莉亚。审判庭的首脑本人。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1304
translate chinese story05_2_fbaeea6b:

    # mc "(Astoria’s younger sister?)"
    mc "（阿斯托里亚的妹妹？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1305
translate chinese story05_2_3759ed3b:

    # k "(That’s her.)"
    k "（就是她。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1306
translate chinese story05_2_5487592e:

    # k "You wanted to see me?"
    k "你要见我？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1309
translate chinese story05_2_a7438ac2:

    # k "(Her posture, her eyes, her presence... Absolute. Like the weight of the whole world suddenly crashing down on you.)"
    k "（她的姿态、她的眼神、她的气场……绝对。像是整个世界的重量突然砸下来。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1310
translate chinese story05_2_9354e9b2:

    # k "(I could feel her power with my entire body.)"
    k "（我用整个身体都能感觉到她的力量。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1312
translate chinese story05_2_4a212a08:

    # k "(There was one catch, though. How she looked, and how she acted. That part threw me off.)"
    k "（不过有个反差。她的样子和她的举止。那部分把我整懵了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1315
translate chinese story05_2_b47fe7ce:

    # Evrel "Cute face."
    Evrel "脸蛋挺可爱。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1317
translate chinese story05_2_070a82a9:

    # k "(And the funniest thing? I expected a lot, but that level of absurdity? From her? Yeah, no. I froze, had no clue how to even respond.)"
    k "（最好笑的是？我预期了很多，可那种荒唐程度？从她嘴里出来？不。我僵住了，完全不知道该怎么接。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1318
translate chinese story05_2_15a72cee:

    # Evrel "Your report was… interesting."
    Evrel "你的报告……挺有意思。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1319
translate chinese story05_2_84c6d1c4:

    # Evrel "Interesting enough that even my sister took notice."
    Evrel "有意思到连我姐姐都注意到了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1321
translate chinese story05_2_6119d1c1:

    # Evrel "Tell me something."
    Evrel "告诉我一件事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1322
translate chinese story05_2_a6019a71:

    # Evrel "How do you feel about deciding other people’s fates?"
    Evrel "决定别人的命运，你是什么感觉？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1325
translate chinese story05_2_44362d8b:

    # k "(Didn’t take me long to answer, honestly. And just like that, I signed up for the next couple of years as a trainee.)"
    k "（说实话，我没想多久就答了。就这么着，我签了接下来几年的见习合同。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1328
translate chinese story05_2_f1c2d373:

    # k "So what’s the result? My body turned into a weapon. Scars, burns, everything you can see. One ugly mess, really."
    k "结果是什么？我身体变成了武器。疤、烧伤、你看到的这些。真是一团难看的烂摊子。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1330
translate chinese story05_2_8d43342e:

    # k "Then again… isn’t that what they say? Scars make a warrior, right?"
    k "不过话说回来……不是都这么说吗？疤才能造就战士，对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1332
translate chinese story05_2_08470cbc:

    # mc "Scars are experience. Bitter, unpleasant, but necessary. I don’t see anything wrong with them."
    mc "疤就是经历。苦、难受，但必要。我不觉得它们有什么不好。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1333
translate chinese story05_2_23722540:

    # k "You’ve got a smooth tongue, I’ll give you that."
    k "你嘴挺甜，这点我认。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1334
translate chinese story05_2_d622e7db:

    # k "Alright. Enough."
    k "好了。够了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1342
translate chinese story05_2_82091822_4:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1344
translate chinese story05_2_d89b8cb1:

    # k "You know, I just remembered something."
    k "你知道吗，我刚想起件事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1345
translate chinese story05_2_645f92f3:

    # k "Your implants, still giving you trouble?"
    k "你的植入体，还在闹腾吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1347
translate chinese story05_2_db369493:

    # mc "What’s with the sudden interest? Thought it was my turn to tell a story."
    mc "怎么突然感兴趣了？我以为轮到我讲故事了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1349
translate chinese story05_2_8d15596a:

    # k "Oh, trust me, I’d love to hear your story and all that, but not right now."
    k "哦，信我，我很想听你的故事什么的，但不是现在。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1350
translate chinese story05_2_69654e49:

    # k "A little bird whispered in my ear that I should take a look at your implants. Call it curiosity."
    k "有只小鸟在我耳边说，我该看看你的植入体。就当是好奇吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1352
translate chinese story05_2_4bc3c2ba:

    # mc "If I remember correctly, you couldn’t care less before. What changed?"
    mc "我记得你以前根本不在乎。什么变了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1354
translate chinese story05_2_d422f34c:

    # k "Let’s go."
    k "走吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1369
translate chinese story05_2_1_74deaa9f:

    # mc "(Life didn’t go easy on her, that’s for sure. But it doesn’t fully explain her mental state. Still…)"
    mc "（生活对她确实不轻松。但这也不能完全解释她的精神状态。不过……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1371
translate chinese story05_2_1_4bc62d14:

    # mc "You’re a tough one."
    mc "你是个狠角色。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1372
translate chinese story05_2_1_a7d5693c:

    # k "Oh, I know that without you. And watch your head, by the way."
    k "哦，这不用你说我也知道。顺便，小心你的头。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1375
translate chinese story05_2_1_e5013fa2:

    # mc "Arkh…"
    mc "咳啊……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1376
translate chinese story05_2_1_aa148588:

    # k "Told you."
    k "跟你说了吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1377
translate chinese story05_2_1_2c56c3a0:

    # k "And about what you said earlier, truth is, that’s not really my achievement."
    k "还有你刚才说的那些，说实话，那不算我的成就。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1380
translate chinese story05_2_1_d8a61277:

    # k "Just like you, I’m packed to the brim with implants. They’re the ones responsible for everything my body does."
    k "跟你一样，我全身塞满了植入体。我身体的每一个动作，都是它们的功劳。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1381
translate chinese story05_2_1_d11f2732:

    # mc "Not that different, are we?"
    mc "那我们也没多大差别，是吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1382
translate chinese story05_2_1_db915de8:

    # mc "(Whispering) My head…"
    mc "（低声）我的头……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1383
translate chinese story05_2_1_6e609aaf:

    # k "Heh..."
    k "呵……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1385
translate chinese story05_2_1_77823fd0:

    # k "Different? I don’t even know if this is really me, or someone else. Either way, I don’t lose sleep over it."
    k "差别？我连这是不是真正的我都不知道，还是别人。反正我不为这个失眠。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1387
translate chinese story05_2_1_ac733c95:

    # mc "(Ostorius mentioned something like this…)"
    mc "（奥斯特里乌斯提过类似的事……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1388
translate chinese story05_2_1_d97228a1:

    # mc "Side effects?"
    mc "副作用？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1390
translate chinese story05_2_1_80484cde:

    # k "Bingo."
    k "答对了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1391
translate chinese story05_2_1_9e888770:

    # k "Nasty stuff. Don’t keep an eye on them, and in the middle of a fight your head might just-click-shut down."
    k "恶心玩意儿。要是不盯着它们，打着打着，你脑袋可能就咔哒一下关机了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1392
translate chinese story05_2_1_0340e3ca:

    # k "And ding-ding. You’re dead."
    k "然后叮叮。你就死了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1394
translate chinese story05_2_1_c863cb52:

    # mc "With honor and glory, huh?"
    mc "带着荣耀和光荣，是吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1397
translate chinese story05_2_1_0aea7593:

    # k "Yeah. Face down in dirt and shit. Nothing noble about it."
    k "是啊。脸朝下趴在泥和屎里。一点都不高尚。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1398
translate chinese story05_2_1_13457756:

    # mc "Depends on how you look at it, but overall, I agree."
    mc "看你怎么看吧，不过总的来说，我同意。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1404
translate chinese story05_2_1_ac223aba:

    # k "Yeah, yeah. Strip. Time to see what you’ve got under the hood."
    k "行了行了。脱吧。该看看你引擎盖底下装的是什么了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1405
translate chinese story05_2_1_6eee0bd4:

    # k "Pants stay on. One time was more than enough, I’m good."
    k "裤子留着。一次已经够多了，我够了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1406
translate chinese story05_2_1_3c25c078:

    # mc "Don’t remember agreeing to this. But I doubt I can talk you out of it."
    mc "我不记得我答应过这事。不过我估计也劝不动你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1409
translate chinese story05_2_1_e2968a08:

    # mc "What I don’t get is, why do you need to undress?"
    mc "我不明白的是，你干嘛也得脱？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1410
translate chinese story05_2_1_a3d66542:

    # k "Hm..."
    k "嗯……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1411
translate chinese story05_2_1_0028e907:

    # k "I don’t like talking about this, but answer me one thing."
    k "我不喜欢谈这个，但回答我一个问题。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1413
translate chinese story05_2_1_791569fe:

    # k "Would you rather lose all your memories… or never be able to make new ones?"
    k "你宁愿失去所有记忆……还是永远无法创造新的记忆？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1416
translate chinese story05_2_1_f0c90342:

    # mc "This is…"
    mc "这……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1417
translate chinese story05_2_1_a008ab70:

    # mc "(Is she talking about herself? Or in general?)"
    mc "（她说的是自己？还是一般情况？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1418
translate chinese story05_2_1_355a2486:

    # mc "Personal experience, or you want my opinion?"
    mc "是亲身经历，还是想听我的看法？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1421
translate chinese story05_2_1_04482542:

    # k "Let’s call it personal curiosity."
    k "就当是私人好奇吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1422
translate chinese story05_2_1_d71db43e:

    # k "How did you put it? “You tell me your story, I trade you a couple of gags and saving your ass.”"
    k "你怎么说的来着？“你讲你的故事，我回你几个笑话，外加救你的命。”"

# game/Story04.rpy:1423
translate chinese story05_2_1_f082497e:

    # k "Your story won’t tell me much. Your views, though? That’s a different matter."
    k "你的故事告诉不了我什么。可你的看法？那就是另一回事了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1425
translate chinese story05_2_1_b0d80c19:

    # mc "(Views, huh… Giving up the past for the sake of the future, or living in the past with no future at all?)"
    mc "（看法，是吧……为了未来放弃过去，还是抱着过去、根本没有未来？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1426
translate chinese story05_2_1_103f0f2e:

    # mc "(The past or the future? On one hand, how could I forget the deaths of my comrades, my own son, the betrayals and-)"
    mc "（过去还是未来？一方面，我怎么能忘掉战友的死、我儿子的死、那些背叛，还有——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1428
translate chinese story05_2_1_019ca93c:

    # mc "(On the other… what would be the point of everything else then? By that logic, I could’ve stayed back on Earth.)"
    mc "（可另一方面……那其他的事还有什么意义？按这逻辑，我当初就该留在地球。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1429
translate chinese story05_2_1_6b0ecf96:

    # mc "(But honestly, why am I doing all this? Did the others really want the same thing I did?)"
    mc "（可说实话，我做这些到底为什么？别人真的跟我想要的一样吗？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1430
translate chinese story05_2_1_4b95a23f:

    # mc "(Or is this just a cover for my own selfish need?)"
    mc "（还是说，这只是我自己私心的遮羞布？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1433
translate chinese story05_2_1_0e2aff84:

    # mc "(Take Norman, for example. His death… and that moment at the end. In the end, he just wanted to see me… happy?)"
    mc "（就说诺曼。他的死……还有最后那一刻。说到底，他只是想看我……幸福？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1435
translate chinese story05_2_1_881e6fce:

    # mc "(Yes, he wanted Lora back too, that’s true, but was that really the main goal?)"
    mc "（是，他也想洛拉回来，没错，但那真是主要目的吗？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1436
translate chinese story05_2_1_f5caebce:

    # mc "(And Lora herself… At first, I ignored everything, waited, moved forward. But if I’m being honest-)"
    mc "（还有洛拉本人……一开始，我无视一切，等着，往前走。可要说实话——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1437
translate chinese story05_2_1_6721f269:

    # mc "(Whispering) Is this really the same Lora?"
    mc "（低声）这真的是同一个洛拉吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1440
translate chinese story05_2_1_40f0da06:

    # mc "Probably never would."
    mc "大概永远都做不到。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1441
translate chinese story05_2_1_5e7df436:

    # mc "That life is all I have left."
    mc "那段人生是我仅剩的东西。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1444
translate chinese story05_2_1_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1445
translate chinese story05_2_1_177d3eb2:

    # mc "What are you doing?"
    mc "你干什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1446
translate chinese story05_2_1_f51a7293:

    # k "Making a bad decision. Don’t interrupt."
    k "做个烂决定。别打岔。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1448
translate chinese story05_2_1_732b9d92:

    # k "So… trading the past for the future?"
    k "所以……拿过去换未来？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1449
translate chinese story05_2_1_762f80ee:

    # k "Honestly? Not surprised. Sounds like you."
    k "说实话？不意外。挺像你的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1450
translate chinese story05_2_1_012d1b1e:

    # k "But hey, I’m feeling generous. I’ll give you a tip."
    k "不过嘛，我今天大方。给你个建议。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1453
translate chinese story05_2_1_a2accc58:

    # k "Sometimes you just say ‘to hell with it’, and live all the way."
    k "有时候你就得说一句“去他的”，然后一路活到底。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1454
translate chinese story05_2_1_88131326:

    # k "One day at a time. No plans. No regrets."
    k "一天一天过。没计划。没后悔。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1456
translate chinese story05_2_1_8941d536:

    # k "And for that, you need enough strength not to drop dead from a sneeze."
    k "而要做到这个，你得有足够的力气，别打个喷嚏就倒下。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1457
translate chinese story05_2_1_a591e10a:

    # mc "Hey, hey, wait. Your whole neck is-"
    mc "喂，喂，等等。你整个脖子都——"

# game/Story04.rpy:1460
translate chinese story05_2_1_b2f9abcd:

    # k "Forget it. This’ll hurt. You’ll live."
    k "别管。会疼。你死不了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1461
translate chinese story05_2_1_95d3b1bf:

    # mc "That’s an implant, right?"
    mc "那是植入体，对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1463
translate chinese story05_2_1_82091822_1:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1464
translate chinese story05_2_1_c2d4b2e4:

    # k "Inquisition architecture. Same base system as yours."
    k "审判庭架构。跟你一样的底层系统。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1465
translate chinese story05_2_1_35940ae2:

    # mc "So my body won’t reject it."
    mc "所以我身体不会排斥它。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1466
translate chinese story05_2_1_248672b5:

    # k "Your system should recognize it as a clearance key."
    k "你的系统应该会把它识别成权限钥匙。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1467
translate chinese story05_2_1_55b57617:

    # mc "Should?"
    mc "应该？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1468
translate chinese story05_2_1_dd0aff41:

    # k "I said I was making a bad decision."
    k "我说了我在做个烂决定。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1490
translate chinese story05_2_1_4d1e626b:

    # k "I’m no neuromechanic. Hell if I know how this crap actually works."
    k "我不是神经机械师。这破玩意儿到底怎么运作，我他妈也不知道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1492
translate chinese story05_2_1_d5db2433:

    # mc "(Same as with Mireille… but now it’s the body.)"
    mc "（跟米蕾那会儿一样……可这次是身体。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1493
translate chinese story05_2_1_eaf8895a:

    # k "But with this, hah… you’ll knock a lot of heads around, that’s for sure."
    k "但有了这个，哈……你肯定能敲翻不少脑袋。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1496
translate chinese story05_2_1_37e288f5:

    # mc "You were against this idea."
    mc "你本来反对这主意。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1497
translate chinese story05_2_1_45826b3f:

    # mc "Thanks, I guess, but what suddenly changed?"
    mc "谢了，大概吧，可怎么突然就变了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1498
translate chinese story05_2_1_6fb165f8:

    # k "Hmm..."
    k "嗯……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1501
translate chinese story05_2_1_fb22bfc9:

    # k "An hour ago I locked myself in the ladies’ room and masturbated thinking about you."
    k "一小时前我把自己锁在女厕所里，想着你自慰了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1502
translate chinese story05_2_1_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1503
translate chinese story05_2_1_f37d4536:

    # mc "Sorry, what?"
    mc "抱歉，你说什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1505
translate chinese story05_2_1_85ac228c:

    # k "Kidding."
    k "逗你的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1508
translate chinese story05_2_1_23924aa7:

    # mc "It’s not going to stop on its own, is it?"
    mc "它不会自己止住，对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1509
translate chinese story05_2_1_eb5b8702:

    # k "Huh? It’ll bleed a bit. Then stop. Hopefully."
    k "啊？流点血就停了。但愿吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1511
translate chinese story05_2_1_fa26a0ce:

    # mc "What were you thinking, ripping an implant out of your neck?"
    mc "你在想什么，把植入体从脖子上硬拽出来？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1513
translate chinese story05_2_1_82091822_2:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1514
translate chinese story05_2_1_4b5a0375:

    # mc "Sit down. I’ll find something to treat that wound."
    mc "坐下。我去找点东西给你处理伤口。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1516
translate chinese story05_2_1_fea46a6f:

    # k "What, you my mom now? I can handle it."
    k "怎么，你现在成我妈了？我自己能弄。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1518
translate chinese story05_2_1_288cd843:

    # mc "Kalestra."
    mc "卡莱斯特拉。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1521
translate chinese story05_2_1_3306bbe9:

    # k "Yeah, yeah… mom."
    k "行行行……妈。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1526
translate chinese story05_2_1_a77a111f:

    # mc "Alright. So what exactly did you shove into my head?"
    mc "好。你到底往我脑子里塞了什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1528
translate chinese story05_2_1_51903399:

    # k "I had a talk with the one-eyed girl."
    k "我跟那个独眼姑娘谈了谈。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1531
translate chinese story05_2_1_46b60069:

    # mc "The one-eyed one? Lora?"
    mc "独眼的那个？洛拉？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1533
translate chinese story05_2_1_a1295175:

    # k "Yeah. Long story short, I told her I’d sleep with you."
    k "对。长话短说，我跟她说我要跟你上床。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1534
translate chinese story05_2_1_b8c17dd5:

    # k "Ow, damn it. That hurts!"
    k "哎，该死的。好疼！"

# game/Story04.rpy:1536
translate chinese story05_2_1_7f204ed5:

    # mc "And her reaction?"
    mc "她什么反应？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1537
translate chinese story05_2_1_82091822_3:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1540
translate chinese story05_2_1_6ff1287d:

    # k "She didn’t like it. Looked at me like she wanted me dead."
    k "她不喜欢。看我的眼神像想弄死我。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1541
translate chinese story05_2_1_ba8a4335:

    # k "Honestly? Kinda enjoyed it."
    k "说实话？还挺享受。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1543
translate chinese story05_2_1_f157eef7:

    # mc "Predictable."
    mc "毫不意外。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1546
translate chinese story05_2_1_f1c97c10:

    # k "Later I thought about it… and caught myself on a weird idea."
    k "后来我想了想……发现自己冒出个怪念头。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1547
translate chinese story05_2_1_5cc342fa:

    # k "You two are married, right?"
    k "你们俩是夫妻，对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1549
translate chinese story05_2_1_cf1adef2:

    # mc "Yeah."
    mc "是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1551
translate chinese story05_2_1_430b8173:

    # k "So how do you deal with arousal then? Implants. All that crap."
    k "那你怎么处理性欲？植入体。那一堆破玩意儿。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1554
translate chinese story05_2_1_51ca185a:

    # mc "Where are you going with this?"
    mc "你想说什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:1556
translate chinese story05_2_1_02eedb59:

    # k "I need to blow off steam, [mc]. Like, actually need to."
    k "我需要发泄，[mc]。是真的需要。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1558
translate chinese story05_2_1_fca52711:

    # mc "No."
    mc "不行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1561
translate chinese story05_2_1_cc417541:

    # k "This isn’t a whim. It’s a need. I lent you power, you help me with something else."
    k "这不是心血来潮。这是需要。我把力量借给你，你帮我另一件事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1563
translate chinese story05_2_1_5cf4a35c:

    # mc "I have a wife."
    mc "我有老婆。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1565
translate chinese story05_2_1_2833b383:

    # k "And? Honestly, I don’t give a damn."
    k "那又怎样？说实话，我一点都不在乎。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1566
translate chinese story05_2_1_cd3173ca:

    # k "But if you really need an excuse…"
    k "但你要是真需要一个借口……"

# game/Story04.rpy:1571
translate chinese story05_2_1_9c3b5cab:

    # k "Time to test your new toy."
    k "该试试你的新玩具了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:1573
translate chinese story05_2_1_fb838115:

    # mc "(What-)"
    mc "（什么——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:1581
