# game/Story04.rpy:2030
translate chinese story05_2_1_1080a4a9:

    # k "I’m gonna be using you a lot more often."
    k "我会更频繁地用你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2032
translate chinese story05_2_1_428eefee:

    # mc "This was a one-time thing."
    mc "这只是一次性的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2033
translate chinese story05_2_1_eeec84ca:

    # k "The last time will be when you’re dead."
    k "最后一次，会是你死的时候。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2035
translate chinese story05_2_1_bf31aca8:

    # k "Until then?"
    k "在那之前呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2036
translate chinese story05_2_1_100019b3:

    # k "You and I are tied together now."
    k "你和我，现在绑在一起了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2059
translate chinese story05_3_1c8acf17:

    # am "..."
    am "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2061
translate chinese story05_3_87a5d7f6:

    # sel "You know, I’m amazed at how calm your face looks in a moment like this."
    sel "你知道吗，这种时候你脸还这么平静，我真惊讶。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2062
translate chinese story05_3_61e58563:

    # sel "The capital is burning, our armies are fighting tooth and nail for every planet… and here you stand, simply watching."
    sel "首都在烧，我们的军队为每一颗星球拼死血战……而你站在这儿，只是看着。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2063
translate chinese story05_3_fd102096:

    # sel "Most would call you-"
    sel "大多数人会说你——"

# game/Story04.rpy:2065
translate chinese story05_3_67bfa7ab:

    # am "Mad?"
    am "疯了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2067
translate chinese story05_3_cc4b9c1c:

    # sel "Exactly."
    sel "正是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2068
translate chinese story05_3_56e85cbc:

    # am "You’re all the same, strong and clever on the outside, yet hollow and helpless within."
    am "你们都一样，外表强大聪明，内里却空洞无力。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2070
translate chinese story05_3_2eb3ff31:

    # sel "Emotionless as always. But tell me, sitting idle while the other races spit on us… is that truly your idea of a solution?"
    sel "还是一如既往地没有感情。可告诉我，别的种族朝我们吐口水，你却干坐着……这真是你所谓的解决办法？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2072
translate chinese story05_3_68858537:

    # am "Before you lie to me, learn to believe your own falsehoods."
    am "在骗我之前，先学会相信你自己的谎话。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2073
translate chinese story05_3_61089d35:

    # am "You murdered your father and stole the throne. Why?"
    am "你杀了你父亲，夺了王座。为什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2074
translate chinese story05_3_b9729f67:

    # am "The answer is simple, self-interest."
    am "答案很简单，私利。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2076
translate chinese story05_3_7ff1791f:

    # sel "So easy to speak for someone who has lived her whole life above the world."
    sel "一个一辈子活在世界之上的人，说这话当然轻松。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2077
translate chinese story05_3_4d01e91c:

    # sel "Though, what am I saying, you even locked your own sister in the abyss."
    sel "不过我在说什么呢，你连自己妹妹都锁进了深渊。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2079
translate chinese story05_3_4970e38a:

    # am "Time. A fundamental constant, one that never needed a definition to exist."
    am "时间。一个基本常量，从来不需要定义就能存在。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2080
translate chinese story05_3_c37ceec6:

    # am "Tell me, why has every era tried to claim dominion over it?"
    am "告诉我，为什么每个时代都想宣称对它的统治权？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2082
translate chinese story05_3_4446b4bc:

    # sel "Because of fear, fear of your own frailty."
    sel "因为恐惧，对自己脆弱的恐惧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2083
translate chinese story05_3_c154c5c5:

    # sel "Even beings like us share one terror: we are not immortal."
    sel "即便像我们这样的存在，也有同一个恐惧：我们并非不朽。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2085
translate chinese story05_3_52275d77:

    # am "This power did not save your father."
    am "这份力量没能救你父亲。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2087
translate chinese story05_3_b65fc501:

    # sel "Nor did it save your sister."
    sel "也没能救你妹妹。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2089
translate chinese story05_3_9ca8f620:

    # sel "Tell me, Evrelia possessed this power, yet her path led to chains. Why?"
    sel "告诉我，艾芙蕾莉亚拥有这份力量，可她的路却通向锁链。为什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2091
translate chinese story05_3_1c8acf17_1:

    # am "..."
    am "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2093
translate chinese story05_3_bc968356:

    # sel "Don’t pretend you never thought it through."
    sel "别装得你从没想过。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2095
translate chinese story05_3_1aca2bde:

    # sel "People fear what they cannot control."
    sel "人害怕自己控制不了的东西。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2096
translate chinese story05_3_3fb71332:

    # sel "And you were no exception. You locked her away because you feared her strength."
    sel "你也不例外。你把她锁起来，是因为你怕她的力量。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2098
translate chinese story05_3_7c6714c8:

    # am "I acted for the Federation’s sake."
    am "我是为了联邦。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2100
translate chinese story05_3_059fb3ab:

    # sel "So did I."
    sel "我也是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2101
translate chinese story05_3_e3519dfd:

    # sel "It’s always easier to judge another’s sins… while refusing to look at your own."
    sel "评判别人的罪总是更容易……只要不看自己的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2102
translate chinese story05_3_3c59ae3e:

    # sel "Your sister became the proof of it."
    sel "你妹妹就成了活生生的证明。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2104
translate chinese story05_3_5a8d2bf3:

    # am "She knew what she was stepping into, yet she chose stupidity over reason."
    am "她清楚自己要踏进什么，可她还是选了愚蠢，而不是理智。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2106
translate chinese story05_3_5fb3b007:

    # sel "Both betrayed, yet, I wonder… To die feels kinder than living an entire life knowing your own blood betrayed you."
    sel "两个都是被背叛的，不过我倒是想……死，总好过活一辈子，明知自己的血亲背叛了自己。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2108
translate chinese story05_3_e7680b7b:

    # am "You could have spared him. You chose not to."
    am "你本可以放过他。是你选择不放。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2109
translate chinese story05_3_72aceebc:

    # sel "He was a weak ruler. He bowed and endured humiliation from every other race."
    sel "他是个软弱的统治者。他向所有种族低头，忍受羞辱。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2111
translate chinese story05_3_64735397:

    # am "He was wise, not weak."
    am "他是明智，不是软弱。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2112
translate chinese story05_3_1ce5c2bc:

    # sel "And you call that wisdom? Bowing before those we surpass, absurd."
    sel "你管那叫明智？向被我们超越的人低头，荒唐。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2113
translate chinese story05_3_fe2cf831:

    # sel "Because of him we lost respect. Because of him, they mocked us, and despised us."
    sel "因为他，我们失去了尊重。因为他，他们嘲笑我们，鄙视我们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2117
translate chinese story05_3_b194efcc:

    # am "He did what he did to save your people."
    am "他那么做，是为了救你的人民。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2119
translate chinese story05_3_59481cd0:

    # sel "To suffer for what we never did? Please…"
    sel "为我们从没做过的事受苦？得了吧……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2120
translate chinese story05_3_ee4379e4:

    # sel "Death is preferable to such disgrace."
    sel "死也好过这种耻辱。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2122
translate chinese story05_3_5f19499b:

    # am "Few can kneel and silence their pride."
    am "很少有人能跪下，还能把自尊按下去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2123
translate chinese story05_3_73ca11ad:

    # am "Which is why the other leaders respected him. None ever looked down on him for it."
    am "所以其他领袖才敬重他。没有一个人因此看轻他。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2124
translate chinese story05_3_d7b42565:

    # sel "..."
    sel "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2125
translate chinese story05_3_291c5099:

    # am "Why are you here?"
    am "你来干什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2127
translate chinese story05_3_8c341647:

    # sel "The same reason you didn’t stop us."
    sel "跟你没拦我们，是同一个原因。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2128
translate chinese story05_3_57f89419:

    # sel "The Abyss."
    sel "深渊。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2130
translate chinese story05_3_1c8acf17_2:

    # am "..."
    am "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2131
translate chinese story05_3_93d1259b:

    # sel "But what interests me more is this, why didn’t you do it yourself?"
    sel "但我更感兴趣的是这个——你为什么不自己动手？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2133
translate chinese story05_3_57b69a42:

    # am "(Because I already tried...)"
    am "（因为我已经试过了……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2140
translate chinese story05_3_883fcb00:

    # em "Stop acting like a spoiled child. You knew the law, and you chose to break it anyway? Lost your mind?"
    em "别像个被惯坏的孩子。你知道那条法律，还是选择违背？你脑子坏了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2142
translate chinese story05_3_f66ae881:

    # Evrel "Yeah, yeah, I screwed up, happy now? And maybe, {b}just maybe{/b}, I got a little carried away and made a mess."
    Evrel "是啊是啊，我搞砸了，满意了？也许，{b}只是也许{/b}，我有点上头，把事情弄乱了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2143
translate chinese story05_3_bc6983c5:

    # em "Got carried away,’ she says. There’s a whole damn galaxy hunting you now. If not for your sister, I’d have handed you to the Keepers myself."
    em "她说“有点上头”。现在整个该死的星系都在追杀你。要不是你姐姐，我早亲手把你交给守护者了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2144
translate chinese story05_3_1de8db17:

    # Evrel "Oh please. Forgot to ask the big lizard for her opinion."
    Evrel "哦，得了吧。忘了问那头大蜥蜴的意见了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2145
translate chinese story05_3_24316cc5:

    # em "You wanna get mouthy now? Go ahead, tell her something. She barely listens to me as it is."
    em "你现在还想嘴硬？行啊，你去跟她说。她本来就不怎么听我的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2146
translate chinese story05_3_e68c079d:

    # am "(If I hand her over, the Federation falls. If I don’t… I lose her.)"
    am "（我把她交出去，联邦就垮。我不交……我就会失去她。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2148
translate chinese story05_3_abf42d65:

    # am "I agree with Ember. You crossed a forbidden line."
    am "我同意恩伯。你越了禁线。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2151
translate chinese story05_3_820073ba:

    # Evrel "Asti, forgive me, really. I messed up, I admit it. But who could’ve thought a small spatial jump would stir up this kind of storm?"
    Evrel "阿丝，原谅我，真的。我搞砸了，我承认。可谁能想到一次小小的空间跳跃会掀起这种风暴？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2152
translate chinese story05_3_84617e24:

    # Evrel "(I never imagined the consequences would be this bad...)"
    Evrel "（我从没想过后果会这么严重……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2154
translate chinese story05_3_1be8b5cc:

    # em "Jump or no jump. Rules exist to keep people like you in check, and you broke them."
    em "跳没跳都一样。规则的存在就是为了管住你这种人，而你破了规矩。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2159
translate chinese story05_3_b625677a:

    # Evrel "Come on. They’ve always been looking for an excuse to get rid of me. This little stunt just gave them one."
    Evrel "得了吧。他们一直想找个借口除掉我。这一出正好送上门。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2160
translate chinese story05_3_038433df:

    # Evrel "Can’t control it, eliminate it. Sounds familiar, doesn’t it?"
    Evrel "控制不了，就消灭。听着耳熟吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2163
translate chinese story05_3_2601a833:

    # Evrel "(So flawless, so noble on the outside...)"
    Evrel "（外表那么完美，那么高贵……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2164
translate chinese story05_3_f7c07f4b:

    # Evrel "(...and underneath the masks, greedy, selfish hypocrites.)"
    Evrel "（……面具底下，全是贪婪自私的伪君子。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2166
translate chinese story05_3_a0402936:

    # am "(Am I ready to lose her? And is the Federation worth more than one life…?)"
    am "（我准备好失去她了吗？联邦比一条命更值吗……？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2167
translate chinese story05_3_206f4910:

    # am "What will you do now?"
    am "你现在打算怎么办？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2170
translate chinese story05_3_bf020874:

    # Evrel "Honestly? No idea. I’ll figure something out. Wouldn’t be the first time I crawl out of trouble like this."
    Evrel "说实话？不知道。我会想办法。这种事我也不是第一次爬出来了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2172
translate chinese story05_3_026dd865:

    # em "I doubt it. They’re not letting you walk away from this."
    em "我怀疑。这次他们不会让你走掉。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2173
translate chinese story05_3_b2b23bb6:

    # Evrel "And why exactly wouldn’t they?"
    Evrel "他们凭什么不让？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2177
translate chinese story05_3_bfb5967e:

    # am "It will damage their authority."
    am "那会损害他们的权威。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2179
translate chinese story05_3_dc50c666:

    # Evrel "You both know damn well they don’t care about authority!"
    Evrel "你们俩都他妈清楚，他们根本不在乎什么权威！"

# game/Story04.rpy:2180
translate chinese story05_3_3c0997ba:

    # Evrel "After what they did to the elves, especially not."
    Evrel "他们对精灵干了那种事之后，更不在乎。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2182
translate chinese story05_3_9ca89262:

    # am "Evrelia."
    am "艾芙蕾莉亚。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2183
translate chinese story05_3_d8ef886c:

    # am "We all know what became of the first expedition that entered the First Tomb."
    am "我们都知道，第一支进入第一墓穴的远征队后来怎么了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2184
translate chinese story05_3_c23f30e8:

    # am "Everything the Empire unleashed, and everything that remains, is absolute taboo."
    am "帝国释放出的一切，以及残存的一切，都是绝对的禁忌。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2186
translate chinese story05_3_b5625d82:

    # Evrel "That’s just an excuse-"
    Evrel "那不过是个借口——"

# game/Story04.rpy:2188
translate chinese story05_3_64515613:

    # am "You broke that taboo. What happened to the elves… now awaits us."
    am "你破了那条禁忌。发生在精灵身上的事……现在轮到我们了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2190
translate chinese story05_3_ed423e38:

    # Evrel "I-"
    Evrel "我——"

# game/Story04.rpy:2193
translate chinese story05_3_ec607d06:

    # Evrel "(No… she’s right. What was I even thinking, going to that tomb?)"
    Evrel "（不……她说得对。我到底在想什么，才去了那座墓？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2194
translate chinese story05_3_68254f4a:

    # Evrel "(Seriously… what {b}was{/b} I thinking?)"
    Evrel "（说真的……我到底{b}在想什么{/b}？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2196
translate chinese story05_3_6a7b7eef:

    # am "(She’s powerful, unbelievably powerful… but her recklessness has never led to anything good. And still, I cannot give her up.)"
    am "（她很强，强得难以置信……可她的鲁莽从来没带来过好结果。即便如此，我还是不能放弃她。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2197
translate chinese story05_3_b49f21e4:

    # am "(Even if it costs us everything.)"
    am "（哪怕代价是我们的一切。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2199
translate chinese story05_3_8839fce5:

    # am "I will send you into the future."
    am "我会把你送进未来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2203
translate chinese story05_3_8451c01c:

    # Evrel "WHAT?! ARE YOU OUT OF YOUR MIND?! This will destroy you, and the entire Federation!"
    Evrel "什么？！你疯了吗？！这会毁了你，还有整个联邦！"

# game/Story04.rpy:2204
translate chinese story05_3_a74574fe:

    # Evrel "Asti, please, tell me you’re joking-"
    Evrel "阿丝，求你，告诉我你在开玩笑——"

# game/Story04.rpy:2205
translate chinese story05_3_d2188890:

    # am "I won’t allow them to harm you."
    am "我不会让他们伤害你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2206
translate chinese story05_3_6ad649f5:

    # Evrel "Then I’ll kill them myself!"
    Evrel "那我就自己杀了他们！"

# game/Story04.rpy:2207
translate chinese story05_3_1c8acf17_3:

    # am "..."
    am "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2208
translate chinese story05_3_b4d854a3:

    # am "If you kill them, the galaxy will collapse into chaos."
    am "你要是杀了他们，整个星系会陷入混乱。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2210
translate chinese story05_3_47da6034:

    # Evrel "The idea of you sacrificing yourself doesn’t exactly make me smile!"
    Evrel "你要牺牲自己这个念头，可一点都不让我高兴！"

# game/Story04.rpy:2212
translate chinese story05_3_e1504de9:

    # em "Let this be a damn lesson-"
    em "让这成为一次该死的教训——"

# game/Story04.rpy:2213
translate chinese story05_3_7e54a4b1:

    # Evrel "Don’t interfere."
    Evrel "别插手。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2214
translate chinese story05_3_1f60867d:

    # am "Evrelia, listen to me..."
    am "艾芙蕾莉亚，听我说……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2216
translate chinese story05_3_239b034c:

    # Evrel "If this is your way out, then I hate it. The thought that I stay alive at the cost of your life is the worst thing imaginable!"
    Evrel "如果这就是你的出路，那我恨它。想到我活着是用你的命换的，这是我能想到最糟的事！"

# game/Story04.rpy:2217
translate chinese story05_3_fc983a8f:

    # Evrel "And I decide what I do with my damn life!"
    Evrel "而我这该死的命怎么用，我自己决定！"

# game/Story04.rpy:2219
translate chinese story05_3_08b07af0:

    # am "Don’t do anything foolish. This is the only way."
    am "别做傻事。这是唯一的办法。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2223
translate chinese story05_3_495d0387:

    # em "She’s gone."
    em "她走了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2224
translate chinese story05_3_75a50f00:

    # em "Damn, that girl’s got a nasty temper, really nasty."
    em "妈的，那丫头脾气真冲，真够冲的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2227
translate chinese story05_3_dabc8a6d:

    # em "Wait, were you actually ready to trade everything you own for her?"
    em "等等，你真准备拿你所有的一切去换她？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2228
translate chinese story05_3_d6e9cfbd:

    # em "Should’ve handed her to me instead, I would’ve-"
    em "还不如把她交给我，我本来可以——"

# game/Story04.rpy:2232
translate chinese story05_3_68c3546f:

    # em "Alright, alright, don’t glare at me."
    em "行，行，别瞪我。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2233
translate chinese story05_3_bf9b5df0:

    # em "I’ll see what I can do, but don’t get your hopes up."
    em "我看看能做什么，但别抱太大希望。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2236
translate chinese story05_3_7f3251b8:

    # am "Thank you, Em."
    am "谢谢你，恩。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2237
translate chinese story05_3_178dae24:

    # em "I’m not doing it for free."
    em "我可不是白干的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2238
translate chinese story05_3_bb30b747:

    # em "I’ll take my cut, and it’ll be big."
    em "我要抽成，而且不小。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2245
translate chinese story05_3_8ea6b1b9:

    # am "(A world in exchange for one life… or one life in exchange for a world?)"
    am "（用一个世界换一条命……还是用一条命换一个世界？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2247
translate chinese story05_3_05cf51cb:

    # am "(Sometimes we must make choices so heavy that everything hangs on their outcome.)"
    am "（有时候我们必须做出极其沉重的选择，一切都系于其结果。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2249
translate chinese story05_3_b53b388a:

    # am "(And a path that appears righteous… may lead to anything but salvation.)"
    am "（而一条看似正直的路……通向的可能恰恰不是救赎。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2250
translate chinese story05_3_39b2f587:

    # am "(At times, we must compromise with fate itself.)"
    am "（有时，我们必须与命运本身妥协。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2252
translate chinese story05_3_31007c2b:

    # Evrel "{b}Sings"
    Evrel "{b}歌唱{/b}"

# game/Story04.rpy:2253
translate chinese story05_3_dc4d5b43:

    # am "(All our lives we stood side by side, our triumphs, our failures, our joy and our suffering were always shared between the two of us.)"
    am "（我们一生都并肩而立，我们的胜利、失败、喜悦与痛苦，从来都是两个人一起分担。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2255
translate chinese story05_3_21850939:

    # am "(Without her, I would not exist. And without me, neither would she.)"
    am "（没有她，我无法存在。没有我，她也不会存在。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2256
translate chinese story05_3_abe730c0:

    # am "(Yet one day the world decided it wished to take her from me.)"
    am "（可有一天，世界决定要把她从我这带走。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2258
translate chinese story05_3_94e5eb58:

    # Evrel "You know… sometimes I wonder what it would be like if we all turned into flowers."
    Evrel "你知道吗……有时候我会想，要是我们全都变成花，会是什么样子。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2260
translate chinese story05_3_73f0b076:

    # am "A flower?"
    am "花？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2262
translate chinese story05_3_564d27c0:

    # Evrel "To live your entire life in one quiet place. On a beautiful meadow, wrapped in nature’s calm."
    Evrel "一辈子待在一个安静的地方。在一片美丽的草地上，被自然的宁静裹着。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2263
translate chinese story05_3_e33d515e:

    # Evrel "If that isn’t paradise… then what is?"
    Evrel "那要不算天堂……还有什么是？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2265
translate chinese story05_3_7a5a326c:

    # am "It does sound… not entirely unpleasant."
    am "听着……倒也不算太坏。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2268
translate chinese story05_3_87f08231:

    # Evrel "So? Did you come here to change my mind?"
    Evrel "怎么？你是来让我改主意的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2271
translate chinese story05_3_c42afbd5:

    # am "Will it work?"
    am "会有用吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2272
translate chinese story05_3_d93c1303:

    # am "You’ve already chosen your path."
    am "你已经选好路了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2274
translate chinese story05_3_b74c036e:

    # Evrel "When flowers die, they shed their petals…"
    Evrel "花枯萎的时候，会落下花瓣……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2275
translate chinese story05_3_127611d4:

    # Evrel "…so something new can grow."
    Evrel "……好让新的东西长出来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2276
translate chinese story05_3_64a8777b:

    # Evrel "And then, they begin a new life."
    Evrel "然后，它们开始新的生命。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2279
translate chinese story05_3_1bd05abb:

    # am "You don’t regret leaving this world like this?"
    am "你就这么离开这个世界，不后悔？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2281
translate chinese story05_3_2c13a87a:

    # Evrel "We’ve both lived a long life. By everyone else’s standards, far too long."
    Evrel "我们俩都活得够久了。按别人的标准，是太久了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2283
translate chinese story05_3_d0e91a8f:

    # Evrel "And for better or worse, everything has an end. I just chose to hurry the inevitable."
    Evrel "不管好坏，一切都有终点。我只是选择把不可避免的提前了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2284
translate chinese story05_3_06d3173d:

    # Evrel "Do I regret it?"
    Evrel "我后悔吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2285
translate chinese story05_3_ae1515b6:

    # Evrel "Not even a little."
    Evrel "一点都不。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2287
translate chinese story05_3_bca6ab1f:

    # Evrel "But you… you’re a different matter."
    Evrel "可你……你是另一回事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2288
translate chinese story05_3_8481c1a4:

    # Evrel "I’m sorry, Asti, but you’ll have to keep living without me."
    Evrel "对不起，阿丝，但你得继续活下去，在没有我的日子里。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2289
translate chinese story05_3_c6c89e61:

    # Evrel "And take care of this whole Federation… and everything that comes with it."
    Evrel "还有照顾好整个联邦……以及随之而来的一切。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2292
translate chinese story05_3_7ea072d2:

    # am "Cruel."
    am "残忍。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2294
translate chinese story05_3_d5e3dd86:

    # Evrel "I’m sorry."
    Evrel "对不起。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2298
translate chinese story05_3_4c749945:

    # am "Do you remember how we spent time here as children?"
    am "还记得我们小时候在这儿怎么玩的吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2299
translate chinese story05_3_22b4d1e0:

    # Evrel "Huh? Oh, don’t remind me, I still get chills remembering how angry Mother got when she saw the bruises."
    Evrel "啊？哦，别提醒我，我现在想起来还发冷——妈看到那些淤青时气成什么样。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2301
translate chinese story05_3_bf1d7dca:

    # am "Can you blame her? You were a real little shit back then."
    am "能怪她吗？你那时候真是个十足的小混球。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2302
translate chinese story05_3_e76b22f5:

    # Evrel "Whoa, since when do you use words like that?"
    Evrel "哇，你什么时候开始说这种话了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2304
translate chinese story05_3_7c7cd8fa:

    # am "Back off."
    am "少来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2308
translate chinese story05_3_80ca0814:

    # Evrel "(I’d almost forgotten what it feels like… to just sit and talk with family.)"
    Evrel "（我几乎忘了那种感觉……就是跟家人坐着聊聊天。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2309
translate chinese story05_3_8087fe24:

    # Evrel "(Funny how, right before death, you start thinking about things like that.)"
    Evrel "（真有意思，临死之前，人反而开始想这种事。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2311
translate chinese story05_3_7515cb18:

    # Evrel "Sis?"
    Evrel "姐？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2313
translate chinese story05_3_61497916:

    # am "Yes?"
    am "嗯？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2315
translate chinese story05_3_a73407b6:

    # Evrel "Thank you."
    Evrel "谢谢你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2316
translate chinese story05_3_1c8acf17_4:

    # am "..."
    am "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2318
translate chinese story05_3_3ff2d0c2:

    # am "(Every minute stretches into eternity… and eternity passes in a single minute.)"
    am "（每一分钟都拖成永恒……而永恒只在一分钟里流过。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2319
translate chinese story05_3_ce32ae26:

    # am "(It’s hard. It hurts. It feels hopeless… and worst of all, nothing can change it.)"
    am "（很难。很疼。让人觉得绝望……最糟的是，什么都改变不了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2321
translate chinese story05_3_c70d0986:

    # Evrel "Beautiful."
    Evrel "真美。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2323
translate chinese story05_3_be008720:

    # am "Why didn’t you go to the past and try to fix this?"
    am "你为什么不去过去，试着改变这一切？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2325
translate chinese story05_3_802d4ae6:

    # Evrel "I tried."
    Evrel "我试过。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2326
translate chinese story05_3_4a1bd9d5:

    # Evrel "But I couldn’t."
    Evrel "可做不到。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2330
translate chinese story05_3_f653f572:

    # am "What? How?"
    am "什么？怎么会？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2332
translate chinese story05_3_8e9a8177:

    # Evrel "No matter how much power you have, messing with time never ends well."
    Evrel "不管你有多少力量，玩弄时间从来没好下场。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2333
translate chinese story05_3_0d344611:

    # Evrel "In the end, Asti… we’re not all-powerful."
    Evrel "说到底，阿丝……我们不是无所不能的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2335
translate chinese story05_3_49b992bc:

    # Evrel "Well… I guess it’s time. They’ve arrived."
    Evrel "好吧……时候到了。他们来了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2337
translate chinese story05_3_f875a9d0:

    # "The air shuddered ever so slightly, and three figures in white cloaks appeared in the garden."
    "空气微微震颤，花园里出现了三个披白斗篷的身影。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2339
translate chinese story05_3_3d4a3581:

    # a "And I am pleased to see you as well, Lady Astoria… young lady."
    a "我也很高兴见到你，阿斯托里亚夫人……以及这位年轻女士。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2341
translate chinese story05_3_facf703f:

    # Evrel "Disgusting as ever."
    Evrel "一如既往地恶心。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2343
translate chinese story05_3_38aaea10:

    # am "What does a Keeper want in my home?"
    am "守护者来我家想干什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2345
translate chinese story05_3_a7e44f3f:

    # a "By Order Seventy-Two, Lady Evrelia is to be brought before the court and punished for her crimes."
    a "依据第七十二号令，艾芙蕾莉亚女士须被押上法庭，为其罪行受罚。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2346
translate chinese story05_3_9d33d4df:

    # am "Who issued this order?"
    am "谁下的令？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2347
translate chinese story05_3_d147a714:

    # a "Unanimously. The Council of Keepers."
    a "一致通过。守护者议会。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2348
translate chinese story05_3_a317bc40:

    # a "Any resistance will result in your entire race being wiped from the face of the galaxy."
    a "任何抵抗，都会导致你们整个种族从星系上被抹去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2349
translate chinese story05_3_a3fa6188:

    # a "But I suspect you already know that."
    a "不过我猜你早就知道了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2351
translate chinese story05_3_43625aa3:

    # am "May I ask a single question, why her?"
    am "我能问一个问题吗，为什么是她？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2353
translate chinese story05_3_0a933921:

    # a "I fail to see what you mean."
    a "我不明白你的意思。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2355
translate chinese story05_3_9bd8586e:

    # am "Very well, I’ll answer it myself: you fear that one day she will surpass you."
    am "好，我自己来答：你们怕她有一天会超越你们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2356
translate chinese story05_3_c4d82c07:

    # am "You fear what you cannot control, and so you chose to erase her."
    am "你们害怕控制不了的东西，所以选择抹掉她。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2358
translate chinese story05_3_0f6fb0c5:

    # a "I understand your emotions, but you are crossing the bounds of what is permit-"
    a "我理解你的情绪，但你正在越过允许的界——"

# game/Story04.rpy:2360
translate chinese story05_3_f0b96a7c:

    # am "Many have committed far worse crimes than she, yourself included. Yet you select her as the sacrificial lamb?"
    am "比她罪重得多的人多得是，包括你自己。可你们偏偏挑她当祭品？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2362
translate chinese story05_3_5cc44e8a:

    # am "Then hear this: if you intend to destroy her, you will have to destroy all of us."
    am "那就听好了：你们要毁她，就得毁掉我们所有人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2364
translate chinese story05_3_dc394fca:

    # am "Every last one."
    am "一个不剩。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2365
translate chinese story05_3_bb8e4b4e:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2367
translate chinese story05_3_1a72da87:

    # aa "What are your orders, Keeper? If she joins the fight, we won’t stand a chance."
    aa "守护者，请下令。要是她参战，我们毫无胜算。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2369
translate chinese story05_3_4575439e:

    # a "If I were you, I would think very carefully about your next move."
    a "我要是你，就会非常仔细地想想下一步。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2371
translate chinese story05_3_520399ab:

    # y "I wouldn’t advise it."
    y "我劝你别这么做。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2372
translate chinese story05_3_f8793759:

    # aa "How dare you speak to a Keeper that way, servant?!"
    aa "你一个仆人，竟敢那样跟守护者说话？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:2373
translate chinese story05_3_71a86863:

    # y "..."
    y "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2376
translate chinese story05_3_ca56f8ed:

    # am "(whisper) If a flower is meant to begin a new life today… then I will become the soil for it."
    am "（低声）要是今天注定有一朵花要开始新生……那我就做它的土壤。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2377
translate chinese story05_3_1562ec1b:

    # am "(whisper) I’ll hold them off. Run. Run with everything you have."
    am "（低声）我来拖住他们。跑。用尽全力跑。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2379
translate chinese story05_3_a3f9c1ec:

    # Evrel "(Her voice shakes… yet I can feel the anger and hurt behind her mask of strength and independence. Damn, Asti… you’re amazing.)"
    Evrel "（她的声音在抖……可我能感觉到她那副坚强独立的壳子底下的愤怒和伤痛。妈的，阿丝……你太厉害了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2381
translate chinese story05_3_e3164e91:

    # Evrel "(But none of this will change anything.)"
    Evrel "（可这些都改变不了什么。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2383
translate chinese story05_3_8118763b:

    # Evrel "(whisper) A choice without a choice… right?"
    Evrel "（低声）一个没得选的选择……对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2385
translate chinese story05_3_2afab3c0:

    # Evrel "You were incredible. I always felt safe behind your back."
    Evrel "你太厉害了。躲在你的背后，我总是很安心。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2386
translate chinese story05_3_a9fca864:

    # Evrel "I was really, really lucky to have a big sister like you."
    Evrel "能有你这样的姐姐，我真的、真的特别幸运。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2387
translate chinese story05_3_c2b4ba9a:

    # Evrel "In that sense… I guess I won the lottery at birth."
    Evrel "这么说来……我大概一出生就中了头奖。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2390
translate chinese story05_3_15890d67:

    # Evrel "Still… it’s time to say goodbye."
    Evrel "不过……该说再见了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2391
translate chinese story05_3_4aafbd81:

    # "Tears begin to well up in Astoria’s eyes."
    "阿斯托里亚的眼里开始泛起泪水。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2393
translate chinese story05_3_0e61cccb:

    # am "It’s cruel..."
    am "太残忍了……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2395
translate chinese story05_3_132e405d:

    # am "So cruel... unbearably cruel..."
    am "太残忍了……残忍得让人受不了……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2397
translate chinese story05_3_d7a7cc38:

    # Evrel "(A compromise with fate, sis. A compromise with fate...)"
    Evrel "（跟命运妥协，姐。跟命运妥协……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2400
translate chinese story05_3_ca8dde94:

    # Evrel "One last smile, sis. I don’t want the last thing I see to be your sad face."
    Evrel "最后一个笑容，姐。我不想最后看见的是你难过的脸。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2401
translate chinese story05_3_33f7d098:

    # Evrel "That’s better."
    Evrel "这样就好多了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2402
translate chinese story05_3_58e40f2d:

    # Evrel "Take care of yourself."
    Evrel "照顾好自己。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2404
translate chinese story05_3_edbc6848:

    # a "Please, come with us, Lady Evrelia."
    a "请跟我们走，艾芙蕾莉亚女士。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2407
translate chinese story05_3_58afc374:

    # y "I don’t know much… but I heard they plan to cast her into the Abyss."
    y "我知道的不多……但我听说他们打算把她丢进深渊。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2409
translate chinese story05_3_6f6017cc:

    # y "I’m not sure how different that is from death… but still."
    y "我说不准那跟死有什么不同……不过还是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2411
translate chinese story05_3_6adcab04:

    # y "How are you holding up?"
    y "你还撑得住吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2413
translate chinese story05_3_9f8a7455:

    # am "I… could you leave me alone?"
    am "我……能让我一个人待着吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2415
translate chinese story05_3_71a86863_1:

    # y "..."
    y "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2417
translate chinese story05_3_76844891:

    # am "Please."
    am "求你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2421
translate chinese story05_3_74d05bfd:

    # y "I’ll go keep an eye on the young lady."
    y "我去看着那位年轻女士。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2422
translate chinese story05_3_4ad97173:

    # am "Thank you."
    am "谢谢。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2424
translate chinese story05_3_26e1620f:

    # am "(Sometimes we must make choices... and their consequences reshape our entire lives.)"
    am "（有时我们必须做出选择……而它们的后果会重塑我们的一生。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2425
translate chinese story05_3_cbec281a:

    # am "(A world for one life… so that’s what it truly means…)"
    am "（一个世界换一条命……原来是这个意思……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2427
translate chinese story05_3_8d8e48c5:

    # am "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAaaah...!"
    am "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊……！"

# game/Story04.rpy:2428
translate chinese story05_3_6fbb48f5:

    # "Regret and sorrow fused into one. A voice that had always remained restrained finally broke, torn apart by raw, unbearable pain."
    "悔恨与悲伤融为一体。那一直克制着的声音终于破了，被生猛、无法承受的痛苦撕开。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2458
translate chinese story05_4_3c109c55:

    # L "(What an idiot I am… Why, why can’t I just go to him and say it all as it is?)"
    L "（我真是个蠢货……为什么，为什么我就不能直接走到他面前，把一切照实说出来？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2460
translate chinese story05_4_7b1caaa5:

    # L "(No lies. No pretending. Just tell him everything. What happened. What I did.)"
    L "（不撒谎。不装。就把一切告诉他。发生了什么。我做了什么。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2461
translate chinese story05_4_8d4ef61d:

    # L "(Just...)"
    L "（只要……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2463
translate chinese story05_4_77f212f0:

    # L "(whispering) God… I really am a fool..."
    L "（低声）天哪……我真是个傻瓜……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2464
translate chinese story05_4_65cabcbf:

    # v "..."
    v "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2467
translate chinese story05_4_d9d98dab:

    # L "(When did everything go wrong? When I started the research? Or when I got involved with Li?)"
    L "（一切是什么时候开始出错的？是我开始研究的时候？还是我跟李牵扯上的时候？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2468
translate chinese story05_4_e445f39e:

    # L "(And was there ever a way out of this? I don’t know...)"
    L "（这事真有出路吗？我不知道……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2470
translate chinese story05_4_89a262fd:

    # L "Tell me... what would you do if one day you found out that the person you love..."
    L "告诉我……要是有一天你发现，你爱的人……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2471
translate chinese story05_4_168522fd:

    # L "Someone you thought you knew your whole life..."
    L "你以为自己一辈子都了解的那个人……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2472
translate chinese story05_4_5bbfbb7d:

    # L "Had been lying to you?"
    L "一直在骗你？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2474
translate chinese story05_4_3dcff64c:

    # v "Are you talking about yourself?"
    v "你说的是你自己？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2476
translate chinese story05_4_cb923f3c:

    # L "Just answer the question."
    L "回答问题就行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2478
translate chinese story05_4_fc9e3154:

    # v "That depends on the circumstances."
    v "那得看情况。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2479
translate chinese story05_4_22d518e9:

    # v "If the intentions were good - acceptable."
    v "出发点是好的——可以接受。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2480
translate chinese story05_4_dbae0734:

    # v "If not… that’s a different matter."
    v "如果不是……那就是另一回事了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2482
translate chinese story05_4_809f3b35:

    # L "Everything is poison, everything is medicine. It’s all about the dose… isn’t it."
    L "什么都是毒，什么都是药。关键在剂量……对吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2485
translate chinese story05_4_25306d27:

    # v "Something like that."
    v "差不多是这个意思。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2488
translate chinese story05_4_ae36c3c2:

    # L "Then… can I tell him the truth? He’s suffered enough already. At least he deserves to know why-"
    L "那……我能告诉他真相吗？他受的苦已经够多了。至少他该知道为什么——"

# game/Story04.rpy:2492
translate chinese story05_4_3bb6a523:

    # v "Out of the question. The less he knows, the better it is, for all of us."
    v "不行。他知道得越少，对我们所有人越好。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2494
translate chinese story05_4_74b42149:

    # L "(“Better”? You’re just afraid that if he learns the truth, you’ll have to kill him. And you can’t do that.)"
    L "（“越好”？你只是怕他知道真相之后，你不得不杀他。而你下不了手。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2495
translate chinese story05_4_dd6b474d:

    # L "(Though it’s almost funny… He went to the edge of the galaxy for me.)"
    L "（说起来倒有点好笑……他为了我跑到了星系的边缘。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2498
translate chinese story05_4_42535635:

    # L "(And in return… what do I give him? Lies? Pain? Ignorance… and a broken heart?)"
    L "（换回来的……我给了他什么？谎言？痛苦？蒙在鼓里……还有一颗碎掉的心？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2499
translate chinese story05_4_64ab554d:

    # L "(What a reward. Well done. Wife of the year... no, of the decade…)"
    L "（真是好回报。干得漂亮。年度妻子……不，是十年最佳……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2502
translate chinese story05_4_9993b94e:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2503
translate chinese story05_4_59b6df58:

    # L "(So, Lora, what are you going to do? Keep running away… or finally tell him what really happened?)"
    L "（那么，洛拉，你要怎么办？继续逃……还是终于告诉他真相？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2504
translate chinese story05_4_9993b94e_1:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2506
translate chinese story05_4_48825996:

    # L "You have the helm. I… need to step away for a moment."
    L "你来掌舵。我……得离开一会儿。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2508
translate chinese story05_4_563f2bc4:

    # v "The Lady won’t approve."
    v "夫人不会同意的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2510
translate chinese story05_4_a0bbb727:

    # L "I’ll deal with her later."
    L "她那边我之后处理。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2511
translate chinese story05_4_dd37c320:

    # v "(You will regret this.)"
    v "（你会后悔的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2518
translate chinese story05_4_de932652:

    # L "(whisper) I’m sorry, my love… I did all this to protect you."
    L "（低声）对不起，我的爱人……我做这一切都是为了保护你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2521
translate chinese story05_4_51666017:

    # L "(Will he believe me? I’ve lied for so long… and he, he saw it, but chose to accept it.)"
    L "（他会信我吗？我撒了这么久的谎……而他，他看得出来，却选择接受。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2522
translate chinese story05_4_0f1356f1:

    # L "(But what if the truth changes everything? What if he doesn’t believe me at all?)"
    L "（可万一真相改变了一切呢？万一他压根不信我呢？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2525
translate chinese story05_4_3faf3b14:

    # L "(What if, after I tell him everything, he thinks it’s just another lie?)"
    L "（万一我把一切说出来之后，他觉得那又是个谎？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2526
translate chinese story05_4_416fbd70:

    # L "(Then it’s over. After all this… trust would be almost impossible to restore.)"
    L "（那就完了。经历了这一切……信任几乎不可能再修好。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2529
translate chinese story05_4_01fd664b:

    # L "(Maybe… maybe it’s not too late to leave everything as it is?)"
    L "（也许……也许现在让一切都保持原样还不算太晚？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2531
translate chinese story05_4_9993b94e_2:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2534
translate chinese story05_4_6a5f03d8:

    # L "(Sighs) May I come in?"
    L "（叹气）我能进来吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2538
translate chinese story05_4_831ed014:

    # h "Lora? What are you doing here?"
    h "洛拉？你来这儿干嘛？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2539
translate chinese story05_4_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2540
translate chinese story05_4_e6024885:

    # mc "(So the main heroine finally shows up… Guess it’s time to settle everything here and now.)"
    mc "（女主角终于登场了……看来该在这儿一次把一切都了结。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2541
translate chinese story05_4_bbc0a062:

    # L "I-"
    L "我——"

# game/Story04.rpy:2543
translate chinese story05_4_0bf2c0fb:

    # mc "Lora? We need to talk."
    mc "洛拉？我们得谈谈。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2545
translate chinese story05_4_d2eeed15:

    # L "(That look… He’s serious. There’s no point in running, is there? Right…)"
    L "（那个眼神……他是认真的。跑也没用了吧？对……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2547
translate chinese story05_4_9ccf733b:

    # L "Alright. But before that… I need to ask you for one thing."
    L "好。但在那之前……我得求你一件事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2548
translate chinese story05_4_8cc5451c:

    # L "No matter what happens after this, promise me you’ll do exactly what I say. Okay?"
    L "不管之后发生什么，答应我，你会完全照我说的做。行吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2550
translate chinese story05_4_b86e1dee:

    # mc "I have to hear-"
    mc "我得先听——"

# game/Story04.rpy:2551
translate chinese story05_4_ed2a5aac:

    # L "[mc]! Please… Just this. I’m begging you…"
    L "[mc]！求你……就这一次。我求你了……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2554
translate chinese story05_4_022037a2:

    # mc "(And what do I do? Agree? Like I even have a choice…)"
    mc "（那我怎么办？答应？好像我有得选似的……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2555
translate chinese story05_4_c89045fb:

    # mc "(On the other hand, what do I lose? She’s your wife, after all… or trying to be.)"
    mc "（换个角度，我又能失去什么？她毕竟是你的妻子……或者说想当。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2557
translate chinese story05_4_e8b52a56:

    # mc "I’ve already given you enough chances."
    mc "我已经给过你够多机会了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2558
translate chinese story05_4_f9ec880e:

    # mc "Sorry. I really am trying… but I can’t."
    mc "抱歉。我真的在努力……可我做不到。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2560
translate chinese story05_4_bbc0a062_1:

    # L "I-"
    L "我——"

# game/Story04.rpy:2561
translate chinese story05_4_0a3b7915:

    # L "(It hurts… my chest feels tight, like it’s being crushed. But I should have expected this.)"
    L "（好疼……胸口发紧，像被碾着。可我本该料到。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2563
translate chinese story05_4_9d9f0392:

    # L "Yes. I understand."
    L "好。我明白。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2565
translate chinese story05_4_2dd7ac95:

    # L "(Sighs) Alright then. I’ll tell you everything exactly as it is."
    L "（叹气）那好。我会把一切照实告诉你们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2566
translate chinese story05_4_609aefeb:

    # L "No secrets. No lies. The truth. And only the truth."
    L "不藏。不骗。真话。只有真话。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2568
translate chinese story05_4_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2569
translate chinese story05_4_130151fb:

    # L "No one knows if we’ll survive. If we’ll even be able to complete this mission…"
    L "没人知道我们能不能活下来。能不能完成这次任务……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2570
translate chinese story05_4_f03658c6:

    # L "I thought about it for a long time. Weighed every possible outcome."
    L "我想了很久。把每种可能的结果都掂量过了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2571
translate chinese story05_4_bf6869f0:

    # mc "(She’s scared, voice shaking, eyes darting everywhere. Part of me wants to pull her close… but the other part-)"
    mc "（她怕了，声音在抖，眼神到处飘。我有一部分想把她拉过来……可另一部分——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2573
translate chinese story05_4_d548d924:

    # h "Yeah, alright, I’ll just-"
    h "行，那好，我就先——"

# game/Story04.rpy:2575
translate chinese story05_4_57c44f0f:

    # L "No. You all need to hear this. Every single one of you."
    L "不。你们都得听。每一个人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2577
translate chinese story05_4_f5b849b2:

    # mc "Even Miriel and Kalestra?"
    mc "连米莉尔和卡莱斯特拉也是？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2578
translate chinese story05_4_9993b94e_3:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2579
translate chinese story05_4_61a9dceb:

    # L "They will be the guarantee of your survival."
    L "她们是你们活下去的保障。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2581
translate chinese story05_4_6c807545:

    # mc "A guarantee for survival? Fine."
    mc "活下去的保障？行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2583
translate chinese story05_4_d61fd2df:

    # L "(Sighs) Well… it’s time."
    L "（叹气）好吧……时候到了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2587
translate chinese story05_4_15d25cf8:

    # "13 years before the key events. Or 4 years by Earth standards."
    "关键事件发生前 13 年。按地球标准算是 4 年。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2592
translate chinese story05_4_423a89f1:

    # L "{b}humming softly{/b}"
    L "{b}轻轻哼着歌{/b}"

# game/Story04.rpy:2593
translate chinese story05_4_e7e7ec51:

    # L "(What should I make for dinner today? Curry? No, [mc] hates it. Maybe baked chicken?)"
    L "（今天晚饭做什么？咖喱？不行，[mc] 讨厌咖喱。烤鸡？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2594
translate chinese story05_4_2de2e6b6:

    # L "(No, that won’t work. Norman won’t eat that… Hmm. Cutlets? Yes! That’s perfect!)"
    L "（不行，那个不行。诺曼不吃……嗯。肉饼？对！完美！）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2596
translate chinese story05_4_e5a64b31:

    # L "(whispering) The best cutlets in the whole world… yay…"
    L "（低声）全世界最好吃的肉饼……耶……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2598
translate chinese story05_4_472d7514:

    # a "Dr. Lora? You seem to be in a great mood today. Something nice happen?"
    a "洛拉博士？你今天心情很好啊。有什么好事？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2600
translate chinese story05_4_9f764cb9:

    # L "We’re having a family dinner today!"
    L "我们今天要家庭聚餐！"

# game/Story04.rpy:2602
translate chinese story05_4_50bbaf8d:

    # L "Well, just like yesterday… but today is even more special than yesterday!"
    L "嗯，跟昨天一样……可今天比昨天还要特别！"

# game/Story04.rpy:2604
translate chinese story05_4_511ea4ec:

    # a "Really? Glad to hear that. Please, go ahead, and have a lovely family dinner, Dr. Lora."
    a "真的？很高兴听到这个。请吧，祝你们家庭聚餐愉快，洛拉博士。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2606
translate chinese story05_4_38667339:

    # L "Oh, yes, yes. And tell your wife thank you for the recipe, it was absolutely wonderful."
    L "哦，好，好。还有，替我谢你妻子，那个食谱简直太棒了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2607
translate chinese story05_4_c5cf4c42:

    # a "I will."
    a "我会的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2608
translate chinese story05_4_b3cff24d:

    # a "And give my regards to your son. He’s always welcome here."
    a "也替我向你儿子问好。这儿随时欢迎他。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2609
translate chinese story05_4_17fe3ba6:

    # L "Take care Jason."
    L "保重，杰森。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2613
translate chinese story05_4_1c4b9f55:

    # L "(That day felt just as ordinary as any other. At first, nothing hinted at what was coming.)"
    L "（那天感觉跟平常任何一天一样。起初，没有任何迹象预示要发生什么。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2614
translate chinese story05_4_99e1ec03:

    # L "(But that was the day we were assigned to a new site, code-named “Ark.”)"
    L "（可就是那天，我们被派去一个新地点，代号“方舟”。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2615
translate chinese story05_4_a538e2f7:

    # L "(The place where the warp-drive was taken from.)"
    L "（曲速引擎就是从那儿拿走的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2618
translate chinese story05_4_4a83555d:

    # L "(For the record, I’m talking about this thing right here.)"
    L "（说明一下，我说的就是这东西。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2619
translate chinese story05_4_8b27c14f:

    # L "(I knew his origin wasn’t entirely… earthly. I just never imagined it was this far from it.)"
    L "（我知道它的来历不完全……属于地球。只是没想到会远到这个程度。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2621
translate chinese story05_4_9d178b6b:

    # L "With all due respect, Doctor Li, I can’t. I have a family dinner tonight. I need to be there."
    L "恕我直言，李博士，我不能去。今晚有家庭聚餐。我必须到场。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2623
translate chinese story05_4_6501bdac:

    # R "Dr. Lora, without you this entire expedition is going to fall apart."
    R "洛拉博士，没有你，整支远征队都会散架。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2624
translate chinese story05_4_b266dd22:

    # R "And as unpleasant as it may sound, this expedition needs you."
    R "这话可能不好听，但这次远征需要你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2626
translate chinese story05_4_241d0b6d:

    # L "Oh, really? Well, thank you for the compliment. It’s nice to know I’m valued so highly, but still… I can’t."
    L "哦，真的？那谢谢夸奖。知道我被看得这么重，挺好，不过……我还是不能去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2627
translate chinese story05_4_d8779c81:

    # L "My husband and I talked about this side of my work. We both decided to spend more time together."
    L "我丈夫和我聊过我工作的这一面。我们都说好要多花点时间在一起。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2629
translate chinese story05_4_44eae256:

    # R "You don’t need to worry. It won’t take much of your time."
    R "你不用担心。不会占你多少时间。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2630
translate chinese story05_4_61e09e07:

    # R "After that, we’ll take you straight home. Deal?"
    R "之后我们直接送你回家。成交？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2632
translate chinese story05_4_cc012f42:

    # L "I… I need to make a call."
    L "我……我得打个电话。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2635
translate chinese story05_4_81dd9707:

    # mc "And how long is this going to take?"
    mc "这得多久？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2637
translate chinese story05_4_44ac9c84:

    # L "I don’t know. They say I should be home by evening."
    L "不知道。他们说傍晚前我该能回家。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2639
translate chinese story05_4_d534f3d0:

    # mc "Lora, we’ve been through this before."
    mc "洛拉，这事我们已经说过一遍了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2640
translate chinese story05_4_291db75f:

    # L "I know, love. I know. That’s why I’m asking you… What do you think?"
    L "我知道，亲爱的。我知道。所以我才问你……你觉得呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2642
translate chinese story05_4_126af4cd:

    # mc "(sigh) Just this once, alright? If you’re late, Norman and I will eat everything and leave you nothing."
    mc "（叹气）就这一次，行吗？你要是晚了，我和诺曼就把东西全吃光，一点不给你留。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2644
translate chinese story05_4_2388cfa4:

    # L "Hey! That’s not what we agreed on!"
    L "喂！说好的可不是这样！"

# game/Story04.rpy:2646
translate chinese story05_4_36f1e18c:

    # mc "Yeah, yeah, I’ll listen to all your complaints later… Take care."
    mc "行行行，你的抱怨我回头再听……保重。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2648
translate chinese story05_4_91422991:

    # L "I love you. Kisses for both of you!"
    L "我爱你。给你们俩都亲一口！"

# game/Story04.rpy:2653
translate chinese story05_4_f5ba6f48:

    # R "Ready?"
    R "准备好了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2654
translate chinese story05_4_109280b3:

    # L "Yes."
    L "好了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2655
translate chinese story05_4_78430511:

    # L "(The moment that turned our entire lives upside down.)"
    L "（那一刻，把我们整个人生掀翻了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2659
translate chinese story05_4_91e1caf8:

    # L "(The Ark. An alien vessel designed to transport a relocation mechanism. In simple terms, a gate.)"
    L "（方舟。一艘外星飞船，用来运送某种位移装置。简单说，就是一道门。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2660
translate chinese story05_4_abc0bea1:

    # L "(One important clarification: a breach and a gate are not the same thing.)"
    L "（有一点很重要：裂隙和门不是一回事。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2661
translate chinese story05_4_6fb78722:

    # L "(A breach is a natural phenomenon. A gate is a machine built to control one.)"
    L "（裂隙是自然现象。门是用来控制它的机器。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2662
translate chinese story05_4_cf29779d:

    # L "(The truth is… we learned that much, much later.)"
    L "（事实是……这些是我们很久很久以后才知道的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2665
translate chinese story05_4_85594dc2:

    # L "What… what is this?"
    L "这……这是什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2667
translate chinese story05_4_51e0888d:

    # R "A spacecraft."
    R "一艘飞船。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2668
translate chinese story05_4_f839bfee:

    # R "How it ended up here, we don’t know."
    R "它怎么到这儿来的，我们不知道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2669
translate chinese story05_4_c364ad41:

    # R "But that’s where the gate research started. Or so I was told."
    R "但门的研究就是从这儿开始的。至少我是这么听说的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2671
translate chinese story05_4_bbdf7a11:

    # L "That’s it?! I thought… I thought it was just a marketing name or something…"
    L "就这个？！我还以为……以为那只是个宣传用的名字之类的……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2672
translate chinese story05_4_19e14b97:

    # L "(whispering) An actual alien ship… Someone pinch me."
    L "（低声）真是一艘外星飞船……谁掐我一下。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2673
translate chinese story05_4_61b65785:

    # L "Wait, and you expect us to go inside? Don’t you think that’s a little… reckless?"
    L "等等，你还指望我们进去？你不觉得这有点……鲁莽吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2675
translate chinese story05_4_322f2620:

    # R "I agree. Completely."
    R "我完全同意。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2676
translate chinese story05_4_dafd43c1:

    # R "To be honest, I know no more than you do."
    R "说实话，我知道的并不比你多。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2677
translate chinese story05_4_a4728b03:

    # L "Wait, what? Then how-"
    L "等等，什么？那怎么——"

# game/Story04.rpy:2679
translate chinese story05_4_f2928398:

    # aa "There’s no need to worry. We’ll explain everything, on one condition."
    aa "不必担心。我们会解释一切，但有一个条件。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2680
translate chinese story05_4_1b69d2cd:

    # aa "You cooperate."
    aa "你们配合。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2681
translate chinese story05_4_d807b914:

    # R "And what happens if we refuse?"
    R "要是我们拒绝呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2682
translate chinese story05_4_24dc6d40:

    # aa "We’d really hate for something… unfortunate to happen to you."
    aa "我们会非常不愿意看到……什么不幸的事发生在你们身上。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2684
translate chinese story05_4_2742c993:

    # L "(Everything we knew was kept under strict confidentiality. We were forced to sign stacks of non-disclosure agreements.)"
    L "（我们知道的一切都被严格保密。我们被逼着签了一摞摞保密协议。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2686
translate chinese story05_4_ac3d6b6e:

    # L "(Though, to be fair, those papers weren’t exactly the real guarantee.)"
    L "（不过说句公道话，那些纸并不是真正的保障。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2687
translate chinese story05_4_d8b0a4e1:

    # L "(The real guarantee were the guns pressed against our heads.)"
    L "（真正的保障是顶在我们头上的枪。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2689
translate chinese story05_4_cede01e6:

    # mc "So that’s when you started calling only from your phone..."
    mc "所以你就是从那时候开始只用你手机打电话……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2691
translate chinese story05_4_a684dd3f:

    # L "I remember how angry that made you. But I didn’t have a choice. Honestly, convincing them to even allow phone calls was already a small victory."
    L "我记得那让你多生气。可我没得选。说实话，能说服他们允许打电话，已经算小小的胜利了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2693
translate chinese story05_4_58a981cb:

    # mc "If you’d refused, none of this might’ve happened."
    mc "你要是当时拒绝，这一切也许都不会发生。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2695
translate chinese story05_4_ab1f8b4d:

    # L "I- yes. You’re right. Maybe I should’ve refused. Maybe I should have walked away..."
    L "我——是。你说得对。也许我该拒绝。也许我该走开……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2696
translate chinese story05_4_cf422a1e:

    # L "But I couldn’t."
    L "可我做不到。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2698
translate chinese story05_4_afb74cd0:

    # h "Don’t push her. You know how much all that science crap means to her. She didn’t even realize it would turn out like this."
    h "别逼她。你知道那些科学破事对她多重要。她自己都没想到会变成这样。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2701
translate chinese story05_4_ee163efc:

    # mc "Oh, so now you’re on her side?"
    mc "哦，现在你站她那边了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2704
translate chinese story05_4_c0faa04d:

    # h "You’re both just as important to me. And watching you tear into each other? Not exactly my idea of a good time."
    h "你们俩对我一样重要。看你们互相撕？这可不算我的乐子。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2705
translate chinese story05_4_515ac98c:

    # h "And come on. Don’t forget, we’ve been in her shoes before. If anyone should get how she feels, it’s you."
    h "还有，得了吧。别忘了，我们也经历过她那种处境。要说谁该懂她的感受，就是你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2707
translate chinese story05_4_84476e8b:

    # mc "(If she had told us all this from the start, I wouldn’t have said a word. But now? Now it’s a different story entirely.)"
    mc "（她要是从一开始就把这些说出来，我一个字都不会说。可现在？现在完全不是一回事了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2708
translate chinese story05_4_e9c75761:

    # h "(Oh, great. So now he’s playing the victim? Wow, impressive-)"
    h "（哦，好极了。现在他演起受害者了？哇，真厉害——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2709
translate chinese story05_4_b8f81952:

    # mc "Olivia."
    mc "奥利维亚。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2710
translate chinese story05_4_10bec45e:

    # mc "(Stop drilling holes in me with your eyes.)"
    mc "（别拿眼神在我身上钻洞了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2712
translate chinese story05_4_6e5a6696:

    # h "What, [mc]?"
    h "怎么了，[mc]？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2714
translate chinese story05_4_623538d7:

    # mc "(No. Get a grip.)"
    mc "（不。稳住。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2716
translate chinese story05_4_4bbde761:

    # mc "(sigh) Let’s just continue, alright?"
    mc "（叹气）继续吧，行吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2720
translate chinese story05_4_e1f684b7:

    # L "(We spent some time aboard that ship. A month? Maybe a little less.)"
    L "（我们在那艘船上待了一阵。一个月？也许短一点。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2721
translate chinese story05_4_b6485116:

    # L "(At some point, I started keeping a journal, just to keep myself sane.)"
    L "（某个时候，我开始写日记，纯粹为了不让自己疯掉。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2723
translate chinese story05_4_b083419e:

    # L "(At first, everything seemed… manageable. We were assigned to study the gates. To understand their purpose. To figure out how to activate them.)"
    L "（起初，一切都还……能应付。我们被派去研究那些门。搞懂它们的用途。弄清楚怎么激活它们。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2727
translate chinese story05_4_489d405d:

    # L "(Hour after hour. Day after day. Everything only got worse.)"
    L "（一小时又一小时。一天又一天。一切只是越来越糟。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2728
translate chinese story05_4_5a4d5a8f:

    # L "(We didn’t know how to open them. And we weren’t even sure they really were gates at all.)"
    L "（我们不知道怎么打开它们。甚至都不确定它们到底是不是门。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2730
translate chinese story05_4_cccea87e:

    # L "(Those who broke faster… they were simply taken away.)"
    L "（那些崩溃得更快的人……就那么被带走了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2731
translate chinese story05_4_ff7af11b:

    # L "(Where to - no one ever told us.)"
    L "（带去哪儿——没人告诉过我们。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2733
translate chinese story05_4_a0b40540:

    # mc "(Those zombies… they’ve got to be connected to this somehow.)"
    mc "（那些丧尸……肯定跟这事有某种关联。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2739
translate chinese story05_4_2e29b790:

    # h "So… how did you end up here?"
    h "那……你是怎么到这儿来的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2741
translate chinese story05_4_0d5bf6b3:

    # mc "(So that recorder really was hers…)"
    mc "（所以那个录音笔真是她的……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2742
translate chinese story05_4_8e1b5ad4:

    # mc "They found the source. The filthiest one imaginable, but they found it."
    mc "他们找到了源头。最脏的那种，但他们找到了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2743
translate chinese story05_4_95bf3694:

    # h "(His voice… is he shaking?)"
    h "（他的声音……他在抖吗？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2745
translate chinese story05_4_88594c53:

    # h "That bad?"
    h "有那么糟？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2746
translate chinese story05_4_1d4a85ce:

    # h "(Alright, this is getting way too tense. Time to crack a joke.)"
    h "（好了，这气氛太绷了。该开个玩笑。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2748
translate chinese story05_4_919d52ea:

    # h "Why do the Ninja Turtles always attack in a group of four?"
    h "忍者神龟为什么总是四个人一起上？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2749
translate chinese story05_4_dcbc61fb:

    # h "Because their teacher is a rat!"
    h "因为他们的老师是只老鼠！"

# game/Story04.rpy:2751
translate chinese story05_4_198a862c:

    # k "Heh. Not bad."
    k "嘿。还行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2752
translate chinese story05_4_93145fff:

    # h "(Yeah… not the reaction I was hoping for.)"
    h "（是啊……不是我想要的反应。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2754
translate chinese story05_4_7345317e:

    # h "So what’s this mysterious energy source everyone’s freaking out about?"
    h "那这个让所有人炸毛的神秘能源到底是什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2756
translate chinese story05_4_39c6b048:

    # Mi "Blood. More precisely, the life carried inside it."
    Mi "血。更准确地说，是血里承载的生命。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2757
translate chinese story05_4_2fded262:

    # h "..."
    h "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2759
translate chinese story05_4_ff932e82:

    # h "What?"
    h "什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2760
translate chinese story05_4_a255536d:

    # mc "(They aren’t burning the blood itself. They’re extracting the life energy carried within it.)"
    mc "（他们烧的不是血本身。他们提取的是血里承载的生命能量。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2762
translate chinese story05_4_58ae8c8a:

    # mc "Disgusting, isn’t it?"
    mc "恶心吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2764
translate chinese story05_4_1ae0de7c:

    # h "That’s… yeah. Wow."
    h "那……是啊。哇。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2765
translate chinese story05_4_1589c336:

    # h "Wait. Is that why there’s a bloodbath in the streets right now?"
    h "等等。现在街上血流成河就是因为这个？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2766
translate chinese story05_4_0563a075:

    # mc "Yes. Every death gives the system more of it."
    mc "是。每死一个人，系统就多得到一份。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2767
translate chinese story05_4_294be3a9:

    # h "For what?"
    h "为了什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2769
translate chinese story05_4_0c446907:

    # mc "I don’t know… But that’s not the point right now."
    mc "我不知道……但现在这不是重点。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2770
translate chinese story05_4_0a5f750a:

    # mc "So what happened next? I get how you ended up here, more or less."
    mc "那接下来呢？你怎么到这儿来的，我大概懂了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2772
translate chinese story05_4_2360bb55:

    # mc "Astoria and Ember opened the gate and led the survivors in."
    mc "阿斯托里亚和恩伯打开了门，把幸存者带了进来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2773
translate chinese story05_4_d37dd2ff:

    # mc "What interests me is the reason. How?"
    mc "我感兴趣的是原因。怎么做到的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2778
translate chinese story05_4_f17f3fcf:

    # L "(The reason? Should I really say it as it was, or-)"
    L "（原因？我该照实说吗，还是——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2779
translate chinese story05_4_15ac6682:

    # L "It wasn’t exactly like that. The gates… didn’t open the way they were supposed to."
    L "不完全是那样。那些门……并没有按该有的方式打开。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2781
translate chinese story05_4_2db4ea4f:

    # L "(No, Lora. Say it. All of it. They need to know. He needs to know.)"
    L "（不，洛拉。说出来。全都说出来。他们需要知道。他也需要知道。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2782
translate chinese story05_4_023aac97:

    # L "They pulled me somewhere else entirely."
    L "它们把我拉到了一个完全不同的地方。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2785
translate chinese story05_4_a5c6c2d9:

    # L "The Abyss."
    L "深渊。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2789
translate chinese story05_4_1c9d1f32:

    # mc "(Wait, what?)"
    mc "（等等，什么？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2790
translate chinese story05_4_e162e18e:

    # mc "So you were in the Abyss? But how?"
    mc "所以你进过深渊？可怎么进去的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2792
translate chinese story05_4_ef6f51c6:

    # Mi "It’s…"
    Mi "这……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2793
translate chinese story05_4_dc563231:

    # k "(whistling) Well damn… now that’s a revelation."
    k "（吹口哨）好家伙……这才叫爆料。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2796
translate chinese story05_4_fb12c97d:

    # h "Hey, hey, hold on. Can someone explain to me where that reaction even came from?"
    h "喂，喂，等等。谁能给我解释一下，这反应是怎么来的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2798
translate chinese story05_4_6d45d90f:

    # k "You ruined the whole mood. Absolutely butchered the scene."
    k "你把气氛全毁了。这场戏被你演砸了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2800
translate chinese story05_4_d468f118:

    # h "Then maybe enlighten me, what kind of abyss is this supposed to be? So I’m not completely out of the loop."
    h "那不如给我科普一下，这算什么深渊？好让我别完全跟不上。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2802
translate chinese story05_4_be919a93:

    # k "No light, no darkness. Just the Abyss, lurking in the shadows. No time to run. No sound to scream."
    k "没有光，没有暗。只有深渊，潜伏在影子里。没时间跑。没声音喊。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2803
translate chinese story05_4_dc9c60a5:

    # k "That little rhyme’s been floating around for ages."
    k "这首小调传了好多年了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2804
translate chinese story05_4_f0343c0e:

    # k "Or, even simpler, picture a black screen in front of you. And here we are, welcome to the Abyss."
    k "或者更简单点，想象你眼前一块黑屏。就这样，欢迎来到深渊。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2806
translate chinese story05_4_efdcfd20:

    # Mi "That’s an oversimplification… but in plain terms, yes. That’s it."
    Mi "这说得太简化了……但通俗讲，是的。就是这样。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2807
translate chinese story05_4_67e4b248:

    # h "Mm-hm. Interesting. If there’s nothing there… then how the hell do you get out?"
    h "嗯哼。有意思。要是那儿什么都没有……那他妈怎么出来？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2810
translate chinese story05_4_827bc971:

    # k "Ding-ding, we’ve got a winner. You don’t."
    k "叮叮，答对了。出不来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2811
translate chinese story05_4_9a19759e:

    # k "That’s exactly why her story’s so damn intriguing."
    k "所以她的故事才这么他妈有意思。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2813
translate chinese story05_4_336391a8:

    # mc "(And still, that place, the one the younger sister of Astoria stood in, I remember every detail I saw there.)"
    mc "（可那个地方，阿斯托里亚妹妹站过的那个地方，我在那儿看到的每一个细节都记得。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2815
translate chinese story05_4_338986f6:

    # mc "If no one’s ever been in the Abyss, then where did the rumor even come from?"
    mc "要是没人进过深渊，那这传闻又是从哪儿来的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2818
translate chinese story05_4_469b25f0:

    # k "That’s… actually a good question. Where did it come from?"
    k "这……确实是个好问题。从哪儿来的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2819
translate chinese story05_4_13204d8b:

    # k "Huh. Never really thought about it."
    k "嗯。还真没想过。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2821
translate chinese story05_4_a0202169:

    # Mi "People like to gossip about things they don’t understand."
    Mi "人总爱对自己不懂的东西嚼舌根。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2822
translate chinese story05_4_ba2169b4:

    # Mi "For most of them, the Abyss is nothing more than a myth."
    Mi "对大多数人来说，深渊不过是个传说。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2824
translate chinese story05_4_76496ffa:

    # k "Yeah. Pretty much."
    k "是啊。差不多。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2825
translate chinese story05_4_74cece54:

    # h "A myth? You hear that, [mc]? So what now… we’re mythbusters? Ha!"
    h "传说？听见没，[mc]？那现在我们算什么……流言终结者？哈！"

# game/Story04.rpy:2829
translate chinese story05_4_ff7addc1:

    # mc "(Chuckle) Guess so."
    mc "（轻笑）看来是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2830
translate chinese story05_4_cd4d2b1b:

    # mc "Time to find out what that myth is hiding. Lora?"
    mc "该看看这传说藏着什么了。洛拉？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2835
translate chinese story05_4_794e845e:

    # L "(Endless scorched plains. No animals. No plants. Nothing. Just dust.)"
    L "（一望无际的焦土平原。没有动物。没有植物。什么都没有。只有灰。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2837
translate chinese story05_4_cb3ddc70:

    # L "(I never saw a sun. No star. No source of light. Yet something, or someone, was lighting my path.)"
    L "（我从没见过太阳。没有恒星。没有光源。可有什么，或者什么人，在照亮我的路。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2839
translate chinese story05_4_bcafb1fb:

    # L "(I wandered that place for hours. Maybe longer. Searching for an exit. No success. At some point, I caught myself thinking-)"
    L "（我在那地方游荡了几个小时。也许更久。找出口。没找到。某个时候，我发现自己在想——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2840
translate chinese story05_4_61b32fcc:

    # L "(If I don’t find a way out… how am I supposed to survive here? That’s when the panic started.)"
    L "（要是我找不到出路……在这儿怎么活？就是从那时候开始慌的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2841
translate chinese story05_4_4ba68b51:

    # L "(I tried to fight it. Talk myself out of it. Convince myself it wasn’t real.)"
    L "（我试着对抗它。劝自己别慌。说服自己那不是真的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2844
translate chinese story05_4_913bab13:

    # L "(Didn’t help much. Cold. Hunger. Panic. Exhaustion. That was my constant state.)"
    L "（没什么用。寒冷。饥饿。恐慌。疲惫。那就是我的常态。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2846
translate chinese story05_4_35d42be2:

    # L "(It kept pressing down on me. Slowly. At first, all I wanted was to go home. Later… I just wanted it to end.)"
    L "（它一直压着我。慢慢地。起初我只想回家。后来……我只想让它结束。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2848
translate chinese story05_4_edfd6413:

    # L "(But you… and Norman. You gave me strength. Enough to keep moving.)"
    L "（可你……还有诺曼。你们给了我力量。够我继续走。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2850
translate chinese story05_4_0e659f5f:

    # L "(Funny thing is - hunger barely affected my body. I felt it, sure. It was unpleasant. But that was all.)"
    L "（好笑的是——饥饿几乎影响不到我的身体。我能感觉到，当然。不舒服。但也就那样。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2851
translate chinese story05_4_2de0436c:

    # L "(Honestly, I don’t know how long I stayed there. But to me… it felt like an eternity.)"
    L "（说实话，我不知道在那儿待了多久。可对我来说……像过了永恒。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2853
translate chinese story05_4_9ba0cc5a:

    # L "(Thirst. Labored breathing. Complete exhaustion.)"
    L "（口渴。呼吸困难。彻底虚脱。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2854
translate chinese story05_4_cd206755:

    # L "(And then my body just gave up.)"
    L "（然后我的身体就这么放弃了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2855
translate chinese story05_4_76c61d77:

    # L "(No strength to move. No will. Nothing.)"
    L "（没力气动。没意志。什么都没有。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2859
translate chinese story05_4_98419ced:

    # L "(The end.)"
    L "（结束了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2865
translate chinese story05_4_d4ce6c95:

    # L "(Or so I thought.)"
    L "（我本来是这么以为的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2866
translate chinese story05_4_45d9771b:

    # L "(When I opened my eyes again… I was back where it all began.)"
    L "（等我再睁开眼……我又回到了最开始的地方。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2868
translate chinese story05_4_9993b94e_4:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2871
translate chinese story05_4_1704a47b:

    # mc "(This…)"
    mc "（这……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2875
translate chinese story05_4_c31334f4:

    # h "INSANITY! Get over here, you, you massive asshole! Why, tell me WHY you didn’t say this from the start?!"
    h "疯了吧！你给我过来，你、你这个大混蛋！为什么，告诉我为什么你一开始不说？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:2876
translate chinese story05_4_6684edda:

    # h "Why did you keep all of this to yourself?!"
    h "你为什么把这一切都自己憋着？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:2878
translate chinese story05_4_c8702bd9:

    # L "Compared to what came after… that was nothing."
    L "跟后面发生的事比……那不算什么。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2880
translate chinese story05_4_9f1e792d:

    # mc "(I… I don’t even know what to feel anymore. What to think…)"
    mc "（我……我都不知道该有什么感觉了。该想什么……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2882
translate chinese story05_4_3cac5d5e:

    # mc "(While I was worrying about her, raging at her, blaming her… she was surviving. Literally surviving.)"
    mc "（我担心她、冲她发火、怪她的时候……她正在求生。字面意义上的求生。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2883
translate chinese story05_4_8e5079f3:

    # mc "(And still, a part of me wants to tear myself apart, why didn’t she tell me from the start?)"
    mc "（可我还是有一部分想把自己撕了——她为什么一开始不告诉我？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2885
translate chinese story05_4_d226d40f:

    # mc "Why didn’t you tell me the truth? From the very beginning, why?"
    mc "你为什么不告诉我真相？从一开始，为什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2886
translate chinese story05_4_16581fc2:

    # mc "You think I would’ve treated you differently because of this? You think I would’ve-"
    mc "你觉得我会因为这个就对你另眼相看？你觉得我会——"

# game/Story04.rpy:2888
translate chinese story05_4_fa3bc6f5:

    # L "No. That wasn’t the reason."
    L "不。不是这个原因。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2890
translate chinese story05_4_15753e98:

    # Mi "Tell me… how did you find the place? When there was nothing around you at all?"
    Mi "告诉我……你是怎么找到那个地方的？当时你周围什么都没有。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2894
translate chinese story05_4_9993b94e_5:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2896
translate chinese story05_4_5d975f40:

    # L "(It didn’t happen right away.)"
    L "（不是一开始就发生的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2897
translate chinese story05_4_79c26add:

    # L "(On the fourth attempt, I noticed something in the distance. What exactly it was, I still don’t know.)"
    L "（第四次尝试的时候，我注意到远处有什么东西。到底是什么，我到现在也不知道。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2899
translate chinese story05_4_10c2be14:

    # L "(Not then. Not now. But it became my reference point.)"
    L "（当时不知道。现在也不知道。但它成了我的参照点。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2902
translate chinese story05_4_af99da52:

    # L "(I started moving toward it, thinking it was the way out.)"
    L "（我开始朝它走，以为那是出路。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2903
translate chinese story05_4_a9a000e2:

    # L "(But every time I blacked out, reset. Back to the beginning.)"
    L "（可每次我昏过去，就重置。回到起点。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2905
translate chinese story05_4_ba3e7a2d:

    # L "(I tried. I fought. I searched for a way to break that limit.)"
    L "（我试了。我拼了。我找过打破那个限制的办法。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2907
translate chinese story05_4_3bfa0664:

    # L "(I stayed awake as long as I could.)"
    L "（我尽可能久地保持清醒。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2908
translate chinese story05_4_7014e4d3:

    # L "(Tried different paths.)"
    L "（试过不同的路。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2909
translate chinese story05_4_3d81278f:

    # L "(Tried doing nothing at all.)"
    L "（试过什么都不做。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2910
translate chinese story05_4_071f8464:

    # L "(Tried… anything.)"
    L "（什么都试过……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2912
translate chinese story05_4_bb515b59:

    # L "(Anything at all.)"
    L "（什么都试。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2913
translate chinese story05_4_5e6ebd87:

    # L "(Until I heard a voice. Her voice.)"
    L "（直到我听见一个声音。她的声音。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2916
translate chinese story05_4_83782ccd:

    # L "(Suddenly, she was standing in front of me.)"
    L "（突然，她就站在我面前。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2917
translate chinese story05_4_f6b436ba:

    # L "(Red eyes. White, silky hair. A dress. And a gentle smile.)"
    L "（红眼睛。雪白柔顺的长发。一条裙子。还有一个温柔的笑。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2919
translate chinese story05_4_be2979b3:

    # L "(Astoria’s younger sister. Evrelia.)"
    L "（阿斯托里亚的妹妹。艾芙蕾莉亚。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2920
translate chinese story05_4_42851c7f:

    # L "(She didn’t say a word. Just stood there. Watching me.)"
    L "（她一个字都没说。就那么站着。看着我。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2922
translate chinese story05_4_fc7852d1:

    # L "(I tried to talk to her. Asked who she was. Where we were.)"
    L "（我试着跟她说话。问她是sei。我们在哪儿。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2923
translate chinese story05_4_cadb3a2f:

    # L "(Silence.)"
    L "（沉默。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2924
translate chinese story05_4_593740a8:

    # L "(And yet… in her gaze, in that smile, I felt something strange.)"
    L "（可……在她的目光里，在那个笑里，我感觉到某种奇怪的东西。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2925
translate chinese story05_4_06e83ca5:

    # L "(Warmth.)"
    L "（温暖。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2926
translate chinese story05_4_a04ebaef:

    # L "(For the first time… I felt something.)"
    L "（那是第一次……我感觉到了什么。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2929
translate chinese story05_4_eb2760fe:

    # L "(Something that made me stop wanting to scream from pain and regret.)"
    L "（某种让我不再想因痛苦和悔恨而尖叫的东西。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2931
translate chinese story05_4_9c424347:

    # L "(And so… together with her, I walked toward that reference point.)"
    L "（于是……我跟她一起，朝那个参照点走去。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2936
translate chinese story05_4_b98e6b50:

    # k "Hm… Evrelia? You’re sure it was really her?"
    k "嗯……艾芙蕾莉亚？你确定真是她？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2938
translate chinese story05_4_57f2ac9f:

    # mc "What’s with that tone? Something wrong?"
    mc "这语气什么意思？有什么问题？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2940
translate chinese story05_4_4cd787af:

    # k "Yeah. Your description matches her scarily well. Except for one thing, a gentle smile?"
    k "有。你的描述跟她像得吓人。除了一个地方——温柔的笑？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2941
translate chinese story05_4_b84ad481:

    # k "You were in your right mind back then, right?"
    k "你当时脑子清醒吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2942
translate chinese story05_4_679d9c1f:

    # h "Rude. You know that, right?"
    h "没礼貌。你知道吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2944
translate chinese story05_4_9d7a397d:

    # Mi "But she’s not wrong."
    Mi "可她说得没错。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2945
translate chinese story05_4_f06341ef:

    # Mi "Most people know the Lady’s younger sister as a tyrant… with a cold heart."
    Mi "大多数人只知道夫人的妹妹是个暴君……心冷得很。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2946
translate chinese story05_4_6762ff02:

    # Mi "A gentle smile was never something people associated with her name."
    Mi "温柔的笑，从来没人会跟她名字联系起来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2948
translate chinese story05_4_8119db56:

    # mc "You said the same thing about the Abyss, and look how that turned out."
    mc "你对深渊也是这么说的，结果呢。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2951
translate chinese story05_4_cfed6a8b:

    # k "Don’t butt in, sweetheart. We’re still not sure whether that was the Abyss…"
    k "别插嘴，甜心。我们还不能确定那是不是深渊……"

# game/Story04.rpy:2952
translate chinese story05_4_9b5b34c0:

    # k "or just your little wife having a vivid hallucination."
    k "还是你那小妻子做了个栩栩如生的幻觉。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2954
translate chinese story05_4_e3ee1bd6:

    # mc "You’re saying she’s lying?"
    mc "你是说她在撒谎？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2956
translate chinese story05_4_7ddd46f9:

    # k "Could be."
    k "有可能。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2957
translate chinese story05_4_f0d03cd1:

    # k "Still, there’s a grain of truth in what she said."
    k "不过，她说的话里有一颗真话的种子。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2959
translate chinese story05_4_4bb6d487:

    # mc "Can you confirm that claim?"
    mc "你能证实这个说法吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2961
translate chinese story05_4_0d4d630a:

    # k "Nope."
    k "不能。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2963
translate chinese story05_4_f6b34ecb:

    # mc "(Honestly, that last bit about this… Evrélia? Hard to swallow.)"
    mc "（说实话，最后那段关于这个……艾芙蕾莉亚的？很难咽下去。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2964
translate chinese story05_4_295d2d3f:

    # mc "(But judging by her description, and what I saw in that dream, everything lines up so far.)"
    mc "（可照她的描述，加上我在那个梦里看到的，目前全都对得上。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2965
translate chinese story05_4_9e20caac:

    # mc "You’re surprisingly calm and quiet, are you okay?"
    mc "你出奇地平静和安静，你没事吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2967
translate chinese story05_4_a49ef982:

    # L "I’m telling it exactly as it is. Whether they believe me or not is their choice."
    L "我照实说。他们信不信，是他们的事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2968
translate chinese story05_4_cd68761f:

    # L "I can’t, and won’t, try to convince them."
    L "我不能，也不会去说服他们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2969
translate chinese story05_4_77f30bb0:

    # L "(whispering) In the end… I can understand them."
    L "（低声）说到底……我能理解他们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2973
translate chinese story05_4_570e9671:

    # L "(We walked together, day after day.)"
    L "（我们一起走着，一天又一天。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2974
translate chinese story05_4_93d992f4:

    # L "(Maybe because of everything I’d been through, my senses dulled, I barely felt hunger or cold.)"
    L "（也许因为经历得太多，我的感官钝了，几乎感觉不到饥饿和寒冷。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2975
translate chinese story05_4_407e29dd:

    # L "(Or maybe… she had something to do with it.)"
    L "（或者……跟她有关。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2976
translate chinese story05_4_3d40d03f:

    # L "(Either way, I didn’t dig into it.)"
    L "（不管怎样，我没深究。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2978
translate chinese story05_4_2f3c7e7a:

    # L "(The picture started to come together.)"
    L "（画面开始拼起来了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2979
translate chinese story05_4_d62a417c:

    # L "(I began to see outlines, towers, mechanisms, structures.)"
    L "（我开始看到轮廓、高塔、机械、建筑。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2980
translate chinese story05_4_cd0aab64:

    # L "(Asking myself what it all was, I foolishly decided to ask her instead.)"
    L "（我自己琢磨那是什么，却傻乎乎地决定去问她。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2981
translate chinese story05_4_59a5a2ab:

    # L "(I had nothing to lose.)"
    L "（我没什么可失去的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2982
translate chinese story05_4_0dd2c7fb:

    # L "(And then-)"
    L "（然后——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2984
translate chinese story05_4_7fb69399:

    # Evrel "Tell me… why are you here?"
    Evrel "告诉我……你为什么在这儿？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2986
translate chinese story05_4_475f9bbb:

    # L "(Her voice sounded like a melody. Every word, like a note.)"
    L "（她的声音像一段旋律。每个字都像一个音符。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2988
translate chinese story05_4_3e2b0e44:

    # L "I… don’t know the true reason myself."
    L "我……自己也不知道真正的原因。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2989
translate chinese story05_4_ab5b9724:

    # L "I was simply pulled into this place."
    L "我只是被拉进了这地方。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2990
translate chinese story05_4_425d5902:

    # L "(She only smiled in response.)"
    L "（她只是笑了笑作为回应。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:2992
translate chinese story05_4_cad51054:

    # Evrel "From the moment you appeared here, I’ve been watching you. Seeing you. Feeling you."
    Evrel "从你出现在这儿的那一刻起，我就在看着你。看着你。感觉着你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2993
translate chinese story05_4_9123662a:

    # Evrel "You have a pure heart."
    Evrel "你有一颗纯净的心。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2995
translate chinese story05_4_5d05afe2:

    # L "Uh- thank you? Sorry, this might be awkward, but… what should I call you?"
    L "呃——谢谢？抱歉，这可能有点尴尬，不过……我该怎么称呼你？"

# game/Story04.rpy:2997
translate chinese story05_4_96b7afc9:

    # Evrel "Evrelia."
    Evrel "艾芙蕾莉亚。"

# game/Story04.rpy:2999
translate chinese story05_4_d793b07d:

    # L "My name is Lora. It’s nice to meet you."
    L "我叫洛拉。很高兴认识你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3000
translate chinese story05_4_8d2e2129:

    # L "But may I ask, what is this place?"
    L "不过我能问一下吗，这是什么地方？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3002
translate chinese story05_4_15f57fce:

    # Evrel "This place? It has many names."
    Evrel "这地方？它有很多名字。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3003
translate chinese story05_4_1b5b7e9d:

    # Evrel "Some call it the Abyss. Others, a tomb."
    Evrel "有人叫它深渊。有人叫它墓穴。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3004
translate chinese story05_4_e239fba9:

    # Evrel "Some, the ruins of an empire."
    Evrel "有人叫它帝国的遗迹。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3005
translate chinese story05_4_2bac8dc7:

    # Evrel "But to me… this is home."
    Evrel "可对我来说……这里是家。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3007
translate chinese story05_4_76651acc:

    # L "But… what are you doing here?"
    L "可……你在这儿做什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3011
translate chinese story05_4_20329604:

    # Evrel "Before you came, I thought. I dreamed. After that… I watched."
    Evrel "你来之前，我在思考。我在做梦。那之后……我在看着。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3012
translate chinese story05_4_11967701:

    # Evrel "Tell me, do you like this place?"
    Evrel "告诉我，你喜欢这地方吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3014
translate chinese story05_4_da2ee350:

    # L "I’m sorry, but it’s dark here."
    L "抱歉，可这儿很暗。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3015
translate chinese story05_4_595ad8b3:

    # L "Dry. Cold. Gray."
    L "干。冷。灰。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3016
translate chinese story05_4_51ab616e:

    # L "I understand this is your home, but still…"
    L "我知道这是你的家，可是……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3018
translate chinese story05_4_c7366c8f:

    # Evrel "It really is…"
    Evrel "确实是……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3024
translate chinese story05_4_27eaa938:

    # L "(After that, a snap of her fingers, and I froze.)"
    L "（然后，她打了个响指，我愣住了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3025
translate chinese story05_4_d2e452ba:

    # L "(The world that once felt dead and hollow turned into a living garden.)"
    L "（那个曾经死寂空洞的世界，变成了一座活着的花园。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3026
translate chinese story05_4_ccb17783:

    # L "(Ruins became towering buildings.)"
    L "（废墟变成了高耸的建筑。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3027
translate chinese story05_4_bc7522d9:

    # L "(Dust became people.)"
    L "（尘埃变成了人。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3028
translate chinese story05_4_b019367c:

    # L "(All of it, with a single snap.)"
    L "（一切，只用一个响指。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3029
translate chinese story05_4_a5c8e70b:

    # L "(But the most disturbing part…)"
    L "（但最让人不安的是……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3031
translate chinese story05_4_6f66c26b:

    # Evrel "Does it feel familiar?"
    Evrel "觉得熟悉吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3032
translate chinese story05_4_fc2fb28a:

    # L "(In that moment, I realized-)"
    L "（那一刻，我意识到——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3033
translate chinese story05_4_040618eb:

    # L "(All this time… I had been on Earth.)"
    L "（原来这一路……我一直在地球上。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3044
translate chinese story05_4_195a6167:

    # b "WHAT?!"
    b "什么？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:3046
translate chinese story05_4_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3048
translate chinese story05_4_14634ff8:

    # h "Okay… yeah. This is definitely not what I was expecting."
    h "好吧……是啊。这绝对不是我预想的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3050
translate chinese story05_4_24016079:

    # mc "But I don’t get it. What was the point of all this? Why the whole damn show?"
    mc "可我不明白。这一切图什么？搞这么一大出干嘛？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3052
translate chinese story05_4_ae438b19:

    # Mi "So the ancient empire was on Earth…?"
    Mi "所以古代帝国是在地球上……？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3053
translate chinese story05_4_5a7a01da:

    # Mi "Unthinkable…"
    Mi "难以置信……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3055
translate chinese story05_4_ecd070c9:

    # mc "And you’re surprised? Shouldn’t you already know this?"
    mc "你还惊讶？你不是早该知道吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3057
translate chinese story05_4_b6fb513b:

    # L "This is something no one knows. Except Astoria… and me."
    L "这事没人知道。除了阿斯托里亚……和我。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3059
translate chinese story05_4_819f8355:

    # k "So that’s why she treats you so special. Interesting."
    k "所以她才对你这么特别。有意思。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3060
translate chinese story05_4_04ed0afd:

    # k "And what about the sister?"
    k "那她妹妹呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3061
translate chinese story05_4_665b1de7:

    # L "She doesn’t know."
    L "她不知道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3063
translate chinese story05_4_f68cb59e:

    # h "Alright, we cleared that up, but you still didn’t say why they’re hunting you. What’s the point of all this?"
    h "好，这个说清了，可你还没说他们为什么追你。这一切图什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3065
translate chinese story05_4_1223f5ba:

    # k "Seriously? I thought I was the dumbest one here. Turns out, I was wrong."
    k "认真的？我还以为这儿我最蠢。看来我错了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3067
translate chinese story05_4_b07ac3e1:

    # h "You looking for trouble?"
    h "你找茬？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3069
translate chinese story05_4_6d702955:

    # k "Oh, me? Picking a fight? Trust me, if I were, you’d already be on the floor."
    k "哦，我？挑事？信我，我要真挑，你早趴地上了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3070
translate chinese story05_4_c832adff:

    # k "This? Just friendly banter."
    k "这个？就是友好的嘴仗。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3071
translate chinese story05_4_770aa998:

    # h "Then do us all a favor and explain what’s actually going on. See, not everyone here is a genius who spent their whole life swimming in this shit."
    h "那就帮大家一个忙，解释一下到底怎么回事。你看，这儿不是每个人都是泡在这摊屎里一辈子的天才。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3072
translate chinese story05_4_920bc321:

    # h "Sometimes people need things spelled out. You know. Slowly. Okay? Now shut-"
    h "有时候得把话掰开揉碎讲。懂吧。慢慢讲。行吗？现在闭——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3073
translate chinese story05_4_bcc2ebba:

    # k "Pfft… poor thing. Aww, did I hurt your feelings?"
    k "噗……可怜的小东西。哎哟，我伤到你感情了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3076
translate chinese story05_4_23e0480a:

    # mc "You two, enough."
    mc "你们两个，够了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3077
translate chinese story05_4_80bb3b2f:

    # mc "Right now, we’re a team. Tearing each other’s throats out isn’t exactly helping."
    mc "现在我们是团队。互相撕喉咙可没什么帮助。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3079
translate chinese story05_4_09191d6f:

    # mc "Afterward, do whatever the hell you want, but for now, try to get along."
    mc "之后你们想干嘛干嘛，但现在，试着好好相处。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3081
translate chinese story05_4_4164b948:

    # mc "Are we clear?"
    mc "清楚了吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3083
translate chinese story05_4_84081136:

    # h "Yeah."
    h "清楚了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3085
translate chinese story05_4_76f558a8:

    # mc "Kalestra?"
    mc "卡莱斯特拉？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3086
translate chinese story05_4_82091822_1:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3087
translate chinese story05_4_a752e9a3:

    # mc "Don’t start."
    mc "别来这套。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3090
translate chinese story05_4_56c59193:

    # k "Yeah, yeah. I’ll do everything within my power. Or something like that."
    k "行，行。我会尽我所能。差不多就这意思。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3093
translate chinese story05_4_7bd03829:

    # k "And on that lovely note, I’ll be quiet as a fish till the meeting’s over."
    k "就着这么个美好的基调，会议结束前我会像鱼一样安静。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3095
translate chinese story05_4_d8c719b3:

    # h "(whispering) Short, I get it, hurts, but fair. But stupid? Coming from her, of all people? That’s bullshit."
    h "（低声）说我矮，我懂，扎心，但也没毛病。可说蠢？偏偏从她嘴里出来？放屁。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3098
translate chinese story05_4_4670a90e:

    # mc "(whispering) Her intentions were good."
    mc "（低声）她本意不坏。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3099
translate chinese story05_4_e45c754d:

    # h "(whispering) Doubt it."
    h "（低声）我怀疑。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3101
translate chinese story05_4_778455b1:

    # mc "(whispering) Don’t take it to heart. I know you’re smart, stubborn too."
    mc "（低声）别往心里去。我知道你聪明，也倔。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3102
translate chinese story05_4_86f0a6bd:

    # h "(This…)"
    h "（这……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3104
translate chinese story05_4_bbd727be:

    # h "(He- he called me smart! No, stop. Get a grip, you’re smiling like an idiot…)"
    h "（他——他说我聪明！不，停。稳住，你笑得跟个傻子似的……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3105
translate chinese story05_4_f862223a:

    # h "(But damn… that’s the first compliment from him in ages. Hell yeah.)"
    h "（可该死……这是他这么久以来第一次夸我。太爽了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3109
translate chinese story05_4_b1f5f7db:

    # mc "So, forgive the little spectacle."
    mc "那么，原谅刚才那点小闹剧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3110
translate chinese story05_4_1863dee0:

    # mc "Now… tell me. Why are they hunting Lora?"
    mc "现在……告诉我。他们为什么追捕洛拉？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3112
translate chinese story05_4_0564626e:

    # Mi "With that knowledge, she can tune the gate to the Aby-"
    Mi "有那份知识，她能把门调到深渊——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3113
translate chinese story05_4_d39c2a68:

    # Mi "to Earth. To the range where the second part is hidden."
    Mi "调到地球。调到第二部分藏身的范围。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3114
translate chinese story05_4_47c41413:

    # Mi "That alone makes her the primary target for everyone."
    Mi "光这一点，就让她成了所有人的首要目标。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3116
translate chinese story05_4_d5a2e521:

    # h "Nothing new. Looks like information is valuable everywhere."
    h "没什么新鲜的。看来情报在哪儿都值钱。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3119
translate chinese story05_4_de017464:

    # h "(But after all these revelations… I feel like crap. Like, genuinely awful.)"
    h "（可这些爆料之后……我感觉糟透了。真的非常糟。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3120
translate chinese story05_4_3cda5883:

    # h "(Especially since I have no idea how I’m even supposed to react to this.)"
    h "（尤其是我根本不知道该对这一切作何反应。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3122
translate chinese story05_4_026bfd4c:

    # h "(Do I joke it off? Keep a straight face? Or just let it sink me?)"
    h "（我该开玩笑带过？板着脸？还是干脆让它把我压垮？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3123
translate chinese story05_4_5384582a:

    # h "(Judging by everyone else, and the vibe in the room, I’m afraid the confessions aren’t over yet.)"
    h "（看其他人的样子，还有这屋里的气氛，恐怕坦白还没结束。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3124
translate chinese story05_4_f0449bb2:

    # mc "And the second reason?"
    mc "第二个原因呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3126
translate chinese story05_4_b88ae97e:

    # Mi "She-"
    Mi "她——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3129
translate chinese story05_4_f4ba6945:

    # L "(Should I…? This moment, it could make him hate me.)"
    L "（我该说吗……？这一刻，可能会让他恨我。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3130
translate chinese story05_4_81b13fce:

    # L "(And yet…)"
    L "（可即便如此……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3132
translate chinese story05_4_395f3fff:

    # L "Miriel, I…"
    L "米莉尔，我……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3133
translate chinese story05_4_c46c084c:

    # L "(And still, this is the first time I truly don’t know what will happen next.)"
    L "（可这还是我第一次，真的不知道接下来会发生什么。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3135
translate chinese story05_4_e785ea8d:

    # L "In a sense… I can control time. By changing the future."
    L "某种意义上……我能控制时间。通过改变未来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3140
translate chinese story05_4_7829b1d1:

    # mc "What… does that mean, Lora?"
    mc "这……是什么意思，洛拉？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3141
translate chinese story05_4_63cac2fd:

    # mc "(This a joke? Lora, please… tell me you’re joking. Tell me Norman’s death, my fate-)"
    mc "（这是开玩笑？洛拉，求你……告诉我你在开玩笑。告诉我诺曼的死、我的命运——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3144
translate chinese story05_4_5e283b25:

    # mc "So you knew everything that was going to happen to us?!"
    mc "所以你早就知道我们会经历的一切？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:3146
translate chinese story05_4_2ab1ad6f:

    # mc "Then why did you still go there? Why did you-"
    mc "那你为什么还是去了？你为什么——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3148
translate chinese story05_4_b4300a04:

    # L "In the Abyss, I gained what others would call immortality. In reality, it’s a resurrection point."
    L "在深渊里，我得到了别人所谓的永生。实际上是复活点。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3149
translate chinese story05_4_56a4b38c:

    # L "I can’t choose the moment."
    L "我选不了时间点。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3150
translate chinese story05_4_23d6187e:

    # L "I can’t truly change anything."
    L "我没法真正改变什么。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3151
translate chinese story05_4_ae8fd361:

    # L "I tried to end it in a way where both of you survived."
    L "我试过用一种方式收尾，让你们俩都活下来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3152
translate chinese story05_4_dac21ac1:

    # L "Where you both lived long, happy lives."
    L "让你们都过上长久、幸福的生活。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3154
translate chinese story05_4_968f0681:

    # L "And unfortunately… in that version of your lives-"
    L "而不幸的是……在那个版本的人生里——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3155
translate chinese story05_4_7720ad17:

    # L "I wasn’t there."
    L "我不在。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3156
translate chinese story05_4_cfcae04e:

    # mc "(I… nothing. Completely empty. I don’t even know what I’m supposed to feel.)"
    mc "（我……什么都没有。完全空。我都不知道自己该有什么感觉。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3157
translate chinese story05_4_eb31b531:

    # mc "That’s cruel."
    mc "太残忍了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3159
translate chinese story05_4_62b6d5a1:

    # mc "Tell me, Lora-"
    mc "告诉我，洛拉——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3160
translate chinese story05_4_deb27756:

    # mc "Who gave you the right to decide what my life should be?"
    mc "谁给你的权力，决定我的人生该是什么样？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3162
translate chinese story05_4_69f9e5d1:

    # mc "(And here you are shouting… but deep down, you’re not angry at her-)"
    mc "（你在这儿吼……可心底里，你气的人不是她——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3163
translate chinese story05_4_3380a2bd:

    # mc "Better short and happy than long and… pathetic."
    mc "短暂但幸福，也好过漫长又……可悲。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3165
translate chinese story05_4_4270af80:

    # mc "(You’re angry at yourself, at your own helplessness.)"
    mc "（你气的是自己，是自己的无能为力。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3168
translate chinese story05_4_7c93177a:

    # L "In another timeline, you and I already talked about this."
    L "在另一条时间线里，你和我已经谈过这个了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3169
translate chinese story05_4_3d06a61b:

    # L "And… yes. You’re right."
    L "而……是的。你说得对。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3172
translate chinese story05_4_00f56f0c:

    # L "But if our fates were reversed-"
    L "可要是我们的命运调换——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3173
translate chinese story05_4_2ad09a73:

    # L "Tell me… would you have done it differently?"
    L "告诉我……你会做得不一样吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3174
translate chinese story05_4_02ea37af:

    # mc "(You know exactly why she did it. Because you would’ve done the same damn thing.)"
    mc "（你清楚她为什么这么做。因为你也会干出一模一样的事。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3176
translate chinese story05_4_d7afdc3b:

    # mc "I-"
    mc "我——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3177
translate chinese story05_4_898319c0:

    # mc "No. I wouldn’t have been able to."
    mc "不。我也做不到。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3179
translate chinese story05_4_82091822_2:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3180
translate chinese story05_4_0ec0ed91:

    # k "(That… didn’t sit right with me.)"
    k "（这话……让我心里不舒服。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3182
translate chinese story05_4_b1891b23:

    # k "(The hell? What kind of nonsense is that? Why would I even care?)"
    k "（搞什么？这算什么屁话？我干嘛要在意？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3183
translate chinese story05_4_b99b7f97:

    # k "Hmpf..."
    k "哼……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3185
translate chinese story05_4_85e1772a:

    # mc "(And that’s why it hurts, because she lived what should’ve been yours.)"
    mc "（所以才疼，因为她过的是本该属于你的日子。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3188
translate chinese story05_4_c487bd12:

    # L "That’s exactly why…"
    L "正因为这样……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3189
translate chinese story05_4_c93115dd:

    # L "I’m asking you to forgive me for it."
    L "我求你原谅我。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3191
translate chinese story05_4_bff0737e:

    # mc "(So what am I supposed to do now…?)"
    mc "（那我现在该怎么办……？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3196
translate chinese story05_4_fabefd5b:

    # mc "(Looking at yourself from the outside… yeah. You’re disgusting.)"
    mc "（从外面看自己……是啊。你真恶心。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3197
translate chinese story05_4_bd80f36b:

    # mc "(Sitting here, crying like a little girl, debating forgiveness-)"
    mc "（坐在这儿，像个小姑娘一样哭，纠结要不要原谅——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3198
translate chinese story05_4_4c89217e:

    # mc "(while doing absolutely nothing yourself.)"
    mc "（自己却什么都不做。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3206
translate chinese story05_4_c0a317d1:

    # mc "(Forgive her? But can I…? Too much time has passed.)"
    mc "（原谅她？可我能吗……？过了太久了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3207
translate chinese story05_4_26262e2e:

    # mc "(And even if I did, could we really live like before? I doubt it.)"
    mc "（就算原谅了，我们真能像以前那样过吗？我怀疑。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3209
translate chinese story05_4_f3052438:

    # mc "Part of me wants to forgive you, Lora. But the other part-"
    mc "我有一部分想原谅你，洛拉。可另一部分——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3210
translate chinese story05_4_c9b35284:

    # mc "I’m trying. I really am. But… I can’t."
    mc "我在努力。真的在努力。可我……做不到。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3216
translate chinese story05_4_2e9d06b8:

    # h "You know… it actually hurts to watch this. And the thought that my whole life’s already been decided? That makes it even worse."
    h "你知道吗……看着这个真挺扎心的。想到我这一辈子早就被定好了？那更糟。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3219
translate chinese story05_4_1ae22209:

    # h "But why tell us all this now? Why not sooner?"
    h "可为什么现在才告诉我们？为什么不早点？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3222
translate chinese story05_4_105178e2:

    # h "I seriously doubt it’s because of that gorilla’s sister."
    h "我严重怀疑是因为那大猩猩的妹妹。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3224
translate chinese story05_4_0d903063:

    # k "I can hear you, shorty."
    k "我听得见，矮子。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3225
translate chinese story05_4_2fded262_1:

    # h "..."
    h "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3229
translate chinese story05_4_19546ddb:

    # mc "(She had her reasons. And… in the end, I understand why she did it.)"
    mc "（她有她的理由。而……说到底，我理解她为什么这么做。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3230
translate chinese story05_4_eb118c42:

    # mc "(Yes, she abandoned everything, but was it truly her choice?)"
    mc "（是，她抛下了一切，可那真是她的选择吗？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3233
translate chinese story05_4_4a0bc9ad:

    # L "What are you-"
    L "你干什么——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3236
translate chinese story05_4_8cfaeec7:

    # mc "(Blaming her for that? Ridiculous.)"
    mc "（这也要怪她？荒唐。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3237
translate chinese story05_4_7a69b945:

    # mc "(Some would call this foolish. Naive.)"
    mc "（有人会说这很蠢。很天真。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3238
translate chinese story05_4_32962abc:

    # mc "(But she’s the reason I set out on this journey in the first place.)"
    mc "（可我最开始踏上这趟旅程，就是因为她。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3240
translate chinese story05_4_020555ec:

    # mc "(All of us had our ups and downs. Watching everyone along the way, everyone grew.)"
    mc "（我们都有起有落。一路看着每个人，每个人都成长了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3241
translate chinese story05_4_25c560cb:

    # mc "(Everyone… except me.)"
    mc "（每个人……除了我。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3242
translate chinese story05_4_0085853b:

    # mc "(How many times were decisions made for me? How often did I just stand there, powerless?)"
    mc "（有多少次是别人替我做的决定？有多少次我就那么站着，无能为力？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3245
translate chinese story05_4_92f874f1:

    # mc "(But I’m not powerless. I have a choice.)"
    mc "（可我不是无能为力。我有选择。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3246
translate chinese story05_4_147d4d11:

    # mc "(And this, this is my chance.)"
    mc "（而这次，这是我的机会。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3247
translate chinese story05_4_98a440bd:

    # mc "(I can’t change the past.)"
    mc "（我改变不了过去。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3248
translate chinese story05_4_8d40f515:

    # mc "(But I can shape the future.)"
    mc "（可我能塑造未来。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3250
translate chinese story05_4_bab0c0e8:

    # k "What kind of cheap melodrama are they putting on now..."
    k "他们现在演的这是什么廉价狗血剧……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3251
translate chinese story05_4_29cdf8bc:

    # k "Makes me sick just watching."
    k "看着就恶心。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3253
translate chinese story05_4_ab72e872:

    # Mi "I’m glad to see them like this."
    Mi "看到他们这样，我很高兴。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3254
translate chinese story05_4_b093676e:

    # Mi "They value each other more than anything. It reminds me of home…"
    Mi "他们彼此珍视，胜过一切。这让我想起家……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3256
translate chinese story05_4_4a062be5:

    # k "Yeah, sure. A relationship built on lies."
    k "是啊，当然。建立在谎言上的关系。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3257
translate chinese story05_4_90a449e7:

    # k "That’s hilarious."
    k "笑死人了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3259
translate chinese story05_4_85159be2:

    # Mi "You’re just jealous of them."
    Mi "你就是嫉妒他们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3260
translate chinese story05_4_82091822_3:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3262
translate chinese story05_4_36b747dc:

    # mc "Why are you two just standing there?"
    mc "你们两个站那儿干嘛？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3263
translate chinese story05_4_460cb1c5:

    # h "We’re a team, aren’t we?"
    h "我们是团队，对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3264
translate chinese story05_4_ccdd4004:

    # h "(whispering) Even that gorilla..."
    h "（低声）连那只大猩猩也……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3266
translate chinese story05_4_850ef128:

    # b "..."
    b "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3269
translate chinese story05_4_3aa4057f:

    # mc "(I didn’t want to return to that old life. I really didn’t.)"
    mc "（我不想回到从前那种生活。真的不想。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3270
translate chinese story05_4_8c184579:

    # mc "(But their lives depend on my decisions.)"
    mc "（可她们的命，都系在我的决定上。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3271
translate chinese story05_4_9168f769:

    # mc "(I won’t let them down.)"
    mc "（我不能让她们失望。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3277
translate chinese story05_4_3770ae6a:

    # mc "(That doesn’t mean I’ll let her mistakes destroy us.)"
    mc "（但这不代表我会让她的错误毁掉我们。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3278
translate chinese story05_4_70c2b435:

    # mc "(The team comes first. I won’t let them suffer because of my choice.)"
    mc "（团队优先。我不能让他们因为我的选择而受苦。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3280
translate chinese story05_4_3148890a:

    # mc "(I can’t just forget the pain and pretend everything’s fine.)"
    mc "（我没法就这么忘了痛，假装一切都好。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3281
translate chinese story05_4_31f742db:

    # mc "(No… it’s better to leave everything between us in the past.)"
    mc "（不……最好把我们之间的一切都留在过去。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3283
translate chinese story05_4_87c7398c:

    # mc "I tried. I really did."
    mc "我试过。真的试过。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3284
translate chinese story05_4_3fb3bb5b:

    # mc "But I can’t forgive you."
    mc "可我原谅不了你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3285
translate chinese story05_4_7298bc80:

    # mc "And in the end… I’m no better."
    mc "而说到底……我也没好到哪儿去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3287
translate chinese story05_4_2717735e:

    # L "(So that’s it? It’s over… between us?)"
    L "（就这样了？我们之间……结束了？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3288
translate chinese story05_4_b08cb254:

    # L "(No, Lora. Breathe. You knew it could end like this.)"
    L "（不，洛拉。呼吸。你早该知道可能是这个结局。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3290
translate chinese story05_4_388ea11a:

    # L "Alright, love. If that’s your choice… I’ll accept it."
    L "好，亲爱的。如果这是你的选择……我接受。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3292
translate chinese story05_4_bd9b69aa:

    # mc "(Please, don’t look at me like that. Don’t turn me into the villain.)"
    mc "（求你，别那样看我。别把我变成恶人。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3293
translate chinese story05_4_e3b73606:

    # mc "Let’s move. We’ve got things to discuss."
    mc "走吧。我们有事要商量。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3295
translate chinese story05_4_e122b4bf:

    # L "Yes, and…"
    L "好，还有……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3296
translate chinese story05_4_4f00bda4:

    # L "I’m sorry."
    L "对不起。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3301
translate chinese story05_4_1354722b:

    # "Minutes later, in pairs."
    "几分钟后，两两结伴。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3302
translate chinese story05_4_8b62f193:

    # "Silence swallowed the room, thick and heavy, pressing down on everyone like it had weight you could feel."
    "沉默吞掉了整间屋子，又厚又沉，压在每个人身上，仿佛有能摸到的重量。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3305
translate chinese story05_4_f235b29c:

    # mc "(That was a hard performance. But it was necessary.)"
    mc "（那场戏演得很难。但有这个必要。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3307
translate chinese story05_4_01bfd98e:

    # mc "(The situation is clearer now than it was before. That’s a plus.)"
    mc "（局势比之前清楚多了。这是好事。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3309
translate chinese story05_4_838871fc:

    # mc "(The weight of it, though, that’s the real cost.)"
    mc "（可它的分量，才是真正的代价。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3310
translate chinese story05_4_8551c05a:

    # mc "(We’re carrying problems on a galactic scale.)"
    mc "（我们扛着的是星系级的问题。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3312
translate chinese story05_4_476624b8:

    # h "So… Astoria isn’t acting because she wants her sister back?"
    h "所以……阿斯托里亚不动手，是因为想把妹妹弄回来？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3313
translate chinese story05_4_421992e2:

    # Mi "Seems like it is."
    Mi "看来是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3315
translate chinese story05_4_8bef1ca6:

    # h "Then what the hell was all this circus for?! Why drag us into this, WHY KILL SO MANY PEOPLE?!"
    h "那这一切马戏团表演到底图什么？！干嘛把我们拖进来，为什么要杀那么多人？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:3316
translate chinese story05_4_c03bc1df:

    # h "For a sister?! That’s just-"
    h "为了一个妹妹？！这简直——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3319
translate chinese story05_4_0fb1417e:

    # h "(But if I were in her place… would I really do it any differently?)"
    h "（可要是换成我……我真会做得不一样吗？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3320
translate chinese story05_4_906d3461:

    # h "Argh… this is heavy."
    h "唉……这太沉重了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3322
translate chinese story05_4_20145cf7:

    # mc "We have no reason to blame her. Yes, the situation is fucked. That’s a fact."
    mc "我们没理由怪她。是，局势烂透了。这是事实。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3323
translate chinese story05_4_f6e64583:

    # mc "But we move forward with what we have. First priority, survive."
    mc "但我们就用手上有的往前走。第一优先，活下来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3325
translate chinese story05_4_1a276065:

    # mc "Then we go home."
    mc "然后我们回家。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3326
translate chinese story05_4_53f4e79d:

    # mc "Everyone on board?"
    mc "大家都同意？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3328
translate chinese story05_4_483f0116:

    # E "The squad nodded in unison."
    E "小队齐声点头。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3329
translate chinese story05_4_406eab4a:

    # a "I hate to interrupt, but we’ll arrive in twenty minutes."
    a "我不想打断，但我们二十分钟后到。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3332
translate chinese story05_4_ab2a64e6:

    # mc "Good. Then it’s time to put the puzzle together."
    mc "好。那该把拼图拼起来了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3365
translate chinese story05_5_66a513ad:

    # mc "Our objective is what’s inside the tower."
    mc "我们的目标是高塔里面的东西。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3367
translate chinese story05_5_4843cf9c:

    # mc "A gate to Earth."
    mc "一道通往地球的门。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3368
translate chinese story05_5_a36da26b:

    # mc "We stop the summoning of Evrelia-"
    mc "我们要阻止对艾芙蕾莉亚的召唤——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3369
translate chinese story05_5_5fa08d3f:

    # L "We’ll make it out alive."
    L "我们会活着出来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3371
translate chinese story05_5_f544d7e6:

    # mc "In twenty minutes, this ship at full speed crashes into the tower."
    mc "二十分钟后，这艘船会全速撞进高塔。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3372
translate chinese story05_5_4e3fc1b0:

    # mc "That gives us the window we need to punch through the defenses and get inside."
    mc "那就给了我们打穿防御、冲进去的窗口。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3374
translate chinese story05_5_450cd29b:

    # mc "We don’t know the exact situation inside the tower."
    mc "我们不清楚高塔内部的确切情况。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3375
translate chinese story05_5_8d6b2a0d:

    # mc "First priority, find out what the hell is going on."
    mc "第一优先，搞清楚到底他妈怎么回事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3376
translate chinese story05_5_0e66f65f:

    # k "Breaking in by force?"
    k "硬闯？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3377
translate chinese story05_5_3f2cfb7e:

    # k "Yeah, no. Might as well shoot myself in the head, better odds of surviving."
    k "嗯，不行。还不如朝自己脑袋来一枪，活下来的概率还大点。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3378
translate chinese story05_5_b475b492:

    # mc "We’re all going to die someday."
    mc "我们总有一天都会死。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3379
translate chinese story05_5_ad665f6a:

    # mc "Just not today."
    mc "但不是今天。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3383
translate chinese story05_5_ea853a0a:

    # L "I can get you through, I know enough holes in your security."
    L "我能带你们进去，你们的安保漏洞我知道得够多。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3385
translate chinese story05_5_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3387
translate chinese story05_5_b3ba6c43:

    # mc "From there on, enemy or ally, we won’t know."
    mc "从那之后，是敌是友，我们都不知道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3388
translate chinese story05_5_55d1a068:

    # mc "Killing everyone isn’t rational."
    mc "把所有人杀光不理智。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3389
translate chinese story05_5_a4c4660c:

    # mc "Avoid casualties whenever possible."
    mc "能避免伤亡就避免。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3390
translate chinese story05_5_5937212f:

    # h "And if avoiding it isn’t an option?"
    h "要是避免不了呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3393
translate chinese story05_5_60b26f43:

    # mc "Neutralize them."
    mc "制服他们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3394
translate chinese story05_5_a6005984:

    # mc "Your life comes first."
    mc "你们的命优先。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3395
translate chinese story05_5_3acb8eed:

    # h "Can’t say I’m thrilled."
    h "我可说不上高兴。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3401
translate chinese story05_5_ecd39557:

    # mc "If hiding in a corner were an option, I’d already be there."
    mc "要是躲角落里算个选项，我早就在那儿了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3402
translate chinese story05_5_cb276708:

    # Mi "What about communications?"
    Mi "通讯怎么办？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3405
translate chinese story05_5_735a09d8:

    # mc "That’s our main problem. We can’t move as a large group, too visible."
    mc "这是主要问题。我们不能大部队行动，太显眼。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3406
translate chinese story05_5_097a4775:

    # mc "But splitting up is even worse without communication."
    mc "可没有通讯，分散更糟。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3409
translate chinese story05_5_5eac5c4f:

    # Mi "So… we move together?"
    Mi "那……我们一起行动？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3411
translate chinese story05_5_81d52519:

    # mc "We don’t have a choice."
    mc "我们没得选。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3412
translate chinese story05_5_7822c547:

    # Mi "Alright."
    Mi "好。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3413
translate chinese story05_5_593493a0:

    # mc "Lora. The gate, what do we know?"
    mc "洛拉。那道门，我们知道多少？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3415
translate chinese story05_5_ac18072d:

    # L "The tower’s core. Sublevel thirty-two."
    L "塔的核心。地下三十二层。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3416
translate chinese story05_5_0db36c14:

    # L "Once it activates, everything on this planet turns into energy."
    L "一旦启动，这颗星球上的一切都会变成能量。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3417
translate chinese story05_5_a457ceba:

    # mc "How do we get there?"
    mc "我们怎么到那儿？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3418
translate chinese story05_5_5f52a5a1:

    # L "The gate needs cooling, we’ll swim along the coolant line."
    L "门需要冷却，我们沿着冷却管道游过去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3421
translate chinese story05_5_49b97a77:

    # h "Swim through it?!"
    h "游过去？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:3422
translate chinese story05_5_927c410b:

    # L "Yes. A water reservoir, big enough to swim through, and the fastest way."
    L "对。一个蓄水池，大到能游过去，也是最快的路。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3425
translate chinese story05_5_9290713c:

    # mc "Time is against us."
    mc "时间不站在我们这边。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3426
translate chinese story05_5_73109912:

    # mc "Every minute is death."
    mc "每一分钟都是死亡。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3427
translate chinese story05_5_11c3ee67:

    # mc "Every death brings the end closer."
    mc "每一个死者都让终点更近。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3428
translate chinese story05_5_1e634c3a:

    # L "According to my calculations, we have enough time. If nothing changes, everything goes smoothly."
    L "按我的计算，我们时间够。只要不出变数，一切都会顺利。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3429
translate chinese story05_5_a18463b8:

    # Mi "In numbers?"
    Mi "具体数字？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3432
translate chinese story05_5_f66cf251:

    # L "Two days."
    L "两天。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3434
translate chinese story05_5_df368373:

    # h "Not exactly a lot of time."
    h "时间可不算多。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3435
translate chinese story05_5_410fba32:

    # mc "Right now, Flora should be engaging the enemy’s main forces."
    mc "现在，弗洛拉应该在跟敌军主力交手。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3437
translate chinese story05_5_65090c4e:

    # h "But what if the Gate is already active?"
    h "可要是门已经启动了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3438
translate chinese story05_5_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3439
translate chinese story05_5_911d744a:

    # L "Then we’d already be gone."
    L "那我们早就不在了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3441
translate chinese story05_5_d117c6d1:

    # L "We follow my plan. Exactly."
    L "按我的计划来。一步不差。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3442
translate chinese story05_5_2876efd9:

    # mc "Why?"
    mc "为什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3444
translate chinese story05_5_f9dfb18d:

    # L "Better odds… of getting a new ending."
    L "得到新结局的……概率更高。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3445
translate chinese story05_5_01eac64a:

    # k "I don’t like it when my life gets called an ‘ending.’"
    k "我不喜欢别人管我的命叫“结局”。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3447
translate chinese story05_5_56d10797:

    # mc "You said you didn’t know where this path would lead."
    mc "你说过你不知道这条路通向哪儿。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3448
translate chinese story05_5_c9819295:

    # L "No, but I know how the other paths end."
    L "不知道，可我知道其他路怎么结束。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3450
translate chinese story05_5_1f97629b:

    # mc "With all due respect, darling- I can’t agree to that."
    mc "恕我直言，亲爱的——我不能同意。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3451
translate chinese story05_5_9993b94e:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3452
translate chinese story05_5_055829a8:

    # h "That might actually be useful."
    h "那也许真有用。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3453
translate chinese story05_5_c6ae0460:

    # a "3 minutes."
    a "3 分钟。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3455
translate chinese story05_5_6be066f6:

    # mc "(Sigh) Fine."
    mc "（叹气）行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3456
translate chinese story05_5_bc9dedc6:

    # mc "All paths. All outcomes."
    mc "所有路径。所有结果。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3458
translate chinese story05_5_a92e0be0:

    # mc "I want everything."
    mc "我全都要。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3459
translate chinese story05_5_e89385ad:

    # L "Alright, darling."
    L "好，亲爱的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3460
translate chinese story05_5_a87a115e:

    # mc "We don’t get a second chance."
    mc "我们没有第二次机会。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3466
translate chinese story05_5_195cfbb1:

    # "Cryo-Cooling Reservoir."
    "低温冷却蓄水池。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3472
translate chinese story05_5_a2284625:

    # k "Nice and warm… Hey, shorty, this what you were dreaming about?"
    k "又暖又舒服……喂，矮子，这就是你梦寐以求的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3474
translate chinese story05_5_6211b675:

    # h "I was dreaming of a proper bath. You know, clean water. Not… whatever this is."
    h "我梦的是好好泡个澡。你懂的，干净水。不是……这玩意儿。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3475
translate chinese story05_5_e6fbb307:

    # k "Should’ve been more careful with your wishes."
    k "许愿的时候就该小心点。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3478
translate chinese story05_5_7d6fec9d:

    # h "Screw you..."
    h "去你的……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3479
translate chinese story05_5_70b28f76:

    # mc "Hold on."
    mc "等等。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3482
translate chinese story05_5_63ee07d0:

    # h "Hey, Lora? I really don’t like this whole ‘predicting my death’ thing, but still-"
    h "喂，洛拉？我真的很讨厌这种“预测我死法”的玩意，不过——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3483
translate chinese story05_5_38992e38:

    # h "Was there even one successful outcome? Out of all our attempts?"
    h "那么多次尝试里，有没有哪怕一次成功的结果？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3486
translate chinese story05_5_2e1e176b:

    # L "It’s..."
    L "这……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3488
translate chinese story05_5_8bf3fbf2:

    # h "Mm-hmm. Yeah, figured. Couldn’t be worse."
    h "嗯哼。是啊，我就知道。不能再糟了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3489
translate chinese story05_5_794254ff:

    # L "I haven’t said anything yet."
    L "我还没说话呢。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3491
translate chinese story05_5_80aaeedf:

    # Mi "A delay… did its job."
    Mi "一次延后……起了作用。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3492
translate chinese story05_5_84163720:

    # h "So what, one hundred percent chance we’re walking straight to our deaths? Real suicide squad, huh."
    h "所以呢，百分之百径直走向死亡？真是自杀小队啊。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3493
translate chinese story05_5_58bb35d5:

    # mc "Where did {b}I shape my own fate{/b} go?"
    mc "{b}我自己塑造命运{/b}那套呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3494
translate chinese story05_5_1f35a5bd:

    # mc "Or {b}I don’t believe in prophecies{/b}?"
    mc "还有{b}我不信预言{/b}呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3496
translate chinese story05_5_a6a581ef:

    # h "Look, I don’t plan on dying. But this stuff? It really kills morale."
    h "听着，我没打算死。可这些东西？真掉士气。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3497
translate chinese story05_5_e5c0a60a:

    # mc "I can give a speech, if you want."
    mc "你想听的话，我可以来段演讲。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3498
translate chinese story05_5_c10ed752:

    # h "Nah, I’ve had enough speeches for now. Thanks."
    h "不用，演讲我听够了。谢了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3501
translate chinese story05_5_82091822_1:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3502
translate chinese story05_5_06771e67:

    # k "So… what are you doing?"
    k "那……你干什么呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3505
translate chinese story05_5_7be7dfae:

    # mc "Trying to help."
    mc "想帮忙。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3506
translate chinese story05_5_7fc1b9c6:

    # mc "Unless you want to do it yourself?"
    mc "除非你想自己来？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3507
translate chinese story05_5_25e62972:

    # k "Oh, how sweet...."
    k "哦，真贴心……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3508
translate chinese story05_5_b1971237:

    # k "Really makes me wonder, what did I do to deserve that kind of treatment?"
    k "真让我好奇，我做了什么才配得上这种待遇？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3516
translate chinese story05_5_68d3a288:

    # k "Wouldn’t happen to be because of that little talk we had, huh, [mc]?"
    k "该不会是因为我们那场小谈话吧，啊，[mc]？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3517
translate chinese story05_5_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3518
translate chinese story05_5_d55874c1:

    # h "What are you talking about?"
    h "你们在说什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3521
translate chinese story05_5_dfe8cb2b:

    # k "Oh, nothing."
    k "哦，没什么。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3522
translate chinese story05_5_4e4426ad:

    # k "Just enjoyed each other’s company."
    k "就是享受了一下彼此的陪伴。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3523
translate chinese story05_5_d4411c42:

    # k "What do you call it? Blowing off some steam?"
    k "你们管那叫什么来着？释放一下压力？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3524
translate chinese story05_5_deb48ff1:

    # mc "(whispering) Why are you provoking them?"
    mc "（低声）你干嘛激她们？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3525
translate chinese story05_5_9e1a83b7:

    # k "(whispering) Let me think… because it’s fun. And I kinda like watching them get jealous."
    k "（低声）我想想……因为好玩。而且我还真喜欢看她们吃醋。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3527
translate chinese story05_5_ceb0ab41:

    # mc "Everyone here? Let’s move."
    mc "人都齐了？走吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3529
translate chinese story05_5_487e474b:

    # h "[mc]? Can I steal you for a minute…"
    h "[mc]？能借你一分钟吗……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3530
translate chinese story05_5_e3c4889f:

    # mc "Did something happen?"
    mc "出什么事了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3531
translate chinese story05_5_ffb1c1a5:

    # h "About everything Lora said. My brain’s finally starting to catch up with it all."
    h "关于洛拉说的那些。我脑子终于开始跟上了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3532
translate chinese story05_5_2f7b900d:

    # h "I get that we’re supposed to stay positive and believe we’ll pull through, but…"
    h "我知道我们该保持乐观，相信能挺过去，可是……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3533
translate chinese story05_5_094a1f7e:

    # h "What if we don’t come back?"
    h "要是我们回不来呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3534
translate chinese story05_5_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3536
translate chinese story05_5_c6a8c3da:

    # h "The longer I think about it, the clearer it gets… I’m scared, [mc]."
    h "越想越清楚……我怕，[mc]。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3537
translate chinese story05_5_2548d507:

    # h "And yeah, my head knows I’m supposed to be brave. Strong. All that crap."
    h "是，我脑子知道我应该勇敢、坚强。那一套废话。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3538
translate chinese story05_5_2da41225:

    # h "But…"
    h "可是……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3539
translate chinese story05_5_cdaf174b:

    # h "I’ve already caught myself regretting coming with you. More than once."
    h "我已经不止一次发现自己在后悔跟你来了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3540
translate chinese story05_5_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3542
translate chinese story05_5_76e1c216:

    # h "(What did I just…?)"
    h "（我刚说什么了……？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3544
translate chinese story05_5_88d58078:

    # h "No! That’s not what I meant— I mean—"
    h "不！我不是那个意思——我是说——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3548
translate chinese story05_5_3ce22fc0:

    # mc "We all fear death. I’m no exception."
    mc "我们都怕死。我也不例外。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3549
translate chinese story05_5_60071f93:

    # mc "In this short time… I wanted to run. More times than I can count."
    mc "这段时间……我想过跑。次数多到数不清。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3551
translate chinese story05_5_608a457c:

    # h "Why didn’t you?"
    h "那你为什么没跑？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3553
translate chinese story05_5_4765806d:

    # mc "Because of all of you."
    mc "因为你们所有人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3554
translate chinese story05_5_97a70e53:

    # mc "Life’s a funny thing. When you’ve got nothing, you can walk straight into death without a second thought."
    mc "生命这东西挺奇妙。你一无所有的时候，能想都不想就直直走向死亡。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3555
translate chinese story05_5_e2293bba:

    # mc "But once someone appears in it…"
    mc "可一旦有人出现在里面……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3556
translate chinese story05_5_6c8e1a23:

    # mc "You start fighting. Fighting for every single moment."
    mc "你就开始拼。为每一个瞬间拼。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3558
translate chinese story05_5_52476fd5:

    # h "You’re a lousy speaker…"
    h "你演讲真烂……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3559
translate chinese story05_5_e2718278:

    # mc "Hey, I was trying."
    mc "喂，我尽力了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3563
translate chinese story05_5_d776b1ff:

    # h "You know, it’s weird… but that actually helped."
    h "你知道吗，挺奇怪的……但这话真管用。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3564
translate chinese story05_5_4b9ba5c5:

    # mc "Maybe I’m not such a bad motivator after all, huh?"
    mc "也许我没那么不会打气，是吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3566
translate chinese story05_5_77821c84:

    # h "Oh, shut up…"
    h "哦，闭嘴……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3568
translate chinese story05_5_b8f81952:

    # mc "Olivia."
    mc "奥利维亚。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3570
translate chinese story05_5_b65bef1e:

    # h "Hm?"
    h "嗯？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3571
translate chinese story05_5_d4f616a7:

    # mc "Chin up."
    mc "抬起头。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3575
translate chinese story05_5_84081136:

    # h "Yeah."
    h "嗯。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3588
translate chinese story05_5_f10bd58a:

    # Fl "Twenty-Second, move to Ray’s position with the Syndicate forces, cover their rear."
    Fl "二十二号，带着辛迪加的部队去雷的位置，掩护他们后方。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3590
translate chinese story05_5_49f0e37d:

    # aaa "Moving out."
    aaa "出发。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3591
translate chinese story05_5_3132dca8:

    # a "Shaft Thirteen is online!"
    a "十三号竖井已上线！"

# game/Story04.rpy:3593
translate chinese story05_5_bf0a3053:

    # Fl "Good... just a little more..."
    Fl "好……就差一点……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3597
translate chinese story05_5_cff39955:

    # em "(Under that kind of pressure… and she’s still giving orders.)"
    em "（那种压力下……她还在下命令。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3599
translate chinese story05_5_fadee7ee:

    # em "She’ll go far."
    em "她能走远。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3603
translate chinese story05_5_6b1360d3:

    # aS "You’re really not going to intervene?"
    aS "你真不打算插手？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3604
translate chinese story05_5_6a11998d:

    # em "Hm? I’ve already done everything I could. My people are under her command. What more does she want?"
    em "嗯？我已经尽力了。我的人在她指挥下。她还想怎样？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3605
translate chinese story05_5_b88244a4:

    # aS "Forgive my bluntness, but this is absurd. If we just keep standing by, this will turn into a complete failure."
    aS "恕我直言，这太荒唐了。我们要是就这么旁观，这会变成彻底的失败。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3606
translate chinese story05_5_b3ab4a23:

    # aS "And this isn’t even about faith anymore, it’s about reality."
    aS "这已经不是信不信的问题了，是现实问题。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3607
translate chinese story05_5_df680d2b:

    # aS "You can’t control a crowd like that as a rookie, it’s just impossi—"
    aS "一个新手不可能控住那种场面，根本不可——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3609
translate chinese story05_5_cd9919aa:

    # aS "…come on. Just a little more…"
    aS "……来吧。就差一点……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3611
translate chinese story05_5_4a100abf:

    # "Defeat."
    "失败。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3612
translate chinese story05_5_d6dad3c2:

    # em "She’ll handle it."
    em "她能应付。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3616
translate chinese story05_5_cee34e4c:

    # aS "..."
    aS "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3617
translate chinese story05_5_11955c66:

    # aS "Why are you so fiercely against helping her?"
    aS "你为什么这么坚决不肯帮她？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3619
translate chinese story05_5_79a4bd22:

    # aS "She’s already proven her worth, hasn’t she?"
    aS "她已经证明了自己的价值，不是吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3621
translate chinese story05_5_922d29e1:

    # em "I gave my word. And I don’t break it."
    em "我许过诺。我不食言。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3622
translate chinese story05_5_3a9408b1:

    # em "We are not intervening. Is that clear?"
    em "我们不插手。清楚了吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3624
translate chinese story05_5_1d4520d7:

    # aS "So you’d rather sit here and watch your people get slaughtered?"
    aS "所以你宁愿坐在这儿看着你的人被屠？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3625
translate chinese story05_5_af9e0a50:

    # em "..."
    em "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3627
translate chinese story05_5_7440a6db:

    # Fl "(Why do innocents have to die because of people like Astoria?)"
    Fl "（为什么无辜的人要因为阿斯托里亚那种人而死？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3628
translate chinese story05_5_8bb00273:

    # Fl "(Why won’t you protect them...)"
    Fl "（你为什么不保护他们……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3629
translate chinese story05_5_d995d6b5:

    # Fl "(Why... {w=0.2}why am I so useless?!)"
    Fl "（为什么……{w=0.2}为什么我这么没用？！）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3630
translate chinese story05_5_20534efd:

    # em "Are you alright? You don’t look well."
    em "你没事吧？脸色不太好。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3634
translate chinese story05_5_cf373e59:

    # Fl "(Get it together. You have to. They’ve put their lives in your hands.)"
    Fl "（振作。你必须振作。他们把命交到了你手上。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3635
translate chinese story05_5_09d7a175:

    # Fl "Ember… I need your help."
    Fl "恩伯……我需要你帮忙。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3636
translate chinese story05_5_c0f7bd16:

    # em "(Sighs) What exactly are you offering in return?"
    em "（叹气）你拿什么换？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3639
translate chinese story05_5_41da62cb:

    # Fl "..."
    Fl "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3640
translate chinese story05_5_9770f94b:

    # Fl "(Right. I almost forgot what kind of person she is.)"
    Fl "（对。我差点忘了她是什么人。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3641
translate chinese story05_5_a5d4f5a2:

    # Fl "(I can’t betray their expectations. I won’t let all these sacrifices be for nothing.)"
    Fl "（我不能辜负他们的期待。我不能让这些牺牲白费。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3642
translate chinese story05_5_04d4d846:

    # Fl "(And if I have to give up everything I have for them… then I will.)"
    Fl "（要是为了他们得放弃我所有的一切……那我就放弃。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3646
translate chinese story05_5_3f848c0f:

    # o "Eastern Front, reading you."
    o "东线，收到。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3648
translate chinese story05_5_830f399b:

    # o "We’ve received your distress signal. A strike team is on its way to your position."
    o "我们收到你的求救信号。一支突击队正前往你的位置。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3650
translate chinese story05_5_2080ded1:

    # Fl "(That voice…)"
    Fl "（那个声音……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3653
translate chinese story05_5_b494c745:

    # Fl "DAD!"
    Fl "爸！"

# game/Story04.rpy:3654
translate chinese story05_5_de64ffc2:

    # o "Flora? Sweetheart, are you alright?! Thank the gods…"
    o "弗洛拉？宝贝，你没事吧？！谢天谢地……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3655
translate chinese story05_5_0bc1d1ec:

    # o "I’m so glad to hear your voice."
    o "能听到你的声音，我真高兴。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3657
translate chinese story05_5_e92964a7:

    # Fl "I… I’m so glad to hear yours too…"
    Fl "我……我也很高兴听到你的……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3658
translate chinese story05_5_c8954ec5:

    # o "Easy, dear, easy. This is an open channel, we need to shut this hell down first."
    o "别急，宝贝，别急。这是公开频道，我们得先把这鬼地方关掉。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3661
translate chinese story05_5_6d403a76:

    # Fl "Y-yes, Father, sorry. I just—"
    Fl "是、是，爸，抱歉。我只是——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3662
translate chinese story05_5_5759e745:

    # aaaa "Honored to hear you, sir!"
    aaaa "很荣幸听到您的声音，长官！"

# game/Story04.rpy:3663
translate chinese story05_5_960f4318:

    # o "Men, you’re alive?"
    o "弟兄们，你们还活着？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3668
translate chinese story05_5_38bcefc1:

    # aaaa "Thanks to your daughter. She—"
    aaaa "多亏您女儿。她——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3671
translate chinese story05_5_d82bb302:

    # aa "The Ninth Assault Group is in trouble!"
    aa "第九突击组有麻烦了！"

# game/Story04.rpy:3672
translate chinese story05_5_e770ad20:

    # Fl "Anyone nearby?"
    Fl "附近有人吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3673
translate chinese story05_5_b5c9e09e:

    # a "Thirty-Second Group requesting further orders!"
    a "三十二组请求进一步指示！"

# game/Story04.rpy:3676
translate chinese story05_5_090e8dd8:

    # Fl "Send them to support the Ninth. They need to regroup."
    Fl "派他们去支援第九组。他们需要重新集结。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3678
translate chinese story05_5_dbaed599:

    # o "Flora?"
    o "弗洛拉？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3679
translate chinese story05_5_46f87ab9:

    # Fl "Yes?"
    Fl "嗯？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3680
translate chinese story05_5_c5a6cf55:

    # o "You’re doing well. Really well."
    o "你做得很好。非常好。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3683
translate chinese story05_5_41da62cb_1:

    # Fl "..."
    Fl "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3685
translate chinese story05_5_b0705bee:

    # Fl "Yeah…"
    Fl "嗯……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3687
translate chinese story05_5_3ad39d4a:

    # em "(This scene...)"
    em "（这一幕……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3688
translate chinese story05_5_5f2ca30e:

    # em "Tch..."
    em "啧……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3693
translate chinese story05_5_87dedb5f:

    # aS "Don’t like what you see?"
    aS "不喜欢看到的景象？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3694
translate chinese story05_5_6c478378:

    # em "Let’s go."
    em "走吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3695
translate chinese story05_5_5c83d535:

    # aS "Wait— Ember? H-hey, I’m coming!"
    aS "等等——恩伯？嘿、嘿，我来了！"

# game/Story04.rpy:3700
translate chinese story05_5_98bab40c:

    # aS "But… why didn’t you tell her?"
    aS "可……你为什么不告诉她？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3702
translate chinese story05_5_74ca8b4c:

    # em "What are you talking about?"
    em "你在说什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3703
translate chinese story05_5_c0c45bda:

    # aS "About Lady Astoria’s message. She asked yo—"
    aS "关于阿斯托里亚夫人的消息。她让你——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3705
translate chinese story05_5_50e1c633:

    # em "Don’t you dare."
    em "你敢。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3706
translate chinese story05_5_6c4ff828:

    # aS "B-but why?"
    aS "可、可是为什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3708
translate chinese story05_5_b0818494:

    # em "I said, don’t. You. Dare."
    em "我说了，你敢。试试。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3709
translate chinese story05_5_b79b2750:

    # aS "I’m sorry..."
    aS "对不起……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3710
translate chinese story05_5_133164c3:

    # em "(My patience is wearing thin. You asked me not to interfere, but my people are not endless.)"
    em "（我耐心快没了。你让我别插手，可我的人不是无限的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3711
translate chinese story05_5_fc18f67f:

    # em "(This was supposed to end with far fewer losses.)"
    em "（这本来该以少得多的损失收场。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3712
translate chinese story05_5_fab53566:

    # em "(What use are those lands to me if everyone on them is dead?)"
    em "（上面的人都死了，那些地盘对我还有什么用？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3713
translate chinese story05_5_6cf1f845:

    # em "(Seems even you can’t foresee everything.)"
    em "（看来连你也没法预见一切。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3715
translate chinese story05_5_7bd3943b:

    # em "Aisha. Gather the others. It’s time to make adjustments to our plan."
    em "艾莎。把其他人叫来。该调整我们的计划了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3717
translate chinese story05_5_972386d1:

    # aS "Right away. I’ll gather everyone."
    aS "马上。我把所有人叫来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3718
translate chinese story05_5_79790114:

    # em "(This farce ends now. And no, one continent won’t be enough this time, Astoria.)"
    em "（这场闹剧到此为止。而且这次，一块大陆可不够了，阿斯托里亚。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3732
translate chinese story05_6_c4d064fc:

    # h "So, um… Lora? If this actually works out… will you come back with us?"
    h "那么，呃……洛拉？要是这事真成了……你会跟我们回去吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3734
translate chinese story05_6_0c030790:

    # L "Back to Earth?"
    L "回地球？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3735
translate chinese story05_6_474e085a:

    # h "Home, yeah."
    h "回家，对。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3736
translate chinese story05_6_4aacf53a:

    # L "And why the sudden question?"
    L "怎么突然问这个？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3737
translate chinese story05_6_6872b0fe:

    # h "I don’t know. Just got this feeling you’re not planning to come back with us. Like… you belong here more than there."
    h "不知道。就是有种感觉，你没打算跟我们一起回去。像是……你更属于这儿，而不是那儿。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3740
translate chinese story05_6_aab281bf:

    # L "If I had the chance to return, I would."
    L "要是有机会回去，我会的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3741
translate chinese story05_6_d5be3df8:

    # L "But for me… it was a dream that could never come true."
    L "可对我来说……那是个永远实现不了的梦。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3742
translate chinese story05_6_197c5f9a:

    # h "Hey! What about positive thinking and all that?"
    h "喂！正能量那一套呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3743
translate chinese story05_6_cbcda323:

    # h "We’re definitely coming back! You know…"
    h "我们肯定会回来的！你知道的……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3746
translate chinese story05_6_02fe1b3a:

    # Mi "I wouldn’t be so sure."
    Mi "我可不敢这么肯定。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3747
translate chinese story05_6_61fb93dd:

    # h "Hey! You’re supposed to be on our side."
    h "喂！你该站我们这边。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3748
translate chinese story05_6_e76073f0:

    # Mi "On your side… or on {b}yours{/b}?"
    Mi "站我们这边……还是站{b}你{/b}这边？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3749
translate chinese story05_6_dc44d352:

    # h "They don’t contradict each other."
    h "这俩又不冲突。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3752
translate chinese story05_6_d9b5eeb0:

    # L "You know… maybe you’re right."
    L "你知道吗……也许你说得对。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3753
translate chinese story05_6_de72ef84:

    # L "With everything that’s happened, I forgot how to think positively."
    L "经历了这一切，我都忘了怎么往好处想。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3754
translate chinese story05_6_da30bac4:

    # mc "Never give up, huh?"
    mc "永不放弃，是吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3755
translate chinese story05_6_0fc83358:

    # L "Exactly."
    L "正是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3758
translate chinese story05_6_993fbf22:

    # h "Yo, by the way, how are your implants holding up? Because what you pulled a few hours ago was seriously messed up."
    h "哟，对了，你的植入体怎么样？你几小时前干的那事可真够猛的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3759
translate chinese story05_6_7a06bca5:

    # Mi "Agreed."
    Mi "同意。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3760
translate chinese story05_6_b56a9f11:

    # h "But hey, don’t overdo it, okay? I’ve got no clue how those things really work, but judging by Miriel—"
    h "不过，别太拼了，行吗？我完全不懂那玩意怎么运作，可看米莉尔的样子——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3762
translate chinese story05_6_c11545a4:

    # mc "’m fine. Not perfect, but functional."
    mc "我没事。不算完美，但能用。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3763
translate chinese story05_6_d0eb78af:

    # mc "I’ve still got a lot to learn… but it was a worthwhile upgrade."
    mc "还有很多要学……但这升级值。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3764
translate chinese story05_6_99e56e8c:

    # mc "(Though sometimes… it feels like something’s pressing from the inside.)"
    mc "（不过有时候……感觉像有东西从里面往外压。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3766
translate chinese story05_6_4364cc73:

    # mc "(Still, the pros outweigh the cons.)"
    mc "（不过好处还是多过坏处。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3767
translate chinese story05_6_20a57789:

    # L "Please, just be careful with those implants."
    L "拜托，对植入体小心点。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3768
translate chinese story05_6_9c3e5274:

    # L "They’re not all-powerful."
    L "它们不是万能的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3769
translate chinese story05_6_fbeed068:

    # mc "Yeah. I know…"
    mc "嗯。我知道……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3775
translate chinese story05_6_9eebdc7f:

    # a "You’re in a much better state now."
    a "你现在状态好多了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3776
translate chinese story05_6_aa1c570e:

    # mc "(That voice… the white mask?)"
    mc "（那个声音……白面具？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3777
translate chinese story05_6_cf9f8888:

    # mc "And here I thought you were just a figment of my messed-up mind."
    mc "我还以为你只是我脑子坏了想象出来的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3779
translate chinese story05_6_63f65233:

    # a "Yes… and no. But your mind wouldn’t survive that truth right now."
    a "是……也不是。但你现在这脑子承受不住那个真相。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3780
translate chinese story05_6_6c0e797a:

    # mc "(This feeling… it’s the same as with Yong and Lora…)"
    mc "（这种感觉……跟面对勇和洛拉时一样……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3781
translate chinese story05_6_b7465cf9:

    # a "No one else can hear us."
    a "没有别人能听见我们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3784
translate chinese story05_6_c5818565:

    # mc "Alright. Why are you here this time?"
    mc "行。你这次来干嘛？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3785
translate chinese story05_6_acf8930e:

    # a "To warn you. You won’t be able to stop the gate. It’s already too late."
    a "来警告你。你阻止不了那道门。已经太迟了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3786
translate chinese story05_6_0b89ca93:

    # mc "Then what am I supposed to do?"
    mc "那我该怎么办？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3787
translate chinese story05_6_d4d8c3b8:

    # a "Accept the fact that not everyone can be saved."
    a "接受这个事实：不是所有人都能被救。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3789
translate chinese story05_6_63e36d5d:

    # mc "And you’re so sure because… what? You’re still just something in my head."
    mc "你这么确定是因为……什么？你还是只是我脑子里的东西。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3790
translate chinese story05_6_65991015:

    # a "I know far more than you do."
    a "我知道的远比你多。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3791
translate chinese story05_6_fca2bc30:

    # mc "Maybe. I won’t deny that. But that doesn’t tell {b}me{/b} anything."
    mc "也许吧。我不否认。可那没告诉{b}我{/b}任何东西。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3792
translate chinese story05_6_5f877a5a:

    # mc "So who the hell are you, really?"
    mc "那你到底他妈是谁？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3794
translate chinese story05_6_74a6dbbc:

    # k "Keepers."
    k "守护者。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3797
translate chinese story05_6_f026c42c:

    # a "How did you—"
    a "你怎么——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3800
translate chinese story05_6_2f114662:

    # k "(Hmph… figures.)"
    k "（哼……果然。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3801
translate chinese story05_6_011974f5:

    # k "Trying to fill his head with your fairy-tale bullshit, huh?"
    k "想往他脑子里灌你那套童话鬼话，是吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3802
translate chinese story05_6_e27c73b3:

    # a "I mean no harm to the one who serves as my vessel."
    a "我对充当我的容器的人没有恶意。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3803
translate chinese story05_6_a2eea7d6:

    # k "Oh, listen to that tone. I’ve heard plenty about your kind from Evrelia. Hypocritical bastards, the lot of you."
    k "哦，听听那语气。我从艾芙蕾莉亚那儿听过不少你们这帮人的事。虚伪的混蛋，你们全是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3805
translate chinese story05_6_0369574b:

    # mc "You can see him too-"
    mc "你也能看见他——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3806
translate chinese story05_6_3edac295:

    # k "My implant feeds me everything you see, straight into my skull."
    k "我的植入体会把你看到的直接送进我脑子里。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3807
translate chinese story05_6_5c89f43b:

    # k "And this thing felt something was off… so it crawled out of whatever hole it came from."
    k "而这东西感觉不对劲……就不知从哪个洞里爬出来了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3812
translate chinese story05_6_e133dbba:

    # k "(I’ll give it that, though. Ripping open a parallel reality with your own hands… Impressive.)"
    k "（不过这得承认。空手撕开一个平行现实……厉害。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3816
translate chinese story05_6_3c6a64a3:

    # mc "Ghh!"
    mc "呃啊！"

# game/Story04.rpy:3817
translate chinese story05_6_fb9aa277:

    # h "Wh— [mc]!"
    h "什——[mc]！"

# game/Story04.rpy:3818
translate chinese story05_6_7b3c89b6:

    # L "My love!"
    L "我的爱人！"

# game/Story04.rpy:3821
translate chinese story05_6_d33126f3:

    # mc "(It hurts… My head’s about to… explode…)"
    mc "（好疼……我脑袋快……炸了……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3822
translate chinese story05_6_ecd6d2e4:

    # L "Your body… it’s overloaded."
    L "你的身体……过载了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3824
translate chinese story05_6_cc67885a:

    # k "(Why would they even put those implants in him… especially if the Mistress had already seen him?)"
    k "（他们干嘛要给他装那些植入体……尤其女主人早就看过他了？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3825
translate chinese story05_6_3aacbb8e:

    # k "(On purpose? …Tch. Whatever.)"
    k "（故意的？……啧。随便吧。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3828
translate chinese story05_6_a1a7bfa5:

    # h "What did you do to him, you gorilla?!"
    h "你对他干了什么，你这大猩猩？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:3829
translate chinese story05_6_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3830
translate chinese story05_6_f8d027af:

    # h "Answer me!"
    h "回答我！"

# game/Story04.rpy:3831
translate chinese story05_6_958d1da8:

    # k "I saved him."
    k "我救了他。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3834
translate chinese story05_6_2e8c3642:

    # k "Pointy-ears. Pills."
    k "尖耳朵。药。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3835
translate chinese story05_6_9c03ccda:

    # h "How did you—"
    h "你怎么——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3836
translate chinese story05_6_8a57c4f8:

    # Mi "What happened to him?"
    Mi "他怎么了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3837
translate chinese story05_6_08505e66:

    # k "Pills."
    k "药。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3839
translate chinese story05_6_cffbc34d:

    # k "Or would you rather watch him lose his damn mind?"
    k "还是你想看着他彻底疯掉？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3848
translate chinese story05_6_073ccd73:

    # k "(Well… guess I don’t have much of a choice.)"
    k "（好吧……看来我也没什么选择。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3850
translate chinese story05_6_2737aa70:

    # k "(Then again, who am I kidding? Pissing all of you off kinda gets me going.)"
    k "（不过话说回来，我骗谁呢？把你们全惹毛还挺让我兴奋的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3851
translate chinese story05_6_9993b94e:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3852
translate chinese story05_6_f00bcd0e:

    # h "Wh—"
    h "什——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3854
translate chinese story05_6_71504f90:

    # h "Mouth to mouth… hey, tell me I didn’t just imagine that. She seriously just—"
    h "嘴对嘴……喂，告诉我我没看错。她刚才真的——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3855
translate chinese story05_6_7ad3be95:

    # Mi "S-she kissed him… yes…"
    Mi "她、她亲了他……是的……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3856
translate chinese story05_6_9993b94e_1:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3858
translate chinese story05_6_6ae772c7:

    # k "(We’ll have our fun later. You and me.)"
    k "（咱们之后慢慢玩。你和我。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3859
translate chinese story05_6_2b03bc66:

    # L "What do you think you’re doing?"
    L "你以为你在干什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3861
translate chinese story05_6_9bdeebc4:

    # k "(Someone’s pissed. Like, really pissed.)"
    k "（有人火了。真火了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3864
translate chinese story05_6_691fdb93:

    # k "You should be thanking me. For once in your life, I actually saved him."
    k "你该谢我。这辈子头一回，我真救了他。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3866
translate chinese story05_6_b9481cb6:

    # L "(She’s crossed the line. I need to put her back in her place.)"
    L "（她越线了。我得把她按回去。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3868
translate chinese story05_6_3fe50cfb:

    # L "If you hadn’t done something so reckless, this would’ve ended far more smoothly."
    L "你要是不干这种鲁莽的事，这事本会顺利得多。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3869
translate chinese story05_6_1c31c509:

    # L "Stop playing with my husband’s life."
    L "别拿我丈夫的命玩。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3870
translate chinese story05_6_a3d66542:

    # k "Hm..."
    k "嗯……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3872
translate chinese story05_6_3cf4e600:

    # k "Even if that were true, what are you gonna do about it?"
    k "就算真是这样，你又能拿我怎么样？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3873
translate chinese story05_6_f5a9657d:

    # k "Try to stop me?"
    k "想拦我？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3875
translate chinese story05_6_845c604c:

    # L "(She helped him, and still, I feel sick with rage.)"
    L "（她帮了他，可我还是气得想吐。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3876
translate chinese story05_6_9993b94e_2:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3878
translate chinese story05_6_0278b4eb:

    # k "(Whispering) Just like I thought."
    k "（低声）果然如此。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3879
translate chinese story05_6_f9df68bb:

    # L "(I’ll cleanse every trace of her filth from him. I swear I will.)"
    L "（我要把他身上她留下的每一丝脏东西都清干净。我发誓。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3883
translate chinese story05_6_831acfdb:

    # k "He’ll be back on his feet soon."
    k "他很快就会缓过来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3884
translate chinese story05_6_82109004:

    # k "But don’t get it twisted, those pills aren’t a miracle."
    k "但别搞错了，那些药不是什么奇迹。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3885
translate chinese story05_6_fadf12b2:

    # k "They just push the inevitable a little further down the road."
    k "它们只是把不可避免的事往后推了一点。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3888
translate chinese story05_6_5b6514b6:

    # L "My love? How are you feeling?"
    L "我的爱人？你感觉怎么样？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3889
translate chinese story05_6_4bebbe53:

    # mc "I’m fine. Let’s move-"
    mc "我没事。走吧——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3890
translate chinese story05_6_a737dcab:

    # mc "(Though my temples are still pounding...)"
    mc "（不过太阳穴还在突突跳……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3891
translate chinese story05_6_2653b46c:

    # L "No."
    L "不行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3893
translate chinese story05_6_a53716b9:

    # L "We’ll take a break."
    L "我们休息一下。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3894
translate chinese story05_6_74efee1a:

    # mc "Lora. We don’t have time."
    mc "洛拉。我们没时间。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3895
translate chinese story05_6_ecb8f84d:

    # L "(No. I’m not letting this slide. I need to have a word with that psychopath.)"
    L "（不。这事我不能就这么算了。我得跟那个疯子说句话。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3896
translate chinese story05_6_a47cea91:

    # L "I don’t care. We’re stopping here. Understood?"
    L "我不管。就在这儿停。明白吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3897
translate chinese story05_6_1c899d2b:

    # L "You’re not going anywhere in that condition."
    L "你这状态哪儿都不许去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3899
translate chinese story05_6_92fdac9d:

    # mc "We’re a team. Other people’s decisions matter too."
    mc "我们是团队。别人的决定也得算数。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3900
translate chinese story05_6_9452bee5:

    # L "I—"
    L "我——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3901
translate chinese story05_6_280ae4c5:

    # h "(She’s really pissed. Not even trying to hide it.)"
    h "（她是真气了。连藏都不藏了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3902
translate chinese story05_6_34784c0e:

    # h "(Alright, Liv, stop. Why are you getting so worked up? You’re no better than her.)"
    h "（好了，莉芙，停下。你干嘛这么上头？你也好不到哪儿去。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3905
translate chinese story05_6_bf716b0d:

    # h "Lora’s right. We should take a break."
    h "洛拉说得对。我们该休息一下。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3906
translate chinese story05_6_2880e7e8:

    # h "(And while we do… I need to clear something up between us.)"
    h "（趁休息的时候……我得把咱们之间的事说清。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3910
translate chinese story05_6_61bd5045:

    # h "(whispering) Can I steal you for a minute?"
    h "（低声）能借你一分钟吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3916
translate chinese story05_6_20e3448e:

    # mc "Alright. What did you want to talk about?"
    mc "好。你想聊什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3917
translate chinese story05_6_8b9c99bd:

    # h "You know… for as long as I can remember, you and Lora have always taken up a huge part of my life."
    h "你知道吗……打我记事起，你和洛拉就一直占着我生命中很大一块。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3918
translate chinese story05_6_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3920
translate chinese story05_6_b973e595:

    # mc "Is something bothering you?"
    mc "有什么烦心事？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3921
translate chinese story05_6_a0de38e5:

    # h "It’s not that something’s wrong, it’s just—"
    h "不是有什么不对，只是——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3922
translate chinese story05_6_f16e164a:

    # h "So much has happened. So many problems, disasters, all that crap… you get it, right?"
    h "发生了太多事。那么多问题、灾难、那些破事……你懂吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3923
translate chinese story05_6_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3925
translate chinese story05_6_b5f3b044:

    # h "And no matter what went down, you were always there."
    h "不管出了什么事，你一直都在。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3926
translate chinese story05_6_3e7377cf:

    # h "Saving my ass. More times than I can even count."
    h "救我。次数多到我自己都数不清。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3927
translate chinese story05_6_9ea2f800:

    # mc "Really? Don’t remember it that way."
    mc "是吗？我可不记得是这样。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3930
translate chinese story05_6_42d253ad:

    # "A couple of years ago"
    "几年前"

# game/Story04.rpy:3933
translate chinese story05_6_6d1fa352:

    # h "(Oh, I remember it perfectly. Like that fight, with that bitch Anya got tangled up with.)"
    h "（哦，我记得清清楚楚。比如安雅被卷进去的那场架。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3934
translate chinese story05_6_4216066b:

    # h "(She was a real piece of work. There were moments I honestly thought I’d lose.)"
    h "（那女人真不是省油的灯。有好几次我真以为自己要输了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3936
translate chinese story05_6_41899266:

    # h "(But even then… when my head was screaming that this was the end.)"
    h "（可即便那时……当我脑子里尖叫着说这就是尽头的时候。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3937
translate chinese story05_6_c95f4c2e:

    # mc "Right hook, right hook- YES!"
    mc "右勾拳，右勾拳——漂亮！"

# game/Story04.rpy:3938
translate chinese story05_6_a6719841:

    # mc "COME ON! WRECK THAT BITCH!"
    mc "上啊！把那婊子打趴下！"

# game/Story04.rpy:3939
translate chinese story05_6_74bfdcb4:

    # h "(Funny, right? Just words. But somehow… they gave me strength.)"
    h "（好笑吧？就几句话。可不知怎么……给了我力气。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3942
translate chinese story05_6_6d011ded:

    # h "(You’re the one who taught me how to stand up for myself.)"
    h "（是你教会了我怎么为自己站出来。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3943
translate chinese story05_6_4d200ecf:

    # h "(Hell… our training sessions became something sacred to me.)"
    h "（妈的……我们的训练对我来说成了某种神圣的东西。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3944
translate chinese story05_6_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3946
translate chinese story05_6_f9cbafdc:

    # mc "(But where are you going with this?)"
    mc "（可你想说什么？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3947
translate chinese story05_6_940da555:

    # h "(What I’m getting at is… without you, I’m not sure who I’d even be.)"
    h "（我想说的是……没有你，我都不确定自己会是谁。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3948
translate chinese story05_6_805067da:

    # mc "(Didn’t seem to stop you back on Earth.)"
    mc "（在地球上的时候可没见你停。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3950
translate chinese story05_6_58348e3a:

    # h "(Back then, I just ran. From everything. Telling myself I was strong and independent.)"
    h "（那时候我只会逃。逃开一切。跟自己说我坚强又独立。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3951
translate chinese story05_6_4ed78104:

    # mc "Olivia! That’s my girl!"
    mc "奥利维亚！这才是我姑娘！"

# game/Story04.rpy:3952
translate chinese story05_6_3bcf52b6:

    # h "(But deep down…)"
    h "（可心底里……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3955
translate chinese story05_6_84b87c50:

    # mc "Hip-hip, hooray!"
    mc "万岁，万岁！"

# game/Story04.rpy:3956
translate chinese story05_6_2a18d57a:

    # h "(You became the support I never asked for.)"
    h "（你成了我从没求过的支撑。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3958
translate chinese story05_6_6f3fb058:

    # h "(But desperately needed.)"
    h "（却拼命需要的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3959
translate chinese story05_6_c2d2ff63:

    # h "(At first, I confused gratitude with something more.)"
    h "（起初，我把感激跟更深的东西搞混了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3960
translate chinese story05_6_460149aa:

    # mc "(Liv...)"
    mc "（莉芙……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3961
translate chinese story05_6_a07063d3:

    # h "(Still… the closer we got, the more I realized, that wasn’t it.)"
    h "（可……我们越亲近，我越明白，不是那样。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3963
translate chinese story05_6_39f68757:

    # h "(whispering) Thank you, [mc]."
    h "（低声）谢谢你，[mc]。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3964
translate chinese story05_6_a67878c8:

    # h "(Yeah, yeah, I know how that probably sounds… but still.)"
    h "（是，是，我知道这话听着像什么……但还是。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:3968
translate chinese story05_6_a6cb3b9e:

    # mc "And yet… here we are. Alone."
    mc "可……我们还是到了这儿。就我们俩。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3969
translate chinese story05_6_2fded262:

    # h "..."
    h "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3970
translate chinese story05_6_1b1c8dcc:

    # h "You know, [mc]…"
    h "你知道吗，[mc]……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3971
translate chinese story05_6_d1b0e31f:

    # h "I’m a mess of a girl. Loud. Hot-headed. Dumb. Useless—"
    h "我是个一团糟的姑娘。吵。冲动。蠢。没用——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3972
translate chinese story05_6_0f098f83:

    # mc "No. Stop. Where did you even get that idea?"
    mc "不。停下。你这想法从哪儿来的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3974
translate chinese story05_6_326dbc74:

    # h "Isn’t it true though?"
    h "难道不是真的吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:3975
translate chinese story05_6_1ff2cacc:

    # mc "Your optimism. Your experience. Your confidence. Your skills."
    mc "你的乐观。你的经验。你的自信。你的本事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3976
translate chinese story05_6_9cc76550:

    # h "Yeah, but compared to the others, I’m just—"
    h "是，可跟其他人比，我就只是——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3977
translate chinese story05_6_aff53f61:

    # mc "You’ve got your own kind of charm."
    mc "你有你自己那种魅力。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3980
translate chinese story05_6_9bf1b482:

    # mc "And if anyone tells you otherwise… I’ll knock their teeth in."
    mc "要是有人说不是……我就把他们的牙敲掉。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3981
translate chinese story05_6_ad8988f9:

    # h "Even Kalestra? She says it all the time."
    h "连卡莱斯特拉也算？她老这么说。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3984
translate chinese story05_6_302c4649:

    # mc "She… doesn’t mean it like that. Mostly."
    mc "她……不是那个意思。大部分时候。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3985
translate chinese story05_6_c4b92529:

    # mc "That’s just how she talks. Give her time, you’ll see, she’s alright."
    mc "她就那样说话。给她点时间，你会发现的，她人还行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3988
translate chinese story05_6_f1f0bef3:

    # h "That kiss she gave you. Right in front of Lora…"
    h "她给你的那个吻。就在洛拉面前……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3991
translate chinese story05_6_4b6b00f3:

    # mc "Olivia? What are you-"
    mc "奥利维亚？你干什——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3992
translate chinese story05_6_5e36dc82:

    # h "I’m scared… really scared, just thinking about it."
    h "我怕……光是想想就真的很怕。"

# game/Story04.rpy:3993
translate chinese story05_6_92338f44:

    # h "In all of this mess—"
    h "在这一团乱里——"

# game/Story04.rpy:3994
translate chinese story05_6_31508719:

    # h "With all these girls orbiting around you…"
    h "这么多姑娘围着你转……"

# game/Story04.rpy:3996
translate chinese story05_6_72bab72f:

    # h "There’s no place for me."
    h "没有我的位置。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4000
translate chinese story05_6_32bbb88d:

    # h "And that… that honestly terrifies me."
    h "而这一点……真的让我害怕。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4001
translate chinese story05_6_8406df8f:

    # h "I get it. Lora’s your wife. And I owe her so much. Same with you—"
    h "我懂。洛拉是你妻子。我欠她太多。也欠你——"

# game/Story04.rpy:4002
translate chinese story05_6_eab2f2f0:

    # h "But I just can’t…"
    h "可我就是没法……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4005
translate chinese story05_6_4ac48758:

    # h "I can’t stay on the sidelines anymore, pretending these feelings don’t exist."
    h "我没法再站在一边，假装这些感情不存在。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4007
translate chinese story05_6_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4008
translate chinese story05_6_a6e978e2:

    # mc "(So… what do I do now?)"
    mc "（那……我现在该怎么办？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4013
translate chinese mcchoice1_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4014
translate chinese mcchoice1_7eaa385d:

    # mc "(What am I supposed to do now?)"
    mc "（我现在该怎么办？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4019
translate chinese mcchoice1_e5ddbbd4:

    # mc "You did well. Really."
    mc "你做得很好。真的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4020
translate chinese mcchoice1_0d238bc1:

    # mc "But I’m not the kind of man who has the right to accept feelings like that."
    mc "可我不是那种有资格接受这种感情的人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4022
translate chinese mcchoice1_da780d91:

    # mc "(I’m sorry, Liv. Truly. But this… this is for your sake.)"
    mc "（对不起，莉芙。真的。可这……这是为你好。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4024
translate chinese mcchoice1_a32efabb:

    # mc "I won’t abandon you."
    mc "我不会抛下你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4025
translate chinese mcchoice1_f58a8001:

    # mc "But if we keep going, it’ll break us both."
    mc "可要是继续下去，会把我们两个都毁掉。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4026
translate chinese mcchoice1_e58550bb:

    # mc "So… distance is the only option."
    mc "所以……保持距离是唯一的选择。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4028
translate chinese mcchoice1_6f79b2ab:

    # h "I… I don’t like this."
    h "我……我不喜欢这样。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4030
translate chinese mcchoice1_586f0bc1:

    # mc "I know. I’m sorry…"
    mc "我知道。对不起……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4032
translate chinese mcchoice1_df7d6113:

    # h "Well… at least now I’m glad I finally dumped all that weight off my chest."
    h "好吧……至少现在我挺高兴，终于把心里那块石头放下了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4034
translate chinese mcchoice1_e9127611:

    # h "And I’m sure I’ll start living an even better life now. You’ll see, [mc]—"
    h "而且我肯定从现在起会过得更好。你等着看，[mc]——"

# game/Story04.rpy:4036
translate chinese mcchoice1_8ae8249b:

    # mc "Olivia, your tears-"
    mc "奥利维亚，你的眼泪——"

# game/Story04.rpy:4038
translate chinese mcchoice1_f50181f7:

    # h "Huh? No— it’s not that… I—"
    h "啊？不——不是那样……我——"

# game/Story04.rpy:4040
translate chinese mcchoice1_c9a635d6:

    # h "(No, stop it. You’re strong. We’ve been over this already…)"
    h "（不，停下。你很坚强。这事我们说过了……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4042
translate chinese mcchoice1_cdcb688b:

    # "(quietly, as he hugs her)"
    "（他抱住她，声音很轻）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4043
translate chinese mcchoice1_7f9e20be:

    # h "Why… I was ready."
    h "为什么……我明明准备好了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4045
translate chinese mcchoice1_8d38f66d:

    # h "So why can’t I let you go?!"
    h "那我为什么还是放不下你？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:4046
translate chinese mcchoice1_e2437d16:

    # "Without a word, he gently strokes her hair, while she, through laughter and tears, tries to come to terms with the storm raging in her heart."
    "他一言不发，轻轻抚着她的头发，而她笑着、哭着，试着接受心里那场翻涌的风暴。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4048
translate chinese mcchoice1_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4049
translate chinese mcchoice1_b7a91b35:

    # k "Tch."
    k "啧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4061
translate chinese mcchoice1_e209dae1:

    # mc "(I don’t know if this is right or wrong… but seeing her like this tears me apart.)"
    mc "（我不知道这算对还是错……可看她这样，把我心都撕开了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4062
translate chinese mcchoice1_b179ea76:

    # mc "(And at the same time, if I go through with this, I might shatter Lora’s heart.)"
    mc "（同时，我要是真做下去，可能会把洛拉的心打碎。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4064
translate chinese mcchoice1_b0ebefcc:

    # mc "No. I can’t, Lora-"
    mc "不。我不能，洛拉——"

# game/Story04.rpy:4066
translate chinese mcchoice1_7d3082c9:

    # h "I… I have her consent."
    h "我……我得到她同意了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4067
translate chinese mcchoice1_ad0e1602:

    # h "I don’t know if that changes how you—"
    h "我不知道那会不会改变你——"

# game/Story04.rpy:4069
translate chinese mcchoice1_d8e899d8:

    # mc "Are you sure?.."
    mc "你确定……？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4071
translate chinese mcchoice1_cb93fe83:

    # h "I want to be honest. With everyone."
    h "我想坦诚。对所有人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4074
translate chinese mcchoice1_87760af8:

    # mc "(Yeah. I really might be the worst husband in existence.)"
    mc "（是啊。我可能真是世上最烂的丈夫。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4075
translate chinese mcchoice1_3cead245:

    # mc "(But the way she looked at me… something just snapped in my head.)"
    mc "（可她看我的那种眼神……我脑子里有什么东西断了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4078
translate chinese mcchoice1_d1ab9ce8:

    # mc "(Her eyes… so much trust. So much vulnerability. I can’t just walk away from that.)"
    mc "（她的眼睛……那么多信任。那么多脆弱。我没法就这么走开。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4079
translate chinese mcchoice1_0410adcb:

    # mc "(I don’t know if this is just a moment of weakness, but if I cross this line, I’ll have to take responsibility.)"
    mc "（我不知道这是不是一时的软弱，可要越过这条线，我就得担起责任。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4082
translate chinese mcchoice1_f34c726f:

    # mc "(What I’m doing behind Lora’s back… yet she hid the truth to protect everyone.)"
    mc "（我背着洛拉做的事……可她也曾为了护住所有人而藏起真相。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4083
translate chinese mcchoice1_2dbc4a1f:

    # mc "(She lied, but not out of malice.)"
    mc "（她撒了谎，但不是出于恶意。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4084
translate chinese mcchoice1_ea5148cb:

    # mc "(And still… looking into Olivia’s eyes like this, I can’t turn away.)"
    mc "（可即便如此……这样看着奥利维亚的眼睛，我转不开身。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4086
translate chinese mcchoice1_f8f2628a:

    # mc "(So should I stop now? I’ll hurt them both if I don’t.)"
    mc "（那我现在该停吗？不停的话，我会伤到她们两个。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4087
translate chinese mcchoice1_6b6bd25e:

    # mc "(Yeah… I’m a real bastard.)"
    mc "（是啊……我是个彻头彻尾的混蛋。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4088
translate chinese mcchoice1_6ae1e449:

    # mc "(But having such a beautiful woman standing right in front of me—)"
    mc "（可这么美的女人就站在我面前——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4090
translate chinese mcchoice1_8cca184f:

    # h "What’re you thinking about?"
    h "你在想什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4092
translate chinese mcchoice1_fd638b9d:

    # mc "With your hair down… you look incredible."
    mc "你头发放下来……太美了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4093
translate chinese mcchoice1_c6608d26:

    # mc "(After this, I’ll have to tell Lora everything.)"
    mc "（这之后，我得把一切都告诉洛拉。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4094
translate chinese mcchoice1_15c6db8a:

    # mc "(But the mission—)"
    mc "（可任务——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4096
translate chinese mcchoice1_803e3062:

    # h "You’re thinking about her right now, aren’t you?"
    h "你现在在想她，对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4097
translate chinese mcchoice1_58eac386:

    # h "I can tell by your eyes."
    h "你眼睛里写着呢。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4098
translate chinese mcchoice1_e62410b0:

    # h "You don’t know what the right thing to do is."
    h "你不知道什么才是对的做法。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4100
translate chinese mcchoice1_4fc7852d:

    # mc "Sorry… Before, not knowing the reason, I could ignore it."
    mc "抱歉……以前不知道原因的时候，我还能忽视它。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4101
translate chinese mcchoice1_fe8693d9:

    # mc "But now, knowing what happened, thinking about what a shitty thing I’m doing doesn’t exactly make life easier."
    mc "可现在知道了发生了什么，再想着自己干的事有多烂，日子可就好过不了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4103
translate chinese mcchoice1_ab52b869:

    # h "So… what will it be?"
    h "那……你想怎样？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4104
translate chinese mcchoice1_526ed341:

    # h "Do you want to stop here, or—"
    h "你想停在这儿，还是——"

# game/Story04.rpy:4108
translate chinese mcchoice1_68a8eb45:

    # mc "We keep going. I’ll deal with everything else later."
    mc "继续。其他的我之后处理。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4110
translate chinese mcchoice1_8bac112a:

    # h "Then I’ve got an idea how to really grab your attention."
    h "那我有个办法，能真把你的注意力抓过来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4111
translate chinese mcchoice1_f8276af5:

    # mc "Oh? And what would that be?"
    mc "哦？什么办法？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4114
translate chinese mcchoice1_04beeb56:

    # h "Two very convincing arguments. Like them?"
    h "两个非常有说服力的理由。喜欢吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4115
translate chinese mcchoice1_fb3a8304:

    # mc "They really do look… impressive."
    mc "它们看着……确实很震撼。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4117
translate chinese mcchoice1_761821ef:

    # h "{b}giggles"
    h "{b}咯咯笑{/b}"

# game/Story04.rpy:4118
translate chinese mcchoice1_074a19ef:

    # h "(Hopefully, at least for a couple of minutes, he can relax and get a break from all this.)"
    h "（但愿至少有那么几分钟，他能放松一下，从这一切里喘口气。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4120
translate chinese mcchoice1_1b1c8dcc:

    # h "You know, [mc]…"
    h "你知道吗，[mc]……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4121
translate chinese mcchoice1_207d64f9:

    # h "I don’t know what happens after this, but—"
    h "我不知道这之后会发生什么，可是——"

# game/Story04.rpy:4122
translate chinese mcchoice1_35d26d9c:

    # h "No matter what comes next, I’ll always be on your side. Okay?"
    h "不管接下来是什么，我永远站你这边。行吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4123
translate chinese mcchoice1_d5397b11:

    # h "Now drop all those thoughts for just a moment and let your brain rest."
    h "现在把那些念头放下，就一会儿，让脑子歇歇。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4124
translate chinese mcchoice1_cda45429:

    # h "In the end, we all need to unwind sometimes."
    h "说到底，谁都需要偶尔放松一下。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4126
translate chinese mcchoice1_228b94eb:

    # h "(And I’m no exception.)"
    h "（我也不例外。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4127
translate chinese mcchoice1_5aa2efcf:

    # h "(Just thinking about the pleasure sends shivers through my whole body. But even more than that-)"
    h "（光是想到那种快感，就让我全身发颤。可比那更强烈的——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4128
translate chinese mcchoice1_7609ee65:

    # h "(Feeling the tension leave him, bit by bit, makes my heart race like crazy.)"
    h "（感觉到他身上的紧绷一点点退去，让我心跳得快疯了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4130
translate chinese mcchoice1_c445c729:

    # mc "(Her gaze cuts straight through me… I feel like I’m losing control.)"
    mc "（她的目光直直穿过我……我感觉自己在失控。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4131
translate chinese mcchoice1_edf32488:

    # mc "Olivia… may I?"
    mc "奥利维亚……可以吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4132
translate chinese mcchoice1_5e14f090:

    # h "(whispering) Yes..."
    h "（低声）可以……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4139
translate chinese mcchoice1_0aa4535a:

    # h "(These sensations… the way he fills me… the way he holds me, I just melt in his arms.)"
    h "（这些感觉……他填满我的方式……他抱住我的方式，我就在他怀里化了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4140
translate chinese mcchoice1_28891814:

    # h "(And his eyes… full of passion and care…)"
    h "（还有他的眼睛……满是激情和在乎……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4141
translate chinese mcchoice1_753d41c6:

    # h "(whispering) Please… don’t stop…..."
    h "（低声）求你……别停……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4142
translate chinese mcchoice1_9262929b:

    # h "Aaahh..."
    h "啊啊……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4143
translate chinese mcchoice1_32deae18:

    # "A soft, tender moan slipped from her lips."
    "一声轻柔的呻吟从她唇间滑出。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4144
