translate chinese story05_7_096989e9:

    # L "When I live through a life, I can change its ending… but what that change leads to, I don’t know, not until I live it again."
    L "我经历一次人生时，可以改变它的结局……但那个改变会通向什么，我不知道，除非我重活一遍。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4600
translate chinese story05_7_b3efdbc2:

    # h "So if you already know everything, what are we doing he- oh!"
    h "既然你什么都知道了，那我们在这儿干嘛——哦！"

# game/Story04.rpy:4601
translate chinese story05_7_6b967441:

    # h "You’re checking whether anything’s shifted from the previous path?"
    h "你在确认有没有偏离上一条路线？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4602
translate chinese story05_7_49fd450f:

    # L "More or less. And about our deaths…"
    L "差不多吧。至于我们的死……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4605
translate chinese story05_7_4e193f5d:

    # Mi "Considering how things went up to this point… and what we faced along the way, none of it posed a real threat."
    Mi "考虑到事情到目前为止的走向……还有路上遇到的东西，没有一样构成真正的威胁。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4606
translate chinese story05_7_f4c8c1df:

    # Mi "Which means we reached our objective in most cases. So the real question is, what was waiting for us there?"
    Mi "也就是说，大多数情况下我们都到达了目标。那么真正的问题是，那儿等着我们的是什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4609
translate chinese story05_7_881e1ab2:

    # mc "Impressive."
    mc "厉害。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4612
translate chinese story05_7_9b808559:

    # Mi "I don’t believe that small group of soldiers could’ve stopped us."
    Mi "我不信那一小撮士兵能拦住我们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4614
translate chinese story05_7_fcf340b6:

    # mc "I agree."
    mc "我同意。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4615
translate chinese story05_7_8325604b:

    # mc "Still, wasn’t it thanks to her information that we avoided running into them?"
    mc "不过，我们躲开他们，不也是靠她的情报？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4616
translate chinese story05_7_af23ebf1:

    # mc "And you of all people should know, underestimating the enemy gets you killed."
    mc "而且你最该知道，低估敌人会送命。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4617
translate chinese story05_7_da3fdbf1:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4619
translate chinese story05_7_667d329b:

    # L "(sigh) Miriel’s right. None of that was thanks to me."
    L "（叹气）米莉尔说得对。那些都不是靠我。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4621
translate chinese story05_7_13108c51:

    # h "Hey, hey, we’re a team, remember? Where’s the team spirit?"
    h "喂，喂，我们是团队，记得吗？团队精神呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4622
translate chinese story05_7_240fdbdd:

    # h "And yeah, I’m sure this brainy one’s got a plan."
    h "而且我肯定这位脑力派有计划。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4624
translate chinese story05_7_e34ed9b2:

    # k "You’re a cutie, shorty, defending the one-eyed one like that… Should’ve learned a thing or two from her-"
    k "你这小可爱，还这么护着眼罩姐……你该跟她学两手——"

# game/Story04.rpy:4625
translate chinese story05_7_f1846764:

    # mc "Speak."
    mc "说。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4626
translate chinese story05_7_6306d208:

    # mc "What is it you want?"
    mc "你想干什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4632
translate chinese story05_7_adeac56a:

    # L "She thinks I’m working for the enemy. And honestly, I don’t blame her."
    L "她以为我在替敌人干活。说实话，我不怪她。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4633
translate chinese story05_7_986db736:

    # L "But for better or worse… I’m not."
    L "可不管好坏……我不是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4636
translate chinese story05_7_5ee7475f:

    # mc "You mean… who?"
    mc "你是指……谁？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4637
translate chinese story05_7_69f0f411:

    # L "The Elven Empress. Selvari-"
    L "精灵女皇。塞尔瓦莉——"

# game/Story04.rpy:4640
translate chinese story05_7_0ace2745:

    # k "You’re hiding something, darling."
    k "你在瞒着什么，亲爱的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4641
translate chinese story05_7_007184b4:

    # mc "Lower the blade."
    mc "把刀放下。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4642
translate chinese story05_7_a4fd8d2c:

    # k "Don’t get involved, honey. Love you, sure, but I won’t stand for lies."
    k "别插手，宝贝。我是爱你，但我不容忍谎言。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4644
translate chinese story05_7_6cf391b8:

    # k "If you’re not on her side, why drag your feet?"
    k "你要不是站她那边，干嘛磨磨蹭蹭？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4645
translate chinese story05_7_8e4d4ddf:

    # k "All this drama with the Abyss, Evrelia… nonsense."
    k "这一堆深渊、艾芙蕾莉亚的戏……全是胡扯。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4647
translate chinese story05_7_c259eb8a:

    # L "And what would be the point of lying to you?"
    L "骗你又能图什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4649
translate chinese story05_7_4db65bc2:

    # k "Just as much as telling us the truth."
    k "跟说真话一样，图点什么。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4652
translate chinese story05_7_8b9ee863:

    # mc "Enough."
    mc "够了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4653
translate chinese story05_7_360ca7d3:

    # mc "Whether it’s truth or lies, that’s for me to decide."
    mc "是真是假，由我来判断。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4654
translate chinese story05_7_1dbef00b:

    # k "Hand’s off."
    k "别碰。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4657
translate chinese story05_7_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4658
translate chinese story05_7_62ac8622:

    # k "I’m helping you outta fun, that’s it. And your wifey? She’s ruining it with her lies."
    k "我帮你纯粹是图个乐，就这样。可你那老婆呢？她的谎话把乐子全毁了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4660
translate chinese story05_7_78b0e255:

    # mc "(What happened to her? Where did this sudden shift come from?)"
    mc "（她怎么了？这突然的转变从哪儿来的？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4661
translate chinese story05_7_4ec01498:

    # mc "What’s going on with y-"
    mc "你怎么——"

# game/Story04.rpy:4662
translate chinese story05_7_2d24663c:

    # mc "Your implants…"
    mc "你的植入体……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4663
translate chinese story05_7_82091822_1:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4667
translate chinese story05_7_84cc1be9:

    # mc "We’re all on edge right now."
    mc "我们现在全都绷着。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4668
translate chinese story05_7_246c0cdc:

    # mc "I understand why you’re acting like this, and what pushed you there."
    mc "我理解你为什么这样，也理解是什么把你逼到这儿。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4669
translate chinese story05_7_dd222afc:

    # mc "But I won’t allow you to take it out on the team."
    mc "但我不允许你把气撒在团队身上。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4672
translate chinese story05_7_9ce02636:

    # mc "If that’s what you need, I’m willing to help you deal with it."
    mc "你要是需要，我愿意帮你处理。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4673
translate chinese story05_7_4164b948:

    # mc "Are we clear?"
    mc "清楚了吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4676
translate chinese story05_7_82091822_2:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4679
translate chinese story05_7_dd6674f9:

    # k "(Whisper) You’re a little gem yourself."
    k "（低声）你自己也是块小宝贝。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4683
translate chinese story05_7_ca7842fc:

    # k "Ciao."
    k "拜啦。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4684
translate chinese story05_7_353c051d:

    # mc "And where exactly are you going?"
    mc "那你要去哪儿？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4685
translate chinese story05_7_c5769283:

    # k "Just need some air."
    k "就是想透透气。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4688
translate chinese story05_7_177bd0d2:

    # h "Implants, huh… Miriel?"
    h "植入体，是吧……米莉尔？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4689
translate chinese story05_7_78f09310:

    # h "So what, you gonna pump me full of those too?"
    h "所以呢，你也要给我灌一身那玩意儿？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4691
translate chinese story05_7_a61614ea:

    # Mi "Can’t wait to walk around constantly agitated and aggressive?"
    Mi "你就那么想整天躁着、凶着到处走？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4703
translate chinese story05_7_a8cbea34:

    # h "Wait, agitated? Excited?? They actually affect the body like that?"
    h "等等，躁？兴奋？？它们真会那样影响身体？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4704
translate chinese story05_7_9d0bff27:

    # h "Okay, dumb question, of course they do. But why excitement, specifically?"
    h "好吧，蠢问题，当然会。可为什么偏偏是兴奋？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4711
translate chinese story05_7_2f8a12dd:

    # Mi "High blood circulation. Energy builds up… and once it reaches its limit, it needs release."
    Mi "血液循环加快。能量积聚……一旦到极限，就需要释放。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4712
translate chinese story05_7_28e52dbc:

    # Mi "And after that… I think you understand."
    Mi "至于之后……我想你懂。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4714
translate chinese story05_7_464f006e:

    # h "So she went to blow off some steam? Masturbating?"
    h "所以她是去发泄了？自慰？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4715
translate chinese story05_7_f8bbaebf:

    # Mi "No. Knowing her, definitely not."
    Mi "不。以她的性子，绝对不是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4716
translate chinese story05_7_851c94d9:

    # Mi "At least not under circumstances like these."
    Mi "至少在这种情形下不会。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4719
translate chinese story05_7_8b94683e:

    # L "Thank you, darling."
    L "谢谢你，亲爱的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4722
translate chinese story05_7_ee44d251:

    # mc "This is your last chance. And if even this turns out to be a lie…"
    mc "这是你最后的机会。要是连这次也是谎……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4723
translate chinese story05_7_60e734ef:

    # L "I know, darling. The truth, nothing but the truth."
    L "我知道，亲爱的。真话，只有真话。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4730
translate chinese story05_7_90607bc8:

    # mc "Why didn’t you say this from the start?"
    mc "你为什么不一开始就说？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4732
translate chinese story05_7_58bfa70f:

    # L "I couldn’t. Not of my own free will. I wanted to tell you, but Astoria…"
    L "我不能。由不得我自己。我想告诉你，可阿斯托里亚……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4734
translate chinese story05_7_ba6d04ac:

    # L "The fewer people knew, the more likely we were to fool the pattern."
    L "知道的人越少，我们越有可能骗过那个模式。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4735
translate chinese story05_7_459a48f1:

    # mc "The pattern?"
    mc "什么模式？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4737
translate chinese story05_7_dd2b1277:

    # L "Every choice leads to another outcome."
    L "每一个选择都通向另一个结果。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4738
translate chinese story05_7_2e5a91be:

    # L "Astoria and I were trying to find the one where everyone survives."
    L "阿斯托里亚和我在找那个所有人都活下来的结果。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4740
translate chinese story05_7_c8992b1c:

    # L "And for that… we had to keep things hidden."
    L "为此……我们只能把事藏着。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4741
translate chinese story05_7_23078864:

    # mc "(This is absurd… and I’m just supposed to believe this?)"
    mc "（这太荒唐了……我就该信这个？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4742
translate chinese story05_7_02bb9192:

    # mc "I’ll be honest, this sounds like complete nonsense."
    mc "说实话，这听着纯属胡扯。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4743
translate chinese story05_7_64960f08:

    # mc "But fine."
    mc "不过行吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4744
translate chinese story05_7_fcbd24cb:

    # mc "Still… if you’re telling me now, does that mean we’ve already lost the chance to choose that path?"
    mc "可……你现在告诉我，是不是意味着我们已经失去了选那条路的机会？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4745
translate chinese story05_7_d144587b:

    # L "I don’t know. This is the first time I’ve dared to do it."
    L "不知道。这是我第一次敢这么做。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4747
translate chinese story05_7_d4bb82c8:

    # L "I get it, to everyone else, I must look horrible."
    L "我明白，在别人眼里，我一定很可怕。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4748
translate chinese story05_7_ec1f5afa:

    # L "A selfish, hypocritical bitch. But… I had to do it."
    L "一个自私、虚伪的贱人。可……我必须这么做。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4750
translate chinese story05_7_5d9f22ac:

    # mc "I…"
    mc "我……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4751
translate chinese story05_7_03b08cef:

    # mc "(What am I even supposed to do? I can barely take care of myself… let alone protect her.)"
    mc "（我到底能做什么？我连自己都勉强顾得住……更别说护她了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4752
translate chinese story05_7_978c8108:

    # mc "How can I help you?"
    mc "我能怎么帮你？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4754
translate chinese story05_7_9993b94e:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4755
translate chinese story05_7_a69c9c06:

    # L "(He’s made it this far - even without the power I have.)"
    L "（他走到这一步——连我这份力量都没有。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4756
translate chinese story05_7_5ddc20e2:

    # L "(But what if…)"
    L "（可要是……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4758
translate chinese story05_7_b48eb54a:

    # L "(If he had it too- No. Do you really want him to suffer like that?)"
    L "（他也有了这份力量——不。你真想让他那样受苦吗？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4759
translate chinese story05_7_6c0d544d:

    # L "(He’s suffered enough already. I have to finish this, and then, for sure-)"
    L "（他已经受够了。我必须了结这事，然后，一定能——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4761
translate chinese story05_7_0297642d_1:

    # mc "Lora?"
    mc "洛拉？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4763
translate chinese story05_7_35a7270f:

    # L "In the tower, Astoria’s opening a controlled path to Evrelia."
    L "在高塔里，阿斯托里亚正打开一条通往艾芙蕾莉亚的受控通道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4764
translate chinese story05_7_58880440:

    # L "She’s using the elves’ interests as cover, drawing attention to them."
    L "她拿精灵的利益当掩护，把注意力引到他们身上。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4765
translate chinese story05_7_2ea71718:

    # mc "A distraction? From whom?"
    mc "分散注意？从谁那儿？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4766
translate chinese story05_7_53a1bdce:

    # L "From the Keepers. A higher power that keeps order in the galaxy."
    L "从守护者那儿。维持星系秩序的一股更高力量。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4768
translate chinese story05_7_6b32f19c:

    # mc "So Astoria is the enemy?"
    mc "所以阿斯托里亚是敌人？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4769
translate chinese story05_7_44ad84b0:

    # L "No. She isn’t the enemy."
    L "不。她不是敌人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4770
translate chinese story05_7_df3a5d0b:

    # L "Three plans are converging on the same Gate."
    L "三个计划正汇聚在同一道门上。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4771
translate chinese story05_7_81f09d5b:

    # mc "Three?"
    mc "三个？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4772
translate chinese story05_7_cfdf0b74:

    # L "Astoria intends to open a narrow, controlled path to Evrelia."
    L "阿斯托里亚打算打开一条狭窄、受控的通往艾芙蕾莉亚的路。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4773
translate chinese story05_7_a2584039:

    # L "Selvaria intends to seize that opening."
    L "塞尔瓦莉亚打算夺取那个开口。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4774
translate chinese story05_7_307f0c95:

    # L "She’ll feed the Gate with the planet’s life energy and force it fully open."
    L "她会用这颗星球的生命能量喂那道门，强行把它完全打开。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4775
translate chinese story05_7_76980de4:

    # mc "And us?"
    mc "那我们呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4777
translate chinese story05_7_1807b543:

    # L "We use Astoria’s window to reach the core before Selvaria takes control."
    L "我们利用阿斯托里亚的窗口，在塞尔瓦莉亚夺取控制之前抵达核心。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4778
translate chinese story05_7_e19486f5:

    # L "I change the destination to Earth."
    L "我把目的地改成地球。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4779
translate chinese story05_7_7b5d30c8:

    # L "We cross, then shut the Gate behind us."
    L "我们穿过去，然后在身后关掉那道门。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4780
translate chinese story05_7_01064469:

    # mc "And if you can’t rewrite it?"
    mc "要是你改不了呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4781
translate chinese story05_7_e4dd368f:

    # L "Then we don’t go home."
    L "那我们就回不了家。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4782
translate chinese story05_7_3cb8738f:

    # L "We block the cooling system."
    L "我们堵死冷却系统。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4783
translate chinese story05_7_b15c0594:

    # L "That should force an emergency shutdown before Selvaria can stabilize the Gate."
    L "那应该能迫使紧急停机，赶在塞尔瓦莉亚稳定门之前。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4784
translate chinese story05_7_3969bcdd:

    # mc "So the first plan gets us out."
    mc "所以第一个计划能带我们出去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4785
translate chinese story05_7_b33978cd:

    # mc "The second only stops them."
    mc "第二个只能阻止他们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4786
translate chinese story05_7_0fc83358:

    # L "Exactly."
    L "正是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4794
translate chinese story05_7_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4808
translate chinese story05_8_39a2d6d8:

    # h "What the hell happened here? The smell’s awful…"
    h "这儿到底出了什么事？这味儿太呛了……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4809
translate chinese story05_8_81eb4c36:

    # L "A slaughter. The Peacekeepers held as long as they could."
    L "一场屠杀。维和部队撑到了极限。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4810
translate chinese story05_8_dc2cc8fa:

    # L "As you can see, it wasn’t enough."
    L "你也看到了，还不够。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4813
translate chinese story05_8_fb668695:

    # L "Still… credit where it’s due. If it weren’t for them—"
    L "不过……该给的功劳还得给。要不是他们——"

# game/Story04.rpy:4814
translate chinese story05_8_c9e6938b:

    # k "Yeah, right. If it weren’t for the rats, things might’ve gone a hell of a lot better."
    k "是啊，可不是。要不是那些耗子，事情本来能顺得多。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4815
translate chinese story05_8_7608de78:

    # k "What’s wrong, one-eye?"
    k "怎么了，眼罩姐？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4817
translate chinese story05_8_be2cf39b:

    # L "What are you implying?"
    L "你想说什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4818
translate chinese story05_8_39d0c124:

    # Mi "(That style...)"
    Mi "（那种调子……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4820
translate chinese story05_8_8b315007:

    # mc "This is not the time. Focus on the objective."
    mc "现在不是时候。专注目标。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4821
translate chinese story05_8_23ee89f6:

    # k "Yeah, yeah…"
    k "行，行……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4823
translate chinese story05_8_09efa42a:

    # h "Yo… so behind those doors is where the real trouble starts?"
    h "哟……所以那扇门后面才是真麻烦开始的地方？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4824
translate chinese story05_8_cd86005f:

    # h "Maybe-"
    h "也许——"

# game/Story04.rpy:4825
translate chinese story05_8_50d5fa00:

    # Mi "(No... this can’t be.)"
    Mi "（不……不可能。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4828
translate chinese story05_8_851698a9:

    # L "Afraid?"
    L "怕了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4829
translate chinese story05_8_5dd95e89:

    # h "You’re not? I still remember my run-in with that Astoria, she tossed me around like I was nothing."
    h "你不怕？我还记得跟那个阿斯托里亚的交手，她把我甩来甩去，跟扔垃圾一样。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4830
translate chinese story05_8_cf700d0a:

    # h "And now she’s not alone. There’s two of them. Two. And they’re angry!"
    h "现在她还不是一个人。有两个。两个。而且她们还火了！"

# game/Story04.rpy:4831
translate chinese story05_8_958945ec:

    # k "(So this is where they locked Evrelia up… Yeah. What a shithole.)"
    k "（所以他们就把艾芙蕾莉亚关在这儿……是啊。真他妈是个破地方。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4834
translate chinese story05_8_833dd20e:

    # k "Hey, [mc]?"
    k "喂，[mc]？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4835
translate chinese story05_8_f49fff8f:

    # mc "Yeah?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4836
translate chinese story05_8_e94742b9:

    # k "Can you promise me one thing?"
    k "能答应我一件事吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4837
translate chinese story05_8_914ddfbf:

    # k "If I lose my mind in there, shoot me."
    k "我要是在里面疯了，就开枪打我。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4838
translate chinese story05_8_98d018d6:

    # mc "You’ll be fi-"
    mc "你不会有——"

# game/Story04.rpy:4839
translate chinese story05_8_8d33bef4:

    # k "Promise."
    k "答应我。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4840
translate chinese story05_8_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4841
translate chinese story05_8_6651ab87:

    # mc "Alright."
    mc "好。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4843
translate chinese story05_8_09b897ff:

    # mc "(Even she isn’t sure we’ll make it out alive… almost funny.)"
    mc "（连她都不确定我们能活着出去……几乎有点好笑。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4844
translate chinese story05_8_fcdbdfee:

    # mc "(We came this far, only to realize this journey might be our last.)"
    mc "（我们走到这一步，才发现这趟可能就是最后一程。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4846
translate chinese story05_8_d0e1886d:

    # mc "(No. No matter the cost, we survive. We have to.)"
    mc "（不。不管代价多大，我们都要活下来。必须。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4851
translate chinese story05_8_40bee8ee:

    # Mi "NO-!"
    Mi "不——！"

# game/Story04.rpy:4854
translate chinese story05_8_cb418999:

    # mc "Miriel?!"
    mc "米莉尔？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:4857
translate chinese story05_8_dc47c174:

    # mc "What happened? Are you alright?"
    mc "怎么了？你没事吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4858
translate chinese story05_8_e6ae08f8:

    # Mi "No... not this... not again..."
    Mi "不……不是这个……不要再来一次……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4859
translate chinese story05_8_0137d978:

    # mc "Miriel, calm down!"
    mc "米莉尔，冷静！"

# game/Story04.rpy:4862
translate chinese story05_8_4bf31749:

    # Mi "(What are they doing here?! I have to warn my teacher...)"
    Mi "（他们怎么会在这儿？！我得警告老师……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4865
translate chinese story05_8_e43f6daa:

    # L "What happened to you?!"
    L "你怎么了？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:4866
translate chinese story05_8_aca27f95:

    # h "Miriel! What’s wrong with her?!"
    h "米莉尔！她怎么了？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:4867
translate chinese story05_8_b5dc4a0b:

    # mc "I don’t know. She won’t respond… she’s terrified."
    mc "不知道。她没反应……她吓坏了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4868
translate chinese story05_8_7ebc8eed:

    # k "(So they tried. And failed… That’s unsettling.)"
    k "（所以他们试过。失败了……这可不妙。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4870
translate chinese story05_8_0bc26a75:

    # k "(If we don’t convince her, we’re dead. No other way around it.)"
    k "（说服不了她，我们就死定了。没别的路。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4871
translate chinese story05_8_ecec496f:

    # k "Hey, one-eye. We’ve got a problem."
    k "喂，眼罩姐。我们有麻烦了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4872
translate chinese story05_8_9993b94e:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4873
translate chinese story05_8_eb60968a:

    # L "Not yet."
    L "还没到。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4876
translate chinese story05_8_dd171ae6:

    # k "Feels like we do. There’s a Keeper’s corpse lying around. And not just one."
    k "感觉已经到了。旁边躺着一具守护者的尸体。还不止一具。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4877
translate chinese story05_8_eef53157:

    # L "There will be more if we don’t move."
    L "要是不走，会有更多。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4878
translate chinese story05_8_e26151fc:

    # k "Got a plan?"
    k "有办法？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4879
translate chinese story05_8_109280b3:

    # L "Yes."
    L "有。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4882
translate chinese story05_8_0f10bd2b:

    # Mi "(Pull yourself together, Miriel. Pull yourself together. The Teacher entrusted you with this. You have to see it through.)"
    Mi "（振作，米莉尔。振作。老师把这事托付给你了。你得做到底。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4883
translate chinese story05_8_bef89616:

    # Mi "I can’t… I—I…"
    Mi "我做不到……我、我……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4884
translate chinese story05_8_08716cfc:

    # Mi "(Push the emotions away. Push the memories-)"
    Mi "（把情绪推开。把记忆推开——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4887
translate chinese story05_8_52afec7d:

    # mc "We’re with you."
    mc "我们在你身边。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4888
translate chinese story05_8_da3fdbf1:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4889
translate chinese story05_8_efb57761:

    # Mi "(Yes… right. I’m not alone anymore. Not alone.)"
    Mi "（对……没错。我不再是一个人了。不是一个人。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4892
translate chinese story05_8_81359aac:

    # Mi "[mc]… we have to leave. Before they arrive!"
    Mi "[mc]……我们得走。赶在他们到之前！"

# game/Story04.rpy:4893
translate chinese story05_8_59d4582c:

    # mc "(She’s shaking. Her voice is breaking. She’s on the verge of hysteria because of those people.)"
    mc "（她在抖。声音在碎。那些人快把她逼到歇斯底里了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4895
translate chinese story05_8_d4a404e4:

    # Mi "I don’t want to feel that pain again… I don’t want to lose you too!"
    Mi "我不想再感受那种痛……我不想连你也失去！"

# game/Story04.rpy:4896
translate chinese story05_8_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4898
translate chinese story05_8_edf53eef:

    # Mi "I don’t want to… I don’t want to... I don’t want to…"
    Mi "我不想……我不想……我不想……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4901
translate chinese story05_8_76f0aaba:

    # mc "Quiet, Miriel. We’re here."
    mc "安静，米莉尔。我们在。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4902
translate chinese story05_8_c447d351:

    # mc "(I’ve never seen her this scared.)"
    mc "（我从没见过她这么怕。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4904
translate chinese story05_8_a2ddf086:

    # L "Can I?"
    L "可以吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4905
translate chinese story05_8_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4906
translate chinese story05_8_f800bed0:

    # mc "Yes."
    mc "可以。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4913
translate chinese story05_8_177d3eb2:

    # mc "What are you doing?"
    mc "你干什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4915
translate chinese story05_8_ef2f2970:

    # L "Elven ears are their most intimate spot."
    L "精灵的耳朵是他们最私密的地方。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4916
translate chinese story05_8_5794ce61:

    # L "If you stroke them like this, they calm down."
    L "这样摸，他们就会平静下来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4917
translate chinese story05_8_4c36b43a:

    # L "What do you say, dear?"
    L "你觉得呢，亲爱的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4919
translate chinese story05_8_bd2053d2:

    # Mi "Mmh..."
    Mi "嗯……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4920
translate chinese story05_8_46f7213d:

    # Mi "P-please... just not in front of him... I-I’m embarrassed..."
    Mi "求、求你了……别在他面前……我、我不好意思……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4921
translate chinese story05_8_6b40ba75:

    # L "You’re adorable."
    L "你真可爱。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4922
translate chinese story05_8_23e22b23:

    # L "(whispering) So… did you like my husband?"
    L "（低声）那么……你喜欢我丈夫吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4924
translate chinese story05_8_2ea6555e:

    # Mi "W-WHAT?! NO, I-!"
    Mi "什——什么？！不，我——！"

# game/Story04.rpy:4925
translate chinese story05_8_31bfb294:

    # L "In this state, she always reminds me of Mina."
    L "这个样子，总让我想起米娜。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4926
translate chinese story05_8_ed03914a:

    # L "Makes me want to just squeeze those cheeks."
    L "让我忍不住想捏捏那脸蛋。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4928
translate chinese story05_8_ef99283a:

    # mc "(That sadistic streak of hers... give her an inch and she bares her fangs.)"
    mc "（她那点施虐倾向……给她一寸，她就露牙。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4929
translate chinese story05_8_d85279a8:

    # mc "(Still, it worked. Miriel’s calmer.)"
    mc "（不过还真管用。米莉尔平静下来了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4931
translate chinese story05_8_9a0f7aba:

    # h "(whispering) The more I watch them, the more I realize..."
    h "（低声）越看她们，我越觉得……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4932
translate chinese story05_8_c61a3039:

    # h "(whispering) You two are seriously creepy up close. Gives me chills."
    h "（低声）你们俩近距离看真瘆人。让我发毛。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4933
translate chinese story05_8_d67ffa4b:

    # h "(whispering) And these are the ones keeping balance in the galaxy? Yeah right, more like villains."
    h "（低声）就这还维持星系平衡？得了吧，更像反派。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4939
translate chinese story05_8_efe3833f:

    # h "(No-)"
    h "（不——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4943
translate chinese story05_8_e641f310:

    # h "(No...)"
    h "（不……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4945
translate chinese story05_8_2fded262:

    # h "..."
    h "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4946
translate chinese story05_8_3d69da2b:

    # h "(Fell...)"
    h "（倒了……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:4947
translate chinese story05_8_c2565da4:

    # mc "Olivia?"
    mc "奥利维亚？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4950
translate chinese story05_8_d3db1433:

    # h "It wasn’t me!"
    h "不是我干的！"

# game/Story04.rpy:4959
translate chinese story05_8_2fecf3d4:

    # h "I think?"
    h "应该吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4961
translate chinese story05_8_10096254:

    # h "I mean, who would’ve thought one little poke would knock him out cold?"
    h "我是说，谁能想到轻轻戳一下就把人戳晕了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4962
translate chinese story05_8_5287f3aa:

    # h "What are they made of, cardboard? Why are they so damn fragile?!"
    h "他们是什么做的，纸板吗？怎么这么他妈脆？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:4964
translate chinese story05_8_390eaf1a:

    # mc "Olivia. Enough."
    mc "奥利维亚。够了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4966
translate chinese story05_8_45fee4ae:

    # h "I- yeah. Sorry. That one’s on me."
    h "我——嗯。抱歉。这事算我的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4969
translate chinese story05_8_c3237d01:

    # k "That hit sealed it, we need to move."
    k "这一下把事情定了，我们得走。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4970
translate chinese story05_8_c1bcff2e:

    # k "I’m afraid her little stunt aggroed pretty much everything with a pulse."
    k "恐怕她这一出把所有还有心跳的东西都招来了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4971
translate chinese story05_8_570c24b2:

    # mc "Interesting. Where exactly are we supposed to go? We’re cornered. Lora, doors?"
    mc "有意思。我们还能去哪儿？被逼到墙角了。洛拉，门呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4972
translate chinese story05_8_b2698d79:

    # L "Sealed shut. They won’t open."
    L "封死了。打不开。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4974
translate chinese story05_8_6d172e86:

    # h "Yo, [mc]? I think I found a way out."
    h "哟，[mc]？我好像找到出路了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4975
translate chinese story05_8_2048344f:

    # mc "Olivia, this is not the time for jokes."
    mc "奥利维亚，现在不是开玩笑的时候。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4976
translate chinese story05_8_3675f07b:

    # h "No, seriously. I’m not joking. Look."
    h "不，说真的。我没开玩笑。看。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4978
translate chinese story05_8_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:4979
translate chinese story05_8_e1cf355d:

    # mc "Any idea where it leads?"
    mc "知道它通向哪儿吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4980
translate chinese story05_8_a8d7e199:

    # k "No clue. But I’m damn sure it doesn’t lead anywhere good."
    k "不知道。但我敢肯定，绝不是什么好地方。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4982
translate chinese story05_8_c7a98210:

    # h "For once, I agree with the gorilla. And I have zero desire to check what’s down there."
    h "难得，我同意大猩猩。而且我一点也不想下去看。"

# game/Story04.rpy:4984
translate chinese story05_8_cd099211:

    # mc "Olivia? Remember the promise?"
    mc "奥利维亚？记得那个承诺吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:4986
translate chinese story05_8_992969d0:

    # h "{b}Giggle"
    h "{b}咯咯笑{/b}"

# game/Story04.rpy:4988
translate chinese story05_8_aa150cc4:

    # h "Nope. Not happening. I’m not crawling in there. No way in hell."
    h "不。免谈。我不爬进去。绝不可能。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5017
translate chinese story05_9_8510cdca:

    # a "Move it, you worthless trash."
    a "动起来，你这没用的垃圾。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5019
translate chinese story05_9_ce129342:

    # R "H-how dare you talk to me li—"
    R "你、你竟敢这样跟我说话——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5020
translate chinese story05_9_f03a6b69:

    # a "You humans deserve nothing better."
    a "你们人类不配更好的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5022
translate chinese story05_9_29347032:

    # R "(So this is how you repay my work? Hypocrites!)"
    R "（这就是你们报答我工作的方式？伪君子！）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5024
translate chinese story05_9_32199085:

    # am "You really couldn’t find someone… even remotely competent?"
    am "你真找不到一个……稍微有点能力的人？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5026
translate chinese story05_9_5ea99ac7:

    # sel "You do realize the Keepers have started hunting anyone tied to the tombs."
    sel "你知道守护者已经开始猎杀任何与墓穴有关的人了吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5027
translate chinese story05_9_d75bd3e3:

    # sel "Finding someone who won’t embarrass themselves is already an accomplishment."
    sel "能找到一个不丢人现眼的，已经算成就了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5029
translate chinese story05_9_fd3c1758:

    # am "Could have brought your own scientists, you know."
    am "你本来可以带你自己的科学家来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5031
translate chinese story05_9_1ad5ec06:

    # sel "Unlike you, we consider our scientists a strategic resource."
    sel "不像你，我们把科学家当作战略资源。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5032
translate chinese story05_9_58156ee7:

    # sel "And even if I agreed to this little ‘Abyss’ venture, I’m not throwing my own people into it."
    sel "而且就算我答应了这趟“深渊”小冒险，我也不会把自己人往里扔。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5035
translate chinese story05_9_13de5f3f:

    # a "My Queen, we’ve got a problem."
    a "女王陛下，我们有麻烦了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5036
translate chinese story05_9_0a9e6245:

    # sel "What is it?"
    sel "什么事？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5039
translate chinese story05_9_33dda69c:

    # R "Then kill me already!"
    R "那就杀了我啊！"

# game/Story04.rpy:5040
translate chinese story05_9_1825690b:

    # aa "Stand down."
    aa "退下。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5041
translate chinese story05_9_6a7c5523:

    # aa "What about the gate?"
    aa "门怎么样了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5043
translate chinese story05_9_9478adc3:

    # R "There’s a problem, I can’t activate it."
    R "有问题，我启动不了它。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5044
translate chinese story05_9_842d3b3b:

    # sel "The reason? Not enough sacrifices?"
    sel "原因？祭品不够？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5045
translate chinese story05_9_7434b249:

    # R "No, something’s jamming them… from the other side."
    R "不，有什么东西在干扰它们……从另一边。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5047
translate chinese story05_9_14de9c4b:

    # sel "You didn’t invent that excuse… simply because you don’t know how to activate them, did you?"
    sel "你不是因为根本不知道怎么启动，才编出这个借口吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5049
translate chinese story05_9_a36b9fc6:

    # R "How dare you question my intellect!"
    R "你竟敢质疑我的智力！"

# game/Story04.rpy:5050
translate chinese story05_9_2d83607a:

    # aa "Watch your tongue, boy."
    aa "注意你的嘴，小子。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5052
translate chinese story05_9_4a6cd9cb:

    # sel "You have exactly one hour to fix this."
    sel "你只有一小时解决这个。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5053
translate chinese story05_9_aad3197d:

    # sel "If he fails, kill him."
    sel "他要是失败，就杀了他。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5055
translate chinese story05_9_05418593:

    # R "How da—"
    R "你竟——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5056
translate chinese story05_9_562c2793:

    # a "Yes, Your Majesty."
    a "是，陛下。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5058
translate chinese story05_9_dd99f046:

    # am "The sacrifices were never part of our agreement."
    am "献祭从来不在我们的协议里。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5059
translate chinese story05_9_ecb5b6d9:

    # sel "They became necessary when your clean solution stopped being sufficient."
    sel "当你的干净方案不够用的时候，它们就变得必要了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5060
translate chinese story05_9_b7e71d62:

    # am "Necessary for your plan. Not mine."
    am "对你的计划必要。不是我的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5063
translate chinese story05_9_84c330cd:

    # sel "Tell me, Astoria… what’s worth more: a star you can lose for the sake of the world,"
    sel "告诉我，阿斯托里亚……什么更值得：一颗可以为了世界舍弃的星，"

# game/Story04.rpy:5064
translate chinese story05_9_f0786ce7:

    # sel "or a world where one star shines brighter than all the rest?"
    sel "还是一个只有一颗星比其他所有星都亮的世界？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5066
translate chinese story05_9_281e6bb9:

    # am "The star. Even a single one can set the darkness on fire."
    am "是那颗星。哪怕只有一颗，也能把黑暗点燃。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5067
translate chinese story05_9_a0dda036:

    # am "A world without light is nothing but emptiness."
    am "没有光的世界，只是虚空。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5068
translate chinese story05_9_45b2fa62:

    # am "Truth is born from sacrifice. Value comes from the one you’d give everything up for."
    am "真相从牺牲中诞生。价值来自那个你愿意为之放弃一切的人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5070
translate chinese story05_9_532236ca:

    # sel "Or perhaps… the world matters more."
    sel "又或者……世界更重要。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5071
translate chinese story05_9_a5e62fdd:

    # sel "If the star goes out, life changes, but the universe continues."
    sel "星熄了，生命会变，但宇宙继续。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5072
translate chinese story05_9_a0085e19:

    # sel "Value is measured by what preserves the system, not by a single life."
    sel "价值由维持系统的东西衡量，而不是一条命。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5074
translate chinese story05_9_6cf15b8e:

    # am "And what if the world itself is ready to abandon its star?"
    am "可要是世界自己都准备抛弃它的星呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5075
translate chinese story05_9_7b1af516:

    # am "Worth isn’t measured by what survives, it’s measured by who is willing to give themselves so something else can."
    am "价值不由活下来的东西衡量，而由愿意献出自己、让别的东西活下去的人衡量。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5077
translate chinese story05_9_87afc3ba:

    # sel "Then who is more important, the one others die for, or the one who can choose to sacrifice?"
    sel "那么谁更重要，是别人为之而死的人，还是能选择牺牲的人？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5078
translate chinese story05_9_7731dd70:

    # sel "Truth lives in the choice: what you decide to protect… and what you’re willing to let go."
    sel "真相存在于选择里：你决定护住什么……又愿意放手什么。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5080
translate chinese story05_9_e50cd946:

    # am "The one people are willing to give everything for, that’s what matters."
    am "人们愿意为之付出一切的那个人，才是重要的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5081
translate chinese story05_9_c8f42703:

    # am "Without them, sacrifice is nothing but strategy."
    am "没有他们，牺牲就只是策略。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5082
translate chinese story05_9_c20a51da:

    # am "Greatness is the person you’re willing to break your rules for… even if it destroys you."
    am "伟大，就是那个你愿意为之打破自己规则的人……哪怕那会毁掉你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5084
translate chinese story05_9_1f75bb8c:

    # sel "And sometimes, the one who seems precious only tests who is truly willing to sacrifice."
    sel "而有时候，那个看似珍贵的人，只是在考验谁才真正愿意牺牲。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5085
translate chinese story05_9_6c9add1d:

    # sel "Worth exists in the eyes of the one who judges."
    sel "价值存在于评判者的眼中。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5086
translate chinese story05_9_47cd6163:

    # sel "The truth of sacrifice is seeing the pain, and walking forward anyway."
    sel "牺牲的真相，是看见那份痛，却依然往前走。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5090
translate chinese story05_9_b97d5dfe:

    # am "The truth is simple: the one who makes the decision is stronger than the one who merely seems important."
    am "真相很简单：做决定的人，比那个只是看起来重要的人更强。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5091
translate chinese story05_9_281fdb12:

    # am "And sometimes sacrifice isn’t loss at all, it’s a test of whether you can live with what follows."
    am "而有时候，牺牲根本不是失去，而是考验你能不能承受之后的一切。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5093
translate chinese story05_9_2e2902de:

    # am "(But the real power lies in the one who can do the impossible… for the person they cannot afford to lose.)"
    am "（可真正的力量，在于那个能为不能失去的人做出不可能之事的人。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5097
translate chinese story05_9_a31353a7:

    # am "(Sometimes the ‘rational’ choice is just a mask… hiding what has already begun inside.)"
    am "（有时候“理性”的选择只是个面具……藏着心里已经开始的东西。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5101
translate chinese story05_9_2707a773:

    # am "(I’ve already stepped onto this path.)"
    am "（我已经踏上这条路了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5105
translate chinese story05_9_b43326bb:

    # am "(No one will notice… not until it ends.)"
    am "（没人会察觉……直到它结束。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5109
translate chinese story05_9_6a8c1ca9:

    # am "(If my principles brought me to this ending…)"
    am "（要是我的原则把我带到了这个结局……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5115
translate chinese story05_9_7e719909:

    # am "(What were they ever worth?)"
    am "（它们究竟值过什么？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5120
translate chinese story05_9_05779cd7:

    # am "(If a flower is meant to begin a new life…)"
    am "（要是一朵花注定要开始新生……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5126
translate chinese story05_9_770176d2:

    # am "(Then I will become the soil for it.)"
    am "（那我就做它的土壤。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5145
translate chinese story05_9_96972950:

    # C "(A customer? At this hour?)"
    C "（这时候还有客人？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5147
translate chinese story05_9_4987d20d:

    # CC "*whistles* Now that’s a big fish."
    CC "*吹口哨* 这可是条大鱼。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5148
translate chinese story05_9_9ec2ae39:

    # CC "(whispering) What’s a lady like that doing in a bar this dead?"
    CC "（低声）那样的贵妇，跑这么冷清的酒吧来干嘛？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5150
translate chinese story05_9_1deed48e:

    # CC "What can I do for you?"
    CC "有什么能为您效劳的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5152
translate chinese story05_9_4e260567:

    # Evrel "..."
    Evrel "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5153
translate chinese story05_9_88f47ad4:

    # Evrel "I’m looking for a girl..."
    Evrel "我在找一个姑娘……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5154
translate chinese story05_9_915e367e:

    # Evrel "Named Lora."
    Evrel "叫洛拉。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5177
translate chinese story05_5_1_9902a657:

    # "A ventilation shaft stood just a few steps from the gate."
    "离大门几步远的地方有一处通风井。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5182
translate chinese story05_5_1_e4054e3a:

    # mc "Status?"
    mc "情况？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5183
translate chinese story05_5_1_b292e793:

    # k "You can come down."
    k "可以下来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5192
translate chinese story05_5_1_62e6bb7d:

    # mc "So this is our bypass route?"
    mc "所以这就是我们的绕行路线？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5193
translate chinese story05_5_1_21c6e533:

    # mc "Smells off…"
    mc "味道不对……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5195
translate chinese story05_5_1_c32219e9:

    # k "Ventilation’s dead. Where exactly would clean air come from?"
    k "通风死了。干净空气还能从哪儿来？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5196
translate chinese story05_5_1_84266e33:

    # k "Not that there was any left topside either."
    k "反正上面也没剩下。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5198
translate chinese story05_5_1_ab3df8fc:

    # mc "You sure this route is safe?"
    mc "你确定这条路安全？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5201
translate chinese story05_5_1_902f6130:

    # k "Safe? Pfft."
    k "安全？噗。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5202
translate chinese story05_5_1_6b5b501d:

    # k "As long as it’s not a dead end, good enough."
    k "只要不是死路，就够了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5203
translate chinese story05_5_1_61dbac4d:

    # h "Yo! How’s it looking? We coming down?"
    h "哟！怎么样？我们下来吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5207
translate chinese story05_5_1_64a8ca27:

    # k "Don’t overthink it. Might be a lousy option, but hey-"
    k "别想太多。可能是个烂选择，不过——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5208
translate chinese story05_5_1_393d210a:

    # k "sharing the fate of the guys upstairs isn’t on my to-do list."
    k "跟楼上那帮人共命运可不在我的待办清单上。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5211
translate chinese story05_5_1_551b8412:

    # mc "Same here."
    mc "我也不想。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5214
translate chinese story05_5_1_acd6e0e6:

    # mc "Come down!"
    mc "下来！"

# game/Story04.rpy:5221
translate chinese story05_5_1_2fded262:

    # h "..."
    h "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5223
translate chinese story05_5_1_5f6f84be:

    # h "Put me down."
    h "放我下来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5225
translate chinese story05_5_1_5d6f637b:

    # mc "On the bright side, you finally got some height."
    mc "往好处想，你终于有点高度了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5227
translate chinese story05_5_1_1343054b:

    # h "On the dark side, I might die of embarrassment."
    h "往坏处想，我可能要羞死了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5229
translate chinese story05_5_1_e8fbef1e:

    # mc "Pick your poison."
    mc "自己选吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5232
translate chinese story05_5_1_56c76061:

    # h "Oh, shut up."
    h "哦，闭嘴。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5236
translate chinese story05_5_1_b63bac94:

    # h "(whispering) Look… I do value what we’ve got. Really."
    h "（低声）听着……我确实珍惜我们之间有的。真的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5237
translate chinese story05_5_1_eeeb75ba:

    # h "(whispering) But maybe don’t do that while the gorilla’s watching, yeah?"
    h "（低声）不过别在大猩猩看着的时候那么干，行吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5239
translate chinese story05_5_1_6fb1465c:

    # mc "Noted."
    mc "记下了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5242
translate chinese story05_5_1_682e89fa:

    # mc "Next!"
    mc "下一个！"

# game/Story04.rpy:5245
translate chinese story05_5_1_833f4414:

    # Mi "Thank you… but I can manage."
    Mi "谢谢……不过我自己可以。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5247
translate chinese story05_5_1_30f41abf:

    # h "Oh! That reminds me-"
    h "哦！这倒提醒我了——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5248
translate chinese story05_5_1_12e82dff:

    # h "The Soulless… they’re basically humans in mutant bodies, right?"
    h "无魂者……它们本质上就是困在变异体身体里的人，对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5250
translate chinese story05_5_1_694a4fa2:

    # k "Where are you going with this?"
    k "你想说什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5251
translate chinese story05_5_1_92a52439:

    # h "How… do they spread?"
    h "它们……怎么传播？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5255
translate chinese story05_5_1_1ba69910:

    # mc "That’s—"
    mc "这——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5257
translate chinese story05_5_1_80ef4c61:

    # L "Through the air."
    L "通过空气。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5258
translate chinese story05_5_1_5b98c85d:

    # L "(whispering) Thank you, dear."
    L "（低声）谢谢你，亲爱的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5260
translate chinese story05_5_1_53dda515:

    # h "Wait wait, what do you mean {b}through the air{/b}?!"
    h "等等等等，你说{b}通过空气{/b}是什么意思？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:5261
translate chinese story05_5_1_f79bb8fc:

    # h "There are mutants everywhere outside, how are we still alive?!"
    h "外面到处都是变异体，我们怎么还活着？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:5263
translate chinese story05_5_1_de9595e8:

    # k "Hey. Old man."
    k "喂。老头。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5264
translate chinese story05_5_1_ab635f33:

    # k "You planning on putting her down anytime soon?"
    k "你打算什么时候把她放下来？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5266
translate chinese story05_5_1_1cb78db2:

    # h "Funny."
    h "好笑。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5267
translate chinese story05_5_1_27d7f257:

    # h "Didn’t look like you had a problem getting close earlier."
    h "你之前靠那么近的时候，可没见你有意见。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5269
translate chinese story05_5_1_afd941c6:

    # k "That was necessary."
    k "那是必要的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5270
translate chinese story05_5_1_f7d953ec:

    # k "You want him stable, or sentimental?"
    k "你想让他稳定，还是想让他多愁善感？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5272
translate chinese story05_5_1_b043f8ef:

    # mc "Enough. Not here."
    mc "够了。不是在这儿。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5273
translate chinese story05_5_1_9cf63763:

    # mc "We’re talking about the air."
    mc "我们在说空气。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5275
translate chinese story05_5_1_09d19a7d:

    # L "Airborne, yes."
    L "空气传播，对。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5276
translate chinese story05_5_1_3fcae73d:

    # L "But it depends on the concentration."
    L "但要看浓度。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5282
translate chinese story05_5_1_1ba69910_1:

    # mc "That’s—"
    mc "这——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5285
translate chinese story05_5_1_80ef4c61_1:

    # L "Through the air."
    L "通过空气。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5287
translate chinese story05_5_1_53dda515_1:

    # h "Wait wait, what do you mean {b}through the air{/b}?!"
    h "等等等等，你说{b}通过空气{/b}是什么意思？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:5288
translate chinese story05_5_1_f79bb8fc_1:

    # h "There are mutants everywhere outside, how are we still alive?!"
    h "外面到处都是变异体，我们怎么还活着？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:5290
translate chinese story05_5_1_09d19a7d_1:

    # L "Airborne, yes."
    L "空气传播，对。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5291
translate chinese story05_5_1_3fcae73d_1:

    # L "But it depends on the concentration."
    L "但要看浓度。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5301
translate chinese story05_5_1_d14216c9:

    # h "Oh."
    h "哦。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5302
translate chinese story05_5_1_b197b574:

    # h "So the miasma’s already down here."
    h "所以瘴气已经下来了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5303
translate chinese story05_5_1_1452f338:

    # L "Miasma isn’t a cloud."
    L "瘴气不是云。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5304
translate chinese story05_5_1_052ba4ff:

    # L "It’s what leaks from unstable Gates."
    L "它是从不稳定的门里渗出来的东西。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5305
translate chinese story05_5_1_a687bc06:

    # L "It poisons places first. Then bodies."
    L "它先污染地方。然后是身体。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5308
translate chinese story05_5_1_26457832:

    # mc "Why the sudden question?"
    mc "怎么突然问这个？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5312
translate chinese story05_5_1_da4058bd:

    # h "Lower City run."
    h "下城那一趟。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5313
translate chinese story05_5_1_a0096862:

    # h "Same smell there as here."
    h "那儿跟这儿一个味儿。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5315
translate chinese story05_5_1_ac096bbf:

    # h "And those massive ventilation shafts… like someone was deliberately spreading it—"
    h "还有那些巨大的通风井……像是有人故意在散播它——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5317
translate chinese story05_5_1_9da91900:

    # h "(coughs)"
    h "（咳嗽）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5320
translate chinese story05_5_1_1f0f2838:

    # L "Breathe…"
    L "呼吸……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5321
translate chinese story05_5_1_ff79c8ca:

    # L "I thought it was strange too, but—"
    L "我也觉得奇怪，可是——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5323
translate chinese story05_5_1_95042f17:

    # mc "Lora. A word."
    mc "洛拉。说句话。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5324
translate chinese story05_5_1_da5a1401:

    # L "Of course, dear."
    L "当然，亲爱的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5325
translate chinese story05_5_1_e6050af1:

    # L "You feeling better?"
    L "你好点了吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5327
translate chinese story05_5_1_fc809da6:

    # h "Y-yeah… thanks."
    h "嗯、嗯……谢谢。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5330
translate chinese story05_5_1_a2f4c5ce:

    # mc "That device."
    mc "那个装置。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5331
translate chinese story05_5_1_49791b99:

    # mc "Why did you give it to me?"
    mc "你为什么给我？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5334
translate chinese story05_5_1_a7a878b9:

    # L "The Blood of the Ancients…"
    L "古人之血……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5335
translate chinese story05_5_1_52fb14ca:

    # L "That’s what they call the charge inside the device."
    L "他们管装置里的装药叫这个。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5336
translate chinese story05_5_1_6f9cea84:

    # L "It and the miasma come from the same living source."
    L "它和瘴气来自同一个活的源头。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5337
translate chinese story05_5_1_61b9ed66:

    # L "Contained, it can power a Gate."
    L "封住时，它能给门供能。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5338
translate chinese story05_5_1_7e603981:

    # L "Released, it spreads through living tissue and takes control."
    L "释放后，它会通过活体组织扩散并夺取控制。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5339
translate chinese story05_5_1_5a736d53:

    # mc "Fuel and infection."
    mc "燃料和感染。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5340
translate chinese story05_5_1_47edc985:

    # L "The same source. A different state."
    L "同一个源头。不同的状态。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5341
translate chinese story05_5_1_c0613909:

    # L "Please, don’t be angry. I’ll explain."
    L "求你，别生气。我会解释。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5344
translate chinese story05_5_1_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5347
translate chinese story05_5_1_60e4a9a2:

    # L "(whispering) I want to believe we’ll make it through this…"
    L "（低声）我想相信我们能挺过去……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5348
translate chinese story05_5_1_ec948dc4:

    # L "(whispering) But if something happens to you…"
    L "（低声）可要是你出了事……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5351
translate chinese story05_5_1_6a0a0348:

    # L "Please… use it."
    L "求你……用它。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5353
translate chinese story05_5_1_b30c84bc:

    # mc "It kills."
    mc "它会杀人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5355
translate chinese story05_5_1_de3c5539:

    # L "Everything is poison. Everything is medicine."
    L "什么都是毒。什么都是药。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5356
translate chinese story05_5_1_8097260f:

    # L "It’s all in the dose."
    L "关键在剂量。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5357
translate chinese story05_5_1_bde3b303:

    # L "A rapid release will cause an explosion."
    L "快速释放会引起爆炸。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5359
translate chinese story05_5_1_5d8324e4:

    # L "A slow one…"
    L "缓慢释放……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5360
translate chinese story05_5_1_5de31203:

    # L "…can heal even a fatal wound."
    L "……连致命伤都能治好。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5362
translate chinese story05_5_1_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5364
translate chinese story05_5_1_2a60b690:

    # mc "I don’t agree with this, Lora."
    mc "我不认同这个，洛拉。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5366
translate chinese story05_5_1_4a70f78d:

    # L "I know, dear, but—"
    L "我知道，亲爱的，可是——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5367
translate chinese story05_5_1_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5368
translate chinese story05_5_1_8a6eece3:

    # mc "(This thing carries other people’s lives… and you want me to spend them?)"
    mc "（这东西装的是别人的命……而你要我把它花掉？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5369
translate chinese story05_5_1_430be8f1:

    # mc "(How am I supposed to justify that…)"
    mc "（我该怎么为这个找借口……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5371
translate chinese story05_5_1_69fb4ecf:

    # mc "Let’s hope it never comes to that."
    mc "但愿永远到不了那一步。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5380
translate chinese story05_5_1_54fe35bc:

    # "Once again, ventilation shafts."
    "又是通风井。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5382
translate chinese story05_5_1_bf377989:

    # mc "Let's move."
    mc "走。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5385
translate chinese story05_5_1_06c08d43:

    # mc "(The closer we get to the center… the worse it feels.)"
    mc "（越靠近中心……感觉越糟。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5386
translate chinese story05_5_1_dd2652d3:

    # mc "(Every instinct I have is screaming, run. Run as fast as you can.)"
    mc "（我每一个本能都在尖叫：跑。能跑多快跑多快。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5389
translate chinese story05_5_1_b0ba7e15:

    # mc "(But my legs keep walking.)"
    mc "（可我的腿还在往前走。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5391
translate chinese story05_5_1_d3bdf312:

    # mc "(I’ve never been the kind of person who’d give his life for someone else.)"
    mc "（我从来不是那种会为别人豁出命的人。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5392
translate chinese story05_5_1_960f62c0:

    # mc "(If anything… the opposite.)"
    mc "（真要说……恰恰相反。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5393
translate chinese story05_5_1_45860ad5:

    # mc "(And yet… when I look at them…)"
    mc "（可……当我看着她们的时候……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5395
translate chinese story05_5_1_fd05093f:

    # Mi "...Are you okay?"
    Mi "……你没事吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5397
translate chinese story05_5_1_2f61aa8f:

    # mc "Yeah. Why?"
    mc "没事。怎么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5398
translate chinese story05_5_1_6952480b:

    # Mi "(Something’s weighing on him.)"
    Mi "（他心里压着事。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5399
translate chinese story05_5_1_e20615d8:

    # Mi "(He looks steady on the outside, but…)"
    Mi "（他表面看着稳，可是……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5402
translate chinese story05_5_1_98261078:

    # Mi "(whispering) Deep down… you’re afraid…"
    Mi "（低声）心底里……你在怕……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5403
translate chinese story05_5_1_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5406
translate chinese story05_5_1_69b9be19:

    # Mi "We’re… more sensitive to our surroundings."
    Mi "我们……对周围环境更敏感。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5408
translate chinese story05_5_1_1a711067:

    # Mi "And…"
    Mi "而且……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5413
translate chinese story05_5_1_fc46fa94:

    # mc "(whispering) Thanks, Miriel."
    mc "（低声）谢谢，米莉尔。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5414
translate chinese story05_5_1_fcd9ed2e:

    # mc "But don’t worry."
    mc "但别担心。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5420
translate chinese story05_5_1_325c2332:

    # "Threat level: Moderate. Four o`clock."
    "威胁等级：中等。四点钟方向。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5426
translate chinese story05_5_1_2d621a7c:

    # mc "(whispering) Enemy."
    mc "（低声）敌人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5427
translate chinese story05_5_1_944337fe:

    # k "Oh? More pretty faces. Finally, something fun."
    k "哦？又来几张漂亮脸蛋。终于有点乐子了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5430
translate chinese story05_5_1_83f3ad21:

    # mc "(whispering) No. We let them pass."
    mc "（低声）不。放他们过去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5431
translate chinese story05_5_1_dcaa303d:

    # k "…Yeah, I don’t think so."
    k "……嗯，我看不行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5434
translate chinese story05_5_1_bc80c6fb:

    # mc "(whispering) If we can avoid casualties, we do."
    mc "（低声）能避免伤亡就避免。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5436
translate chinese story05_5_1_b3e60d91:

    # k "Wow. How noble of you."
    k "哇。你可真高尚。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5437
translate chinese story05_5_1_2ccd8a3e:

    # k "Not that I care about their lives. But I’m not just going to ignore what they’ve done."
    k "不是说我关心他们的命。可他们干过的事，我不会就这么算了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5439
translate chinese story05_5_1_f5479241:

    # mc "You’ll only make it worse. Every body we drop plays into the enemy’s hands."
    mc "你只会把事情弄得更糟。我们多丢一具尸体，就多帮敌人一把。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5440
translate chinese story05_5_1_221a081e:

    # k "…"
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5442
translate chinese story05_5_1_df809fd0:

    # k "You and your logic. Always ruining the fun."
    k "你跟你那套逻辑。总把乐子毁了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5447
translate chinese story05_5_1_2a5dc2bb:

    # k "Fine."
    k "行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5450
translate chinese story05_5_1_2e87d002:

    # h "Oh wow."
    h "哇哦。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5451
translate chinese story05_5_1_4401822b:

    # h "What happened to “screw the plan, we charge in”?"
    h "“去他的计划，直接冲”那套呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5453
translate chinese story05_5_1_6c10287d:

    # k "Crazy thing called ‘reputation.’ You should try getting one."
    k "有个东西叫“名声”。你也该弄一个。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5456
translate chinese story05_5_1_1213f926:

    # k "Oh, and one more thing."
    k "哦，还有一件事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5459
translate chinese story05_5_1_e7955371:

    # k "That implant? Not a miracle cure. Don’t rely on it too much."
    k "那个植入体？不是神药。别太依赖它。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5460
translate chinese story05_5_1_8f97d66f:

    # k "We’ve already got one lunatic on the team."
    k "队里已经有一个疯子了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5462
translate chinese story05_5_1_830d6e01:

    # mc "(Reputation… huh.)"
    mc "（名声……是吧。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5463
translate chinese story05_5_1_7c66f096:

    # mc "Kali? Thanks."
    mc "卡莉？谢了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5468
translate chinese story05_5_1_3d97c635:

    # k "Yeah, yeah."
    k "行，行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5470
translate chinese story05_5_1_67a2035a:

    # mc "(Small win.)"
    mc "（小胜一局。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5471
translate chinese story05_5_1_a6adc98a:

    # mc "Let’s move."
    mc "走。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5481
translate chinese story05_5_1_225d4e2c:

    # "Entrance to the compressor zone."
    "压缩机区入口。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5483
translate chinese story05_5_1_928fc6da:

    # Mi "...why."
    Mi "……为什么。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5490
translate chinese story05_5_1_83ea7f4e:

    # Mi "Why didn’t you kill them?"
    Mi "你为什么没杀他们？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5491
translate chinese story05_5_1_b98cba5e:

    # mc "(Why did that look give me chills?)"
    mc "（那个眼神怎么让我发冷？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5494
translate chinese story05_5_1_36a65aec:

    # mc "I don’t kill for pleasure. If a fight can be avoided, I avoid it."
    mc "我不为取乐杀人。能不打就不打。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5497
translate chinese story05_5_1_e4094083:

    # Mi "They’ve murdered innocent civilians."
    Mi "他们杀了无辜的平民。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5499
translate chinese story05_5_1_d1144f2a:

    # mc "So have we."
    mc "我们也杀过。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5502
translate chinese story05_5_1_e1408c4a:

    # Mi "…"
    Mi "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5503
translate chinese story05_5_1_23f00e73:

    # mc "None of us are clean."
    mc "我们谁都不干净。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5504
translate chinese story05_5_1_f8f0f586:

    # mc "(whispering) …but if I can shave off even the smallest fraction of the world’s cruelty-"
    mc "（低声）……可要是我能把这世界的残酷削掉哪怕一小块——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5507
translate chinese story05_5_1_cc596d60:

    # mc "—I sleep better at night."
    mc "——我晚上能睡得安稳点。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5508
translate chinese story05_5_1_691a4020:

    # mc "(Hypocritical? Absolutely.)"
    mc "（虚伪吗？绝对虚伪。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5510
translate chinese story05_5_1_23235671:

    # mc "Now move."
    mc "现在走。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5515
translate chinese story05_5_1_0de1b446:

    # k "Hey, shorty."
    k "喂，矮子。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5519
translate chinese story05_5_1_40463722:

    # h "What do you want?"
    h "你想干嘛？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5522
translate chinese story05_5_1_fed23057:

    # k "What’s [mc] deal? Why’s he so obsessed with protecting lives?"
    k "[mc] 怎么回事？干嘛这么执着于保命？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5526
translate chinese story05_5_1_6bd31eea:

    # k "I’ve never seen him kill anyone who wasn’t a mutant."
    k "我从没见他杀过不是变异体的人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5528
translate chinese story05_5_1_aeefabe6:

    # h "That’s…"
    h "这……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5529
translate chinese story05_5_1_ee334f34:

    # h "He had his reasons."
    h "他有他的原因。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5532
translate chinese story05_5_1_b8224b0d:

    # k "Oh yeah? Like what?"
    k "哦，是吗？什么原因？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5537
translate chinese story05_5_1_ef65fda1:

    # h "If he wants you to know, he’ll tell you."
    h "他要是想让你知道，会自己说。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5540
translate chinese story05_5_1_30e950eb:

    # k "Boring."
    k "无聊。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5547
translate chinese story05_5_1_77bc9118:

    # "Air contamination level: Critical."
    "空气污染等级：危险。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5549
translate chinese story05_5_1_44af95aa:

    # mc "Lora. {w=0.4}This Selvaria… who is she?"
    mc "洛拉。{w=0.4}这个塞尔瓦莉亚……她是谁？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5552
translate chinese story05_5_1_3208c91a:

    # L "The Empress of the Elves. Terror made flesh."
    L "精灵女皇。恐惧的化身。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5555
translate chinese story05_5_1_4353de35:

    # mc "An empress… right."
    mc "女皇……是啊。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5558
translate chinese story05_5_1_5a8ce5ce:

    # mc "What are her weaknesses?"
    mc "她的弱点是什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5561
translate chinese story05_5_1_b2373404:

    # L "Weaknesses… She doesn’t have any."
    L "弱点……她没有。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5562
translate chinese story05_5_1_d3692025:

    # L "We tried everything. Every plan, every angle—"
    L "我们什么都试过。每个计划，每个角度——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5563
translate chinese story05_5_1_c771f802:

    # L "I… I don’t know."
    L "我……我不知道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5568
translate chinese story05_5_1_d03b0681:

    # "A heavy silence drops over the group, thick as smoke."
    "一阵沉重的沉默落在队伍上，浓得像烟。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5571
translate chinese story05_5_1_84081136:

    # h "Yeah."
    h "是啊。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5572
translate chinese story05_5_1_7970f727:

    # h "Figures. We’re screwed."
    h "果然。我们完了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5575
translate chinese story05_5_1_d3c8bb73:

    # mc "(Everyone here’s packing implants, tricks, second chances…)"
    mc "（这儿每个人都有植入体、花招、第二次机会……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5576
translate chinese story05_5_1_b8f071ce:

    # mc "(But walking in blind? That’s just suicide with extra steps.)"
    mc "（可蒙着眼走进去？那只是多绕几步的自杀。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5579
translate chinese story05_5_1_95042f17_1:

    # mc "Lora. A word."
    mc "洛拉。说句话。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5582
translate chinese story05_5_1_b1bafb43:

    # "Air contamination level: Within acceptable limits."
    "空气污染等级：在可接受范围内。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5583
translate chinese story05_5_1_dbff8859:

    # L "Yeah, love?"
    L "嗯，亲爱的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5584
translate chinese story05_5_1_46fe0b1d:

    # mc "(whispering) How long till we reach her?"
    mc "（低声）还有多久到她那儿？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5587
translate chinese story05_5_1_ecca0918:

    # L "(Whispering) Half an hour. Give or take."
    L "（低声）半小时左右。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5598
translate chinese story05_5_1_31e24224:

    # mc "(whispering) I need you to do something."
    mc "（低声）我需要你做件事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5600
translate chinese story05_5_1_018700e6:

    # L "(That look again… The same one he had when he enlisted.)"
    L "（又是那个眼神……跟他当年入伍时一模一样。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5601
translate chinese story05_5_1_796a31c2:

    # L "(When he’d already decided, and nothing could stop him.)"
    L "（当他已经下定决心，什么都拦不住他。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5602
translate chinese story05_5_1_fd2fc9ff:

    # L "(Whispering) Please… No stupid heroics."
    L "（低声）求你……别逞英雄。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5604
translate chinese story05_5_1_c5b09c20:

    # mc "(whispering) Take the others."
    mc "（低声）带上其他人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5605
translate chinese story05_5_1_2035cf57:

    # mc "(whispering) Get out."
    mc "（低声）撤出去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5608
translate chinese story05_5_1_7cf36d2f:

    # L "(Whispering) What?!"
    L "（低声）什么？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:5609
translate chinese story05_5_1_98b95f05:

    # L "(Whispering) Have you lost your mind? No!"
    L "（低声）你疯了吗？不行！"

# game/Story04.rpy:5616
translate chinese story05_5_1_bc74d159:

    # mc "(whispering) They don’t have what you have, Lora. For them… death’s final."
    mc "（低声）她们没有你那份力量，洛拉。对她们来说……死了就是死了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5619
translate chinese story05_5_1_9e63dd9a:

    # mc "(whispering) My clock says you still have time to run."
    mc "（低声）我的表说，你们还有时间跑。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5621
translate chinese story05_5_1_e906568a:

    # L "(Whispering) …And you?"
    L "（低声）……那你呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5623
translate chinese story05_5_1_ece63c8d:

    # mc "…"
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5626
translate chinese story05_5_1_82195e0e:

    # mc "…I’ll try to talk to her."
    mc "……我去试试跟她谈。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5629
translate chinese story05_5_1_51558e40:

    # L "(Whispering) No. Please… I—"
    L "（低声）不。求你……我——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5630
translate chinese story05_5_1_9f77d6c4:

    # L "Watching you die… over and over…"
    L "看着你死去……一次又一次……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5631
translate chinese story05_5_1_f82011e9:

    # L "Do you know what that does to me?"
    L "你知道那对我意味着什么吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5634
translate chinese story05_5_1_7df297d4:

    # L "Norman dying every time—"
    L "诺曼每一次都死——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5635
translate chinese story05_5_1_4354e37c:

    # L "I blamed myself. Every single time."
    L "我都怪自己。每一次都怪自己。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5636
translate chinese story05_5_1_f22e501d:

    # L "And you…"
    L "还有你……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5637
translate chinese story05_5_1_d3c13a03:

    # L "Losing you tore me apart."
    L "失去你，把我撕碎了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5639
translate chinese story05_5_1_df52e483:

    # mc "(whispering) Selfish bastard, huh."
    mc "（低声）自私的混蛋，是吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5642
translate chinese story05_5_1_f16faaad:

    # k "(All that whispering. Standing way too close.)"
    k "（一直嘀嘀咕咕。站得还那么近。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5643
translate chinese story05_5_1_05353b4e:

    # k "(God, it’s annoying.)"
    k "（天哪，真烦。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5645
translate chinese story05_5_1_aff9196f:

    # k "Hey. Lovebirds."
    k "喂。小情侣。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5646
translate chinese story05_5_1_b04484d7:

    # k "Especially you, one-eye."
    k "尤其是你，眼罩姐。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5647
translate chinese story05_5_1_7080503e:

    # k "What’s the plan with the elf queen?"
    k "精灵女皇那边什么计划？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5649
translate chinese story05_5_1_efcb9534:

    # L "(Does she just hate me…?)"
    L "（她就这么恨我吗……？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5652
translate chinese story05_5_1_06556e70:

    # L "I… I don’t know. Without Astoria, we—"
    L "我……我不知道。没有阿斯托里亚，我们——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5655
translate chinese story05_5_1_a33b63f8:

    # L "(Focus. Stop drifting. Mission first.)"
    L "（专注。别走神。任务优先。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5656
translate chinese story05_5_1_9cdc11a6:

    # L "She’s a Higher Being."
    L "她是更高存在。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5657
translate chinese story05_5_1_8ce32ee8:

    # L "We can’t kill her. No matter what we try."
    L "我们杀不了她。不管怎么试。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5658
translate chinese story05_5_1_2876efd9:

    # mc "Why?"
    mc "为什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5661
translate chinese story05_5_1_076367fd:

    # Mi "Every higher being carries some kind of safeguard."
    Mi "每个更高存在都有某种保护机制。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5662
translate chinese story05_5_1_8162eea4:

    # Mi "Mortals can’t really hurt them."
    Mi "凡人根本伤不了他们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5666
translate chinese story05_5_1_962b81d1:

    # k "So we just need a bigger gun. Easy."
    k "那我们就需要一把更大的枪。简单。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5668
translate chinese story05_5_1_76f558a8:

    # mc "Kalestra?"
    mc "卡莱斯特拉？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5670
translate chinese story05_5_1_2b744d18:

    # k "Nah. I’m useless here."
    k "不。这方面我没用。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5671
translate chinese story05_5_1_c0930694:

    # k "But if you want, I can give you a hundred and one reasons why higher beings are a pain in the ass."
    k "不过你要愿意，我能给你一百零一条理由，说明更高存在有多他妈烦人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5673
translate chinese story05_5_1_0c802973:

    # mc "(Flora mentioned something like this before… but somehow they managed to kill one of those Higher Beings.)"
    mc "（弗洛拉之前提过类似的事……可他们不知怎么还是杀掉了一个更高存在。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5674
translate chinese story05_5_1_89744d57:

    # mc "(How?)"
    mc "（怎么做到的？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5676
translate chinese story05_5_1_f25e511b:

    # mc "Options?"
    mc "有什么选项？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5678
translate chinese story05_5_1_7329681e:

    # E "..."
    E "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5682
translate chinese story05_5_1_feb99f02:

    # mc "Nothing? Not even one?"
    mc "没有？一个都没有？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5683
translate chinese story05_5_1_57928051:

    # mc "What about all those resets of yours?"
    mc "你那些重置呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5685
translate chinese story05_5_1_37a92146:

    # L "In none of them did we kill her. Not once."
    L "没有一次我们杀掉她。一次都没有。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5686
translate chinese story05_5_1_14a5e90f:

    # L "I thought… maybe if killing her wasn’t possible, we could negotiate—"
    L "我想……要是杀不了她，也许可以谈判——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5690
translate chinese story05_5_1_3e1cb553:

    # k "That’s called betrayal, sweetheart."
    k "那叫背叛，甜心。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5691
translate chinese story05_5_1_9d23d93b:

    # k "And traitors don’t get forgiven."
    k "而叛徒是不会被原谅的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5692
translate chinese story05_5_1_26b5a47d:

    # L "(If betrayal saves my husband’s life… Then so be it.)"
    L "（要是背叛能救我丈夫的命……那就背叛吧。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5695
translate chinese story05_5_1_35a26c1c:

    # L "Not betrayal. Strategy."
    L "不是背叛。是策略。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5696
translate chinese story05_5_1_9d591b3b:

    # k "That pointy-eared monster wiped out half a planet."
    k "那个尖耳朵的怪物灭掉了半颗星球。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5697
translate chinese story05_5_1_215832ea:

    # L "And she’ll wipe us out too if we don’t try something."
    L "我们要是不想办法，她也会把我们灭掉。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5701
translate chinese story05_5_1_ca4dcf31:

    # k "(God, she’s irritating.)"
    k "（天哪，她真烦。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5702
translate chinese story05_5_1_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5703
translate chinese story05_5_1_3e906381:

    # L "What? You gonna kill me for saying it?"
    L "怎么？就因为我这么说，你要杀我？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5704
translate chinese story05_5_1_3f0f39cb:

    # k "You doubting I would?"
    k "你怀疑我不会？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5716
translate chinese story05_5_1_288cd843:

    # mc "Kalestra."
    mc "卡莱斯特拉。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5717
translate chinese story05_5_1_d6c1859d:

    # mc "Sword down."
    mc "把剑放下。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5719
translate chinese story05_5_1_9fcaabaf:

    # k "How long are you gonna keep excusing her crap?!"
    k "你还要替她那套烂事开脱多久？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:5721
translate chinese story05_5_1_c4bfcbc9:

    # mc "Any outcome where we’re still alive… is a good one."
    mc "只要结果是我们还活着……就是好结果。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5726
translate chinese story05_5_1_a43fd612:

    # mc "(If she couldn’t do it… what makes me think I can?)"
    mc "（她做不到……我凭什么以为我能？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5727
translate chinese story05_5_1_d3e1467d:

    # mc "Yeah. It’s stupid."
    mc "是啊。这很蠢。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5729
translate chinese story05_5_1_703bfd85:

    # mc "But I get why she tried."
    mc "可我理解她为什么试。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5730
translate chinese story05_5_1_4cb25773:

    # mc "(We don’t owe these people anything. And still… here we are.)"
    mc "（我们不欠这些人什么。可……我们还是在这儿。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5733
translate chinese story05_5_1_9507136c:

    # k "I’m not siding with that pointy-eared freak."
    k "我不会站那个尖耳朵怪物那边。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5735
translate chinese story05_5_1_0de9c241:

    # mc "You won’t have to."
    mc "你不用站。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5739
translate chinese story05_5_1_c014f7c0:

    # h "That grin... You’ve got something, don’t you?"
    h "那个笑……你有主意了，对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5742
translate chinese story05_5_1_f73b9618:

    # mc "We came here to stop the Gates from opening."
    mc "我们来这儿是为了阻止门打开。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5743
translate chinese story05_5_1_c27888fd:

    # mc "We don’t need to kill her."
    mc "我们不需要杀她。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5744
translate chinese story05_5_1_1d0c4c6b:

    # mc "Selvaria’s just the symptom. The Gates are the disease."
    mc "塞尔瓦莉亚只是症状。门才是病。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5747
translate chinese story05_5_1_b999e60d:

    # mc "Everyone remembers what happens if they stay open."
    mc "大家都记得门一直开着会怎样。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5748
translate chinese story05_5_1_f22c426d:

    # mc "Everything alive dies."
    mc "所有活的东西都会死。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5749
translate chinese story05_5_1_043186df:

    # mc "(I didn’t come here for anyone’s ideals. I came to survive.)"
    mc "（我不是为谁的理想来的。我是为了活下去。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5750
translate chinese story05_5_1_dea6267c:

    # mc "(And protect what matters to me.)"
    mc "（还有护住对我来说重要的东西。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5751
translate chinese story05_5_1_3626803b:

    # h "(That look of his… Damn. It actually gives hope.)"
    h "（他那个眼神……妈的。居然真让人有希望。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5754
translate chinese story05_5_1_b8cdaa4a:

    # h "…There’s something to that."
    h "……这话有点道理。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5756
translate chinese story05_5_1_bcae72f7:

    # Mi "We’re talking about an ancient mechanism here."
    Mi "我们说的是一个远古装置。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5757
translate chinese story05_5_1_42fef246:

    # Mi "How exactly do you plan to shut all that down?"
    Mi "你究竟打算怎么把它关掉？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5759
translate chinese story05_5_1_c5c637cc:

    # mc "You got a better idea?"
    mc "你有更好的主意？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5762
translate chinese story05_5_1_934b0853:

    # Mi "…no."
    Mi "……没有。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5764
translate chinese story05_5_1_2a24def7:

    # mc "We won’t stop Selvaria by killing her. We’ll just die trying."
    mc "杀塞尔瓦莉亚阻止不了她。我们只会白死。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5765
translate chinese story05_5_1_3ccfbc5f:

    # k "So what’s your genius plan?"
    k "那你那天才计划是什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5767
translate chinese story05_5_1_f2d8a4eb:

    # L "May I?"
    L "我能说吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5768
translate chinese story05_5_1_cf1adef2:

    # mc "Yeah."
    mc "说吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5771
translate chinese story05_5_1_62c9476f:

    # L "Then we use the fallback."
    L "那就用备用方案。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5772
translate chinese story05_5_1_58de5b05:

    # L "The Gates use a cooling system."
    L "门有冷却系统。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5773
translate chinese story05_5_1_6c6ea0c1:

    # L "If we block it… in theory, it should force an emergency shutdown."
    L "要是堵住它……理论上，能迫使紧急停机。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5775
translate chinese story05_5_1_47b11890:

    # Mi "“In theory”?"
    Mi "“理论上”？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5776
translate chinese story05_5_1_4979b433:

    # Mi "So, no guarantees?"
    Mi "所以，没保障？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5777
translate chinese story05_5_1_9993b94e:

    # L "..."
    L "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5778
translate chinese story05_5_1_b86c4f82:

    # mc "(Hands shaking. Breathing uneven.)"
    mc "（手在抖。呼吸不匀。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5779
translate chinese story05_5_1_be19d10c:

    # mc "(Yeah… now I see why she considered siding with Selvaria.)"
    mc "（是啊……现在我明白她为什么考虑倒向塞尔瓦莉亚了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5782
translate chinese story05_5_1_9e8bef14:

    # k "(That damn understanding look.)"
    k "（又是那副该死的理解表情。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5783
translate chinese story05_5_1_82ee465c:

    # k "(After all her mistakes… why does he still look at her like that?)"
    k "（她犯了那么多错……他怎么还那样看她？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5786
translate chinese story05_5_1_e26443a8:

    # k "You know, she’s really starting to piss me off."
    k "你知道吗，她开始真让我烦了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5787
translate chinese story05_5_1_78486174:

    # h "Huh?"
    h "啊？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5788
translate chinese story05_5_1_ccfeb021:

    # k "You’re the scientist. And you don’t know squat?"
    k "你是科学家。结果什么都不知道？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5789
translate chinese story05_5_1_5e71a4bb:

    # k "Funny."
    k "可笑。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5790
translate chinese story05_5_1_cd5814d5:

    # k "Feels like you’re holding something back."
    k "感觉你在藏什么。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5792
translate chinese story05_5_1_0297642d:

    # mc "Lora?"
    mc "洛拉？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5793
translate chinese story05_5_1_37019371:

    # L "I really don’t know… Yes, I worked with the Gates. That’s true."
    L "我真的不知道……是，我跟门打过交道。那是真的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5794
translate chinese story05_5_1_a07d9ad7:

    # L "But I only opened them. Closing them? All I have are theories dug out of tombs."
    L "可我只负责打开它们。关掉？我只有从墓里挖出来的理论。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5797
translate chinese story05_5_1_5e6f3792:

    # h "So we’re screwed. Correct?"
    h "所以我们完了。对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5799
translate chinese story05_5_1_1d0ffab1:

    # mc "(Chase a slim chance… or walk straight into the beast’s den and try to talk?)"
    mc "（追一线微小的机会……还是直接走进野兽窝里试着谈？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5800
translate chinese story05_5_1_c4920c72:

    # mc "(whispering) Get them out of here."
    mc "（低声）带她们离开这儿。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5802
translate chinese story05_5_1_caffb20b:

    # mc "Miriel. Olivia. And… Kalestra."
    mc "米莉尔。奥利维亚。还有……卡莱斯特拉。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5803
translate chinese story05_5_1_4376cc92:

    # mc "Stick with Lora. Try to shut the Gates down through cooling."
    mc "跟着洛拉。试着通过冷却系统把门关掉。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5805
translate chinese story05_5_1_c72dd2ac:

    # Mi "Understood."
    Mi "明白。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5807
translate chinese story05_5_1_97f5d0c6:

    # h "Wait. What about you?"
    h "等等。那你呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5808
translate chinese story05_5_1_2b35b6fe_4:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5810
translate chinese story05_5_1_45e827fb:

    # "Threat Level: Moderate. Seven o’clock remaining."
    "威胁等级：中等。七点钟方向，剩余。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5816
translate chinese story05_5_1_8eaf82cb:

    # h "No…"
    h "不……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5817
translate chinese story05_5_1_b1c0183b:

    # h "You’re not actually—"
    h "你不会真打算——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5821
translate chinese story05_5_1_c6f8070d:

    # mc "(Principles… or the people I love?)"
    mc "（原则……还是我爱的人？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5842
translate chinese story05_5_1_79cf9ef2:

    # mc "(Sorry. You didn’t leave me a choice.)"
    mc "（抱歉。你没给我留选择。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5844
translate chinese story05_5_1_ca8c2ca8:

    # h "Holy—"
    h "我的——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5846
translate chinese story05_5_1_3de1631f:

    # mc "Do everything you can. I’ll do the same."
    mc "尽你们所能。我也会。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5853
translate chinese story05_5_1_5e7f65d4:

    # L "Take care of yourself."
    L "照顾好自己。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5858
translate chinese story05_5_1_3d359bef:

    # mc "Why aren’t you with them?"
    mc "你怎么不跟她们一起？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5860
translate chinese story05_5_1_ce0edbf7:

    # k "Didn’t like your order."
    k "不喜欢你的命令。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5862
translate chinese story05_5_1_5aed49b9:

    # mc "What about your precious reputation?"
    mc "你那宝贝名声呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5864
translate chinese story05_5_1_feac6f24:

    # k "Yeah. Well."
    k "是啊。嗯。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5865
translate chinese story05_5_1_e7294983:

    # k "Reputation doesn’t cover crap like this."
    k "名声可管不了这种事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5867
translate chinese story05_5_1_8401eb56:

    # k "Besides..."
    k "再说……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5868
translate chinese story05_5_1_b9abe000:

    # k "dying with you sounds way more fun."
    k "跟你一起死听着有意思多了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5880
translate chinese story05_5_2_11dac42a:

    # "High above the gate."
    "大门上方高处。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5881
translate chinese story05_5_2_e0de6657:

    # mc "Move. We’re short on time."
    mc "走。时间不多了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5882
translate chinese story05_5_2_7f9e98e6:

    # k "Yeah, yeah. Running."
    k "行，行。跑着呢。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5885
translate chinese story05_5_2_670091f4:

    # k "Hey, old man. You sure about this?"
    k "喂，老头。你确定？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5886
translate chinese story05_5_2_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:5889
translate chinese story05_5_2_d1f9104c:

    # k "Drop the doubt."
    k "别犹豫了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5890
translate chinese story05_5_2_1456085c:

    # k "Even the dumbest plans sometimes blow up into victories."
    k "再蠢的计划，有时候也能炸出一场胜利。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5893
translate chinese story05_5_2_3e0d9ba2:

    # mc "And that was?"
    mc "那是什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5894
translate chinese story05_5_2_40a7fa33:

    # k "Advice."
    k "建议。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5895
translate chinese story05_5_2_65869dd9:

    # mc "Sounds more like incompetence."
    mc "听着更像无能。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5897
translate chinese story05_5_2_9db7d3a0:

    # k "Choosing the better of two terrible ideas doesn’t make it good."
    k "在两个烂主意里挑个好的，不代表它就是好主意。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5898
translate chinese story05_5_2_593797f7:

    # k "Now wipe the tears and run."
    k "现在擦干眼泪，跑。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5901
translate chinese story05_5_2_20b30f8b:

    # mc "Time?"
    mc "时间？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5902
translate chinese story05_5_2_cd266054:

    # k "Thirty minutes."
    k "三十分钟。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5905
translate chinese story05_5_2_55da8bb9:

    # mc "Good. Time to buy them some."
    mc "好。该给他们争取点时间了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5912
translate chinese story05_5_2_9ba96f59:

    # mc "(One.)"
    mc "（一。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5917
translate chinese story05_5_2_2e63f1c5:

    # g "What the—"
    g "搞什么——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5918
translate chinese story05_5_2_aed19e69:

    # mc "(Two.)"
    mc "（二。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5921
translate chinese story05_5_2_be2d84d8:

    # g "Who the hell are you supposed to be?"
    g "你他妈是谁？"

# game/Story04.rpy:5922
translate chinese story05_5_2_8ee22d63:

    # mc "(Three.)"
    mc "（三。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5933
translate chinese story05_5_2_e32ab100:

    # "Analysis complete. Displaying optimal elimination method."
    "分析完成。显示最优清除方案。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5934
translate chinese story05_5_2_a3156cc4:

    # mc "(Was that really the only way?)"
    mc "（那真是唯一的办法吗？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5937
translate chinese story05_5_2_25505aa2:

    # mc "(whispering) Or just the easiest?"
    mc "（低声）还是只是最省事的？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5942
translate chinese story05_5_2_5e57bdbb:

    # mc "(whispering) Shut it down. No hesitation."
    mc "（低声）关掉它。别犹豫。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5945
translate chinese story05_5_2_f841b848:

    # "Three hostiles. Eight o’clock. Life threat: high."
    "三个敌对目标。八点钟方向。生命威胁：高。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5953
translate chinese story05_5_2_35d0f937:

    # mc "(They’re just like me.)"
    mc "（他们跟我一样。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5955
translate chinese story05_5_2_0681cc33:

    # mc "(With their own fears… their own lives.)"
    mc "（有自己的恐惧……自己的命。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5960
translate chinese story05_5_2_a5997ee3:

    # mc "(Maybe there’s still a way to—)"
    mc "（也许还有办法——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5961
translate chinese story05_5_2_7e406cf2:

    # mc "We can still—"
    mc "我们还能——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5965
translate chinese story05_5_2_d26ff275:

    # mc "—Argh!"
    mc "——啊！"

# game/Story04.rpy:5967
translate chinese story05_5_2_01912756:

    # "External injuries detected—"
    "检测到外伤——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5968
translate chinese story05_5_2_9f23c748:

    # mc "I KNOW!"
    mc "我知道！"

# game/Story04.rpy:5970
translate chinese story05_5_2_0a90c812:

    # mc "(No. Too late now.)"
    mc "（不。现在太晚了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5974
translate chinese story05_5_2_766ff4b7:

    # mc "…Hold it together."
    mc "……稳住。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5975
translate chinese story05_5_2_18f62b94:

    # mc "(No going back. Either I—)"
    mc "（回不了头了。要么我——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5978
translate chinese story05_5_2_c16c08da:

    # mc "(whispering) or they kill me."
    mc "（低声）要么他们杀了我。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5985
translate chinese story05_5_2_51c2bb95:

    # a "(Willy… Mecca… how—)"
    a "（威利……麦加……怎么会——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:5986
translate chinese story05_5_2_4602a55c:

    # a "Your Majesty, why aren’t we stopping him?!"
    a "陛下，我们为什么不去拦他？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:5988
translate chinese story05_5_2_df45cfdd:

    # a "He’s slaughtering our people down there!"
    a "他在下面屠杀我们的人！"

# game/Story04.rpy:5990
translate chinese story05_5_2_f69eafa9:

    # sel "And in doing so… he saves us the trouble."
    sel "而这样一来……他省了我们的麻烦。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5992
translate chinese story05_5_2_bd86a068:

    # a "But their lives—"
    a "可他们的命——"

# game/Story04.rpy:5994
translate chinese story05_5_2_dd32c377:

    # sel "Necessary losses."
    sel "必要的损失。"

# game/Story04.rpy:5998
translate chinese story05_5_2_fa15ac4f:

    # sel "You object?"
    sel "你有意见？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6000
translate chinese story05_5_2_3e29a907:

    # a "No, Your Majesty."
    a "没有，陛下。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6001
translate chinese story05_5_2_77ce8f29:

    # sel "(Your eyes say otherwise.)"
    sel "（你眼睛可不是这么说的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6008
translate chinese story05_5_2_c83ecd0e:

    # sel "He’s at his limit."
    sel "他到极限了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6013
translate chinese story05_5_2_ff5ab9ce:

    # a "My lady… allow me to kill him myself!"
    a "夫人……让我亲手杀了他！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6015
translate chinese story05_5_2_c77e243c:

    # sel "Go."
    sel "去吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6027
translate chinese story05_5_2_ce6be3d0:

    # mc "(Hold on… hold on…)"
    mc "（撑住……撑住……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6028
translate chinese story05_5_2_52ec7f21:

    # mc "(Don’t black out. Not now.)"
    mc "（别昏过去。别是现在。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6031
translate chinese story05_5_2_2e0c8992:

    # mc "…Fight. Keep fighting!"
    mc "……打。继续打！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6034
translate chinese story05_5_2_1e413492:

    # mc "(I just need to buy them time.)"
    mc "（我只需要给他们争取时间。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6048
translate chinese story05_5_2_45e369e6:

    # mc "(Even if it costs me everything.)"
    mc "（哪怕代价是我的一切。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6053
translate chinese story05_5_2_60c0c064:

    # "Fatal threat level. Three o’clock remaining."
    "致命威胁等级。三点钟方向，剩余。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6054
translate chinese story05_5_2_9f6cbd81:

    # mc "(Where the hell did that—)"
    mc "（这东西他妈从哪儿——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6057
translate chinese story05_5_2_e93c8869:

    # "Analysis complete. Elimination impossible."
    "分析完成。无法清除。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6059
translate chinese story05_5_2_477afc8f:

    # a "You’ll pay for my brothers!"
    a "你要为我兄弟们偿命！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6060
translate chinese story05_5_2_551ec342:

    # mc "(Move, move MOVE!)"
    mc "（动，动，动起来！）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6075
translate chinese story05_5_2_4ad05351:

    # k "How’s that saying go?"
    k "那句话怎么说来着？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6076
translate chinese story05_5_2_ddc865bc:

    # k "The hero shows up at the last second, right?"
    k "英雄总在最后一秒登场，对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6078
translate chinese story05_5_2_787bb59c:

    # mc "Where the hell have you been?!"
    mc "你他妈去哪儿了？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6084
translate chinese story05_5_2_0f56cb2c:

    # k "Enjoying your new combat mode."
    k "在欣赏你那新的战斗模式。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6085
translate chinese story05_5_2_ea49394b:

    # k "While eliminating potential problems."
    k "顺便清掉潜在麻烦。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6088
translate chinese story05_5_2_2747d051:

    # k "(whispering) Eyes forward. Blondie’s our real target. And right now… she’s watching you."
    k "（低声）眼睛往前看。那个金发妞才是我们真正的目标。而现在……她在看着你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6089
translate chinese story05_5_2_84805fc1:

    # mc "(whispering) We holding up or—"
    mc "（低声）我们顶得住还是——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6091
translate chinese story05_5_2_9357428d:

    # k "(whispering) …Told you so."
    k "（低声）……早跟你说了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6092
translate chinese story05_5_2_fe5be12c:

    # mc "Yeah, yeah."
    mc "行，行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6093
translate chinese story05_5_2_bd89b391:

    # mc "Don’t rely on implants."
    mc "别依赖植入体。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6099
translate chinese story05_5_2_82fbdc82:

    # k "Hey! We were talking here—!"
    k "喂！我们这儿正说着话——！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6112
translate chinese story05_5_2_b506f3a4:

    # k "You handle the small fry."
    k "小喽啰归你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6119
translate chinese story05_5_2_37c5d6ec:

    # k "I’ll deal with the bigger fish."
    k "大鱼我来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6124
translate chinese story05_5_2_3c5058e3:

    # k "(Trusting this old man with my back?)"
    k "（把这老头当后背托付？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6125
translate chinese story05_5_2_cce349bc:

    # k "(Yeah. I’m shocked too.)"
    k "（是啊。我自己都惊了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6128
translate chinese story05_5_2_62d14247:

    # k "Hey, elf ears! Let’s talk!"
    k "喂，精灵耳朵！聊聊！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6129
translate chinese story05_5_2_6fa5e42b:

    # k "(And that idiot… Somehow got under my skin more than I expected.)"
    k "（而那个蠢货……居然比我预想的更扎进我心里了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6137
translate chinese story05_5_2_a7a0e2f7:

    # k "Come on, stop running and let me kill you already!"
    k "来啊，别跑了，让我赶紧杀了你！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6139
translate chinese story05_5_2_d57e4051:

    # a "I only want him. Not you."
    a "我只要他。不要你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6140
translate chinese story05_5_2_05728c52:

    # k "Oh yeah?"
    k "哦，是吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6141
translate chinese story05_5_2_80d6d837:

    # k "Too bad. I kinda like the guy. So no."
    k "可惜。我还挺喜欢这家伙的。所以不行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6145
translate chinese story05_5_2_07bdadd6:

    # a "Your Majesty?! That was my prey!"
    a "陛下？！那是我的猎物！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6147
translate chinese story05_5_2_86c6a060:

    # k "The—?"
    k "那——？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6152
translate chinese story05_5_2_d6a00495:

    # k "(You sneaky little—)"
    k "（你这阴险的小——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6155
translate chinese story05_5_2_774fc804:

    # a "Oops. Missed."
    a "哎呀。没打中。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6156
translate chinese story05_5_2_a1e1ff21:

    # a "Falling for tricks like that… Guess the rumors about inquisitions were fake?"
    a "这么容易就中计……看来关于审判庭的传闻都是假的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6159
translate chinese story05_5_2_3e51a270:

    # k "What… did you just say?"
    k "你……刚说什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6160
translate chinese story05_5_2_79bef5dc:

    # a "(Wh-)"
    a "（什——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6162
translate chinese story05_5_2_35da6a5b:

    # k "Don’t you dare—"
    k "你敢——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6164
translate chinese story05_5_2_1b613e65:

    # k "Look—"
    k "看——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6167
translate chinese story05_5_2_0149cef5:

    # k "Down on me."
    k "低头看我。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6170
translate chinese story05_5_2_4dde6fff:

    # k "(No. Hold it.)"
    k "（不。忍住。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6171
translate chinese story05_5_2_fab5dc0f:

    # k "(Kill her too fast, and this gets ugly.)"
    k "（杀她太快，事情就难看了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6173
translate chinese story05_5_2_d76d9202:

    # k "Yo, elfie, you still—"
    k "哟，精灵妞，你还——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6179
translate chinese story05_5_2_708462b3:

    # k "Clever bastard!"
    k "狡猾的混蛋！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6181
translate chinese story05_5_2_ec3abdff:

    # a "All you humans are the same!"
    a "你们人类全都一样！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6182
translate chinese story05_5_2_648c5a34:

    # a "Always thinking you’re above us!"
    a "总以为自己高我们一等！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6185
translate chinese story05_5_2_e16ec40f:

    # k "At least nobody ever called us—"
    k "至少没人叫过我们——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6187
translate chinese story05_5_2_a947b6e7:

    # k "M-O-G-Y-R. \n(S-L-A-V-E-S.)"
    k "M-O-G-Y-R。\n（奴——隶。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6190
translate chinese story05_5_2_8ccf0b78:

    # a "Dagnin gin si! \n(I’LL KILL YOU!)"
    a "Dagnin gin si! \n（我要杀了你！）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6195
translate chinese story05_5_2_07a6d3b4:

    # k "(Time. Stall for time.)"
    k "（时间。拖时间。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6196
translate chinese story05_5_2_91a6f7eb:

    # k "(That old idiot will think of something.)"
    k "（那老蠢货会想出办法的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6198
translate chinese story05_5_2_5d9f6fde:

    # k "(Shoulder… damn.)"
    k "（肩膀……妈的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6199
translate chinese story05_5_2_cb7e2f51:

    # k "(Wait… gunfire stopped. Did he die?)"
    k "（等等……枪声停了。他死了吗？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6204
translate chinese story05_5_2_a27df342:

    # sel "Impressive."
    sel "厉害。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6208
translate chinese story05_5_2_ebba0753:

    # mc "(One word… and my whole body locks up.)"
    mc "（就一个字……我全身都僵住了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6209
translate chinese story05_5_2_986b5606:

    # mc "(No. Focus. Time.)"
    mc "（不。专注。时间。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6210
translate chinese story05_5_2_8918b7c4:

    # mc "Selvaria. That’s you… right?"
    mc "塞尔瓦莉亚。是你……对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6212
translate chinese story05_5_2_b6554ca2:

    # sel "Hm."
    sel "嗯。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6214
translate chinese story05_5_2_0d09b9b4:

    # sel "And you… Astoria’s little boy?"
    sel "那你……阿斯托里亚的小男孩？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6216
translate chinese story05_5_2_8295afc3:

    # mc "(She knows me?)"
    mc "（她认识我？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6217
translate chinese story05_5_2_82396492:

    # mc "(Wait, how would the elven empress know anything about me?)"
    mc "（等等，精灵女皇怎么会知道我什么？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6218
translate chinese story05_5_2_d51242c5:

    # mc "What do you mean, ‘that boy’?"
    mc "你说“那个男孩”是什么意思？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6220
translate chinese story05_5_2_1952d4f5:

    # sel "Astoria never told you?"
    sel "阿斯托里亚从没告诉过你？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6221
translate chinese story05_5_2_ff14af29:

    # mc "(More secrets. Fantastic. Maybe this time they'll work in my favor.)"
    mc "（又是秘密。好极了。也许这次它们能帮上我。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6223
translate chinese story05_5_2_4423e6b0:

    # sel "I see. So you truly don’t know."
    sel "明白了。所以你真不知道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6224
translate chinese story05_5_2_94c2137a:

    # sel "Tell me, [mc]."
    sel "告诉我，[mc]。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6225
translate chinese story05_5_2_dc9bfd66:

    # sel "Do you like riddles?"
    sel "你喜欢猜谜吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6227
translate chinese story05_5_2_f1e8c2a9:

    # mc "(Riddles? Now?)"
    mc "（猜谜？现在？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6228
translate chinese story05_5_2_2876efd9:

    # mc "Why?"
    mc "为什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6229
translate chinese story05_5_2_d7b42565:

    # sel "..."
    sel "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6234
translate chinese story05_5_2_f878f874:

    # sel "I enjoy digging through other people’s minds."
    sel "我喜欢翻别人的脑子。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6237
translate chinese story05_5_2_3e8da146:

    # aa "(whispering) Losto. Daro i gwaith. Dâd cennannen vi i thâl nedh. \n(They’re stalling. Two individuals spotted on lower floors.)"
    aa "（低声）Losto. Daro i gwaith. Dâd cennannen vi i thâl nedh。\n（他们在拖时间。下层发现两个人。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6239
translate chinese story05_5_2_fe7635ff:

    # sel "Nêl. \n(Three.)"
    sel "Nêl。\n（三个。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6241
translate chinese story05_5_2_a10ba100:

    # aa "(whispering) Man i orch? \n(Orders?)"
    aa "（低声）Man i orch？\n（命令？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6242
translate chinese story05_5_2_9adb8044:

    # sel "Tegil hen. Hên hen nín. \n(Handle them. This one is mine.)"
    sel "Tegil hen. Hên hen nín。\n（处理他们。这个归我。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6243
translate chinese story05_5_2_47d7b9d9:

    # aa "Nae, Aran nín. \n(Yes, Your Majesty.)"
    aa "Nae, Aran nín。\n（是，陛下。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6246
translate chinese story05_5_2_33fefc38:

    # mc "No one leaves here!"
    mc "谁也不许离开！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6249
translate chinese story05_5_2_780536ee:

    # k "(Bad feeling.)"
    k "（不祥的预感。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6250
translate chinese story05_5_2_858f96ea:

    # k "(She’s way too calm. Too empty. Gives me chills—)"
    k "（她太冷静了。太空了。让我发毛——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6256
translate chinese story05_5_2_7d64f8ba:

    # k "You’re getting on my nerves…"
    k "你开始让我烦了……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6257
translate chinese story05_5_2_2067f507:

    # a "I’m your opponent!"
    a "你的对手是我！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6259
translate chinese story05_5_2_22fd097d:

    # k "(Empress? Yeah, right.)"
    k "（女皇？得了吧。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6260
translate chinese story05_5_2_f81e8c28:

    # k "(That thing feels like a monster wearing a crown.)"
    k "（那东西感觉像戴着王冠的怪物。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6261
translate chinese story05_5_2_537ac9e9:

    # k "(…Not that I mind monsters.)"
    k "（……我倒不介意怪物。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6264
translate chinese story05_5_2_444ef8b1:

    # k "(But if we don’t do something—)"
    k "（可我们要是不想办法——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6270
translate chinese story05_5_2_49292bdf:

    # a "(How?! Why is she this strong?! Why can’t I hurt her?!)"
    a "（怎么可能？！她为什么这么强？！我为什么伤不了她？！）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6276
translate chinese story05_5_2_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6280
translate chinese story05_5_2_0133ca87:

    # k "(Wait.)"
    k "（等等。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6281
translate chinese story05_5_2_1307d472:

    # k "(Am I… scared?)"
    k "（我……怕了？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6285
translate chinese story05_5_2_28b3b981:

    # sel "Boy. I have a proposal for you."
    sel "小子。我有个提议。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6286
translate chinese story05_5_2_5e45190f:

    # sel "Agree… and I will leave this planet."
    sel "答应……我就离开这颗星球。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6287
translate chinese story05_5_2_0e488cac:

    # mc "And if I refuse?"
    mc "要是我拒绝呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6292
translate chinese story05_5_2_313a9188:

    # sel "Death."
    sel "死。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6298
translate chinese story05_5_2_d7905826:

    # "Error! Error! Err—"
    "错误！错误！错——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6301
translate chinese story05_5_2_b9f9d0a2:

    # mc "(How is she—)"
    mc "（她怎么会——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6304
translate chinese story05_5_2_76e08b0b:

    # mc "(My head’s going to explode…)"
    mc "（我脑袋要炸了……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6305
translate chinese story05_5_2_8481df96:

    # sel "Join me."
    sel "加入我。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6309
translate chinese story05_5_2_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6310
translate chinese story05_5_2_99be54dd:

    # mc "…What?"
    mc "……什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6313
translate chinese story05_5_2_7f047a1b:

    # aa "Aran nín, man i orch? \n(Your Majesty, what about the plan?!)"
    aa "Aran nín, man i orch？\n（陛下，那计划怎么办？！）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6316
translate chinese story05_5_2_a9468acf:

    # sel "What do you say? One life… in exchange for an entire planet."
    sel "怎么样？一条命……换一整颗星球。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6318
translate chinese story05_5_2_aeced65c:

    # mc "(My life… for the planet?)"
    mc "（我的命……换这颗星球？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6319
translate chinese story05_5_2_6f8368c7:

    # mc "(If they live, then fine. I’ll pay it. But—)"
    mc "（要是她们能活，那行。我付。可是——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6320
translate chinese story05_5_2_601ca2a7:

    # mc "What’s the catch?"
    mc "有什么条件？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6321
translate chinese story05_5_2_d7b42565_1:

    # sel "..."
    sel "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6324
translate chinese story05_5_2_1c1cba80:

    # a "Where do you think you’re going?!"
    a "你以为你要去哪儿？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6327
translate chinese story05_5_2_2efcc2cb:

    # k "Get off me!"
    k "放开我！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6331
translate chinese story05_5_2_25bcf8c4:

    # k "Hey, old man. Don’t forget what the one-eyed witch said."
    k "喂，老头。别忘了一眼罩女巫说的话。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6332
translate chinese story05_5_2_aa8d0b34:

    # k "They’ve got loose tongues. All they do is talk."
    k "她们嘴不严。就只会说。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6335
translate chinese story05_5_2_f3c298bd:

    # mc "(I know.)"
    mc "（我知道。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6336
translate chinese story05_5_2_90e5e928:

    # mc "(But the idea of saving all of you… even if it costs me…)"
    mc "（可一想到能救你们所有人……哪怕代价是我……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6337
translate chinese story05_5_2_b8e33414:

    # mc "(Even if it’s a lie… I want to believe it.)"
    mc "（就算是谎话……我也想信。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6340
translate chinese story05_5_2_959f8df8:

    # sel "What’s your answer?"
    sel "你的答复呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6344
translate chinese story05_5_2_358e7735:

    # sel "Betray the others, and they live."
    sel "背叛其他人，他们就能活。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6345
translate chinese story05_5_2_35ed2744:

    # sel "Or share their fate. Cross over together."
    sel "或者同他们共命运。一起过去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6346
translate chinese story05_5_2_c005ad15:

    # sel "Choose."
    sel "选。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6349
translate chinese story05_5_2_1704a47b:

    # mc "(This…)"
    mc "（这……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6351
translate chinese story05_5_2_cfb895e9:

    # mc "What guarantees do I have that if I betray them… you won’t touch them?"
    mc "我背叛他们之后……你不动他们，我有什么保障？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6353
translate chinese story05_5_2_93d3dbbb:

    # sel "Answer."
    sel "回答。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6355
translate chinese story05_5_2_6e071a8b:

    # mc "(Nothing this clean comes without a trap.)"
    mc "（这么干净的提议，不可能没陷阱。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6356
translate chinese story05_5_2_31eff69d:

    # mc "I—"
    mc "我——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6360
translate chinese story05_5_2_73d37299:

    # k "Enough of this bullshit, you decrepit hag!"
    k "别扯这些屁话了，你这老妖婆！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6361
translate chinese story05_5_2_5b0b01fb:

    # mc "Kali, don’t—"
    mc "卡莉，别——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6365
translate chinese story05_5_2_480561c4:

    # k "Die!"
    k "死！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6369
translate chinese story05_5_2_d7b42565_2:

    # sel "..."
    sel "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6370
translate chinese story05_5_2_4e6c6e0f:

    # k "What, without all your fancy magic toys, too scared?!"
    k "怎么，没了你那套花哨魔法玩具，就怕了？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6372
translate chinese story05_5_2_5711bfcf:

    # sel "Correction. Not magic. Technology."
    sel "纠正一下。不是魔法。是科技。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6374
translate chinese story05_5_2_ffcaffeb:

    # k "And that’s supposed to matter?"
    k "那有什么区别？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6375
translate chinese story05_5_2_28f7fde2:

    # k "Same slop, different bowl."
    k "一样的泔水，换个碗装罢了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6377
translate chinese story05_5_2_f13a90e9:

    # sel "Ignorant. Comparing crude “magic” to our technology—"
    sel "无知。拿粗陋的“魔法”跟我们科技比——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6379
translate chinese story05_5_2_72bb8c73:

    # mc "Go back!"
    mc "退回去！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6380
translate chinese story05_5_2_babf978c:

    # k "Oh? Did I hurt your—"
    k "哦？我是不是伤到你——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6395
translate chinese story05_5_2_f670d872:

    # mc "(N-no…)"
    mc "（不、不……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6399
translate chinese story05_5_2_8c22a192:

    # k "(whisper) Run…"
    k "（低声）跑……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6406
translate chinese story05_5_2_a8a99f13:

    # mc "-ah..."
    mc "——啊……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6409
translate chinese story05_5_2_70b720d5:

    # mc "(This can’t be how it ends.)"
    mc "（不能就这么结束。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6416
translate chinese story05_5_2_a611396a:

    # mc "(I’m not letting this end here.)"
    mc "（我不会让事就在这儿结束。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6423
translate chinese story05_5_2_7e406cf2_1:

    # mc "We can still—"
    mc "我们还能——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6426
translate chinese story05_5_2_2a2068a8:

    # mc "AAAAAAAH!"
    mc "啊啊啊啊！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6428
translate chinese story05_5_2_baf362d9:

    # mc "COME ON!"
    mc "来啊！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6431
translate chinese story05_5_2_d31d20d9:

    # mc "DIE!"
    mc "死！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6433
translate chinese story05_5_2_b714889a:

    # k "You idiot…"
    k "你这蠢货……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6435
translate chinese story05_5_2_f7b9d9be:

    # k "(No. I have to help…)"
    k "（不。我得帮忙……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6437
translate chinese story05_5_2_10948111:

    # mc "(Why won’t it break? With all my strength… I—)"
    mc "（为什么打不破？我用尽全力……我——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6449
translate chinese story05_5_2_fab0a607:

    # mc "(COME ON! COME ON!)"
    mc "（来啊！来啊！）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6455
translate chinese story05_5_2_7068baaf:

    # sel "(Pathetic…)"
    sel "（可悲……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6461
translate chinese story05_5_2_a224d4c9:

    # sel "You’re all the same."
    sel "你们全都一样。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6467
translate chinese story05_5_2_9fe4994b:

    # mc "(It’s useless…)"
    mc "（没用的……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6468
translate chinese story05_5_2_44f2a43e:

    # sel "Throwing promises around—"
    sel "到处抛承诺——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6469
translate chinese story05_5_2_ffec9ceb:

    # sel "promises you can never keep."
    sel "你永远兑现不了的承诺。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6471
translate chinese story05_5_2_b95a2169:

    # mc "(promises?)"
    mc "（承诺？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6472
translate chinese story05_5_2_6bae8be1:

    # mc "(No…)"
    mc "（不……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6476
translate chinese story05_5_2_dbd51f4c:

    # L "You want me to tell you everything. You think you can handle it."
    L "你想让我把一切都告诉你。你以为你受得住。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6477
translate chinese story05_5_2_e70dcd17:

    # L "But sometimes knowing ruins more than not knowing ever could."
    L "可有时候，知道了比不知道毁得更多。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6481
translate chinese story05_5_2_d2b59ce7:

    # L "The Empress of the Elves."
    L "精灵女皇。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6482
translate chinese story05_5_2_b2373404:

    # L "Weaknesses… She doesn’t have any."
    L "弱点……她没有。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6486
translate chinese story05_5_2_d3692025:

    # L "We tried everything. Every plan, every angle—"
    L "我们什么都试过。每个计划，每个角度——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6487
translate chinese story05_5_2_c771f802:

    # L "I… I don’t know."
    L "我……我不知道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6491
translate chinese story05_5_2_ba3e7a2d:

    # L "(I tried. I fought. I searched for a way to break that limit.)"
    L "（我试过。我拼过。我找过打破那个极限的办法。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6495
translate chinese story05_5_2_60e4a9a2:

    # L "(whispering) I want to believe we’ll make it through this…"
    L "（低声）我想相信我们能挺过去……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6499
translate chinese story05_5_2_6a0a0348:

    # L "Please… use it."
    L "求你……用它。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6503
translate chinese story05_5_2_42624922:

    # sel "Any last words?"
    sel "有什么遗言？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6504
translate chinese story05_5_2_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6510
translate chinese story05_5_2_737bc36d:

    # "(Cooling control zone.)"
    "（冷却控制区。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6517
translate chinese story05_5_2_695d177e:

    # L "(Come on… hurry up!)"
    L "（快……快点！）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6520
translate chinese story05_5_2_3d5fd860:

    # sel "Well then. For the effort—"
    sel "那么。看在你这么拼的份上——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6522
translate chinese story05_5_2_99325ac6:

    # sel "—I’ll grant you a painless death."
    sel "——我给你个无痛的死法。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6525
translate chinese story05_5_2_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6528
translate chinese story05_5_2_98058bdf:

    # mc "If this is how it ends…"
    mc "要是就这么结束……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6530
translate chinese story05_5_2_89380a54:

    # mc "…so be it."
    mc "……那就这样吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6532
translate chinese story05_5_2_137d9c60:

    # sel "Don’t try anything stupid."
    sel "别想耍花样。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6535
translate chinese story05_5_2_2b35b6fe_4:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6537
translate chinese story05_5_2_b23b1769:

    # N "Once more, you’ve taken too much onto your shoulders, Father."
    N "你又把太多东西扛到肩上了，父亲。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6539
translate chinese story05_5_2_0744eb72:

    # c "Don’t even try to talk him out of it."
    c "别费劲劝他了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6540
translate chinese story05_5_2_3c571d5e:

    # c "Same as always."
    c "老样子。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6542
translate chinese story05_5_2_5db1e534:

    # m "And that’s what makes him so hard to let go of, right?"
    m "而这就是他那么让人放不下的原因，对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6543
translate chinese story05_5_2_4bca7d3a:

    # m "Stubborn idiot."
    m "犟驴。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6545
translate chinese story05_5_2_2211d62e:

    # mc "Jack… Mona… you—"
    mc "杰克……莫娜……你们——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6546
translate chinese story05_5_2_850ef128:

    # b "..."
    b "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6548
translate chinese story05_5_2_a19f5207:

    # m "We’re dying to see you again, Commander, but—"
    m "我们巴不得再见到你，指挥官，可是——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6549
translate chinese story05_5_2_dae7b716:

    # c "Yeah. Don’t you dare die on us."
    c "是啊。你敢死给我们看。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6550
translate chinese story05_5_2_a4ff58ed:

    # c "You owe us."
    c "你欠我们的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6552
translate chinese story05_5_2_5d9f22ac:

    # mc "I…"
    mc "我……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6555
translate chinese story05_5_2_92bdbfbb:

    # N "We know, Father. You miss us."
    N "我们知道，父亲。你想我们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6563
translate chinese story05_5_2_7922d93f:

    # N "And we will meet again."
    N "我们会再见面的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6565
translate chinese story05_5_2_ee2c75bf:

    # N "Just… not yet."
    N "只是……还不是时候。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6572
translate chinese story05_5_2_a28be63a:

    # am "Now. Move!"
    am "现在。走！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6575
translate chinese story05_5_2_06ec2369:

    # mc "Wh—?"
    mc "什——？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6586
translate chinese story05_5_2_2246d100:

    # sel "KILL HIM!"
    sel "杀了他！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6589
translate chinese story05_5_2_57842407:

    # mc "(Was that…?)"
    mc "（那是……？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6590
translate chinese story05_5_2_668834eb:

    # mc "(Whatever that was…)"
    mc "（不管那是什么……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6593
translate chinese story05_5_2_118ca1f5:

    # a "I WON’T LET YOU!"
    a "我不会让你得逞！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6599
translate chinese story05_5_2_4c26efed:

    # am "The present path is lost."
    am "当前这条路已经没了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6600
translate chinese story05_5_2_45432559:

    # am "I’m sending you to the only man who ever shut the System down."
    am "我把你送去唯一一个曾关掉系统的人那儿。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6601
translate chinese story05_5_2_0c89a7cd:

    # am "Go. Find Gorem."
    am "去。找到戈雷姆。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6602
translate chinese story05_5_2_fe5b2af0:

    # am "I’ll handle the rest."
    am "剩下的我来处理。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6605
translate chinese story05_5_2_faffb07b:

    # a "Wh—"
    a "什——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6608
translate chinese story05_5_2_13b5b5eb:

    # sel "What are you doing?! We had an agre—"
    sel "你在干什么？！我们说好的——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6626
translate chinese story05_5_2_6eef417c:

    # "Analysis complete. Condition: critical."
    "分析完成。状态：危急。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6627
translate chinese story05_5_2_6124a389:

    # mc "No. Stay with me."
    mc "不。撑着。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6628
translate chinese story05_5_2_c2309ae2:

    # mc "(whispering) I won’t…"
    mc "（低声）我不会……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6630
translate chinese story05_5_2_7cd6a985:

    # mc "Stay awake."
    mc "保持清醒。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6631
translate chinese story05_5_2_dcf37b01:

    # mc "Don’t close your eyes."
    mc "别闭眼。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6638
translate chinese story05_5_2_82f5d9fe:

    # a "You could use some help yourself."
    a "你自己也需要帮忙。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6639
translate chinese story05_5_2_480890f2:

    # mc "I’ll manage."
    mc "我能行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6641
translate chinese story05_5_2_bb8e4b4e:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6643
translate chinese story05_5_2_73f36c26:

    # a "There’s a hole in her chest."
    a "她胸口有个洞。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6644
translate chinese story05_5_2_ca782d48:

    # a "She’s dying."
    a "她快死了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6646
translate chinese story05_5_2_0058f174:

    # mc "Hey, Kali. Can you hear me?"
    mc "喂，卡莉。能听见我吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6647
translate chinese story05_5_2_10488a95:

    # mc "Don’t you dare pass out!"
    mc "你敢昏过去试试！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6649
translate chinese story05_5_2_e1a21be5:

    # mc "You hear me?"
    mc "听见了吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6650
translate chinese story05_5_2_70815c86:

    # mc "Just… don’t."
    mc "就是……别。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6653
translate chinese story05_5_2_4bd07a7d:

    # k "(He’s trying so hard… For someone like me?)"
    k "（他这么拼命……为了我这样的人？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6654
translate chinese story05_5_2_24c07cb5:

    # k "...leave me. I—"
    k "……别管我了。我——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6656
translate chinese story05_5_2_d0937280:

    # mc "It’s not your time. Got it?"
    mc "还没到你的时候。明白吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6657
translate chinese story05_5_2_913afd3d:

    # k "…yeah."
    k "……嗯。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6658
translate chinese story05_5_2_72a441a9:

    # mc "Go chase that dream of yours."
    mc "去追你的梦。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6660
translate chinese story05_5_2_a16a8e78:

    # mc "Become the best damn actress out there."
    mc "成为最他妈棒的女演员。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6662
translate chinese story05_5_2_bcc08b5a:

    # k "Don’t go crying on me…"
    k "别对着我哭……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6663
translate chinese story05_5_2_85b8aa14:

    # k "old man…"
    k "老头……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6665
translate chinese story05_5_2_ae5fda2e:

    # mc "Hey, Kali, stay with me. Don’t close your—"
    mc "喂，卡莉，撑着。别闭上——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6667
translate chinese story05_5_2_9b40279d:

    # "Blood loss exceeds critical—"
    "失血量超过危急值——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6669
translate chinese story05_5_2_92e7948c:

    # mc "(God, he’s getting on my nerves.)"
    mc "（天哪，他真烦。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6670
translate chinese story05_5_2_0649b689:

    # mc "(If I keep listening to him, she’s going to die.)"
    mc "（我要再听他的，她就死了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6673
translate chinese story05_5_2_a564635b:

    # mc "Screw it."
    mc "管他呢。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6676
translate chinese story05_5_2_ddfcdf85:

    # a "Ironic. {w=0.7}Fighting so hard to save the one who was ready to kill you."
    a "讽刺。{w=0.7}拼了命去救一个本来准备杀你的人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6680
translate chinese story05_5_2_fd0ba02a:

    # mc "...but she didn’t."
    mc "……可她没动手。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6683
translate chinese story05_5_2_68b0f8f5:

    # mc "I’ve ruined more lives than I can count."
    mc "我毁掉的命，数不清。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6684
translate chinese story05_5_2_cec4ec86:

    # mc "Too many…"
    mc "太多了……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6690
translate chinese story05_5_2_9131a2f8:

    # a "And saving this girl—"
    a "那救这个姑娘——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6691
translate chinese story05_5_2_8db5da5d:

    # a "is that your redemption?"
    a "就是你的救赎？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6692
translate chinese story05_5_2_2b35b6fe_5:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6694
translate chinese story05_5_2_df8190a4:

    # mc "Redemption… don’t flatter me."
    mc "救赎……别抬举我。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6695
translate chinese story05_5_2_1885be5a:

    # mc "More like… doing one useful thing in my life."
    mc "更像是……这辈子做一件有用的事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6697
translate chinese story05_5_2_cb89352d:

    # mc "Pathetic, I know."
    mc "很可悲，我知道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6698
translate chinese story05_5_2_bb8e4b4e_1:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6699
translate chinese story05_5_2_8b75cba7:

    # a "(I don’t understand him. {w=0.8}Why go this far for a piece of flesh that’s already used up?)"
    a "（我不理解他。{w=0.8}为什么为了一具已经用尽的皮囊做到这一步？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6701
translate chinese story05_5_2_bb8e4b4e_2:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6702
translate chinese story05_5_2_8fb2f2f3:

    # a "(Strange man.)"
    a "（奇怪的人。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6703
translate chinese story05_5_2_a20432b0:

    # a "(And yet… I want to help.)"
    a "（可……我想帮他。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6704
translate chinese story05_5_2_36793bb1:

    # a "...There is another way."
    a "……还有另一个办法。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6706
translate chinese story05_5_2_28da0811:

    # a "The miasma."
    a "瘴气。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6708
translate chinese story05_5_2_f3509fd7:

    # mc "That would kill her."
    mc "那会要她的命。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6711
translate chinese story05_5_2_160518b6:

    # a "Or save her."
    a "或者救她的命。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6713
translate chinese story05_5_2_2b35b6fe_6:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6716
translate chinese story05_5_2_86ebc2ca:

    # a "They’ll either save her…"
    a "要么救她……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6717
translate chinese story05_5_2_42ac0a14:

    # a "Or turn her into one of those Soulless you’ve been killing."
    a "要么把她变成你一直在杀的那种无魂者。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6719
translate chinese story05_5_2_16810d06:

    # mc "(If that’s what it takes for her to live…)"
    mc "（要是只有这样才能让她活……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6720
translate chinese story05_5_2_1f96c707:

    # mc "(And if it fails, I’ll have to be the one to kill her.)"
    mc "（要是失败，就得我来杀她。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6722
translate chinese story05_5_2_ea77fedf:

    # mc "...Damn it."
    mc "……该死。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6723
translate chinese story05_5_2_1608f321:

    # mc "(I hope it doesn’t come to that.)"
    mc "（但愿别到那一步。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6724
translate chinese story05_5_2_ef5c4567:

    # mc "Please… live."
    mc "求你……活下去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6732
translate chinese story05_5_2_13be4b8e:

    # a "(What am I doing? Using miasma like this breaks the Codex.)"
    a "（我在干什么？这样用瘴气违背了法典。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6733
translate chinese story05_5_2_245fec54:

    # mc "Done. What now?"
    mc "弄好了。现在呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6735
translate chinese story05_5_2_bb8e4b4e_3:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6737
translate chinese story05_5_2_37cb9f2e:

    # a "It’s too cold here. She needs warmth."
    a "这儿太冷。她需要温暖。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6744
translate chinese story05_5_2_7c9db6c9:

    # mc "(whispering) Warmer… works better, right? …Flora?"
    mc "（低声）暖一点……效果更好，对吧？……弗洛拉？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6751
translate chinese story05_5_2_7f29ffb8:

    # mc "(Dusty. Filthy. No one’s been here in years.)"
    mc "（积灰。脏乱。好几年没人来过。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6753
translate chinese story05_5_2_23ca4f93:

    # mc "(Warm enough. If only I could find a bed… something to cover her.)"
    mc "（够暖了。要是能找到张床……能给她盖点什么就好了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6756
translate chinese story05_5_2_f0f95c01:

    # mc "But where…"
    mc "可哪儿有……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6763
translate chinese story05_5_2_518482c2:

    # mc "No, no— don’t you dare die on me, you hear?! Don’t you dare!"
    mc "不，不——你敢死给我看，听见没？！你敢！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6764
translate chinese story05_5_2_e07f6645:

    # mc "Why isn’t the miasma working?!"
    mc "瘴气怎么没起作用？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6766
translate chinese story05_5_2_bb8e4b4e_4:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6767
translate chinese story05_5_2_66ad4f2a:

    # a "It is."
    a "起作用了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6768
translate chinese story05_5_2_8e207271:

    # mc "But her condi—"
    mc "可她的状况——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6770
translate chinese story05_5_2_4a82dede:

    # a "The miasma is keeping her cells active. Without it, she’d already be dead."
    a "瘴气在维持她的细胞活性。没有它，她早死了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6771
translate chinese story05_5_2_678eb3fc:

    # a "But it will keep spreading until it takes control."
    a "但它会一直扩散，直到夺取控制。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6772
translate chinese story05_5_2_bb47ca70:

    # a "Your fight is only beginning."
    a "你的仗才刚开始。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6773
translate chinese story05_5_2_1e19e933:

    # a "Don’t let it reach the rest of her body."
    a "别让它蔓延到她身体其他地方。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6775
translate chinese story05_5_2_b038b21f:

    # mc "What? But you said—"
    mc "什么？可你刚才说——"

# game/Story04.rpy:6776
translate chinese story05_5_2_eb3aea81:

    # a "It’s a virus, not a cure."
    a "它是病毒，不是解药。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6777
translate chinese story05_5_2_92b38daa:

    # mc "Then how?"
    mc "那怎么办？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6778
translate chinese story05_5_2_8b614c8d:

    # a "The lighter."
    a "打火机。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6779
translate chinese story05_5_2_811b7c7a:

    # a "Seal the infected tissue before it spreads farther."
    a "在感染组织扩散更远之前封住它。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6783
translate chinese story05_5_2_24eec0dd:

    # mc "Now?"
    mc "现在？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6784
translate chinese story05_5_2_0b0ed3c0:

    # a "Cauterize the wound."
    a "烧灼伤口。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6785
translate chinese story05_5_2_2b35b6fe_7:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6787
translate chinese story05_5_2_8845a9f6:

    # mc "You’re kidding me..."
    mc "你开玩笑吧……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6788
translate chinese story05_5_2_bb8e4b4e_5:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6789
translate chinese story05_5_2_bd3f07a4:

    # mc "Make her suffer even more?! What, you think I’m a sadist?!"
    mc "让她受更多罪？！怎么，你觉得我是虐待狂？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6791
translate chinese story05_5_2_5cbd867f:

    # a "You kept her alive."
    a "是你把她留下来的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6793
translate chinese story05_5_2_3fb23f4a:

    # mc "That’s torture!"
    mc "那是折磨！"

# game/Story04.rpy:6795
translate chinese story05_5_2_9812897c:

    # a "You took that risk."
    a "风险是你担的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6796
translate chinese story05_5_2_628a420d:

    # a "Now see it through."
    a "那就做到底。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6798
translate chinese story05_5_2_ea77fedf_1:

    # mc "...Damn it."
    mc "……该死。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6800
translate chinese story05_5_2_4ea09cbb:

    # k "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAA..."
    k "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6801
translate chinese story05_5_2_6151ef3b:

    # "A scream of burning agony and sheer terror split the air."
    "一声燃烧般的剧痛与纯粹恐惧的尖叫，撕开了空气。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6822
translate chinese story05_5_3_5acd5567:

    # "Several hours later."
    "几小时后。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6825
translate chinese story05_5_3_324ba4ff:

    # mc "(Her screams… and now she’s just lying there, asleep…)"
    mc "（她的尖叫……现在她就那么躺着，睡着了……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6826
translate chinese story05_5_3_33bef520:

    # mc "(It’s… calming. But is she better? Worse? I can’t stop overthinking it.)"
    mc "（这……让人平静。可她是好转了？还是更糟？我停不下来瞎想。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6828
translate chinese story05_5_3_f7bed42a:

    # mc "(All I can do is wait. Let her rest.)"
    mc "（我能做的只有等。让她休息。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6830
translate chinese story05_5_3_46404cce:

    # mc "(And then what?)"
    mc "（然后呢？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6833
translate chinese story05_5_3_e5013fa2:

    # mc "Arkh…"
    mc "呃……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6834
translate chinese story05_5_3_4159b962:

    # mc "(You threw yourself into that abyss without thinking.)"
    mc "（你想都没想就跳进了那个深渊。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6835
translate chinese story05_5_3_9c799d35:

    # mc "(Yeah. We’re alive.)"
    mc "（是啊。我们还活着。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6836
translate chinese story05_5_3_e9a44c7c:

    # mc "(For now.)"
    mc "（暂时。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6839
translate chinese story05_5_3_998b9209:

    # mc "(No food. Barely any water. If we stay here, we’re dead.)"
    mc "（没吃的。水也快没了。待在这儿就是等死。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6840
translate chinese story05_5_3_69fe3566:

    # mc "(But we can’t leave either. And even if we could, where to?)"
    mc "（可我们也不能走。就算能走，去哪儿？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6842
translate chinese story05_5_3_c0878d3f:

    # mc "Mm… come on…"
    mc "嗯……来……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6844
translate chinese story05_5_3_8138fe90:

    # mc "(Done.)"
    mc "（好了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6853
translate chinese story05_5_3_f1497f9f:

    # mc "Still second-guessing your decision?"
    mc "还在怀疑自己的决定？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6854
translate chinese story05_5_3_5deb8fad:

    # mc "Don’t. We’re past that."
    mc "别。那一步我们已经过了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6856
translate chinese story05_5_3_812ed592:

    # a "After analyzing the situation…"
    a "分析完局势之后……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6857
translate chinese story05_5_3_7066c740:

    # a "For the first time, I don’t know what to tell you."
    a "这是我第一次，不知道该跟你说什么。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6858
translate chinese story05_5_3_d7f2d5e4:

    # mc "What about our location? Do you know where we are?"
    mc "位置呢？你知道我们在哪儿吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6860
translate chinese story05_5_3_4b023d45:

    # a "Hard to say precisely."
    a "很难说准。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6862
translate chinese story05_5_3_28f45037:

    # a "Looks like an old elven colony. According to my estimates, it’s still operational."
    a "像是个古老的精灵殖民地。按我的估算，它还在运转。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6865
translate chinese story05_5_3_f3c80748:

    # mc "…Damn."
    mc "……该死。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6867
translate chinese story05_5_3_d6f139da:

    # mc "You’re sure?"
    mc "你确定？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6869
translate chinese story05_5_3_3caacb87:

    # mc "Another fight would be a terrible idea."
    mc "再打一场可不是好主意。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6870
translate chinese story05_5_3_ec04b38a:

    # mc "Especially with Kali in this state."
    mc "尤其卡莉还是这状态。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6873
translate chinese story05_5_3_fd4a9a24:

    # a "Elves are a peaceful people. They won’t strike first."
    a "精灵是和平的民族。他们不会先动手。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6875
translate chinese story05_5_3_c6240259:

    # mc "Did you forget? We fought the elven Empress just hours ago."
    mc "你忘了？我们几小时前才跟精灵女皇打过。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6876
translate chinese story05_5_3_c27fc1d9:

    # mc "And we were the ones defending ourselves."
    mc "而且我们才是自卫的一方。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6879
translate chinese story05_5_3_ebb0a465:

    # a "Her methods… were an exception."
    a "她的做法……是例外。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6880
translate chinese story05_5_3_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6884
translate chinese story05_5_3_15d70db1:

    # mc "(I need to scout the area.)"
    mc "（我得侦察一下周围。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6885
translate chinese story05_5_3_97f37e66:

    # mc "(If possible, find food… and somewhere better.)"
    mc "（可能的话，找点吃的……还有更好的落脚处。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6887
translate chinese story05_5_3_e7546dee:

    # mc "(And at the same time, leaving her alone…)"
    mc "（可同时，留她一个人……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6892
translate chinese story05_5_3_0205cfee:

    # mc "She’s burning up."
    mc "她烫得厉害。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6894
translate chinese story05_5_3_ff3701fd:

    # a "Her body is fighting the miasma."
    a "她的身体在对抗瘴气。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6895
translate chinese story05_5_3_d274206f:

    # a "That’s a good sign."
    a "这是好迹象。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6896
translate chinese story05_5_3_5e2b3f7d:

    # mc "I hope so."
    mc "但愿如此。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6899
translate chinese story05_5_3_4ed11fbb:

    # k "…no… I don’t want to…"
    k "……不……我不想……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6900
translate chinese story05_5_3_eb224a77:

    # k "die…"
    k "死……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6903
translate chinese story05_5_3_23e8e176:

    # mc "Easy. Easy."
    mc "别急。别急。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6904
translate chinese story05_5_3_96544da9:

    # mc "It’s alright. You’re doing fine."
    mc "没事。你做得很好。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6906
translate chinese story05_5_3_6c49bb40:

    # mc "You will."
    mc "你会的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6907
translate chinese story05_5_3_0a4dbc8d:

    # mc "I promise."
    mc "我保证。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6911
translate chinese story05_5_3_448bd79c:

    # mc "An elven colony, then…"
    mc "精灵殖民地，是吧……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6912
translate chinese story05_5_3_efdbf2a4:

    # mc "Tell me, could they help us?"
    mc "告诉我，他们能帮我们吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6914
translate chinese story05_5_3_91d8b70a:

    # a "The probability is extremely low."
    a "概率极低。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6915
translate chinese story05_5_3_4f5dac8c:

    # a "But not zero, if we play this right."
    a "但不是零，只要操作得当。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6918
translate chinese story05_5_3_6465145d:

    # "A few minutes later."
    "几分钟后。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6920
translate chinese story05_5_3_b0bd7532:

    # keep3 "That was reckless."
    keep3 "那太鲁莽了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6922
translate chinese story05_5_3_379fcd6e:

    # mc "You think?"
    mc "你觉得？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6924
translate chinese story05_5_3_f0495824:

    # keep3 "Ripping it out of your head wasn’t rational."
    keep3 "把它从你脑子里硬扯出来，不理智。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6926
translate chinese story05_5_3_28d51d64:

    # mc "Her life was on the line."
    mc "她的命悬在那儿。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6928
translate chinese story05_5_3_0085e033:

    # keep3 "..."
    keep3 "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6930
translate chinese story05_5_3_05f296f2:

    # keep3 "Next time, think it through."
    keep3 "下次，想清楚了再动手。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6931
translate chinese story05_5_3_98dd1f76:

    # keep3 "I’d rather not cease to exist along with you."
    keep3 "我可不想跟你一起消失。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6932
translate chinese story05_5_3_c1880cd0:

    # mc "(Since we’re on the subject… how does a tiny chip like that hold so much power?)"
    mc "（既然说到这个……那么小一块芯片，怎么能承载这么大的力量？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6934
translate chinese story05_5_3_2703dc02:

    # keep3 "The power isn’t in the chip. It only removes the limiter."
    keep3 "力量不在芯片里。它只是解除限制器。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6938
translate chinese story05_5_3_c210a672:

    # mc "(Elaborate.)"
    mc "（说清楚。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6940
translate chinese story05_5_3_f20777b0:

    # keep3 "Your body is a weapon."
    keep3 "你的身体就是武器。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6941
translate chinese story05_5_3_09b14c3d:

    # keep3 "Not metaphorically."
    keep3 "不是比喻。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6942
translate chinese story05_5_3_cfe02364:

    # keep3 "Not theoretically."
    keep3 "不是理论。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6943
translate chinese story05_5_3_04bfb849:

    # keep3 "Literally."
    keep3 "是字面意义上的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6945
translate chinese story05_5_3_9a8e3d3c:

    # mc "(What?)"
    mc "（什么？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6945
translate chinese story05_5_3_22a9c46d:

    # keep3 "From head to toe, you’re packed with implants."
    keep3 "你从头到脚都塞满了植入体。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6946
translate chinese story05_5_3_61696055:

    # mc "(And the chip keeps them in check. Am I right?)"
    mc "（而芯片在管着它们。我说得对吧？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6948
translate chinese story05_5_3_a48021e4:

    # keep3 "They’re afraid you might become a problem."
    keep3 "他们怕你变成麻烦。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6950
translate chinese story05_5_3_c0e1ae79:

    # mc "Different world. Same methods."
    mc "不同的世界。一样的手段。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6951
translate chinese story05_5_3_921d4607:

    # mc "Almost funny."
    mc "几乎有点好笑。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6952
translate chinese story05_5_3_71d7552f:

    # mc "So without the chip… the implants are useless?"
    mc "所以没了芯片……植入体就没用了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6954
translate chinese story05_5_3_0085e033_1:

    # keep3 "..."
    keep3 "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6955
translate chinese story05_5_3_414fa8de:

    # keep3 "Yes."
    keep3 "是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6957
translate chinese story05_5_3_054c5ee0:

    # mc "I see."
    mc "明白了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6958
translate chinese story05_5_3_cc8bcf5e:

    # mc "And there’s no way around the restrictions?"
    mc "那这些限制就没法绕开？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6960
translate chinese story05_5_3_0d9a648b:

    # keep3 "There are ways."
    keep3 "有办法。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6961
translate chinese story05_5_3_7e7a5f17:

    # keep3 "But they aren’t rational."
    keep3 "但不理智。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6962
translate chinese story05_5_3_0d23de58:

    # keep3 "And you wouldn’t be able to use them freely."
    keep3 "而且你也没法随便用。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6964
translate chinese story05_5_3_107cd636:

    # keep3 "Slowly. Step by step. Your body is destroying itself."
    keep3 "慢慢地。一步一步。你的身体在自我摧毁。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6965
translate chinese story05_5_3_95efdfe5:

    # keep3 "Using them only accelerates the process."
    keep3 "用它们只会加速这个过程。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6969
translate chinese story05_5_3_9954cf90:

    # mc "Power always comes at a cost… doesn’t it?"
    mc "力量总有代价……对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6971
translate chinese story05_5_3_2a144464:

    # keep3 "There are alternatives."
    keep3 "有替代方案。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6972
translate chinese story05_5_3_0ca9c5aa:

    # keep3 "The Federation simply doesn’t need them."
    keep3 "联邦只是不需要它们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6973
translate chinese story05_5_3_0ad98f09:

    # keep3 "Or more precisely, they aren’t cost-effective."
    keep3 "更准确地说，不划算。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6975
translate chinese story05_5_3_826b5892:

    # mc "Meaning?"
    mc "什么意思？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6977
translate chinese story05_5_3_0c5752be:

    # keep3 "Two factors."
    keep3 "两个因素。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6978
translate chinese story05_5_3_2268eb81:

    # keep3 "Not financially viable."
    keep3 "经济上不可行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6979
translate chinese story05_5_3_152a1d37:

    # keep3 "And…"
    keep3 "还有……"

# game/Story04.rpy:6981
translate chinese story05_5_3_b0566b1a:

    # keep3 "The elves are the only ones capable of reinstalling implants."
    keep3 "只有精灵能重装植入体。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6982
translate chinese story05_5_3_7c548846:

    # keep3 "And relations with them… are strained."
    keep3 "而跟他们的关系……很紧张。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6984
translate chinese story05_5_3_8e84bfe9:

    # mc "I figured."
    mc "我就知道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6989
translate chinese story05_5_3_c8ac0829:

    # mc "(Ammo’s intact. Count…)"
    mc "（弹药完好。数数……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6990
translate chinese story05_5_3_80ba8a9a:

    # mc "(Not great. One magazine.)"
    mc "（不太妙。就一个弹匣。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:6993
translate chinese story05_5_3_4883f48e:

    # mc "You sure leaving her alone is a good idea?"
    mc "你确定把她一个人留下是好主意？"

# game/Story04.rpy:6994
translate chinese story05_5_3_688ef7eb:

    # a "Her survival contradicts my logic entirely."
    a "她的生还完全违背我的逻辑。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6995
translate chinese story05_5_3_4c7df73f:

    # a "You’ll have to decide that one yourself."
    a "这个你得自己决定。"

# game/Story04.rpy:6998
translate chinese story05_5_3_2061d0e2:

    # mc "Figures."
    mc "果然。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7000
translate chinese story05_5_3_31a3ef4d:

    # mc "(Then let’s move.)"
    mc "（那就走吧。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7012
translate chinese story05_5_3_a571b8c4:

    # mc "Beautiful…"
    mc "真美……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7013
translate chinese story05_5_3_716fe1a3:

    # a "Ruins and overgrowth."
    a "废墟和疯长的草木。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7014
translate chinese story05_5_3_9dedfefc:

    # a "There’s nothing beautiful about decay."
    a "衰败没什么美的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7015
translate chinese story05_5_3_2ce61a13:

    # mc "Depends how you look at it."
    mc "看你怎么看了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7018
translate chinese story05_5_3_58f732a1:

    # mc "(No signs of life. Hard to believe anyone’s been—)"
    mc "（没有生命迹象。很难相信有人来过——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7019
translate chinese story05_5_3_2dff1cc9:

    # a "You still have the implant?"
    a "你的植入体还在？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7021
translate chinese story05_5_3_2f61aa8f:

    # mc "Yeah. Why?"
    mc "在。怎么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7024
translate chinese story05_5_3_d3c6023d:

    # a "Don’t use it. Elves don’t tolerate implants."
    a "别用。精灵不容忍植入体。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7025
translate chinese story05_5_3_56c3991c:

    # mc "Why not?"
    mc "为什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7027
translate chinese story05_5_3_e7cbf4b2:

    # a "Just advice."
    a "只是建议。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7028
translate chinese story05_5_3_37c49932:

    # mc "(What changed him? He’s… unusually talkative.)"
    mc "（他怎么了？话……出奇地多。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7030
translate chinese story05_5_3_6fb1465c:

    # mc "Noted."
    mc "记下了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7037
translate chinese story05_5_3_c07e88d7:

    # mc "(An elven colony… so not Earth.)"
    mc "（一个精灵殖民地……所以不是地球。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7038
translate chinese story05_5_3_6080a8a9:

    # mc "(Which means the Gate experiment failed?)"
    mc "（也就是说门的实验失败了？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7040
translate chinese story05_5_3_c5975c38:

    # mc "White mask... No. What should I call you?"
    mc "白面具……不。我该怎么称呼你？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7041
translate chinese story05_5_3_e69592fa:

    # keep3 "Third."
    keep3 "三号。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7042
translate chinese story05_5_3_beda4223:

    # keep3 "Names mean nothing to us."
    keep3 "名字对我们没有意义。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7044
translate chinese story05_5_3_50193a3e:

    # mc "Strange customs."
    mc "奇怪的习俗。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7045
translate chinese story05_5_3_f3026fe1:

    # mc "Back to the point, the gate."
    mc "说回正题，那道门。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7046
translate chinese story05_5_3_749f1cf4:

    # mc "Something went wrong, didn’t it? This isn’t the Abyss. And it’s definitely not Earth."
    mc "出岔子了，对吧？这不是深渊。也绝对不是地球。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7048
translate chinese story05_5_3_66884105:

    # keep3 "We were displaced in time. Not speculation. Fact."
    keep3 "我们被时间错位了。不是猜测。是事实。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7049
translate chinese story05_5_3_e86d6d57:

    # keep3 "The question is, {b}when.{/b}"
    keep3 "问题是，{b}什么时候{/b}。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7051
translate chinese story05_5_3_c5c09466:

    # mc "That bad?"
    mc "有那么糟？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7052
translate chinese story05_5_3_b6d81ce1:

    # keep3 "Very. If we plan on getting out."
    keep3 "非常糟。如果我们还想出去的话。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7059
translate chinese story05_5_3_9dcad847:

    # mc "What about the statues? Can they tell us anything?"
    mc "那些雕像呢？它们能告诉我们什么吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7060
translate chinese story05_5_3_abdeb54d:

    # keep3 "I’m a Keeper. Not omniscient."
    keep3 "我是守护者。不是全知者。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7061
translate chinese story05_5_3_a92fcbc5:

    # mc "What’s the difference? You always sounded all-knowing to me."
    mc "有什么区别？你在我听来总是无所不知。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7063
translate chinese story05_5_3_0085e033_2:

    # keep3 "..."
    keep3 "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7064
translate chinese story05_5_3_55ea5652:

    # keep3 "Going to war, would you take a sword, or a book?"
    keep3 "上战场，你带剑，还是带书？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7066
translate chinese story05_5_3_30f3039f:

    # mc "Depends what you’re planning to do there. Doesn’t it?"
    mc "取决于你去那儿打算干什么。对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7068
translate chinese story05_5_3_8be82e98:

    # keep3 "A fair point."
    keep3 "说得有理。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7069
translate chinese story05_5_3_b511b068:

    # keep3 "And your answer, no."
    keep3 "而你的答案是，不。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7070
translate chinese story05_5_3_37eaa0c9:

    # keep3 "I’m not all-knowing. I’m a weapon."
    keep3 "我不是全知。我是武器。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7072
translate chinese story05_5_3_38e357eb:

    # mc "(A statue of a girl. Strange ruins.)"
    mc "（一个女孩的雕像。奇怪的废墟。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7073
translate chinese story05_5_3_0898dd82:

    # mc "(Nothing useful.)"
    mc "（没什么有用的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7078
translate chinese story05_5_3_06f9b724:

    # mc "(If there’s nothing here, I should go higher.)"
    mc "（这儿什么都没有，我该往高处去。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7079
translate chinese story05_5_3_27f3f3ee:

    # mc "(Wait. Dead end?)"
    mc "（等等。死路？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7081
translate chinese story05_5_3_0ca17839:

    # mc "(And here too.)"
    mc "（这儿也是。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7083
translate chinese story05_5_3_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7085
translate chinese story05_5_3_060c6da2:

    # mc "Purely theoretical, what are the odds there’s no way out?"
    mc "纯理论地说，没有出路的概率有多大？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7086
translate chinese story05_5_3_0085e033_3:

    # keep3 "..."
    keep3 "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7088
translate chinese story05_5_3_e72e3021:

    # keep3 "The fact we survived unstable gates at all was already a miracle."
    keep3 "我们能从不稳定的门里活下来，本身已经是奇迹了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7091
translate chinese story05_5_3_39975497:

    # mc "(Time to check something.)"
    mc "（该确认点东西了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7096
translate chinese story05_5_3_5d72f225:

    # "Analysis complete. Optimal route constructed."
    "分析完成。已构建最优路线。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7098
translate chinese story05_5_3_f4d8e7da:

    # keep3 "Implants."
    keep3 "植入体。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7099
translate chinese story05_5_3_fa8e14bf:

    # mc "I know. Still."
    mc "我知道。不过还是得用。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7114
translate chinese story05_5_3_a027e187:

    # mc "Let’s—"
    mc "我们——"

# game/Story04.rpy:7118
translate chinese story05_5_3_ea6e2dab:

    # mc "(Got it.)"
    mc "（找到了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7126
translate chinese story05_5_3_aedf8e8b:

    # mc "(So maybe it’s not completely hopeless.)"
    mc "（也许还不算完全没希望。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7127
translate chinese story05_5_3_60c1564b:

    # mc "I see a passage beyond the rocks."
    mc "岩石后面有条通道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7129
translate chinese story05_5_3_87d30154:

    # mc "But how do I get there?"
    mc "可我怎么过去？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7130
translate chinese story05_5_3_e9643e9d:

    # mc "No, wrong question."
    mc "不，问错了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7131
translate chinese story05_5_3_512d0881:

    # mc "How do I get there {b}with Kalestra…{/b}"
    mc "我怎么才能{b}带着卡莱斯特拉{/b}过去……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7133
translate chinese story05_5_3_d22d3f4a:

    # keep3 "Still haven’t changed your mind?"
    keep3 "还没改主意？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7134
translate chinese story05_5_3_1534a11a:

    # mc "Sounds like you’re hoping I will. Personal dislike?"
    mc "听着像你盼着我改。私人恩怨？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7135
translate chinese story05_5_3_61fe52cc:

    # keep3 "No comment."
    keep3 "无可奉告。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7139
translate chinese story05_5_3_24314cb9:

    # "Threat detected. Enemy at seven o’clock."
    "检测到威胁。敌人在七点钟方向。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7142
translate chinese story05_5_3_86583c85:

    # mc "(Just what I needed.)"
    mc "（正合我意。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7148
translate chinese story05_5_3_0ee54723:

    # mc "(Alone. With flowers? …What the hell is this?)"
    mc "（一个人。还拿着花？……这他妈是什么？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7151
translate chinese story05_5_3_23ac7b1d:

    # Go "..."
    Go "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7153
translate chinese story05_5_3_f1c9a6b3:

    # Go "{font=Cybertron.otf}You are as radiant as you were the day we parted, Viola.{/font} \n(You are as radiant as you were the day we parted, Viola.)"
    Go "{font=Cybertron.otf}You are as radiant as you were the day we parted, Viola.{/font} \n（你依旧如我们分别那天一样光彩照人，维奥拉。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7155
translate chinese story05_5_3_a2fedbd5:

    # mc "(What language is that? Third, I need you.)"
    mc "（那是什么语言？三号，我需要你。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7157
translate chinese story05_5_3_36508db0:

    # keep3 "Ancient Elvish. I’ve never heard it spoken aloud before."
    keep3 "古精灵语。我从没听人念出来过。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7158
translate chinese story05_5_3_88498c70:

    # mc "Do you understand him?"
    mc "你能听懂他吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7159
translate chinese story05_5_3_81776ce8:

    # keep3 "Enough. It’s reserved for the highest circles of power."
    keep3 "够懂。这语言只用于最高权力圈子。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7161
translate chinese story05_5_3_3ff397d5:

    # mc "So he’s important."
    mc "所以他是个大人物。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7162
translate chinese story05_5_3_aacda308:

    # mc "Lucky us…"
    mc "我们真走运……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7165
translate chinese story05_5_3_6fab6dce:

    # Go "{font=Cybertron.otf}So it is…{/font} \n(So it is…)"
    Go "{font=Cybertron.otf}So it is…{/font} \n（正是如此……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7167
translate chinese story05_5_3_8306d34c:

    # Go "{font=Cybertron.otf}Forgive our new guests. They did not know what they were doing.{/font} \n(Forgive our new guests. They did not know what they were doing.)"
    Go "{font=Cybertron.otf}Forgive our new guests. They did not know what they were doing.{/font} \n（原谅我们的新客人。他们不知道自己在做什么。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7169
translate chinese story05_5_3_a51fa43d:

    # keep3 "He knows we’re here."
    keep3 "他知道我们在这儿。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7170
translate chinese story05_5_3_48567073:

    # mc "Wh— The implant?"
    mc "什——植入体？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7171
translate chinese story05_5_3_d076d502:

    # keep3 "That too. But not only that."
    keep3 "那也算。但不只是那个。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7173
translate chinese story05_5_3_c166b2f0:

    # keep3 "He’s… strange."
    keep3 "他……很怪。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7174
translate chinese story05_5_3_bb2eed73:

    # mc "(Strange? No. He’s unsettling.)"
    mc "（怪？不。他让人不安。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7179
translate chinese story05_5_3_27b063dc:

    # Go "{font=Cybertron.otf}May I inquire, honored ones… from where do you hail?{/font} \n(May I inquire, honored ones… from where do you hail?)"
    Go "{font=Cybertron.otf}May I inquire, honored ones… from where do you hail?{/font} \n（可否请问，尊贵的二位……你们来自何方？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7181
translate chinese story05_5_3_b484ae56:

    # keep3 "Advice. Do not attempt to harm him. Under any circumstances."
    keep3 "忠告。别试图伤他。任何情况下都不行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7183
translate chinese story05_5_3_1a5cd818:

    # mc "(As if I could.)"
    mc "（好像我能似的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7185
translate chinese story05_5_3_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7187
translate chinese story05_5_3_3ff05957:

    # Go "{font=Cybertron.otf}Ah, do not be afraid. I come in peace.{/font} \n(Ah, do not be afraid. I come in peace.)"
    Go "{font=Cybertron.otf}Ah, do not be afraid. I come in peace.{/font} \n（啊，别怕。我是带着和平来的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7190
translate chinese story05_5_3_95750b7c:

    # mc "You speak our language?"
    mc "你会说我们的语言？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7191
translate chinese story05_5_3_5fa022ad:

    # Go "(Human?)"
    Go "（人类？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7192
translate chinese story05_5_3_44d18a24:

    # Go "So you are human. Forgive my manners."
    Go "所以你真是人类。恕我失礼。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7195
translate chinese story05_5_3_cd899e40:

    # Go "But with all due respect… would you kindly lower your weapon, monsieur?"
    Go "但恕我直言……先生，能否把武器放下？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7197
translate chinese story05_5_3_7f2db866:

    # mc "I can’t."
    mc "不行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7198
translate chinese story05_5_3_23ac7b1d_1:

    # Go "..."
    Go "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7200
translate chinese story05_5_3_10b12e97:

    # Go "You and that girl… you are not of this time. Correct?"
    Go "你和那个姑娘……不属于这个时代。对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7202
translate chinese story05_5_3_c6c0b090:

    # mc "(How—? No. Don’t react. Keep your face still.)"
    mc "（怎么——？不。别反应。脸上别动。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7203
translate chinese story05_5_3_c3c8f5d8:

    # mc "(You don’t know what he wants. Don’t give him anything.)"
    mc "（你不知道他想要什么。什么都别给他。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7205
translate chinese story05_5_3_0901a30f:

    # Go "I can offer you shelter."
    Go "我可以给你们提供庇护。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7206
translate chinese story05_5_3_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7208
translate chinese story05_5_3_ae0dd016:

    # mc "And why the generosity?"
    mc "为什么这么慷慨？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7209
translate chinese story05_5_3_6c82864f:

    # Go "You required it. And I aid those in need."
    Go "你需要。而我帮助有需要的人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7211
translate chinese story05_5_3_846a3ec1:

    # mc "Guarantees?"
    mc "保障呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7212
translate chinese story05_5_3_37b360e1:

    # Go "My word."
    Go "我的承诺。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7213
translate chinese story05_5_3_c0b32bd6:

    # mc "A life balanced on your word? That’s thin."
    mc "一条命就押在你一句话上？太薄了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7214
translate chinese story05_5_3_390a89fb:

    # Go "It is all I possess. That… and my life. Though I doubt you came seeking that."
    Go "我只有这个。这个……和我的命。不过我猜你不是来要命的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7218
translate chinese story05_5_3_df7ee913:

    # mc "Lead the way."
    mc "带路。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7225
translate chinese story05_5_3_89c8aed2:

    # mc "(Can’t stray more far away from Kali. And at the same time, I have no choice.)"
    mc "（不能再离卡莉更远了。可同时，我没得选。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7226
translate chinese story05_5_3_7a0fb2da:

    # mc "(Just have to believe she’ll be fine…)"
    mc "（只能相信她会没事……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7228
translate chinese story05_5_3_c076da27:

    # mc "(First, deal with this.)"
    mc "（先处理这个。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7230
translate chinese story05_5_3_97c44b9f:

    # "Analysis: Two entities. Three o’clock."
    "分析：两个实体。三点钟方向。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7232
translate chinese story05_5_3_95324184:

    # mc "(An ambush?!)"
    mc "（伏击？！）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7234
translate chinese story05_5_3_20fcac14:

    # mc "No… doesn’t feel like it."
    mc "不……感觉不像。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7237
translate chinese story05_5_3_e9d8e063:

    # "Analysis complete. Elves. No hostile intent detected."
    "分析完成。精灵。未检测到敌意。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7238
translate chinese story05_5_3_09a34de2:

    # mc "(Curious, maybe?)"
    mc "（也许是好奇？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7240
translate chinese story05_5_3_f40f5300:

    # mc "(No… those eyes.)"
    mc "（不……那些眼睛。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7241
translate chinese story05_5_3_84559bab:

    # mc "(They’re afraid.)"
    mc "（他们怕了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7243
translate chinese story05_5_3_1657213d:

    # Go "Forgive us for not receiving you with proper honors."
    Go "恕我们未能以应有的礼数迎接你们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7244
translate chinese story05_5_3_40c5849f:

    # Go "The persecution of my people has… intensified."
    Go "对我族人的迫害……加剧了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7247
translate chinese story05_5_3_ef9d0583:

    # Go "And seeing you escort me at gunpoint does little to ease tensions."
    Go "而看你拿枪押着我，可不太能缓解紧张。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7248
translate chinese story05_5_3_1ab259ba:

    # Go "So I ask, do not mistake their actions for insult."
    Go "所以我请求你，别把他们的举动当成侮辱。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7250
translate chinese story05_5_3_c0e1b402:

    # mc "(He doesn’t look hostile. Quite the opposite.)"
    mc "（他看着不敌对。恰恰相反。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7251
translate chinese story05_5_3_0b0eca6c:

    # mc "(Almost painfully courteous.)"
    mc "（礼貌得几乎让人难受。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7252
translate chinese story05_5_3_1205a01d:

    # mc "(Which is worse.)"
    mc "（而这更糟。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7253
translate chinese story05_5_3_3c0dbd99:

    # mc "(If he wanted me dead, I’d already be bleeding out.)"
    mc "（他要想要我死，我早该在流血了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7254
translate chinese story05_5_3_8f229760:

    # mc "(So killing me isn’t the objective.)"
    mc "（所以杀我不是目的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7257
translate chinese story05_5_3_1516e33d:

    # mc "(Fine. I’ll lower the aggression.)"
    mc "（行。我把攻击性降下来。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7258
translate chinese story05_5_3_0e6d63d7:

    # mc "(But not my guard.)"
    mc "（但警惕不降。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7263
translate chinese story05_5_3_e8b18505:

    # Go "Thank you… for that sliver of trust."
    Go "谢谢你……这一丝信任。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7267
translate chinese story05_5_3_ac18607a:

    # "Critical threat detected!"
    "检测到致命威胁！"

# game/Story04.rpy:7283
translate chinese story05_5_3_700c0950:

    # mc "Don’t."
    mc "别。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7284
translate chinese story05_5_3_2562ad6f:

    # mc "Move."
    mc "走。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7287
translate chinese story05_5_3_81a6be9f:

    # sel "Arkh—!"
    sel "呃啊——！"

# game/Story04.rpy:7288
translate chinese story05_5_3_4c103535:

    # Go "Lá istalyë tenno… \n(You never learn…)"
    Go "Lá istalyë tenno… \n（你永远学不会……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7290
translate chinese story05_5_3_40705a0b:

    # mc "You—"
    mc "你——"

# game/Story04.rpy:7292
translate chinese story05_5_3_17178595:

    # sel "Man cenich na nin, adan fael? \n(What are you staring at, human?)"
    sel "Man cenich na nin, adan fael? \n（你看什么看，人类？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7296
translate chinese story05_5_3_ac18607a_1:

    # "Critical threat detected!"
    "检测到致命威胁！"

# game/Story04.rpy:7298
translate chinese story05_5_3_e4fbcf4a:

    # mc "(Yong? That uniform—)"
    mc "（勇？那身制服——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7299
translate chinese story05_5_3_5a744a17:

    # mc "(What the hell is going on?)"
    mc "（到底他妈怎么回事？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7304
translate chinese story05_5_3_2ee0e7f0:

    # Go "I deeply apologize for this misunderstanding."
    Go "为这场误会，我深表歉意。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7305
translate chinese story05_5_3_ba1dacb0:

    # Go "Please, forgive my daughter’s foolishness."
    Go "请原谅我女儿的愚蠢。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7306
translate chinese story05_5_3_ff9037a4:

    # Go "And if possible… refrain from turning her head into liquid pulp."
    Go "如果可能的话……别把她的脑袋打成浆。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7308
translate chinese story05_5_3_2440bcca:

    # mc "If I did, I’d be next. Wouldn’t I?"
    mc "我要真动手，下一个就是我。对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7310
translate chinese story05_5_3_9f435aa8:

    # Go "I sincerely hope you do not force my hand."
    Go "我真心希望你别逼我出手。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7313
translate chinese story05_5_3_78397e5b:

    # mc "Call off your guards."
    mc "把你的卫兵撤了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7315
translate chinese story05_5_3_ac62e82c:

    # Go "Guarantees?"
    Go "保障呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7317
translate chinese story05_5_3_d32d54aa:

    # mc "My word."
    mc "我的承诺。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7318
translate chinese story05_5_3_d7a503c2:

    # mc "That’s how this works, right?"
    mc "规矩就是这么来的，对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7319
translate chinese story05_5_3_23ac7b1d_2:

    # Go "..."
    Go "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7325
translate chinese story05_5_3_d138d59c:

    # mc "(He… kept it. He actually kept his word.)"
    mc "（他……守了。他居然真守了承诺。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7326
translate chinese story05_5_3_a70ec36d:

    # mc "(I still don’t buy it. But what about her?)"
    mc "（我还是不信。可她呢？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7327
translate chinese story05_5_3_948ac64a:

    # mc "(That’s Selvaria. No doubt.)"
    mc "（那是塞尔瓦莉亚。毫无疑问。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7328
translate chinese story05_5_3_aafce43e:

    # mc "(If I kill her now—)"
    mc "（我现在要是杀了她——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7331
translate chinese story05_5_3_2409f674:

    # mc "(I die with her.)"
    mc "（我也得跟她一起死。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7332
translate chinese story05_5_3_628271fb:

    # mc "(Betray my principles, again.)"
    mc "（再次背弃我的原则。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7333
translate chinese story05_5_3_e14dfccf:

    # mc "(But save the galaxy.)"
    mc "（但能救这个星系。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7334
translate chinese story05_5_3_2b35b6fe_4:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7338
translate chinese story05_5_3_16411555:

    # mc "(No.)"
    mc "（不。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7339
translate chinese story05_5_3_e2f34032:

    # mc "(Too many variables.)"
    mc "（变数太多。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7342
translate chinese story05_5_3_30a02191:

    # mc "(I just hope this doesn’t become the decision I regret most.)"
    mc "（只希望这不会变成我最后悔的决定。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7348
translate chinese story05_5_3_0e0e781e:

    # sel "Ú-berio nin na dîn, adan dûr! \n(Don’t you dare touch me with your filthy hands, human.)"
    sel "Ú-berio nin na dîn, adan dûr! \n（你敢拿你的脏手碰我，人类。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7350
translate chinese story05_5_3_72c3456e:

    # mc "(Wait… I can understand her? The implant?)"
    mc "（等等……我能听懂她？植入体？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7351
translate chinese story05_5_3_31839c19:

    # keep3 "(Exactly.)"
    keep3 "（正是。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7352
translate chinese story05_5_3_bb93c944:

    # mc "Bold words… for someone who was face-down in the dirt a moment ago."
    mc "对一个刚才还趴在地上的人来说……这话挺横。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7354
translate chinese story05_5_3_392b8b1a:

    # sel "Mi maeth oen aen, er oen… \n(In a proper duel, one on one, I would—)"
    sel "Mi maeth oen aen, er oen… \n（要是堂堂正正单挑，我会——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7356
translate chinese story05_5_3_fb08e08b:

    # Go "(whispering) Ce i dhûr nîn veleg… \n(You are my undoing…)"
    Go "（低声）Ce i dhûr nîn veleg… \n（你真是我的克星……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7357
translate chinese story05_5_3_21bd4fae:

    # Go "Selv. Basta na i gwaith. \n(Selv. Enough.)"
    Go "Selv. Basta na i gwaith. \n（塞尔维。够了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7358
translate chinese story05_5_3_7622beb2:

    # Go "Ce dagor danna. \n(You lost. Accept it with dignity.)"
    Go "Ce dagor danna. \n（你输了。体面点接受。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7359
translate chinese story05_5_3_2945c7c6:

    # Go "Telio i chîr a bado ennas. \n(End this circus.)"
    Go "Telio i chîr a bado ennas. \n（结束这场闹剧。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7362
translate chinese story05_5_3_29a98ddc:

    # sel "I thûr lín a i nîf lín… \n(You and your precious principles…)"
    sel "I thûr lín a i nîf lín… \n（你和你那宝贵的原则……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7363
translate chinese story05_5_3_cd119f73:

    # sel "Bado hen na chen. \n(Keep them to yourself.)"
    sel "Bado hen na chen. \n（自己留着吧。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7365
translate chinese story05_5_3_708afbdb:

    # sel "(whispering) Sui nedhannen veleg… \n(How far we’ve fallen…)"
    sel "（低声）Sui nedhannen veleg… \n（我们竟堕落到这种地步……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7366
translate chinese story05_5_3_d006980d:

    # sel "(whispering) I hen cûr na adan bân. \n(That he bows this low before an ordinary mortal.)"
    sel "（低声）I hen cûr na adan bân. \n（他竟向一个普通凡人低到这种程度。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7367
translate chinese story05_5_3_23ac7b1d_3:

    # Go "..."
    Go "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7370
translate chinese story05_5_3_19d1f182:

    # Go "My apologies."
    Go "我道歉。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7371
translate chinese story05_5_3_774d8dd4:

    # Go "Would you kindly wait for me here?"
    Go "能否请你们在这儿等我？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7373
translate chinese story05_5_3_176945f2:

    # mc "Do we have a choice?"
    mc "我们有得选吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7375
translate chinese story05_5_3_8ba00a3d:

    # Go "No."
    Go "没有。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7379
translate chinese story05_5_3_2ee3e922:

    # Go "Had you agreed from the beginning… we might have avoided this awkwardness."
    Go "你要是从一开始就答应……我们本可以避免这场尴尬。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7382
translate chinese story05_5_3_099869e7:

    # "Few minutes later."
    "几分钟后。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7393
translate chinese story05_5_3_d9733396:

    # mc "(whispering) They’re afraid."
    mc "（低声）他们怕了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7394
translate chinese story05_5_3_f3b07c40:

    # mc "(And at the same time… curiosity’s winning.)"
    mc "（可同时……好奇心占了上风。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7397
translate chinese story05_5_3_4880bf9c:

    # keep3 "It always does with them."
    keep3 "他们总是这样。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7398
translate chinese story05_5_3_f5b6cea8:

    # keep3 "They’ve never been able to resist something new."
    keep3 "他们永远抗拒不了新鲜东西。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7404
translate chinese story05_5_3_e1231334:

    # mc "Like that elven scientist, hm?"
    mc "就像那个精灵科学家，是吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7405
translate chinese story05_5_3_0085e033_4:

    # keep3 "..."
    keep3 "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7406
translate chinese story05_5_3_1614dd6c:

    # keep3 "His sector wasn’t under my jurisdiction."
    keep3 "他那区不归我管。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7409
translate chinese story05_5_3_8298bb5c:

    # Go "Please. This way."
    Go "请。这边走。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7411
translate chinese story05_5_3_87590ff9:

    # "Elven Village."
    "精灵村庄。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7414
translate chinese story05_5_3_8d308d85:

    # mc "(Empty. Too empty.)"
    mc "（空。太空了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7415
translate chinese story05_5_3_7a6ee951:

    # mc "(And the smoke… thick. Bitter. Hard to breathe.)"
    mc "（还有那烟……很浓。很苦。很难呼吸。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7416
translate chinese story05_5_3_58f9b8f6:

    # mc "Forgive me. I can’t go any farther."
    mc "恕我直言。我不能再往前了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7418
translate chinese story05_5_3_9c5476d4:

    # Go "Is something… displeasing you?"
    Go "有什么……让你不快吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7419
translate chinese story05_5_3_6c664337:

    # mc "(I’ve gone too far from Kalestra. And if—)"
    mc "（我离卡莱斯特拉太远了。要是——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7421
translate chinese story05_5_3_52f997eb:

    # mc "I need to return."
    mc "我得回去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7422
translate chinese story05_5_3_fb57693e:

    # mc "I have to make sure she’s alright."
    mc "我得确认她没事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7423
translate chinese story05_5_3_f7a03355:

    # Go "Ah. Your companion."
    Go "啊。你的同伴。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7427
translate chinese story05_5_3_8ff7c669:

    # Go "My guards have already seen to her."
    Go "我的卫兵已经去照看她了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7428
translate chinese story05_5_3_95573fa3:

    # mc "What—"
    mc "什么——"

# game/Story04.rpy:7431
translate chinese story05_5_3_4d45f5f4:

    # Go "Do not concern yourself."
    Go "不必担心。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7432
translate chinese story05_5_3_48ff54a5:

    # Go "She is in relative safety."
    Go "她相对安全。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7433
translate chinese story05_5_3_55fcc115:

    # mc "I didn’t ask you to do that."
    mc "我没让你这么做。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7435
translate chinese story05_5_3_23ac7b1d_4:

    # Go "..."
    Go "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7438
translate chinese story05_5_3_7d3f9c6e:

    # Go "Please, do not misunderstand me."
    Go "请别误解我。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7439
translate chinese story05_5_3_37c588c2:

    # Go "A human child with a hole in her chest… filled with miasma."
    Go "一个胸口有洞的人类孩子……还满是瘴气。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7441
translate chinese story05_5_3_3571d02a:

    # Go "At best, that is poor etiquette."
    Go "往好了说，这是失礼。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7442
translate chinese story05_5_3_35412319:

    # Go "At worst… a declaration of war."
    Go "往坏了说……是宣战。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7443
translate chinese story05_5_3_b9b6052e:

    # Go "Anyone else in my position would have eliminated you on the spot."
    Go "换任何人在我的位置，都会当场除掉你们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7444
translate chinese story05_5_3_1aaa839d:

    # mc "(Third. Credibility?)"
    mc "（三号。可信度？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7445
translate chinese story05_5_3_24a9560f:

    # keep3 "(whispering) You saw what happened to the Federation."
    keep3 "（低声）你看到联邦的下场了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7446
translate chinese story05_5_3_c0794855:

    # keep3 "He’s not lying."
    keep3 "他没撒谎。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7449
translate chinese story05_5_3_641a2afc:

    # mc "(So what is this, then?)"
    mc "（那这算什么？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7450
translate chinese story05_5_3_cd969157:

    # mc "(We’re hostages?)"
    mc "（我们是人质？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7451
translate chinese story05_5_3_b20618a2:

    # keep3 "(whispering) No. You’re a curiosity."
    keep3 "（低声）不。你们是件稀罕物。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7452
translate chinese story05_5_3_7f11f745:

    # keep3 "His new toy."
    keep3 "他的新玩具。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7454
translate chinese story05_5_3_bea370c4:

    # mc "(Curiosity…?)"
    mc "（稀罕物……？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7455
translate chinese story05_5_3_9767e7a1:

    # keep3 "(whispering) Yes. Don’t give him everything."
    keep3 "（低声）对。别把什么都给他。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7456
translate chinese story05_5_3_f88b49b7:

    # keep3 "Mystery is leverage. It’s how we stay alive."
    keep3 "神秘就是筹码。我们就是靠这个活着。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7458
translate chinese story05_5_3_bc548899:

    # mc "So you’re saying… she’s safe?"
    mc "所以你是说……她安全？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7459
translate chinese story05_5_3_8e359492:

    # mc "Fine."
    mc "行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7462
translate chinese story05_5_3_1493af16:

    # Go "Thank you for your understanding."
    Go "谢谢你的理解。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7464
translate chinese story05_5_3_a6f34928:

    # mc "(I folded too quickly.)"
    mc "（我退得太快了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7465
translate chinese story05_5_3_48b759a6:

    # mc "(Hooked on his civility like an amateur.)"
    mc "（像个外行一样被他的礼貌钓住了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7466
translate chinese story05_5_3_30b7e44b:

    # keep3 "(whispering) Let that be your lesson."
    keep3 "（低声）就当上一课。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7484
translate chinese story05_5_4_08b8db12:

    # mc "(That feeling again.)"
    mc "（又是那种感觉。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7485
translate chinese story05_5_4_21511ef2:

    # mc "(Tight chest. Measured air.)"
    mc "（胸口发紧。空气有刻度。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7486
translate chinese story05_5_4_0448a427:

    # mc "(Like I’m back in Astoria’s office, being dissected without a blade.)"
    mc "（像回到阿斯托里亚的办公室，被不用刀地解剖。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7489
translate chinese story05_5_4_d5ed36e7:

    # Go "So."
    Go "那么。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7490
translate chinese story05_5_4_b4188e6b:

    # Go "Why did Astoria send her hounds to me?"
    Go "阿斯托里亚为什么把她的猎犬派到我这儿来？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7492
translate chinese story05_5_4_8756dfa3:

    # mc "How long have you known?"
    mc "你知道多久了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7498
translate chinese story05_5_4_71c6da09:

    # Go "Allow me to introduce myself properly."
    Go "容我正式自我介绍。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7499
translate chinese story05_5_4_5b4d5097:

    # Go "Goremilion Aeliren Taer-Sylv."
    Go "戈雷米利昂·艾雷伦·泰尔-希尔夫。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7505
translate chinese story05_5_4_b1008d83:

    # mc "The Elven Emperor himself. I assume."
    mc "精灵皇帝本人。我猜。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7509
translate chinese story05_5_4_23ac7b1d:

    # Go "..."
    Go "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7511
translate chinese story05_5_4_8ec059f7:

    # Go "Emperor…"
    Go "皇帝……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7512
translate chinese story05_5_4_cad9d0a9:

    # Go "Interesting choice of words."
    Go "这用词有意思。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7513
translate chinese story05_5_4_c75c2efd:

    # Go "You are the first to call me that."
    Go "你是第一个这么叫我的人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7515
translate chinese story05_5_4_5ddaab18:

    # mc "(What?)"
    mc "（什么？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7516
translate chinese story05_5_4_48fa5e63:

    # mc "(But Selvaria was called Empress. So either—)"
    mc "（可塞尔瓦莉亚被称作女皇。那要么——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7519
translate chinese story05_5_4_64ab9065:

    # keep3 "(whispering) Bad news."
    keep3 "（低声）坏消息。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7520
translate chinese story05_5_4_485e169d:

    # keep3 "(whispering) We’ve been thrown back 97 years."
    keep3 "（低声）我们被抛回了九十七年前。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7521
translate chinese story05_5_4_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7523
translate chinese story05_5_4_8df9b125:

    # Go "You are no ordinary young man."
    Go "你不是普通的年轻人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7529
translate chinese story05_5_4_a9e3f1f8:

    # Go "Especially your companion."
    Go "尤其是你的同伴。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7530
translate chinese story05_5_4_29e4fb56:

    # Go "The Third Keeper. Am I correct?"
    Go "三号守护者。我说得对吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7532
translate chinese story05_5_4_61abcb5d:

    # keep3 "I underestimated him."
    keep3 "我低估他了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7536
translate chinese story05_5_4_c163fab1:

    # mc "What exactly do you know about us?"
    mc "你到底知道我们多少？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7538
translate chinese story05_5_4_2673f802:

    # Go "Enough to let you live."
    Go "够我留你们活着。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7544
translate chinese story05_5_4_e4147bf7:

    # Go "In trying to save this girl… you attempted to go to the gate"
    Go "为了救这个姑娘……你们试图去那道门"

# game/Story04.rpy:7546
translate chinese story05_5_4_c2650d06:

    # Go "And failed."
    Go "然后失败了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7547
translate chinese story05_5_4_d2cb3ce4:

    # Go "Why?"
    Go "为什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7551
translate chinese story05_5_4_421d6327:

    # Go "Did something interfere."
    Go "是有东西干扰了吗。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7553
translate chinese story05_5_4_1d65c210:

    # Go "Or perhaps...someone."
    Go "又或者……是某个人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7559
translate chinese story05_5_4_f390ac3d:

    # mc "Astoria asked us to meet you."
    mc "阿斯托里亚让我们来找你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7560
translate chinese story05_5_4_9b7059bb:

    # mc "She said you could help."
    mc "她说你能帮忙。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7566
translate chinese story05_5_4_7178350e:

    # Go "I’m pleased we understand one another."
    Go "很高兴我们彼此理解。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7568
translate chinese story05_5_4_0932bce3:

    # mc "Tell me."
    mc "告诉我。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7569
translate chinese story05_5_4_5c7d12e0:

    # mc "Have you ever closed an activated Gate?"
    mc "你关掉过已经启动的门吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7571
translate chinese story05_5_4_e3ab25b2:

    # Go "What’s the catch?"
    Go "有什么条件？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7573
translate chinese story05_5_4_5fee6da8:

    # mc "Hypothetical."
    mc "假设而已。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7578
translate chinese story05_5_4_447e1a11:

    # Go "Yes."
    Go "关过。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7583
translate chinese story05_5_4_21924f07:

    # Go "I will ensure she survives."
    Go "我保证她活下来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7584
translate chinese story05_5_4_c559ab05:

    # Go "Nothing more."
    Go "仅此而已。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7585
translate chinese story05_5_4_42374e0e:

    # Go "Whether she remains the same hum—"
    Go "至于她是否还是原来那个——"

# game/Story04.rpy:7587
translate chinese story05_5_4_2ee86563:

    # mc "That’s enough."
    mc "够了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7591
translate chinese story05_5_4_59ccbc6b:

    # Go "Would you care for a walk?"
    Go "要不要走走？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7603
translate chinese story05_5_4_a706495c:

    # Go "By nature, we elves are… inquisitive."
    Go "我们精灵天性……好奇。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7604
translate chinese story05_5_4_f27a259a:

    # Go "We have always sought to understand how this world is constructed."
    Go "我们一直想弄懂这个世界是怎么构成的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7606
translate chinese story05_5_4_4840e6c1:

    # Go "And at times… that curiosity strayed beyond what was permitted."
    Go "而有时候……那份好奇心越过了允许的界线。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7610
translate chinese story05_5_4_36928135:

    # Mi "Proof that lines were crossed, mistakes made, and debts paid. Paid in blood."
    Mi "证明界线被越过、错误被犯下、债务被偿还。用血偿还。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7614
translate chinese story05_5_4_5c062fba:

    # Mi "The former leader of our faction, who..."
    Mi "我们派系的前任领袖，他……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7618
translate chinese story05_5_4_cef1b352:

    # mc "That scientist."
    mc "那个科学家。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7619
translate chinese story05_5_4_ac2acad2:

    # Go "Yes, my grandfather."
    Go "是，我祖父。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7622
translate chinese story05_5_4_6e50502e:

    # mc "What did he do… exactly?"
    mc "他到底……做了什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7627
translate chinese story05_5_4_7c8b819d:

    # Go "He attempted to access the Astreon System."
    Go "他试图接入阿斯特雷翁系统。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7630
translate chinese story05_5_4_59885c7a:

    # mc "(whispering) And… what is that?"
    mc "（低声）那……是什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7634
translate chinese story05_5_4_a05fa700:

    # Go "A tragedy."
    Go "一场悲剧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7637
translate chinese story05_5_4_530faaff:

    # Go "For our entire people."
    Go "对我们整个种族而言。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7638
translate chinese story05_5_4_853d9845:

    # Go "From that moment on… we became enemies of the galaxy."
    Go "从那一刻起……我们成了整个星系的敌人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7644
translate chinese story05_5_4_2876efd9:

    # mc "Why?"
    mc "为什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7648
translate chinese story05_5_4_b6441a88:

    # keep3 "There are rules in this galaxy."
    keep3 "这个星系有规矩。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7649
translate chinese story05_5_4_d64a83a5:

    # keep3 "Lines that are not to be crossed"
    keep3 "有些界线不能越"

# game/Story04.rpy:7651
translate chinese story05_5_4_fd929e92:

    # keep3 "One of them states: What has happened… must be paid for."
    keep3 "其中一条写着：已经发生的事……必须付出代价。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7653
translate chinese story05_5_4_0c8674d6:

    # keep3 "They broke that rule."
    keep3 "他们破了那条规矩。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7655
translate chinese story05_5_4_78d9297f:

    # keep3 "They went against time itself."
    keep3 "他们逆了时间本身。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7656
translate chinese story05_5_4_5470cd4a:

    # keep3 "And in return… all of us paid for their mistake."
    keep3 "换回来的……是我们所有人替他们的错误买单。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7660
translate chinese story05_5_4_15b3e468:

    # mc "None of us are without sin."
    mc "我们谁都不干净。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7661
translate chinese story05_5_4_0085e033:

    # keep3 "..."
    keep3 "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7667
translate chinese story05_5_4_474762be:

    # Go "What do you see?"
    Go "你看到了什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7670
translate chinese story05_5_4_9d61da8a:

    # mc "A Gate."
    mc "一道门。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7671
translate chinese story05_5_4_0ed99863:

    # Go "Days. Weeks. Years. Decades… Time kept moving."
    Go "日子。周。年。十年……时间一直在走。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7673
translate chinese story05_5_4_4d3c49ef:

    # Go "And with it… our curiosity grew."
    Go "而它也在滋长……我们的好奇心。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7680
translate chinese story05_5_4_479720ab:

    # Go "Long lives are a blessing. {w=0.7}And a curse."
    Go "长寿是福。{w=0.7}也是咒。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7681
translate chinese story05_5_4_671fb598:

    # Go "When you live long enough… meaning begins to rot."
    Go "活得够久……意义就开始腐烂。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7687
translate chinese story05_5_4_63f9db68:

    # Go "So many of us cling to research."
    Go "我们太多人抱着研究不放。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7688
translate chinese story05_5_4_51968a67:

    # Go "To discovery."
    Go "抱着发现。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7689
translate chinese story05_5_4_bb25eb4a:

    # Go "To prying open doors that should remain closed."
    Go "抱着去撬开那些本该关着的门。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7691
translate chinese story05_5_4_d56306e3:

    # Go "My grandfather was no exception."
    Go "我祖父也不例外。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7692
translate chinese story05_5_4_7993dfb4:

    # Go "He believed that uncovering the truth of the Gates would let us step beyond the limits of the possible."
    Go "他相信，揭开门的真相，能让我们跨出可能的边界。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7694
translate chinese story05_5_4_23ac7b1d_1:

    # Go "..."
    Go "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7696
translate chinese story05_5_4_0903fc81:

    # Go "What he didn’t know…"
    Go "他不知道的是……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7697
translate chinese story05_5_4_c96eee8a:

    # Go "Was about the price."
    Go "代价。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7699
translate chinese story05_5_4_c21e0a9c:

    # Go "None of us did."
    Go "我们谁都不知道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7700
translate chinese story05_5_4_a4fc24fd:

    # Go "So he activated the Gate."
    Go "于是他启动了门。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7703
translate chinese story05_5_4_2ef8f991:

    # Go "And time stopped."
    Go "时间停了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7707
translate chinese story05_5_4_e81e8b98:

    # Go "Not metaphorically."
    Go "不是比喻。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7708
translate chinese story05_5_4_104aa39f:

    # Go "Literally."
    Go "是字面意义上的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7710
translate chinese story05_5_4_cd2dd2fb:

    # Go "The world… froze."
    Go "世界……冻住了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7713
translate chinese story05_5_4_32f411d5:

    # Go "Like someone pressed pause."
    Go "像有人按下了暂停。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7718
translate chinese story05_5_4_41128b08:

    # Go "...and then."
    Go "……然后。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7722
translate chinese story05_5_4_26e832f7:

    # Go "In the next second…"
    Go "下一秒……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7724
translate chinese story05_5_4_4a6b467f:

    # Go "My father. My mother. My friends."
    Go "我父亲。我母亲。我的朋友。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7726
translate chinese story05_5_4_af8847a3:

    # Go "Gone."
    Go "没了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7728
translate chinese story05_5_4_1284fe28:

    # Go "(whispering) Vanished…"
    Go "（低声）消失了……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7729
translate chinese story05_5_4_cbdf1bb6:

    # Go "(whispering) Half of our race."
    Go "（低声）我们种族的一半。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7730
translate chinese story05_5_4_822d419a:

    # Go "(whispering) Half of galaxy."
    Go "（低声）半个星系。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7731
translate chinese story05_5_4_cb7eb722:

    # Go "(whispering) In a single heartbeat."
    Go "（低声）就在一次心跳之间。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7733
translate chinese story05_5_4_1890a173:

    # mc "How…?"
    mc "怎么……？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7734
translate chinese story05_5_4_756bb34d:

    # keep3 "Payment."
    keep3 "代价。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7735
translate chinese story05_5_4_42b74561:

    # keep3 "For power."
    keep3 "换力量的代价。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7739
translate chinese story05_5_4_b57a10de:

    # keep3 "We didn’t realize…"
    keep3 "我们没意识到……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7744
translate chinese story05_5_4_9eac7e46:

    # keep3 "The Gates were still tethered to the System."
    keep3 "那些门还连着系统。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7745
translate chinese story05_5_4_76588c2f:

    # keep3 "(That was our mistake.)"
    keep3 "（那是我们的错。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7750
translate chinese story05_5_4_0094ddb6:

    # Go "Answer me this."
    Go "回答我。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7751
translate chinese story05_5_4_87042096:

    # Go "Why is the blood of the Ancients required to activate a Gate?"
    Go "为什么启动门需要古人之血？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7753
translate chinese story05_5_4_81297b39:

    # mc "It’s the only viable energy source."
    mc "那是唯一可行的能量源。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7756
translate chinese story05_5_4_4388f0b9:

    # Go "Correct."
    Go "正确。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7757
translate chinese story05_5_4_0fdd036f:

    # Go "But why?"
    Go "但为什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7759
translate chinese story05_5_4_d94b413c:

    # Go "Because it consumes life."
    Go "因为它消耗生命。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7760
translate chinese story05_5_4_5bebf0d5:

    # Go "To spare your own."
    Go "来保住你自己的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7762
translate chinese story05_5_4_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7764
translate chinese story05_5_4_d8ed302e:

    # mc "Then answer me something."
    mc "那也回答我一件事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7765
translate chinese story05_5_4_38d7f3b3:

    # mc "If you had stood in his place…"
    mc "要是你站在他的位置……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7766
translate chinese story05_5_4_a2b68c64:

    # mc "Would you have chosen differently?"
    mc "你会做出不一样的选择吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7768
translate chinese story05_5_4_059e31ef:

    # Go "Knowing the whole truth?"
    Go "在知道全部真相的情况下？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7771
translate chinese story05_5_4_447e1a11_1:

    # Go "Yes."
    Go "会。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7772
translate chinese story05_5_4_e789ac9c:

    # Go "…Or at least, I would like to believe so."
    Go "……至少，我愿意这么相信。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7774
translate chinese story05_5_4_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7775
translate chinese story05_5_4_295112db:

    # mc "Even if the lives of those you love depended on it?"
    mc "哪怕你爱的人的命都系于此？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7776
translate chinese story05_5_4_95e5a45b:

    # Go "There are rules."
    Go "有规矩。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7780
translate chinese story05_5_4_07b93860:

    # mc "Rules are easy when you’re not the one losing someone."
    mc "不是你在失去人的时候，规矩当然好守。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7788
translate chinese story05_5_4_c80a81cf:

    # Go "So that is what this is about…"
    Go "所以这就是你们来的目的……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7790
translate chinese story05_5_4_c2930ae5:

    # mc "She wants her sister back."
    mc "她想把她妹妹弄回来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7792
translate chinese story05_5_4_479f068d:

    # Go "She knows the risks."
    Go "她知道风险。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7796
translate chinese story05_5_4_0c89a7cd:

    # am "Go. Find Gorem."
    am "去。找到戈雷姆。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7797
translate chinese story05_5_4_fe5b2af0:

    # am "I’ll handle the rest."
    am "剩下的我来处理。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7801
translate chinese story05_5_4_3b753126:

    # mc "I don’t think she understands them."
    mc "我觉得她并不懂这些。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7802
translate chinese story05_5_4_7f08e5f1:

    # mc "Not really."
    mc "并不真的懂。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7804
translate chinese story05_5_4_971fd8c0:

    # Go "Did she grow afraid of her own choices?"
    Go "她开始害怕自己的选择了吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7806
translate chinese story05_5_4_2034c056:

    # mc "Maybe."
    mc "也许吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7807
translate chinese story05_5_4_086f7e4e:

    # mc "Or maybe…"
    mc "或者也许……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7812
translate chinese story05_5_4_99d399b1:

    # L "Astoria and I are trying to choose the one..."
    L "阿斯托里亚和我在试着选那个……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7813
translate chinese story05_5_4_221faad5:

    # L "Where everyone keeps what matters to them."
    L "每个人都能留住自己珍视之物的结局。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7817
translate chinese story05_5_4_8114117d:

    # mc "There’s still something human left in her."
    mc "她身上还留着点人味。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7818
translate chinese story05_5_4_b887b7f4:

    # mc "(whispering) I hope so."
    mc "（低声）但愿如此。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7824
translate chinese story05_5_4_491f58a8:

    # elf "Aran nín, thang veleg dâf! \n(Your Highness, we have a problem!)"
    elf "Aran nín, thang veleg dâf! \n（殿下，我们有麻烦了！）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7825
translate chinese story05_5_4_7fe3f58c:

    # Go "Man danna? \n(What happened?)"
    Go "Man danna? \n（怎么了？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7826
translate chinese story05_5_4_22d705df:

    # elf "I sell, hi— \n(The girl, she—)"
    elf "I sell, hi— \n（那姑娘，她——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7844
translate chinese story05_5_4_efb9a313:

    # ketr "Ánin… ú-aníron baded… \n(Please… I don’t want to die…)"
    ketr "Ánin… ú-aníron baded… \n（求你……我不想死……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7845
translate chinese story05_5_4_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7852
translate chinese story05_5_4_baf2b1b9:

    # elf "An i lû i echant... \n(When she woke up...)"
    elf "An i lû i echant... \n（她醒来的时候……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7853
translate chinese story05_5_4_1a0f3305:

    # elf "Hîr i naur glam a dantha Ketrin na gîl. \n(She grabbed a shard of glass and immediately took Ketrin hostage.)"
    elf "Hîr i naur glam a dantha Ketrin na gîl. \n（她抓起一块玻璃碎片，立刻把凯特琳挟持了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7858
translate chinese story05_5_4_2316d835:

    # Go "Drego i peng. \n(Lower your weapons.)"
    Go "Drego i peng. \n（把武器放下。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7863
translate chinese story05_5_4_36ec17e3:

    # mc "Easy…"
    mc "别急……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7864
translate chinese story05_5_4_7def8fed:

    # mc "They’re not your enemy—"
    mc "他们不是你的敌人——"

# game/Story04.rpy:7877
translate chinese story05_5_4_ff444b16:

    # mc "Good-"
    mc "很好——"

# game/Story04.rpy:7880
translate chinese story05_5_4_9fe59d85:

    # k "You’re… alive."
    k "你……还活着。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7883
translate chinese story05_5_4_cf1adef2:

    # mc "Yeah."
    mc "嗯。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7884
translate chinese story05_5_4_21d60d8b:

    # mc "I am."
    mc "我活着。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7887
translate chinese story05_5_4_8883f279:

    # Go "Drego. \n(Leave us.)"
    Go "Drego. \n（退下。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7888
translate chinese story05_5_4_187294d2:

    # Go "A tiro na Ketrin. \n(And see to Ketrin.)"
    Go "A tiro na Ketrin. \n（去照看凯特琳。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7889
translate chinese story05_5_4_8a5d8422:

    # elf "Nae, Aran nín. \n(Yes, Your Highness.)"
    elf "Nae, Aran nín. \n（是，殿下。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7895
translate chinese story05_5_4_308776f5:

    # elf "(whispering) Losto. Ce danna maer. \n(It’ll pass. You did well. You held steady.)"
    elf "（低声）Losto. Ce danna maer. \n（会过去的。你做得很好。你稳住了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7897
translate chinese story05_5_4_2fa8f909:

    # Go "Maer gwaith. \n(Good work.)"
    Go "Maer gwaith. \n（干得好。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7898
translate chinese story05_5_4_15f8a1d5:

    # ketr "Mm…"
    ketr "嗯……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7900
translate chinese story05_5_4_5e72245c:

    # elf "Tol. \n(Come.)"
    elf "Tol. \n（走吧。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:7908
translate chinese story05_5_4_1984ad90:

    # Go "We’ll continue later."
    Go "我们之后再继续。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7912
translate chinese story05_5_4_099869e7:

    # "Few minutes later."
    "几分钟后。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7917
translate chinese story05_5_4_b97d5541:

    # mc "How do you feel?"
    mc "感觉怎么样？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7919
translate chinese story05_5_4_d5dcf025:

    # k "Well, I can joke."
    k "嗯，还能开玩笑。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7920
translate chinese story05_5_4_46db7444:

    # k "Brain’s a little scrambled though."
    k "不过脑子有点糊。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7921
translate chinese story05_5_4_96007ccf:

    # k "If it wasn’t for the hole in my chest, I’d say I’m fantastic."
    k "要不是胸口有个洞，我就说自己棒极了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7926
translate chinese story05_5_4_148ed410:

    # k "On the bright side…"
    k "往好处想……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7927
translate chinese story05_5_4_49b2ab41:

    # k "I’ve got one extra hole now."
    k "我现在多了一个洞。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7929
translate chinese story05_5_4_0054e596:

    # mc "You’re serious?"
    mc "你说真的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7935
translate chinese story05_5_4_701f9418:

    # k "Knew you’d love that one."
    k "就知道你会喜欢这个。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7939
translate chinese story05_5_4_c28b4c97:

    # mc "(whispering) You never change…"
    mc "（低声）你一点没变……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7941
translate chinese story05_5_4_e6f4db0e:

    # k "Oh, look at that face."
    k "哦，看看那张脸。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7942
translate chinese story05_5_4_65856b10:

    # k "All broody and tragic."
    k "又忧郁又悲情。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7943
translate chinese story05_5_4_079ff3b5:

    # k "Is that supposed to be charming?"
    k "你以为那样很迷人？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7945
translate chinese story05_5_4_3fae39b4:

    # mc "I didn’t say that."
    mc "我没那么说。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7948
translate chinese story05_5_4_ee2f0821:

    # k "(mocking his voice) Don’t die. I won’t let you die."
    k "（模仿他的声音）别死。我不让你死。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7949
translate chinese story05_5_4_77d8f3e9:

    # k "God, you should’ve seen your face."
    k "天哪，你真该看看你那张脸。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7952
translate chinese story05_5_4_2a3ae760:

    # k "What was that expression?"
    k "那表情算什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7953
translate chinese story05_5_4_f2bcf34e:

    # k "You looked like the world was ending."
    k "看着像世界末日。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7957
translate chinese story05_5_4_fbf854f4:

    # mc "Time was measured in seconds."
    mc "时间是按秒算的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7959
translate chinese story05_5_4_d3412f0b:

    # mc "Managing my emotions on top of that…"
    mc "还要在上面顾着我的情绪……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7960
translate chinese story05_5_4_4a4a9b87:

    # mc "Wasn’t exactly feasible."
    mc "不太现实。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7962
translate chinese story05_5_4_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:7972
translate chinese story05_5_4_bbfa73d3:

    # k "Hey… [mc]?"
    k "喂……[mc]？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7974
translate chinese story05_5_4_582359ea:

    # mc "Hm?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7976
translate chinese story05_5_4_2b922a7d:

    # k "Thanks."
    k "谢了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7982
translate chinese story05_5_4_ccc941be:

    # mc "You’re welcome."
    mc "不客气。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7985
translate chinese story05_5_4_4458056b:

    # k "Congratulations."
    k "恭喜。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7986
translate chinese story05_5_4_ae2a9e36:

    # k "You’ve secured third place."
    k "你拿下了第三名。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7987
translate chinese story05_5_4_7f67156e:

    # k "In the ranking of the most important people in my life."
    k "在我生命中重要人物排行榜上。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7989
translate chinese story05_5_4_5161cd10:

    # mc "I’m honored."
    mc "荣幸之至。"

# game/Story04.rpy:7990
translate chinese story05_5_4_efb5bf40:

    # mc "What’s the prize?"
    mc "奖品是什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:7997
translate chinese story05_5_4_406ca583:

    # k "Haven’t decided yet."
    k "还没定。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8001
translate chinese story05_5_4_c64803ba:

    # mc "Sorry I…"
    mc "对不起，我……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8002
translate chinese story05_5_4_ed70c4c2:

    # mc "Disfigured you—"
    mc "把你弄成这样——"

# game/Story04.rpy:8004
translate chinese story05_5_4_78df62db:

    # k "I like it."
    k "我喜欢。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8005
translate chinese story05_5_4_280915bd:

    # k "Makes me feel like I matter to someone."
    k "让我觉得自己对某个人来说很重要。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8006
translate chinese story05_5_4_43c1f242:

    # k "Like someone was actually afraid to lose me."
    k "像真有人怕失去我。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8011
translate chinese story05_5_4_278af78f:

    # k "(whispering) Where are we?"
    k "（低声）我们在哪儿？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8013
translate chinese story05_5_4_0ffe9dab:

    # mc "Still working on that."
    mc "还在查。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8014
translate chinese story05_5_4_d645cf27:

    # mc "There’s a strong chance we were thrown backward."
    mc "很可能我们被抛回去了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8015
translate chinese story05_5_4_1fecf7ef:

    # mc "In time."
    mc "时间上。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8017
translate chinese story05_5_4_26ee2b70:

    # k "(whispering) Wasn’t it a little early to trust them?"
    k "（低声）信他们是不是太早了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8019
translate chinese story05_5_4_08b08bf4:

    # mc "I wasn’t given much of a choice."
    mc "我也没多少选择。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8020
translate chinese story05_5_4_7477892d:

    # mc "But they haven’t shown aggression."
    mc "可他们没表现出敌意。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8022
translate chinese story05_5_4_61651870:

    # k "Which somehow makes it worse."
    k "而这不知怎么反而更糟。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8024
translate chinese story05_5_4_caf9ce28:

    # mc "They saved you."
    mc "他们救了你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8025
translate chinese story05_5_4_4ad6cc31:

    # mc "That earns them… a fraction of trust."
    mc "这给他们挣来……一点点信任。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8029
translate chinese story05_5_4_f8ba76d7:

    # k "Alright. If you say so."
    k "行。你这么说就这么算。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8030
translate chinese story05_5_4_66658c40:

    # k "Just… don’t lose your head over them."
    k "只是……别为他们昏了头。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8036
translate chinese story05_5_4_8e6cd7ac:

    # mc "Want to look around?"
    mc "想四处看看？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8038
translate chinese story05_5_4_b621322b:

    # k "Sure."
    k "行啊。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8039
translate chinese story05_5_4_1d6691e5:

    # k "But first, I need new clothes."
    k "不过先得换身衣服。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8041
translate chinese story05_5_4_2f85716f:

    # k "And a bath."
    k "再洗个澡。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8043
translate chinese story05_5_4_4484b017:

    # k "Want to check if I smell?"
    k "想闻闻我臭不臭？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8045
translate chinese story05_5_4_4f22aa68:

    # mc "I’ll pass."
    mc "算了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8054
translate chinese story05_5_4_6fd55b0d:

    # keep3 "These lands once shone brighter than stars."
    keep3 "这片土地曾比星辰更耀眼。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8055
translate chinese story05_5_4_7fe9aa84:

    # keep3 "Now it’s rubble and ghosts."
    keep3 "现在只剩瓦砾和鬼魂。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8056
translate chinese story05_5_4_2538b566:

    # keep3 "Looking at it… you start wondering."
    keep3 "看着它……你就开始想。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8057
translate chinese story05_5_4_2cc908df:

    # keep3 "What exactly are we living for?"
    keep3 "我们到底为什么活着？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8058
translate chinese story05_5_4_b851516e:

    # mc "Philosophy? I thought you preferred numbers and probability curves."
    mc "哲学？我以为你更喜欢数字和概率曲线。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8060
translate chinese story05_5_4_a77f82fb:

    # keep3 "Science answers ‘how.’ Philosophy asks why ‘how’ is possible at all."
    keep3 "科学回答“怎么”。哲学问的是，“怎么”为什么可能存在。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8061
translate chinese story05_5_4_b14ddca7:

    # mc "Mm."
    mc "嗯。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8063
translate chinese story05_5_4_e59fb131:

    # mc "And we’re still short on answers."
    mc "而我们还缺答案。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8065
translate chinese story05_5_4_0085e033_1:

    # keep3 "..."
    keep3 "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8066
translate chinese story05_5_4_8b0267d8:

    # keep3 "Knowing what you know now."
    keep3 "知道现在这些之后。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8067
translate chinese story05_5_4_f781bf88:

    # keep3 "Would you have chosen differently?"
    keep3 "你会做出不一样的选择吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8069
translate chinese story05_5_4_c9437d53:

    # mc "So it didn’t just get under Gorem’s skin."
    mc "所以这不只扎进了戈雷姆心里。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8070
translate chinese story05_5_4_85ba66cd:

    # mc "It got under yours too."
    mc "也扎进你心里了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8072
translate chinese story05_5_4_4cfbc93b:

    # keep3 "I require data."
    keep3 "我需要数据。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8073
translate chinese story05_5_4_c3036850:

    # keep3 "For protocol."
    keep3 "为了协议。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8075
translate chinese story05_5_4_f2d8d622:

    # mc "Would I chase after Lora again?"
    mc "我还会去追洛拉吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8076
translate chinese story05_5_4_823ad40a:

    # mc "Without hesitation."
    mc "毫不犹豫。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8077
translate chinese story05_5_4_2dce3ab0:

    # mc "But…"
    mc "但是……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8078
translate chinese story05_5_4_4fbd0e85:

    # mc "I would’ve left Olivia and Norman at home."
    mc "我会把奥利维亚和诺曼留在家里。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8079
translate chinese story05_5_4_b77e56b1:

    # mc "Dragging them into this…"
    mc "把他们拖进这事……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8080
translate chinese story05_5_4_fe6b3505:

    # mc "That was my mistake."
    mc "那是我的错。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8082
translate chinese story05_5_4_07570835:

    # keep3 "You would jeopardize the overall success rate."
    keep3 "你会危及整体成功率。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8083
translate chinese story05_5_4_ddd27e90:

    # keep3 "For two lives."
    keep3 "为了两条命。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8085
translate chinese story05_5_4_cbd56881:

    # keep3 "You truly are irrational."
    keep3 "你确实不理性。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8087
translate chinese story05_5_4_ca24eca6:

    # mc "Human."
    mc "是人类。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8088
translate chinese story05_5_4_17077d47:

    # mc "We’re built that way."
    mc "我们就是这么造的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8091
translate chinese story05_5_4_a0ecb67e:

    # k "Talking to that shady voice in your head again?"
    k "又在跟你脑子里那个阴沉的声音说话？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8092
translate chinese story05_5_4_0d2aa6a5:

    # mc "Helps me stay sane."
    mc "帮我保持清醒。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8095
translate chinese story05_5_4_aa60ab2c:

    # mc "Where did you get the clothes?"
    mc "你这衣服哪来的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8096
translate chinese story05_5_4_5cde6623:

    # k "The pointy-eared hospitality committee left me a few options."
    k "尖耳朵招待委员会给我留了几件。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8097
translate chinese story05_5_4_e7431764:

    # k "But enough about that."
    k "不过这个先不说了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8098
translate chinese story05_5_4_ba745ebe:

    # k "Well?"
    k "怎么样？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8101
translate chinese story05_5_4_a8749ff3:

    # mc "It suits you."
    mc "挺配你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8106
translate chinese story05_5_4_cf3000e2:

    # k "I’ll take that."
    k "这话我收下了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8107
translate chinese story05_5_4_b970f6ec:

    # k "Now."
    k "那么。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8108
translate chinese story05_5_4_d858f62d:

    # k "Let’s figure out how to get out of here."
    k "咱们想想怎么从这儿出去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8110
translate chinese story05_5_4_8809c596:

    # mc "Eager for another hole in your chest?"
    mc "急着胸口再开个洞？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8113
translate chinese story05_5_4_f110a669:

    # k "Oh, screw you."
    k "哦，去你的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8118
translate chinese story05_5_4_4b6206da:

    # k "(half-singing)"
    k "（半唱）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8119
translate chinese story05_5_4_075df0d9:

    # k "You know… I was thinking."
    k "你知道吗……我刚在想。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8120
translate chinese story05_5_4_9ca77993:

    # k "What about our little runaways?"
    k "咱们那几个小家伙怎么样了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8121
translate chinese story05_5_4_deb9a320:

    # mc "No idea."
    mc "不知道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8122
translate chinese story05_5_4_ec487437:

    # mc "But I’d like to believe they’re still breathing."
    mc "但我愿意相信他们还喘着气。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8123
translate chinese story05_5_4_6f413137:

    # k "That’s the spirit."
    k "这心态就对了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8125
translate chinese story05_5_4_4d1cdddc:

    # k "But one thing’s bothering me."
    k "但有件事让我心里不舒服。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8126
translate chinese story05_5_4_6687f943:

    # k "Why didn’t Selvaria finish you?"
    k "塞尔瓦莉亚为什么没把你解决掉？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8127
translate chinese story05_5_4_d440cdaf:

    # k "You’re not exactly a legendary hero."
    k "你可不是什么传奇英雄。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8128
translate chinese story05_5_4_daa7a4c8:

    # mc "Astoria intervened."
    mc "阿斯托里亚插手了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8130
translate chinese story05_5_4_c59b958e:

    # k "The young Lady, I understood."
    k "那位年轻夫人，我懂。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8131
translate chinese story05_5_4_38df819a:

    # k "We were… aligned."
    k "我们……利益一致。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8133
translate chinese story05_5_4_482fec83:

    # k "But the Lady?"
    k "可那位夫人呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8134
translate chinese story05_5_4_f60ead9c:

    # k "Her motives were always a riddle to me."
    k "她的动机对我来说一直是个谜。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8137
translate chinese story05_5_4_1b95d582:

    # k "I still don’t get why she didn’t deal with that blonde."
    k "我还是搞不懂她为什么没收拾那个金发妞。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8138
translate chinese story05_5_4_4b9a4c0d:

    # mc "Since when does a member of the Inquisition question her superiors?"
    mc "审判庭的人什么时候开始质疑上级了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8140
translate chinese story05_5_4_31e9f8f4:

    # k "Ah."
    k "啊。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8141
translate chinese story05_5_4_e56591ad:

    # k "I’ve been suspended from the Inquisition."
    k "我被审判庭停职了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8144
translate chinese story05_5_4_9855b7e4:

    # mc "Wait. What?"
    mc "等等。什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8145
translate chinese story05_5_4_d9426b9f:

    # k "Oh. I didn’t mean—"
    k "哦。我不是那个意思——"

# game/Story04.rpy:8148
translate chinese story05_5_4_82091822_1:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8152
translate chinese story05_5_4_3dc0a602:

    # k "That was Miriel."
    k "那是米莉尔。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8153
translate chinese story05_5_4_8a5e85c5:

    # k "Wasn’t it?"
    k "对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8155
translate chinese story05_5_4_3876fc4c:

    # mc "No doubt."
    mc "毫无疑问。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8159
translate chinese story05_5_4_52fa8a48:

    # mc "After her."
    mc "跟上去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8173
translate chinese story05_5_4_af5eede9:

    # mc "What did you mean… by distancing?"
    mc "你说的……保持距离是什么意思？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8174
translate chinese story05_5_4_2b1456e4:

    # k "Hm?"
    k "嗯？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8175
translate chinese story05_5_4_09527ab7:

    # k "Oh. You mean the Inquisition."
    k "哦。你说审判庭。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8178
translate chinese story05_5_4_bc453ae0:

    # k "Because of this."
    k "因为这个。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8179
translate chinese story05_5_4_bdd642d7:

    # k "The moment you shoved that thing into my body…"
    k "你把那东西塞进我身体的那一刻……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8180
translate chinese story05_5_4_275ff51f:

    # k "You made me a problem."
    k "你就把我变成了个问题。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8183
translate chinese story05_5_4_91905ede:

    # mc "How?"
    mc "怎么说？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8184
translate chinese story05_5_4_813ef984:

    # k "Miasma’s outlawed."
    k "瘴气是违禁的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8187
translate chinese story05_5_4_fdec641e:

    # k "If we go back, they’ll drag me in for purification."
    k "我们要是回去，他们会把我拖去净化。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8188
translate chinese story05_5_4_ed6c3a62:

    # k "And if they can’t carve it out…"
    k "要是他们挖不出来……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8189
translate chinese story05_5_4_f10a0af3:

    # k "Execution."
    k "处决。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8190
translate chinese story05_5_4_2b35b6fe_4:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8193
translate chinese story05_5_4_0f73b5cc:

    # k "Relax. I’m not blaming you."
    k "放松。我没怪你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8194
translate chinese story05_5_4_c950acc5:

    # k "You did save my life."
    k "你确实救了我的命。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8195
translate chinese story05_5_4_cfa598da:

    # k "(whispering) So now take responsibility for it."
    k "（低声）所以现在，给我负起责任来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8197
translate chinese story05_5_4_dac16979:

    # mc "I will."
    mc "我会的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8202
translate chinese story05_5_4_f2f3c2f3:

    # mc "Details later."
    mc "细节回头再说。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8222
translate chinese story05_5_4_e68df2ef:

    # Mi "Man aníroch? \n(What do you want?)"
    Mi "Man aníroch? \n（你想干什么？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8225
translate chinese story05_5_4_8fd672ae:

    # "Analysis complete: Elvish. Simplified dialect."
    "分析完成：精灵语。简化方言。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8226
translate chinese story05_5_4_67cf9ebc:

    # mc "(Third… can the implant translate my words?)"
    mc "（三号……植入体能翻译我的话吗？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8227
translate chinese story05_5_4_9db7ead1:

    # keep3 "(It’s not a magic wand. Don’t get greedy.)"
    keep3 "（它不是魔杖。别贪心。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8230
translate chinese story05_5_4_4f27312a:

    # mc "We come in peace."
    mc "我们是带着和平来的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8231
translate chinese story05_5_4_da3fdbf1:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8234
translate chinese story05_5_4_712d9664:

    # k "Ahem."
    k "咳。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8236
translate chinese story05_5_4_49359011:

    # k "Pedir ú-dagorim. \n(He says we’re not here to fight.)"
    k "Pedir ú-dagorim. \n（他说我们不是来打架的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8239
translate chinese story05_5_4_75c6b401:

    # mc "(whispering) Since when do you speak Elvish?"
    mc "（低声）你什么时候会说精灵语了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8241
translate chinese story05_5_4_eace616c:

    # k "(whispering) Remember my sister? Half-elf. She taught me."
    k "（低声）记得我妹妹吗？半精灵。她教我的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8243
translate chinese story05_5_4_4b570606:

    # Mi "Tolen o i fuin a i dúath? \n(Following footprints from the shadows?)"
    Mi "Tolen o i fuin a i dúath? \n（从影子里循着脚印来的？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8245
translate chinese story05_5_4_ae8e8bf3:

    # k "Ú-tholin o i fuin. \n(From the shadows? We weren’t hiding.)"
    k "Ú-tholin o i fuin. \n（从影子里？我们可没躲。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8246
translate chinese story05_5_4_524ef6b3:

    # k "Ach… no adab, penged nîn. \n(But… call it habit, pointy-ears.)"
    k "Ach… no adab, penged nîn. \n（不过……就当是习惯吧，尖耳朵。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8248
translate chinese story05_5_4_0c07b483:

    # Mi "Penged… \n(Pointy-ears…)"
    Mi "Penged… \n（尖耳朵……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8249
translate chinese story05_5_4_a3d5ef70:

    # Mi "Manen istach i lam nîn? \n(How do you know our language?)"
    Mi "Manen istach i lam nîn? \n（你怎么会我们的语言？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8251
translate chinese story05_5_4_b54ea135:

    # k "Ú. Si i lû nín peded. Sui bain, ú? \n(No. Our turn now. Fair’s fair, right?)"
    k "Ú. Si i lû nín peded. Sui bain, ú? \n（不。现在轮到我们问了。公平点，对吧？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8253
translate chinese story05_5_4_2f52be8e:

    # mc "(She looks the same.)"
    mc "（她看着一样。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8254
translate chinese story05_5_4_b2640de5:

    # mc "(Moves the same.)"
    mc "（动作一样。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8255
translate chinese story05_5_4_4ada4453:

    # mc "(Still… I need to be sure.)"
    mc "（不过……我得确认。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8257
translate chinese story05_5_4_c579099c:

    # mc "Your name is Miriel. Isn’t it?"
    mc "你叫米莉尔。对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8259
translate chinese story05_5_4_a4d8b0b9:

    # k "Miriel. Ce i hên hen? \n(Miriel. That you?)"
    k "Miriel. Ce i hên hen? \n（米莉尔。是你？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8261
translate chinese story05_5_4_da3fdbf1_1:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8265
translate chinese story05_5_4_845fdaca:

    # "Miriel memory"
    "米莉尔的记忆"

# game/Story04.rpy:8266
translate chinese story05_5_4_36d01e74:

    # mc "You’re carrying too much on your shoulders, Mi…"
    mc "你肩上扛得太多了，米……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8269
translate chinese story05_5_4_f775c72c:

    # Mi "(What just happened…?)"
    Mi "（刚才怎么了……？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8274
translate chinese story05_5_4_685c0bdb:

    # Mi "Nae. \n(Yes.)"
    Mi "Nae. \n（是。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8276
translate chinese story05_5_4_3f2d2c9e:

    # Mi "Pedin adlant. \n(I’ll ask again.)"
    Mi "Pedin adlant. \n（我再问一遍。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8277
translate chinese story05_5_4_16004a4c:

    # Mi "Man aníroch o nin si? \n(What do you want?)"
    Mi "Man aníroch o nin si? \n（你到底想干什么？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8280
translate chinese story05_5_4_2e1bc89c:

    # mc "(We ran into her.)"
    mc "（我们撞上她了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8281
translate chinese story05_5_4_08fbbb29:

    # mc "(Now what?)"
    mc "（现在怎么办？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8282
translate chinese story05_5_4_55959286:

    # mc "(Ninety-seven years between us.)"
    mc "（我们之间隔着九十七年。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8283
translate chinese story05_5_4_3af0a16a:

    # mc "(Of course she wouldn’t know me yet.)"
    mc "（她当然还不认识我。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8285
translate chinese story05_5_4_dcc5459e:

    # mc "We need to talk."
    mc "我们得谈谈。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8286
translate chinese story05_5_4_ec549066:

    # k "Ped- \n(He sa-)"
    k "Ped- \n（他说——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8291
translate chinese story05_5_4_7dc94aa8:

    # Mi "You."
    Mi "你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8292
translate chinese story05_5_4_aa311760:

    # Mi "Speak."
    Mi "说。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8296
translate chinese story05_5_4_2b35b6fe_5:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8298
translate chinese story05_5_4_63b2cd6d:

    # mc "We’re looking for information."
    mc "我们在找情报。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8300
translate chinese story05_5_4_df5de595:

    # Mi "About what?"
    Mi "关于什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8302
translate chinese story05_5_4_ffcc0ce2:

    # mc "About this world."
    mc "关于这个世界。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8304
translate chinese story05_5_4_132b39c2:

    # Mi "Why me?"
    Mi "为什么找我？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8306
translate chinese story05_5_4_9a6e4349:

    # mc "A man I know, Yong."
    mc "我认识的一个人，勇。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8307
translate chinese story05_5_4_8f759c24:

    # mc "He said you’re the best."
    mc "他说你是最厉害的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8308
translate chinese story05_5_4_64e62ee2:

    # mc "(He says it ninety-seven years from now.)"
    mc "（他是九十七年后这么说的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8309
translate chinese story05_5_4_a4e60b24:

    # mc "(Close enough.)"
    mc "（也够用了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8315
translate chinese story05_5_4_ab5edf8f:

    # mc "And the only one here I can trust."
    mc "也是这儿我唯一能信的人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8321
translate chinese story05_5_4_0196b91b:

    # mc "(whispering) Even if you’re not her yet."
    mc "（低声）哪怕你还没成为她。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8324
translate chinese story05_5_4_97c8384e:

    # mc "And—"
    mc "而且——"

# game/Story04.rpy:8325
translate chinese story05_5_4_5cd254be:

    # k "(whispering) Hey, old man."
    k "（低声）喂，老头。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8326
translate chinese story05_5_4_4ad54061:

    # k "(whispering) We’re surrounded."
    k "（低声）我们被包围了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8328
translate chinese story05_5_4_403f5106:

    # mc "(whispering) I know."
    mc "（低声）我知道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8332
translate chinese story05_5_4_28239c24:

    # "[mc] memory"
    "[mc] 的记忆"

# game/Story04.rpy:8333
translate chinese story05_5_4_d621aecf:

    # Mi "Home..."
    Mi "家……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8335
translate chinese story05_5_4_c4b0a434:

    # Mi "What makes a place… {w=0.5}a real home?"
    Mi "是什么让一个地方……{w=0.5}成为真正的家？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8336
translate chinese story05_5_4_a90a3cd5:

    # Mi "For me… {w=0.5}it’s the people."
    Mi "对我来说……{w=0.5}是人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8339
translate chinese story05_5_4_4adfd366:

    # mc "(She knew exactly where she was leading us…)"
    mc "（她清楚自己在把我们往哪儿带……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8340
translate chinese story05_5_4_9ef3f1c8:

    # mc "(And still brought us here.)"
    mc "（可还是把我们带到了这儿。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8341
translate chinese story05_5_4_71a1aa73:

    # mc "(To protect herself?)"
    mc "（为了护住自己？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8342
translate chinese story05_5_4_2ae6d035:

    # mc "(Or to show us something?)"
    mc "（还是想让我们看点东西？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8349
translate chinese story05_5_4_3f0e7473:

    # elf " Telin o i gwaith hen \n(I’m done with this.)"
    elf " Telin o i gwaith hen \n（我受够了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8350
translate chinese story05_5_4_51563440:

    # elf "Aeg tolach, a badach. \n(Make one move and you’re dead.)"
    elf "Aeg tolach, a badach. \n（敢动一下就死。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8352
translate chinese story05_5_4_84bd6e95:

    # mc "(I see.)"
    mc "（明白了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8353
translate chinese story05_5_4_4b2510e0:

    # mc "(Until we earn the others’ trust, she won’t help us.)"
    mc "（在赢得其他人信任之前，她不会帮我们。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8355
translate chinese story05_5_4_023926d9:

    # mc "(That’s what you’re meaning, isn’t it?)"
    mc "（你就是这个意思，对吧？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8357
translate chinese story05_5_4_29078282:

    # k "(whispering) Her eyes. I’ll handle it."
    k "（低声）她的眼神。我来处理。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8358
translate chinese story05_5_4_7952489c:

    # mc "(whispering) Don’t do anything stupid."
    mc "（低声）别干蠢事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8361
translate chinese story05_5_4_b5fab7d4:

    # k "(whispering) She’s scared. Her eyes keep darting."
    k "（低声）她怕了。眼睛一直乱瞟。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8362
translate chinese story05_5_4_44a0980b:

    # k "(whispering) She’s never killed before."
    k "（低声）她从没杀过人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8363
translate chinese story05_5_4_fe6a4d7b:

    # k "(whispering) I’m sure she won’t sh—"
    k "（低声）我肯定她不会开——"

# game/Story04.rpy:8368
translate chinese story05_5_4_2b35b6fe_6:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8370
translate chinese story05_5_4_542ee3b6:

    # mc "(whispering) They’re serious."
    mc "（低声）他们是认真的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8372
translate chinese story05_5_4_b3320f9f:

    # mc "(whispering) Don’t provoke them."
    mc "（低声）别激他们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8373
translate chinese story05_5_4_904cb755:

    # mc "(whispering) We need trust. Not blood."
    mc "（低声）我们需要信任。不是血。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8377
translate chinese story05_5_4_ddc2b89f:

    # k "(whispering) You saved my life once."
    k "（低声）你救过我一命。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8378
translate chinese story05_5_4_13d9a680:

    # k "(whispering) Let’s see if luck still favors us."
    k "（低声）看看运气还站不站我们这边。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8380
translate chinese story05_5_4_3864dbfa:

    # Mi "You seem to know me."
    Mi "你好像认识我。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8381
translate chinese story05_5_4_f8ec9ee4:

    # Mi "But I know nothing about you."
    Mi "可我对你一无所知。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8386
translate chinese story05_5_4_d991959c:

    # Mi "And though I am curious where you came from…"
    Mi "虽然我很好奇你从哪儿来……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8392
translate chinese story05_5_4_ae8d4a96:

    # Mi "Please… leave."
    Mi "求你……走吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8396
translate chinese story05_5_4_1368b423:

    # k "So… what now?"
    k "那……现在怎么办？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8397
translate chinese story05_5_4_9706ca1d:

    # k "Didn’t see that coming."
    k "没想到会这样。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8399
translate chinese story05_5_4_d0f89ddf:

    # mc "(Hidden from prying eyes.)"
    mc "（躲开窥探的视线。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8400
translate chinese story05_5_4_7d8f710f:

    # mc "(Miriel looks like she walked out of a court… the others?)"
    mc "（米莉尔看着像从宫廷里走出来的……其他人呢？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8401
translate chinese story05_5_4_2143e7b4:

    # mc "(Like they were dragged in off the street.)"
    mc "（像是从街上硬拽进来的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8403
translate chinese story05_5_4_66e49efd:

    # mc "(And the implants…)"
    mc "（还有植入体……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8404
translate chinese story05_5_4_15bd71f7:

    # mc "(Third?)"
    mc "（三号？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8406
translate chinese story05_5_4_a4c0af6a:

    # keep3 "(They’re outcasts.)"
    keep3 "（他们是弃民。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8407
translate chinese story05_5_4_6eede90d:

    # keep3 "(Even among their own, they find no shelter.)"
    keep3 "（连在自己人当中，他们也找不到庇护。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8409
translate chinese story05_5_4_292eaef1:

    # mc "Outcasts, right?"
    mc "弃民，对吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8411
translate chinese story05_5_4_230a290e:

    # mc "Give us what we need to know and I’ll make things better for you."
    mc "把我们需要知道的告诉我们，我帮你们改善处境。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8413
translate chinese story05_5_4_ef8e26c5:

    # Mi "You—"
    Mi "你——"

# game/Story04.rpy:8423
translate chinese story05_5_4_1999c281:

    # Mi "No. Please. Just leave us."
    Mi "不。求你。走吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8425
translate chinese story05_5_4_a3486790:

    # k "(whispering) Well… that went down in flames."
    k "（低声）好吧……彻底谈崩了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8428
translate chinese story05_5_4_91eea5b2:

    # mc "(Whispering) You think so?"
    mc "（低声）你这么觉得？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8429
translate chinese story05_5_4_0c6057bd:

    # mc "(Whispering) I’d say the opposite."
    mc "（低声）我倒觉得正相反。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8431
translate chinese story05_5_4_3daefa13:

    # mc "(Whispering) The seed’s been planted."
    mc "（低声）种子已经埋下了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8434
translate chinese story05_5_4_746f8eae:

    # mc "(Now we wait.)"
    mc "（现在等着就行。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8449
translate chinese story05_5_5_2bf5d17e:

    # mc "Kali?"
    mc "卡莉？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8450
translate chinese story05_5_5_2b1456e4:

    # k "Hm?"
    k "嗯？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8452
translate chinese story05_5_5_3a1c2bf0:

    # mc "Where does this hatred of implants come from?"
    mc "对植入体这种恨，是从哪儿来的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8453
translate chinese story05_5_5_39ce06d0:

    # k "Hatred? Pfft…"
    k "恨？噗……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8454
translate chinese story05_5_5_89376ecc:

    # k "They don’t just dislike them."
    k "他们不只是不喜欢。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8455
translate chinese story05_5_5_11be089f:

    # k "They despise them. Down to the marrow."
    k "他们恨之入骨。恨到骨髓里。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8456
translate chinese story05_5_5_d7640d3a:

    # mc "And yet… they still use them."
    mc "可……他们还是在用。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8459
translate chinese story05_5_5_312e5d02:

    # k "Not all of them. Not even close."
    k "不是所有人。差得远。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8460
translate chinese story05_5_5_6d357138:

    # k "And the ones who do? It’s not because life’s been kind to them, old man."
    k "至于用的人？那可不是因为日子待他们好，老头。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8461
translate chinese story05_5_5_e8c8de34:

    # k "Speaking of which… what was that little performance with Miriel about?"
    k "说到这个……你跟米莉尔那出戏是什么意思？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8464
translate chinese story05_5_5_8b3a6836:

    # mc "(Whispering) Because of Gorem."
    mc "（低声）因为戈雷姆。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8465
translate chinese story05_5_5_a527bca6:

    # mc "(Whispering) When the head of the Federation lets you walk away without a real reason."
    mc "（低声）联邦的头儿没个正当理由就放你走。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8466
translate chinese story05_5_5_e92db08e:

    # mc "(Whispering) That’s never a good sign."
    mc "（低声）这从来不是什么好兆头。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8469
translate chinese story05_5_5_fbcf1332:

    # mc "(Whispering) Which means we need allies. Just in case."
    mc "（低声）也就是说我们需要盟友。以防万一。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8470
translate chinese story05_5_5_64b3ecf8:

    # mc "(Whispering) Even if it’s a pair of elven outcasts."
    mc "（低声）哪怕只是两个精灵弃民。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8477
translate chinese story05_5_5_ddf666d8:

    # k "…Yeah. Can’t argue with that."
    k "……嗯。这我没法反驳。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8482
translate chinese story05_5_5_f2901155:

    # k "Still, you know elves are officially classified as a strategic resource, right?"
    k "不过，你知道精灵在官方上被归类为战略资源吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8485
translate chinese story05_5_5_873f05bf:

    # mc "Strategic?"
    mc "战略资源？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8488
translate chinese story05_5_5_c93cf25d:

    # k "Most Federation worlds can’t grow food."
    k "联邦大多数星球都种不出粮食。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8489
translate chinese story05_5_5_cdeb5ad7:

    # k "And without food… well."
    k "没有粮食……嗯。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8490
translate chinese story05_5_5_be68dfeb:

    # k "You can guess the rest."
    k "剩下的你自己猜。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8493
translate chinese story05_5_5_41aedae2:

    # k "That’s where the elves come in. Their sensitivity."
    k "精灵就派上用场了。他们那份敏感。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8494
translate chinese story05_5_5_9089c6f0:

    # k "You’ve noticed all the green here, haven’t you?"
    k "你注意到这儿满眼的绿色了吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8495
translate chinese story05_5_5_976953f4:

    # k "Now tell me… when was the last time you saw a living tree in the Federation?"
    k "那告诉我……你上次在联邦看见活着的树是什么时候？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8497
translate chinese story05_5_5_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8498
translate chinese story05_5_5_36e583dd:

    # k "Exactly."
    k "正是如此。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8500
translate chinese story05_5_5_0c5c9c12:

    # mc "And what does that have to do with implants?"
    mc "那跟植入体有什么关系？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8501
translate chinese story05_5_5_9d37cafd:

    # k "No idea why some of them still use them."
    k "我不知道为什么有些精灵还在用。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8502
translate chinese story05_5_5_e9ddf8c8:

    # k "But I do know this—"
    k "但我知道这一点——"

# game/Story04.rpy:8503
translate chinese story05_5_5_086bb9b6:

    # k "Implants sever their bond with nature."
    k "植入体会切断他们与自然的联系。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8506
translate chinese story05_5_5_59c09b45:

    # k "And for an elf…"
    k "而对精灵来说……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8507
translate chinese story05_5_5_cebf17f8:

    # k "That’s worse than dea—"
    k "那比死还——"

# game/Story04.rpy:8511
translate chinese story05_5_5_80efaf01:

    # elf "Tírad vaeth a danna am dâd adan amarth. \n(We received a report about two suspicious individuals.)"
    elf "Tírad vaeth a danna am dâd adan amarth. \n（我们收到报告，说有两个可疑人物。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8512
translate chinese story05_5_5_f6f584a8:

    # elf "Pedith istath lín. Si, aníron hen. \n(Identification. Now.)"
    elf "Pedith istath lín. Si, aníron hen. \n（出示身份证明。现在。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8513
translate chinese story05_5_5_71336381:

    # k "A man ce i thain hen? \n(And who exactly are you supposed to be?)"
    k "A man ce i thain hen? \n（你又是谁？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8516
translate chinese story05_5_5_68f28604:

    # elf "Istath lín, si. \n(Identification.)"
    elf "Istath lín, si. \n（身份证明。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8517
translate chinese story05_5_5_7dfc07d2:

    # "Analysis complete: F.E.B. operatives."
    "分析完成：F.E.B. 特工。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8521
translate chinese story05_5_5_841e0fd0:

    # elf "Thathar i gwaith naneth! \n(Implant signatures detected!)"
    elf "Thathar i gwaith naneth! \n（检测到植入体信号！）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8522
translate chinese story05_5_5_dbd63f7b:

    # elf "Peng aen! \n(Arm up!)"
    elf "Peng aen! \n（把胳膊抬起来！）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8523
translate chinese story05_5_5_883d3188:

    # k "(whispering) …So. What’s the play?"
    k "（低声）……那。怎么办？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8531
translate chinese story05_5_5_85949dc8:

    # k "Hey, [mc]…"
    k "喂，[mc]……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8532
translate chinese story05_5_5_abb302d7:

    # k "Don’t hate me for this."
    k "别因为这个恨我。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8534
translate chinese story05_5_5_94654d90:

    # mc "Don’t you—"
    mc "你敢——"

# game/Story04.rpy:8549
translate chinese story05_5_5_37b1bc88:

    # k "What the—"
    k "搞什么——"

# game/Story04.rpy:8557
translate chinese story05_5_5_78ede22b:

    # mc "What exactly were you thinking?"
    mc "你到底在想什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8558
translate chinese story05_5_5_85f566f0:

    # k "She was half a breath away from pulling the trigger."
    k "她差半口气就扣扳机了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8560
translate chinese story05_5_5_c373623a:

    # mc "They’re just doing their job."
    mc "他们只是在尽本分。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8566
translate chinese story05_5_5_35ea046d:

    # mc "Gather their weapons, and-"
    mc "把他们的武器收起来，然后——"

# game/Story04.rpy:8567
translate chinese story05_5_5_642ae1a4:

    # mc "Tell them we’ll go with them."
    mc "告诉他们，我们跟他们走。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8568
translate chinese story05_5_5_b5af1f0d:

    # mc "Peacefully."
    mc "和平地。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8569
translate chinese story05_5_5_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8571
translate chinese story05_5_5_e9a62916:

    # k "Tolith nin na i hîr lín. \n(Take us to your superior.)"
    k "Tolith nin na i hîr lín. \n（带我们去见你们的长官。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8572
translate chinese story05_5_5_921b303b:

    # k "Ú-beriam. \n(We won’t resist.)"
    k "Ú-beriam. \n（我们不反抗。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8576
translate chinese story05_5_5_66711922:

    # mc "(This draws too much attention.)"
    mc "（这太惹眼了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8582
translate chinese story05_5_5_42ce8dfc:

    # mc "(A misstep. I should’ve anticipated this.)"
    mc "（失策了。我本该料到。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8583
translate chinese story05_5_5_a5f43748:

    # elf "I peng nîn? \n(Our weapons?)"
    elf "I peng nîn? \n（我们的武器呢？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8585
translate chinese story05_5_5_5fa60d7b:

    # k "A no dan i dagor nin a chen? Ú. \n(So you can shoot us with them? Please.)"
    k "A no dan i dagor nin a chen? Ú. \n（好让你们拿它们打我们？得了吧。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8586
translate chinese story05_5_5_d7a01f1b:

    # k "Istach gohestel? \n(Ever heard of guarantees?)"
    k "Istach gohestel? \n（听说过保障这回事吗？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8587
translate chinese story05_5_5_f08ac95a:

    # k "Hey, old man. What about the guns?"
    k "喂，老头。枪怎么办？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8590
translate chinese story05_5_5_5eee972f:

    # mc "Keep it. We’ll sort it out later."
    mc "留着。之后再处理。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8592
translate chinese story05_5_5_ff65f64a:

    # mc "(We need to leave.)"
    mc "（我们得离开。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8594
translate chinese story05_5_5_7b2b35e9:

    # mc "(And fast.)"
    mc "（而且要快。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8609
translate chinese story05_5_5_f7ef8cf9:

    # "A couple of minutes later. Police station."
    "几分钟后。警察局。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8614
translate chinese story05_5_5_0ff99894:

    # mc "(Fourteen minutes. They’re taking their time.)"
    mc "（十四分钟了。他们在拖时间。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8616
translate chinese story05_5_5_75b3dae0:

    # k "Hey, old man."
    k "喂，老头。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8617
translate chinese story05_5_5_481e2b48:

    # k "Something’s been bugging me."
    k "有件事一直硌着我。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8618
translate chinese story05_5_5_bec85b7c:

    # k "Why do you avoid killing?"
    k "你为什么尽量不杀人？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8624
translate chinese story05_5_5_93334484:

    # k "What?"
    k "怎么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8625
translate chinese story05_5_5_ed305abc:

    # k "Why are you looking at me like that?"
    k "你干嘛那样看我？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8633
translate chinese story05_5_5_aa1365c3:

    # mc "(Avoid?)"
    mc "（尽量不杀？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8634
translate chinese story05_5_5_6a58fc94:

    # mc "Tell me something…"
    mc "告诉我……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8644
translate chinese story05_5_5_863cc110:

    # mc "Have you ever heard a man scream…"
    mc "你听过一个人惨叫吗……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8645
translate chinese story05_5_5_700a1159:

    # mc "with his lungs torn open?"
    mc "肺被撕开的那种？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8657
translate chinese story05_5_5_e45c3386:

    # mc "Beg you to shoot him…"
    mc "求你快开枪打死他……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8658
translate chinese story05_5_5_cf6910e9:

    # mc "with half his tongue hanging loose—"
    mc "半截舌头挂在外面——"

# game/Story04.rpy:8660
translate chinese story05_5_5_e431164c:

    # c "Commander, plea—"
    c "指挥官，求——"

# game/Story04.rpy:8674
translate chinese story05_5_5_74f8d379:

    # mc "(whispering) …and in return—"
    mc "（低声）……换回来的——"

# game/Story04.rpy:8678
translate chinese story05_5_5_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8680
translate chinese story05_5_5_cc3cee2c:

    # mc "(whispering) …a medal for bravery."
    mc "（低声）……一枚勇敢勋章。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8681
translate chinese story05_5_5_0db5b5b7:

    # mc "Posthumous."
    mc "追授的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8685
translate chinese story05_5_5_38d96485:

    # mc "One day you’re a hero."
    mc "前一天你还是英雄。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8686
translate chinese story05_5_5_c8fe9512:

    # mc "A savior."
    mc "是救世主。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8687
translate chinese story05_5_5_eb5b0273:

    # mc "And the next moment?"
    mc "下一刻呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8688
translate chinese story05_5_5_71e52212:

    # mc "You’re a penniless headcase with a shattered future."
    mc "你就成了个身无分文、前途尽毁的疯子。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8692
translate chinese story05_5_5_82091822_1:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8694
translate chinese story05_5_5_e51c02fe:

    # k "If you’re fishing for sympathy, you picked the wrong girl."
    k "你要想博同情，找错人了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8697
translate chinese story05_5_5_8b71c97c:

    # k "But yeah."
    k "不过，是啊。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8698
translate chinese story05_5_5_35ed8cf2:

    # k "I get it."
    k "我懂。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8704
translate chinese story05_5_5_3422a25a:

    # mc "Why the sudden interest?"
    mc "怎么突然关心这个？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8706
translate chinese story05_5_5_47093d40:

    # mc "Last I checked, you cared more about moral compasses than old ghosts."
    mc "我记得你更在意的是道德指南针，不是旧鬼魂。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8708
translate chinese story05_5_5_6752b3f8:

    # k "No comment."
    k "无可奉告。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8712
translate chinese story05_5_5_2fe96748:

    # k "But you didn’t hesitate with the mutants."
    k "可你对变异体没犹豫。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8718
translate chinese story05_5_5_32fa43ab:

    # mc "When it’s a monster in front of you…"
    mc "当面前是个怪物的时候……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8719
translate chinese story05_5_5_7624c8e1:

    # mc "it’s easier to pull the trigger."
    mc "扣扳机会容易点。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8721
translate chinese story05_5_5_3a20f2a6:

    # k "Even knowing they used to be human?"
    k "哪怕知道它们曾经是人？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8724
translate chinese story05_5_5_b988f138:

    # c "...Th—"
    c "……那——"

# game/Story04.rpy:8725
translate chinese story05_5_5_67f63cc9:

    # "He tries to speak, but only a wet rasp escapes."
    "他想说话，可只漏出一声湿哑的气音。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8726
translate chinese story05_5_5_2e7f7c3f:

    # c "...mmndr..."
    c "……挥官……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8728
translate chinese story05_5_5_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8731
translate chinese story05_5_5_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8733
translate chinese story05_5_5_d5b30864:

    # cj "Why did you kill my dad?!"
    cj "你为什么要杀我爸？！"

# game/Story04.rpy:8734
translate chinese story05_5_5_b13551d2:

    # cj "You`re monster!"
    cj "你是怪物！"

# game/Story04.rpy:8740
translate chinese story05_5_5_f800bed0:

    # mc "Yes."
    mc "是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8743
translate chinese story05_5_5_1393b123:

    # y "Drego si. Nín beria i gwaith hen o si. \n(You’re dismissed. I’ll take it from here.)"
    y "Drego si. Nín beria i gwaith hen o si. \n（你们退下。这里交给我。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8744
translate chinese story05_5_5_553650d9:

    # mc "(That voice… No. It can’t be. Yong?)"
    mc "（那个声音……不。不可能。勇？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8747
translate chinese story05_5_5_e1bb422e:

    # k "(whispering) I don’t believe it. The Chaplain? What the hell is he doing—"
    k "（低声）我不敢信。随军牧师？他他妈在这儿干什么——"

# game/Story04.rpy:8748
translate chinese story05_5_5_1948b831:

    # mc "(whispering) Remember. We’re in the past."
    mc "（低声）记住。我们在过去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8749
translate chinese story05_5_5_039fca86:

    # mc "(whispering) That’s not the man we knew."
    mc "（低声）那不是我们认识的那个人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8754
translate chinese story05_5_5_4ade8ba5:

    # y "Well."
    y "那么。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8755
translate chinese story05_5_5_74d18a43:

    # y "This is unexpected."
    y "这可出人意料。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8756
translate chinese story05_5_5_4b02d19e:

    # y "What happened to the Gate?"
    y "门出了什么事？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8760
translate chinese story05_5_5_2db37614:

    # mc "(He knows?)"
    mc "（他知道？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8761
translate chinese story05_5_5_db429018:

    # k "Wait- you know about it?"
    k "等等——你知道？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8762
translate chinese story05_5_5_98ac8128:

    # k "How?"
    k "怎么会？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8764
translate chinese story05_5_5_2af77eb9:

    # mc "Kali. Not another word."
    mc "卡莉。别再说话了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8766
translate chinese story05_5_5_98937298:

    # mc "(Straight to the Gate.)"
    mc "（一上来就问门。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8767
translate chinese story05_5_5_fc7d38f2:

    # mc "(Testing us? Showing his hand? Or baiting?)"
    mc "（试我们？亮底牌？还是下饵？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8768
translate chinese story05_5_5_81dd08e6:

    # mc "If you know who we are…"
    mc "既然你知道我们是谁……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8769
translate chinese story05_5_5_97ac93af:

    # mc "then you already know about the Gate."
    mc "那你早就知道门的事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8771
translate chinese story05_5_5_3a290c99:

    # y "Clever."
    y "聪明。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8773
translate chinese story05_5_5_1e6446d7:

    # y "A young woman mentioned you spoke my name."
    y "有个年轻姑娘提到，你说过我的名字。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8774
translate chinese story05_5_5_87e557fb:

    # y "Why?"
    y "为什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8776
translate chinese story05_5_5_dc2f12b2:

    # mc "(So Miriel’s in contact with him. Even now.)"
    mc "（所以米莉尔跟他有联系。连现在都是。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8780
translate chinese story05_5_5_8a217083:

    # mc "When are you letting us go?"
    mc "你什么时候放我们走？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8782
translate chinese story05_5_5_b245282c:

    # y "When I have answers."
    y "等我有答案的时候。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8784
translate chinese story05_5_5_e35c271e:

    # mc "Then you should speak to Gorem."
    mc "那你该去找戈雷姆谈。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8785
translate chinese story05_5_5_bd8e977f:

    # mc "We’re his guests."
    mc "我们是他的客人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8786
translate chinese story05_5_5_d9aff9e0:

    # mc "And he’s… something of an emperor around here."
    mc "而他在这儿……算是某种皇帝。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8788
translate chinese story05_5_5_8c97ee1f:

    # mc "(Will you correct me… or let that slide?)"
    mc "（你会纠正我……还是随它去？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8790
translate chinese story05_5_5_b0eb861e:

    # y "He… doesn’t hold authority here."
    y "他……在这儿没有权威。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8791
translate chinese story05_5_5_8f76af15:

    # y "Especially when it comes to those who aren’t from this time."
    y "尤其是面对不属于这个时代的人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8793
translate chinese story05_5_5_054c5ee0:

    # mc "I see."
    mc "明白了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8794
translate chinese story05_5_5_e6994acd:

    # mc "About the girl."
    mc "关于那姑娘。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8795
translate chinese story05_5_5_9c551e39:

    # mc "I wanted her support."
    mc "我想要她的支持。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8796
translate chinese story05_5_5_a48d6ed0:

    # mc "I used your name to get it."
    mc "我用了你的名字来换取。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8798
translate chinese story05_5_5_ed3d8ae6:

    # y "You didn’t hesitate."
    y "你没犹豫。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8799
translate chinese story05_5_5_dd9b355e:

    # mc "(His tone shifted.)"
    mc "（他语气变了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8802
translate chinese story05_5_5_8e0ce643:

    # keep3 "He carries something from outside the cycle."
    keep3 "他身上带着循环之外的东西。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8803
translate chinese story05_5_5_7fb598c1:

    # keep3 "The same marks we do."
    keep3 "跟我们身上一样的印记。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8804
translate chinese story05_5_5_66d96e4b:

    # keep3 "He knows."
    keep3 "他知道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8806
translate chinese story05_5_5_540e1db3:

    # mc "(Yet he acts as if he doesn’t.)"
    mc "（可他还装不知道。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8807
translate chinese story05_5_5_d95bae06:

    # mc "(What are you hiding?)"
    mc "（你在藏什么？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8811
translate chinese story05_5_5_4b83c6cd:

    # y "The enemy is already among us."
    y "敌人已经在我们当中了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8812
translate chinese story05_5_5_a604c986:

    # y "One wrong step… "
    y "走错一步……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8813
translate chinese story05_5_5_25e0c23b:

    # mc "(whispering) …and you’ll find a knife in your back."
    mc "（低声）……你背后就会多一把刀。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8816
translate chinese story05_5_5_189790db:

    # mc "(whispering) Will you help us?"
    mc "（低声）你会帮我们吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8818
translate chinese story05_5_5_dd713813:

    # y "Come."
    y "来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8825
translate chinese story05_5_5_22d5c02d:

    # k "Hey, old man… what was that conversation?"
    k "喂，老头……刚才那对话是什么情况？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8827
translate chinese story05_5_5_f72a13a9:

    # mc "(whispering) We’re being watched."
    mc "（低声）有人在盯着我们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8830
translate chinese story05_5_5_8b6929ae:

    # k "(whispering) Since when?"
    k "（低声）从什么时候起？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8832
translate chinese story05_5_5_2722f776:

    # mc "(whispering) Don’t know."
    mc "（低声）不知道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8833
translate chinese story05_5_5_3aaa359c:

    # mc "(whispering) But if I had to guess? Since the very beginning."
    mc "（低声）可要我猜的话？从一开始就是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8836
translate chinese story05_5_5_5afb78b0:

    # k "(whispering) And him?"
    k "（低声）那他呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8838
translate chinese story05_5_5_5829017a:

    # mc "(whispering) He’s under the same pressure."
    mc "（低声）他压力一样大。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8839
translate chinese story05_5_5_a82e90ba:

    # mc "(whispering) Careful with every word."
    mc "（低声）每句话都得小心。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8841
translate chinese story05_5_5_7349cb49:

    # k "(whispering) I hate this political chess nonsense."
    k "（低声）我讨厌这种政治棋盘上的破事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8842
translate chinese story05_5_5_2108e5a2:

    # k "(whispering) Everyone smiling. No one saying what they mean."
    k "（低声）人人都在笑。谁都不说真话。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8845
translate chinese story05_5_5_b4388f8f:

    # y "Inside."
    y "进去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8856
translate chinese story05_5_5_8b890323:

    # y "Make yourselves at home."
    y "随便坐。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8857
translate chinese story05_5_5_6304a6e2:

    # y "No one should be listening here."
    y "这儿应该没人在听。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8859
translate chinese story05_5_5_3157fd0e:

    # k "(whispering) Gods… smells like a rat bloated and burst in here."
    k "（低声）天哪……这儿闻着像有只老鼠胀破在里面了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8867
translate chinese story05_5_5_86edd8ea:

    # y "And?"
    y "然后呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8868
translate chinese story05_5_5_08691a54:

    # y "What happened?"
    y "发生了什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8871
translate chinese story05_5_5_ec5b37b1:

    # mc "So you don’t know?"
    mc "所以你不知道？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8872
translate chinese story05_5_5_d2560fbd:

    # y "Only fragments."
    y "只有碎片。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8873
translate chinese story05_5_5_4347ee5c:

    # y "Echoes from past lives."
    y "前世留下的回音。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8874
translate chinese story05_5_5_e0b1af56:

    # mc "Then…"
    mc "那……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8880
translate chinese story05_5_5_ce5f8560:

    # mc "And that’s how we ended up here."
    mc "我们就是这么到这儿来的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8885
translate chinese story05_5_5_6b0e8b9e:

    # y "(whispering) Why didn’t it work…"
    y "（低声）为什么没成功……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8889
translate chinese story05_5_5_be9161c2:

    # mc "Can I ask you something?"
    mc "我能问你件事吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8891
translate chinese story05_5_5_d912100d:

    # y "Go on."
    y "说。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8893
translate chinese story05_5_5_7aa6836c:

    # mc "What’s the point?"
    mc "意义是什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8897
translate chinese story05_5_5_f41269fd:

    # y "Look to your left."
    y "看你左边。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8898
translate chinese story05_5_5_929fd42b:

    # y "What do you see?"
    y "你看到什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8902
translate chinese story05_5_5_7aad403a:

    # mc "What’s the trick?"
    mc "耍什么把戏？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8911
translate chinese story05_5_5_3efa6665:

    # y "How is she different from us?"
    y "她跟我们有什么不同？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8913
translate chinese story05_5_5_3e2bc1d1:

    # y "She, and so many others, never had the chance to change their future."
    y "她，还有许许多多人，从没有机会改变自己的未来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8917
translate chinese story05_5_5_453e2cb0:

    # y "It all began the moment Eldrindor activated the Gate."
    y "一切都始于埃尔德林多启动门的那一刻。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8919
translate chinese story05_5_5_fd08e30b:

    # mc "Eldrindor?"
    mc "埃尔德林多？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8921
translate chinese story05_5_5_66390db7:

    # y "The scientist every elf curses."
    y "每个精灵都在咒骂的那个科学家。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8923
translate chinese story05_5_5_84d67ffc:

    # mc "Gorem’s grandfather."
    mc "戈雷姆的祖父。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8925
translate chinese story05_5_5_fff2d6da:

    # y "Yes."
    y "是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8926
translate chinese story05_5_5_3ae83abd:

    # y "He was the one who launched the Gate System."
    y "门系统就是他启动的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8928
translate chinese story05_5_5_5177038e:

    # mc "And half the galaxy vanished."
    mc "半个星系随之消失。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8929
translate chinese story05_5_5_31a38550:

    # mc "Gorem mentioned that."
    mc "戈雷姆提过。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8940
translate chinese story05_5_5_9f47a418:

    # y "Good."
    y "很好。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8941
translate chinese story05_5_5_86933dea:

    # y "Then answer me this."
    y "那回答我。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8942
translate chinese story05_5_5_7cef1169:

    # y "What did the System actually do?"
    y "这个系统到底做了什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8944
translate chinese story05_5_5_edc77061:

    # mc "They teleport."
    mc "它们传送。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8946
translate chinese story05_5_5_3fefb349:

    # y "Those are the Gates. I’m asking about the system that links them."
    y "那是门。我问的是连接它们的系统。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8948
translate chinese story05_5_5_4bbf92b2:

    # mc "It stopped time."
    mc "它让时间停了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8949
translate chinese story05_5_5_b6d2441b:

    # mc "For a few seconds."
    mc "几秒钟。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8951
translate chinese story05_5_5_090b7094:

    # y "Half a second."
    y "半秒。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8952
translate chinese story05_5_5_aa3cf533:

    # y "At the cost of half a galaxy?"
    y "代价是半个星系？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8954
translate chinese story05_5_5_16c59d4c:

    # y "An absurd price…"
    y "荒唐的代价……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8955
translate chinese story05_5_5_0f8bbbbb:

    # y "for half a second."
    y "换半秒。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8957
translate chinese story05_5_5_d4f78dbd:

    # mc "Paying in lives is absurd to begin with."
    mc "用命来付本身就荒唐。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8962
translate chinese story05_5_5_92539b77:

    # y "Perhaps."
    y "也许吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8963
translate chinese story05_5_5_949cb4ce:

    # y "But the time freeze was only the visible consequence."
    y "可时间冻结只是看得见的后果。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8964
translate chinese story05_5_5_9766d763:

    # y "The real function was something else."
    y "真正的功能是别的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8966
translate chinese story05_5_5_79ba89cc:

    # y "It created a cycle."
    y "它造了一个循环。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8967
translate chinese story05_5_5_849e6cf4:

    # y "The Gate established a fixed point in the universe, a boundary we cannot cross."
    y "门在宇宙里立下了一个固定点，一道我们跨不过去的边界。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8969
translate chinese story05_5_5_b6b1024b:

    # y "It stripped everyone of choice."
    y "它剥夺了所有人的选择。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8970
translate chinese story05_5_5_ec943f5e:

    # y "Future. Past. Doesn’t matter."
    y "未来。过去。都一样。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8971
translate chinese story05_5_5_4a0b047d:

    # y "Everything begins at one point…"
    y "一切从一个点开始……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8972
translate chinese story05_5_5_65e73399:

    # y "and ends the same way."
    y "又以同样的方式结束。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8974
translate chinese story05_5_5_ecf872dc:

    # mc "Wait."
    mc "等等。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8975
translate chinese story05_5_5_1b41c7d4:

    # mc "You’re saying us being here… was planned?"
    mc "你是说我们在这儿……是计划好的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8977
translate chinese story05_5_5_c17f6616:

    # y "That’s the difference."
    y "这就是区别所在。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8978
translate chinese story05_5_5_ea53f9a1:

    # y "We can’t break the principle."
    y "我们破不了这个原则。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8979
translate chinese story05_5_5_3b68130b:

    # y "But you can."
    y "但你能。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8981
translate chinese story05_5_5_51c5f03b:

    # mc "Can I?"
    mc "我能？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8982
translate chinese story05_5_5_89fc4ac9:

    # mc "And what makes you so certain?"
    mc "你凭什么这么确定？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8984
translate chinese story05_5_5_f8dfc242:

    # y "Because you’re here."
    y "因为你在这儿。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8986
translate chinese story05_5_5_243907d7:

    # mc "What are you—"
    mc "你在说什——"

# game/Story04.rpy:8988
translate chinese story05_5_5_1652721c:

    # y "Astoria relives the loss of her sister."
    y "阿斯托里亚一次次重历失去妹妹。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8989
translate chinese story05_5_5_8a928548:

    # y "Evreliya walks into the same tomb again and again."
    y "艾芙蕾莉亚一次次走进同一座墓。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8990
translate chinese story05_5_5_a7f460fd:

    # y "Selvaria keeps killing her father."
    y "塞尔瓦莉亚一次次杀死自己的父亲。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8991
translate chinese story05_5_5_2c016249:

    # y "And Lora…"
    y "而洛拉……"

# game/Story04.rpy:8992
translate chinese story05_5_5_0ab28a11:

    # y "She keeps trying to keep you alive."
    y "她一次次拼命让你活下来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8994
translate chinese story05_5_5_fb4d0fde:

    # mc "(So all my wife’s suffering was… for nothing?)"
    mc "（所以我妻子所有的痛苦……都是白费？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:8996
translate chinese story05_5_5_91905ede:

    # mc "How?"
    mc "怎么会？"

# game/Story04.rpy:8998
translate chinese story05_5_5_1c881d34:

    # y "Motives change."
    y "动机会变。"

# game/Story04.rpy:8999
translate chinese story05_5_5_6d385f12:

    # y "The outcome doesn’t."
    y "结果不变。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9000
translate chinese story05_5_5_19a5e91a:

    # y "What’s needed is power from outside the cycle."
    y "需要的是来自循环之外的力量。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9002
translate chinese story05_5_5_1f864a9b:

    # mc "So that’s why I matter."
    mc "所以我才有意义。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9003
translate chinese story05_5_5_d15d8c37:

    # mc "I can break the cycle."
    mc "我能打破循环。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9005
translate chinese story05_5_5_df7b27e3:

    # y "There were 378 attempts before you."
    y "在你之前有三百七十八次尝试。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9006
translate chinese story05_5_5_8ed4a16c:

    # y "But somehow you’ve made it further than any of them."
    y "可你不知怎么走得比他们任何一次都远。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9008
translate chinese story05_5_5_659ad628:

    # mc "Three hundred seventy-eight…"
    mc "三百七十八……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9010
translate chinese story05_5_5_66e59d65:

    # "A strained, humorless laugh."
    "一声勉强、毫无笑意的笑。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9011
translate chinese story05_5_5_eb31b531:

    # mc "That’s cruel."
    mc "太残忍了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9012
translate chinese story05_5_5_8348beeb:

    # mc "And how many of those were mine?"
    mc "其中有多少次是我的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9013
translate chinese story05_5_5_71a86863:

    # y "..."
    y "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9014
translate chinese story05_5_5_a12237f7:

    # y "All of them."
    y "全部都是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9018
translate chinese story05_5_5_cf8b5120:

    # mc "…again?"
    mc "……又一次？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9020
translate chinese story05_5_5_e1ef500b:

    # y "They were all you."
    y "全都是你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9021
translate chinese story05_5_5_2c66875a:

    # y "Every single one."
    y "每一次都是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9023
translate chinese story05_5_5_50e67c79:

    # mc "Cruel."
    mc "残忍。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9024
translate chinese story05_5_5_b8c84b6d:

    # y "You think so?"
    y "你这么觉得？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9025
translate chinese story05_5_5_92de21c0:

    # y "Many of us would give anything for a fate like yours."
    y "我们许多人愿意付出一切，换来你这样的命运。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9026
translate chinese story05_5_5_c6b8f5e9:

    # y "To forget what we were."
    y "忘掉我们曾经是什么。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9028
translate chinese story05_5_5_8c943fbf:

    # mc "And Lora?"
    mc "那洛拉呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9029
translate chinese story05_5_5_69774c55:

    # mc "She’s like me."
    mc "她跟我一样。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9030
translate chinese story05_5_5_728c8fd2:

    # mc "So why didn’t she—"
    mc "那她为什么没——"

# game/Story04.rpy:9032
translate chinese story05_5_5_c423975e:

    # y "Because of Evrelia."
    y "因为艾芙蕾莉亚。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9033
translate chinese story05_5_5_6f40e6d5:

    # y "And her power."
    y "和她的力量。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9034
translate chinese story05_5_5_51c99226:

    # mc "(whispering) I don’t understand…"
    mc "（低声）我不明白……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9036
translate chinese story05_5_5_16cd2d0a:

    # y "The Abyss is a consequence of the Gate."
    y "深渊是门的后果。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9037
translate chinese story05_5_5_a75d85de:

    # y "Gain immortality there…"
    y "在那儿得到永生……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9038
translate chinese story05_5_5_7487b0bd:

    # y "and you lose the ability to leave the cycle."
    y "你就失去了脱离循环的能力。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9039
translate chinese story05_5_5_0d5d6af6:

    # y "She’s no different from the rest of us."
    y "她跟我们其他人没有区别。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9041
translate chinese story05_5_5_e1edc76e:

    # mc "Then I’ll ask two questions."
    mc "那我要问两个问题。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9042
translate chinese story05_5_5_f2c2c05b:

    # mc "First, what do you want from me?"
    mc "第一，你想要我做什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9043
translate chinese story05_5_5_6c9fbd01:

    # y "Break the cycle."
    y "打破循环。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9044
translate chinese story05_5_5_e0bbf01e:

    # mc "Second, what guarantees do I have?"
    mc "第二，我有什么保障？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9055
translate chinese story05_5_5_d5371a83:

    # y "None."
    y "没有。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9058
translate chinese story05_5_5_afb70b29:

    # mc "(So all her suffering…)"
    mc "（所以她所有的痛苦……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9059
translate chinese story05_5_5_fbf53025:

    # mc "(Every attempt to save me. To save Norman.)"
    mc "（每一次试着救我。救诺曼。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9060
translate chinese story05_5_5_fb8ff1c3:

    # mc "(Pointless?)"
    mc "（都没意义？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9061
translate chinese story05_5_5_1a68efbd:

    # mc "(And Astoria’s attempts…)"
    mc "（还有阿斯托里亚的尝试……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9063
translate chinese story05_5_5_71101df6:

    # mc "(whispering) Immortality?"
    mc "（低声）永生？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9064
translate chinese story05_5_5_ae631686:

    # mc "(whispering) Sounds more like eternal imprisonment."
    mc "（低声）听着更像永恒的监禁。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9066
translate chinese story05_5_5_e7d887c0:

    # mc "How long has this been going on?"
    mc "这样持续多久了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9074
translate chinese story05_5_5_71a86863_1:

    # y "..."
    y "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9076
translate chinese story05_5_5_054c5ee0_1:

    # mc "I see."
    mc "明白了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9077
translate chinese story05_5_5_65dfe4e1:

    # mc "Then I refuse."
    mc "那我拒绝。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9085
translate chinese story05_5_5_7d541978:

    # y "Are you certain?"
    y "你确定？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9086
translate chinese story05_5_5_17503904:

    # y "You don’t have a choice."
    y "你没得选。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9088
translate chinese story05_5_5_abe52859:

    # mc "If I’m destined to die either way, what’s the point?"
    mc "反正我横竖都是死，那有什么意义？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9089
translate chinese story05_5_5_7844e0fd:

    # mc "You made me a hero."
    mc "你们把我塑造成了英雄。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9093
translate chinese story05_5_5_63df4058:

    # mc "Put a banner in my hands and told me to save the world."
    mc "把旗帜塞我手里，让我去拯救世界。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9096
translate chinese story05_5_5_c8793936:

    # mc "Never once asking if I wanted the role."
    mc "从没问过我，想不想要这个角色。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9097
translate chinese story05_5_5_2440758b:

    # mc "That’s before we even talk about how you treated me."
    mc "这还没算上你们是怎么对我的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9100
translate chinese story05_5_5_71a86863_2:

    # y "..."
    y "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9102
translate chinese story05_5_5_99833fd8:

    # y "You’re a man of principles."
    y "你是个有原则的人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9103
translate chinese story05_5_5_36c5a29f:

    # y "Am I right?"
    y "我说得对吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9105
translate chinese story05_5_5_3d8c1d5f:

    # mc "I like to think so."
    mc "我愿意这么认为。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9107
translate chinese story05_5_5_42d309e7:

    # y "I saved your life."
    y "我救过你的命。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9108
translate chinese story05_5_5_874027a5:

    # y "Now it’s your turn to save mine."
    y "现在轮到你救我的了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9110
translate chinese story05_5_5_2b35b6fe_4:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9112
translate chinese story05_5_5_3b3938e0:

    # mc "(I don’t like this idea, but refusing won’t change anything.)"
    mc "（我不喜欢这个主意，可拒绝也改变不了什么。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9113
translate chinese story05_5_5_bec30771:

    # mc "(And he’s right… I’m alive because of him.)"
    mc "（而且他说得对……我能活着是因为他。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9115
translate chinese story05_5_5_fcf9c325:

    # mc "Then I want your full support."
    mc "那我要你的全力支持。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9117
translate chinese story05_5_5_84ea3656:

    # mc "No games."
    mc "别玩花样。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9118
translate chinese story05_5_5_896b381b:

    # mc "No schemes."
    mc "别耍心机。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9119
translate chinese story05_5_5_c06c46d8:

    # mc "A clear plan."
    mc "一个清楚的计划。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9120
translate chinese story05_5_5_74647356:

    # mc "Everything on the table."
    mc "一切都摆到台面上。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9122
translate chinese story05_5_5_31ed3599:

    # y "Agreed."
    y "同意。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9125
translate chinese story05_5_5_72a4a768:

    # mc "Kali."
    mc "卡莉。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9126
translate chinese story05_5_5_52e8c385:

    # mc "Your thoughts?"
    mc "你怎么想？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9127
translate chinese story05_5_5_d18fd985:

    # mc "I know you’re not asleep. Stop pretending."
    mc "我知道你没睡。别装了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9134
translate chinese story05_5_5_82091822_2:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9139
translate chinese story05_5_5_7f6c8544:

    # k "How long have you known?"
    k "你知道多久了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9141
translate chinese story05_5_5_c6675718:

    # mc "You snore."
    mc "你打呼。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9142
translate chinese story05_5_5_1608fe92:

    # mc "Did you know?"
    mc "你知道吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9144
translate chinese story05_5_5_191fa3b8:

    # k "I’ll keep that in mind."
    k "我记住了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9146
translate chinese story05_5_5_ad676bab:

    # k "You’re starting to freak me out."
    k "你开始让我发毛了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9147
translate chinese story05_5_5_559f7676:

    # k "First Federation leaders call you friend."
    k "先是联邦领袖管你叫朋友。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9148
translate chinese story05_5_5_0da1d8b8:

    # k "Now a Chaplain."
    k "现在又是随军牧师。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9149
translate chinese story05_5_5_d8838b2b:

    # k "You’ve got a real talent for getting powerful people on your side."
    k "你还真有本事，让有权势的人都站你这边。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9151
translate chinese story05_5_5_8ec8d28b:

    # y "There’s a celebration in the camp tonight."
    y "今晚营地里有个庆祝活动。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9152
translate chinese story05_5_5_7991fa21:

    # y "Care to join us?"
    y "想一起来吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9157
translate chinese story05_5_5_a04fef34:

    # mc "We’ll be there."
    mc "我们会到。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9158
translate chinese story05_5_5_ccf7abda:

    # mc "But first..."
    mc "但首先……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9159
translate chinese story05_5_5_51d67168:

    # mc "We make sure we’re not followed."
    mc "我们得确认没被跟。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9171
translate chinese story05_5_6_3b60565e:

    # "The road to the camp was quiet."
    "去营地的路很安静。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9174
translate chinese story05_5_6_a8d9ff5a:

    # "For a while they walked in silence."
    "有一阵子，他们就沉默地走着。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9176
translate chinese story05_5_6_e5d8fbe9:

    # mc "Kali? About those other worlds… do you know anything?"
    mc "卡莉？那些别的世界……你知道点什么吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9178
translate chinese story05_5_6_0e7d480f:

    # k "Knowledge?"
    k "知识？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9181
translate chinese story05_5_6_c64c795c:

    # k "I prefer meat and spectacle to libraries."
    k "比起图书馆，我更喜欢肉和好戏。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9186
translate chinese story05_5_6_22c82afb:

    # k "But even I have heard the stories."
    k "可连我都听过那些传说。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9190
translate chinese story05_5_6_8b5f3d06:

    # mc "I'd appreciate it."
    mc "我会很感激。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9192
translate chinese story05_5_6_cff1b0d2:

    # k "Ew… don't do that, old man."
    k "呃……别来这套，老头。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9193
translate chinese story05_5_6_1d57d86d:

    # k "Politeness looks strange on you."
    k "礼貌这层皮穿在你身上怪得很。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9195
translate chinese story05_5_6_80eca246:

    # k "But fine."
    k "不过行吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9196
translate chinese story05_5_6_452e8d53:

    # k "People say reality doesn't move in one straight line."
    k "人们说，现实不是一条直线往前走的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9199
translate chinese story05_5_6_75e76b82:

    # k "Every major choice leaves another world behind."
    k "每一个重大的选择，都会在身后留下另一个世界。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9201
translate chinese story05_5_6_2ca31cdd:

    # mc "Parallel worlds."
    mc "平行世界。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9204
translate chinese story05_5_6_f5f5aa01:

    # k "If you like big words."
    k "你要喜欢大词儿就这么叫。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9205
translate chinese story05_5_6_1deb855b:

    # k "Different choices."
    k "不同的选择。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9206
translate chinese story05_5_6_03d1c371:

    # k "Different wars."
    k "不同的战争。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9207
translate chinese story05_5_6_870df9a7:

    # k "Different endings."
    k "不同的结局。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9210
translate chinese story05_5_6_8f297869:

    # k "That’s everything I know."
    k "我就知道这些。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9211
translate chinese story05_5_6_1cb5176c:

    # mc "Not much to go on."
    mc "没什么能用的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9213
translate chinese story05_5_6_44ecae25:

    # k "It’s what there is."
    k "就这么点。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9218
translate chinese story05_5_6_3c2b972a:

    # keep3 "Most beings live their entire lives without ever realizing the truth."
    keep3 "大多数生命终其一生，都没意识到真相。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9219
translate chinese story05_5_6_b67c66c3:

    # keep3 "To them, their world is the only one that exists."
    keep3 "对他们来说，自己的世界就是唯一存在的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9222
translate chinese story05_5_6_1907dfc3:

    # mc "(No chance to change it…)"
    mc "（没机会改变它……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9223
translate chinese story05_5_6_e0e55ef6:

    # keep3 "They don’t need one."
    keep3 "他们不需要。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9225
translate chinese story05_5_6_342ac109:

    # mc "(Why—)"
    mc "（为什么——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9230
translate chinese story05_5_6_92de21c0:

    # y "Many of us would give anything for a fate like yours."
    y "我们许多人愿意付出一切，换来你这样的命运。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9231
translate chinese story05_5_6_c6b8f5e9:

    # y "To forget what we were."
    y "忘掉我们曾经是什么。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9235
translate chinese story05_5_6_6d8e1d7d:

    # mc "(…Because of the memories.)"
    mc "（……因为那些记忆。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9237
translate chinese story05_5_6_dc5a4b17:

    # keep3 "Correct."
    keep3 "正确。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9238
translate chinese story05_5_6_f61b7abb:

    # keep3 "When you live the same life over and over without knowing it’s repeating…"
    keep3 "当你一遍遍过着同样的人生，却不知道它在重复……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9239
translate chinese story05_5_6_1b4da978:

    # keep3 "you’re perfectly satisfied."
    keep3 "你会完全满足。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9241
translate chinese story05_5_6_45ff424e:

    # mc "(That’s… disturbing.)"
    mc "（这……让人不安。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9242
translate chinese story05_5_6_7e849547:

    # keep3 "Only if you know about it."
    keep3 "只有你知道了才会。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9243
translate chinese story05_5_6_dddbdbce:

    # keep3 "Otherwise it’s just… life."
    keep3 "不然就只是……生活。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9246
translate chinese story05_5_6_b9d5eac0:

    # mc "(But how did they even appear? Where did they—)"
    mc "（可它们是怎么出现的？它们从哪儿——）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9247
translate chinese story05_5_6_89c381df:

    # keep3 "From the moment time itself began."
    keep3 "从时间本身开始的那一刻起。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9248
translate chinese story05_5_6_d8341b8f:

    # keep3 "Time is a fabric. Threads are the fibers it’s woven from."
    keep3 "时间是块布。时间线就是织成它的纤维。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9250
translate chinese story05_5_6_7db72d0a:

    # mc "(Haven’t felt this stupid trying to understand something in a long time…)"
    mc "（好久没因为想弄懂一件事觉得自己这么蠢了……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9253
translate chinese story05_5_6_0085e033:

    # keep3 "..."
    keep3 "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9254
translate chinese story05_5_6_764b51d9:

    # keep3 "Do you?"
    keep3 "你懂吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9257
translate chinese story05_5_6_25b41502:

    # keep3 "Think back on your life."
    keep3 "回想你的人生。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9261
translate chinese story05_5_6_bfd4a055:

    # keep3 "The first major break in the cycle happened when you decided to go after Lora."
    keep3 "循环的第一次重大断裂，发生在你决定去追洛拉的时候。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9265
translate chinese story05_5_6_2c64a254:

    # keep3 "The second came when you ended up on the Ark."
    keep3 "第二次是你登上方舟的时候。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9266
translate chinese story05_5_6_b9317d23:

    # keep3 "Together, they forced the cycle to branch."
    keep3 "两者加在一起，迫使循环分岔。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9267
translate chinese story05_5_6_b92849d6:

    # keep3 "A branch changes the road. The fixed point still decides where the cycle closes."
    keep3 "分岔会改变路线。但固定点仍决定循环在哪里闭合。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9271
translate chinese story05_5_6_dcb264ef:

    # mc "(Different roads. Same wall.)"
    mc "（不同的路。同一堵墙。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9272
translate chinese story05_5_6_61485517:

    # mc "(Major shifts… So the small ones don’t matter?)"
    mc "（重大转折……那小的就不算数？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9274
translate chinese story05_5_6_070123e8:

    # keep3 "Every change affects the outcome."
    keep3 "每一个变化都会影响结果。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9275
translate chinese story05_5_6_828f980e:

    # keep3 "Some simply carry more weight."
    keep3 "只是有些分量更重。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9278
translate chinese story05_5_6_34d1cb75:

    # keep3 "But every shift has consequences."
    keep3 "可每一个偏移都有后果。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9279
translate chinese story05_5_6_94698fa3:

    # keep3 "Every outcome leads to a different moment."
    keep3 "每一个结果都通向不同的时刻。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9281
translate chinese story05_5_6_8f27242e:

    # mc "(So these are… literally all possible versions of my life?)"
    mc "（所以这些……真是我人生所有可能的版本？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9282
translate chinese story05_5_6_414fa8de:

    # keep3 "Yes."
    keep3 "是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9285
translate chinese story05_5_6_db12567f:

    # k "You good?"
    k "你没事吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9289
translate chinese story05_5_6_d2944626:

    # mc "Yeah. I’m fine. Don’t worry."
    mc "嗯。没事。别担心。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9291
translate chinese story05_5_6_df4be6a1:

    # k "Talking to that keeper again, huh…"
    k "又跟那个守护者说话了，是吧……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9292
translate chinese story05_5_6_b5c7abcf:

    # k "Well. Whatever."
    k "行吧。随便。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9293
translate chinese story05_5_6_c65c039f:

    # k "Not my place to tell you what to do."
    k "轮不到我教你怎么做。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9294
translate chinese story05_5_6_732f61d5:

    # k "Anyway, how much farther?"
    k "话说，还有多远？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9296
translate chinese story05_5_6_deb9a320:

    # mc "No idea."
    mc "不知道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9297
translate chinese story05_5_6_50c84c8c:

    # mc "Yong’s supposed to meet us somewhere up ahead."
    mc "勇应该在前头某个地方跟我们碰头。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9298
translate chinese story05_5_6_565abddc:

    # mc "After that, he’ll take us to the camp."
    mc "之后他会带我们去营地。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9303
translate chinese story05_5_6_b5c31fa9:

    # k "Got it."
    k "知道了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9310
translate chinese story05_5_6_1882d3dc:

    # "The Outcasts’ Camp."
    "弃民营地。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9312
translate chinese story05_5_6_dbfcf1f1:

    # y "Here we are."
    y "到了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9314
translate chinese story05_5_6_27eaadbc:

    # y "Two rules."
    y "两条规矩。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9315
translate chinese story05_5_6_d72a44d5:

    # y "No mention of slavery."
    y "不许提奴隶制。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9316
translate chinese story05_5_6_a9198e50:

    # y "And nothing about implants."
    y "也不许提植入体。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9319
translate chinese story05_5_6_9d1f09df:

    # mc "What about Gorem?"
    mc "那戈雷姆呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9322
translate chinese story05_5_6_8598b237:

    # y "Make that three."
    y "那就是三条。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9323
translate chinese story05_5_6_95ccb1cb:

    # y "Don’t mention His Highness."
    y "不许提殿下。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9332
translate chinese story05_5_6_e673a5a1:

    # y "And… a word."
    y "还有……说句话。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9334
translate chinese story05_5_6_9cb23c31:

    # k "(whispering) Something’s off about him."
    k "（低声）他不对劲。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9336
translate chinese story05_5_6_379fcd6e:

    # mc "You think?"
    mc "你觉得？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9337
translate chinese story05_5_6_e14da1c5:

    # mc "To me, he feels more open now."
    mc "我倒觉得他现在敞开了些。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9338
translate chinese story05_5_6_dcb7f710:

    # mc "In his own way, sure… but still."
    mc "以他自己的方式，确实……但还是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9340
translate chinese story05_5_6_4faba61d:

    # k "It’s all crap, old man. My gut says something’s wrong here."
    k "全是鬼话，老头。我直觉这儿有问题。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9342
translate chinese story05_5_6_20815cf5:

    # mc "Wait here."
    mc "在这儿等着。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9343
translate chinese story05_5_6_75011522:

    # mc "I’ll see what he wants."
    mc "我去看看他要什么。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9345
translate chinese story05_5_6_c3b40072:

    # k "Yeah."
    k "嗯。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9350
translate chinese story05_5_6_f3c2cd1f:

    # y "(whispering) I know you’re desperate to go back."
    y "（低声）我知道你急着回去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9351
translate chinese story05_5_6_abb70f60:

    # y "(whispering) To make sure they’re alright."
    y "（低声）去确认她们没事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9352
translate chinese story05_5_6_774fff4d:

    # y "(whispering) I have a way… but—"
    y "（低声）我有个办法……可是——"

# game/Story04.rpy:9356
translate chinese story05_5_6_80f35329:

    # y "It’ll take time."
    y "需要时间。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9357
translate chinese story05_5_6_297bc275:

    # y "And permission."
    y "还有许可。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9359
translate chinese story05_5_6_9bea3830:

    # mc "Is this about the anomaly rifts?"
    mc "这跟异常裂隙有关？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9363
translate chinese story05_5_6_fff2d6da:

    # y "Yes."
    y "是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9364
translate chinese story05_5_6_7d0a362a:

    # y "Miriel will explain how they work."
    y "米莉尔会解释它们怎么运作。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9368
translate chinese story05_5_6_4179fbbb:

    # mc "So… you’re in charge here?"
    mc "所以……这儿你管事？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9373
translate chinese story05_5_6_2abdd938:

    # y "More like I watch over them."
    y "更像我照看着他们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9374
translate chinese story05_5_6_356a4f9c:

    # y "Make sure they don’t hurt themselves… or anyone else."
    y "确保他们不伤到自己……也不伤到别人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9375
translate chinese story05_5_6_a52c660d:

    # mc "Then how did you convince them to let us in?"
    mc "那你怎么说服他们放我们进来的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9378
translate chinese story05_5_6_1b27d8ff:

    # y "It wasn’t my doing."
    y "不是我促成的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9379
translate chinese story05_5_6_9a0e5936:

    # y "Miriel made the first move."
    y "是米莉尔先迈的那一步。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9380
translate chinese story05_5_6_6dc0bb31:

    # y "Smoke?"
    y "来一根？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9382
translate chinese story05_5_6_4f22aa68:

    # mc "I’ll pass."
    mc "算了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9383
translate chinese story05_5_6_c5b7a818:

    # mc "Not the right place."
    mc "这儿不合适。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9388
translate chinese story05_5_6_8a86d85f:

    # mc "So… Miriel."
    mc "那……米莉尔。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9389
translate chinese story05_5_6_2876efd9:

    # mc "Why?"
    mc "为什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9391
translate chinese story05_5_6_db27a9ce:

    # y "Somehow…"
    y "不知怎么……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9392
translate chinese story05_5_6_88a07eb4:

    # y "she remembered another life."
    y "她想起了另一段人生。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9393
translate chinese story05_5_6_95fdceb9:

    # y "Not all of it."
    y "不是全部。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9394
translate chinese story05_5_6_58a4a77a:

    # y "Just the one where you existed."
    y "只是有你在的那一段。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9397
translate chinese story05_5_6_91905ede:

    # mc "How?"
    mc "怎么会？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9402
translate chinese story05_5_6_049333a8:

    # y "[mc]?"
    y "[mc]？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9404
translate chinese story05_5_6_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9406
translate chinese story05_5_6_00ed353e:

    # y "No. It’s nothing."
    y "不。没什么。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9407
translate chinese story05_5_6_d2036000:

    # y "Get some rest."
    y "去歇会儿。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9409
translate chinese story05_5_6_ecf872dc:

    # mc "Wait."
    mc "等等。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9410
translate chinese story05_5_6_18804ef2:

    # mc "Say what you were going to say."
    mc "把你刚才要说的话说完。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9415
translate chinese story05_5_6_cfe40dcf:

    # y "One question."
    y "一个问题。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9416
translate chinese story05_5_6_44139f77:

    # y "What is hope?"
    y "希望是什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9418
translate chinese story05_5_6_3997c9e2:

    # mc "Why the sudden philosophy?"
    mc "怎么突然哲学起来了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9421
translate chinese story05_5_6_205a9216:

    # y "Why do you keep moving forward?"
    y "你为什么一直往前走？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9422
translate chinese story05_5_6_5c8880e4:

    # y "What… drives you?"
    y "是什么……驱动着你？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9426
translate chinese story05_5_6_34196b86:

    # mc "Protect what’s mine."
    mc "护住属于我的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9427
translate chinese story05_5_6_db960325:

    # mc "And to survive."
    mc "还有活下去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9433
translate chinese story05_5_6_11455b53:

    # mc "What?"
    mc "怎么了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9434
translate chinese story05_5_6_0151f9f5:

    # mc "You expecting something profound?"
    mc "你以为我会说什么高深的话？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9436
translate chinese story05_5_6_d2237f60:

    # y "That’s your entire motivation?"
    y "这就是你全部的动机？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9438
translate chinese story05_5_6_ee45b483:

    # mc "Isn’t that enough?"
    mc "还不够吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9440
translate chinese story05_5_6_2e500179:

    # mc "When a lion grows weak, the pride casts him out."
    mc "狮子一旦衰弱，狮群就把他赶出去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9441
translate chinese story05_5_6_4a786404:

    # mc "He’s left alone."
    mc "他孤身一人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9442
translate chinese story05_5_6_8f5a3603:

    # mc "No allies. No shelter."
    mc "没盟友。没庇护。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9443
translate chinese story05_5_6_457c9e67:

    # mc "And still…"
    mc "可即便如此……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9444
translate chinese story05_5_6_338e7b9d:

    # mc "They don’t die of old age."
    mc "他们不会老死。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9445
translate chinese story05_5_6_2c80f101:

    # mc "They die fighting."
    mc "他们是战死的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9447
translate chinese story05_5_6_ea9137a4:

    # mc "Struggle is life."
    mc "挣扎就是生命。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9448
translate chinese story05_5_6_4a177878:

    # mc "Stop fighting and you’re already dead."
    mc "停止挣扎，你就已经死了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9449
translate chinese story05_5_6_8eeda518:

    # mc "That’s all there is to it."
    mc "就这么回事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9453
translate chinese story05_5_6_9884eeed:

    # y "What’s a lion?"
    y "狮子是什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9456
translate chinese story05_5_6_95573fa3:

    # mc "What—"
    mc "什么——"

# game/Story04.rpy:9458
translate chinese story05_5_6_556aef90:

    # mc "You know what? Forget it."
    mc "算了，当我没说。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9462
translate chinese story05_5_6_d2036000_1:

    # y "Get some rest."
    y "去歇会儿。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9467
translate chinese story05_5_6_d4a13ab5:

    # mc "(Rest…)"
    mc "（歇会儿……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9468
translate chinese story05_5_6_a6dbc81b:

    # mc "(Like that’s something I can afford.)"
    mc "（说得好像我歇得起似的。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9474
translate chinese story05_5_6_91d8a70c:

    # mc "You okay?"
    mc "你没事吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9476
translate chinese story05_5_6_61a75ab0:

    # k "Hm? Oh, it’s you, old man."
    k "嗯？哦，是你啊，老头。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9477
translate chinese story05_5_6_edf61239:

    # k "Yeah, I’m fine."
    k "嗯，没事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9479
translate chinese story05_5_6_347a4121:

    # mc "Enjoying it?"
    mc "看得开心？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9481
translate chinese story05_5_6_d63f0d2d:

    # k "Nah. I’m more interested in watching him."
    k "不。我更想看他。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9485
translate chinese story05_5_6_2e9afd27:

    # k "So… what were you whispering about?"
    k "那……你们刚才嘀咕什么呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9487
translate chinese story05_5_6_bd886342:

    # mc "That obvious?"
    mc "那么明显？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9490
translate chinese story05_5_6_6229046d:

    # k "Two old men whispering behind everyone’s backs?"
    k "两个老头背着所有人嘀嘀咕咕？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9491
translate chinese story05_5_6_de29071f:

    # k "The whole camp noticed."
    k "全营地都看见了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9495
translate chinese story05_5_6_917a12cb:

    # mc "How’s your wound?"
    mc "你的伤怎么样？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9498
translate chinese story05_5_6_dcc678cf:

    # k "Honestly?"
    k "说实话？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9499
translate chinese story05_5_6_ff8ee4e6:

    # k "Like shit. I’ll live, but it hurts like hell."
    k "烂透了。死不了，但疼得要命。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9503
translate chinese story05_5_6_51d48dc6:

    # mc "Take it off. I need to check how it—"
    mc "脱了。我得看看它——"

# game/Story04.rpy:9506
translate chinese story05_5_6_bf832a13:

    # k "No."
    k "不行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9508
translate chinese story05_5_6_9b60042c:

    # mc "I’ve already seen it, so—"
    mc "我都看过了，所以——"

# game/Story04.rpy:9510
translate chinese story05_5_6_1ffaf74c:

    # mc "(She’s red. Is she… embarrassed? No, wait, what am I doing?)"
    mc "（她脸红了。她是……不好意思了？不对，等等，我在干什么？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9512
translate chinese story05_5_6_91f1affe:

    # k "Others are watching."
    k "别人看着呢。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9516
translate chinese story05_5_6_0f0f8f78:

    # mc "(Not even trying to hide it.)"
    mc "（连藏都不藏了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9519
translate chinese story05_5_6_9d0dd685:

    # mc "But… that never bothered you before. What changed?"
    mc "可……你以前不在乎这个。怎么变了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9521
translate chinese story05_5_6_c6edbff3:

    # k "No means no."
    k "不行就是不行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9524
translate chinese story05_5_6_96de68f4:

    # keep3 "It’s the miasma."
    keep3 "是瘴气。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9526
translate chinese story05_5_6_97dade16:

    # mc "(Care to elaborate?)"
    mc "（能说清楚点吗？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9527
translate chinese story05_5_6_4b70651f:

    # keep3 "The implants used to dull emotions completely."
    keep3 "植入体以前会完全钝化情绪。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9529
translate chinese story05_5_6_790c4588:

    # keep3 "But once you damaged them, that effect stopped working."
    keep3 "可你破坏它们之后，那个效果就失效了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9530
translate chinese story05_5_6_27e6ae11:

    # keep3 "What you see now is the result."
    keep3 "你现在看到的就是结果。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9531
translate chinese story05_5_6_2ce665f2:

    # mc "(Maybe. Or maybe there’s more to it.)"
    mc "（也许吧。也许还有别的原因。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9534
translate chinese story05_5_6_a8be934d:

    # mc "Listen. I’m responsible for you."
    mc "听着。我得对你负责。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9535
translate chinese story05_5_6_8dd1ac38:

    # mc "And I need to know if you’re alright."
    mc "我得确认你没事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9538
translate chinese story05_5_6_6651ab87:

    # mc "Alright."
    mc "行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9539
translate chinese story05_5_6_4f94a11d:

    # mc "We’ll find somewhere more private."
    mc "我们找个更私密的地方。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9540
translate chinese story05_5_6_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9543
translate chinese story05_5_6_996f037d:

    # k "Thanks, old man."
    k "谢了，老头。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9546
translate chinese story05_5_6_bdc003c0:

    # Mi "I… overheard that you were having some trouble."
    Mi "我……听到了，你们遇到了点麻烦。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9548
translate chinese story05_5_6_352ab7f2:

    # Mi "And… I could show you a place."
    Mi "而且……我可以带你们去个地方。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9554
translate chinese story05_5_6_9e0efdff:

    # Mi "(whispering) If you’d like."
    Mi "（低声）如果你们愿意的话。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9556
translate chinese story05_5_6_0b348ba0:

    # mc "…Alright."
    mc "……好。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9558
translate chinese story05_5_6_71f825dc:

    # Mi "Then… follow me."
    Mi "那……跟我来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9562
translate chinese story05_5_6_38c2c890:

    # mc "So… what’s the occasion?"
    mc "那……这是什么场合？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9564
translate chinese story05_5_6_b0442d1a:

    # Mi "It is… our annual day of remembrance. We honor those who perished in the tragedy."
    Mi "是……我们一年一度的纪念日。我们缅怀在那场悲剧中死去的人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9565
translate chinese story05_5_6_5414458b:

    # mc "You mean El— …your Highness’s grandfather?"
    mc "你是说埃——……殿下的祖父？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9567
translate chinese story05_5_6_bddc88bb:

    # Mi "Yes."
    Mi "是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9568
translate chinese story05_5_6_ac242372:

    # Mi "The deeds of our progenitor, Eldrindor."
    Mi "我们的先祖，埃尔德林多的事迹。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9570
translate chinese story05_5_6_1c260c86:

    # k "Funny. I don’t see much mourning."
    k "有意思。我可没看见多少哀悼。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9571
translate chinese story05_5_6_afe4b16c:

    # k "More like celebration."
    k "更像庆祝。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9572
translate chinese story05_5_6_11ed92ca:

    # k "Looks strange."
    k "看着怪。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9574
translate chinese story05_5_6_d07a9da0:

    # Mi "Tears won’t bring the dead back."
    Mi "眼泪唤不回死人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9575
translate chinese story05_5_6_1cb6a1b7:

    # Mi "And I don’t think they’d want to see their loved ones weep."
    Mi "而且我觉得他们也不想看见亲人哭。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9576
translate chinese story05_5_6_f54ce31b:

    # Mi "So we celebrate."
    Mi "所以我们庆祝。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9577
translate chinese story05_5_6_53368c23:

    # Mi "We remember with life, not sorrow."
    Mi "我们以生命去纪念，而不是悲伤。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9579
translate chinese story05_5_6_984bb045:

    # k "I’ve heard of that. Still feels odd."
    k "我听过这种。还是觉得怪。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9581
translate chinese story05_5_6_fcfbdca9:

    # Mi "If you prefer tears, that’s your choice."
    Mi "你要更喜欢眼泪，那是你的选择。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9582
translate chinese story05_5_6_ce7ee942:

    # Mi "We chose a different path."
    Mi "我们选了另一条路。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9585
translate chinese story05_5_6_885df22b:

    # elf "YEE-HEE-HEY!"
    elf "咿——嘿——嘿！"

# game/Story04.rpy:9591
translate chinese story05_5_6_055e3625:

    # Mi "Reyka, Leila, you alright?"
    Mi "蕾卡、蕾拉，你们没事吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9594
translate chinese story05_5_6_316253ac:

    # elf "All good!"
    elf "没事！"

# game/Story04.rpy:9598
translate chinese story05_5_6_a21b180a:

    # mc "Sorry… if her words hit a nerve."
    mc "抱歉……她的话要是戳到痛处了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9600
translate chinese story05_5_6_f9d3c56f:

    # Mi "N-no, it’s alright. For us… it’s an old wound."
    Mi "不、不，没事。对我们来说……是旧伤了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9601
translate chinese story05_5_6_95fca8bb:

    # Mi "But… about that promise—"
    Mi "不过……关于那个承诺——"

# game/Story04.rpy:9603
translate chinese story05_5_6_dbd06f47:

    # mc "That was just an off—"
    mc "那只是一时——"

# game/Story04.rpy:9604
translate chinese story05_5_6_9e00b9f4:

    # mc "(Wait… she refused back then… and now…?)"
    mc "（等等……她当时拒绝了……现在……？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9606
translate chinese story05_5_6_4075d740:

    # mc "So… you agreed?"
    mc "所以……你答应了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9609
translate chinese story05_5_6_12b9d1aa:

    # Mi "After what you said about your bond with my teacher…"
    Mi "在你说了你跟我老师之间的羁绊之后……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9610
translate chinese story05_5_6_60bd3f51:

    # Mi "I went to see him."
    Mi "我去见了他。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9611
translate chinese story05_5_6_fe04e153:

    # Mi "He… explained the bigger picture."
    Mi "他……解释了大局。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9612
translate chinese story05_5_6_615488fb:

    # Mi "I agreed."
    Mi "我答应了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9613
translate chinese story05_5_6_054c5ee0:

    # mc "I see."
    mc "明白了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9614
translate chinese story05_5_6_c15f640f:

    # Mi "But how exactly do you plan to improve our situation?"
    Mi "可你究竟打算怎么改善我们的处境？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9617
translate chinese story05_5_6_086b12f2:

    # mc "(…And what am I supposed to say to that?)"
    mc "（……这我该说什么？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9618
translate chinese story05_5_6_1584b368:

    # mc "I’ll be honest with you. I was acting on the fly."
    mc "我实话跟你说吧。我当时是临时起意。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9620
translate chinese story05_5_6_48a39d86:

    # mc "I didn’t really have a plan, but before facing Gorem, I wanted allies."
    mc "我其实没什么计划，但在面对戈雷姆之前，我想要盟友。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9621
translate chinese story05_5_6_e9348c35:

    # mc "Then… together, we could figure something out."
    mc "然后……一起想办法。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9623
translate chinese story05_5_6_2a9f1c2f:

    # mc "That was the idea."
    mc "当时是这么想的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9625
translate chinese story05_5_6_d91b06da:

    # Mi "Just as I thought…"
    Mi "果然……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9630
translate chinese story05_5_6_0567404e:

    # Mi "You really aren’t that different from how my teacher described you."
    Mi "你真的跟老师描述的不太一样。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9633
translate chinese story05_5_6_fee5441d:

    # mc "(She’s… laughing?)"
    mc "（她……笑了？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9634
translate chinese story05_5_6_167f5f66:

    # k "(whispering) You seeing this too?"
    k "（低声）你也看见了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9636
translate chinese story05_5_6_eb8d2487:

    # mc "(whispering) Yeah… like spotting a unicorn."
    mc "（低声）嗯……跟见着独角兽似的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9637
translate chinese story05_5_6_09cb7fac:

    # k "(whispering) A what?"
    k "（低声）什么兽？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9640
translate chinese story05_5_6_785c3f5f:

    # mc "(whispering) Horse with a horn."
    mc "（低声）长角的马。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9642
translate chinese story05_5_6_f5689c1f:

    # k "(whispering) A hors—"
    k "（低声）长角的——"

# game/Story04.rpy:9645
translate chinese story05_5_6_a7f612db:

    # mc "(whispering) Forget it."
    mc "（低声）算了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9647
translate chinese story05_5_6_7d84c1a2:

    # Mi "Why are you both staring?"
    Mi "你们俩干嘛盯着看？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9649
translate chinese story05_5_6_5df7d9fc:

    # mc "You have a beautiful smile."
    mc "你笑起来很好看。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9651
translate chinese story05_5_6_da3fdbf1:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9654
translate chinese story05_5_6_e54869ef:

    # Mi "Wha— I— No! That’s… embarrassing."
    Mi "什——我——不！那……很尴尬。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9659
translate chinese story05_5_6_be9161c2:

    # mc "Can I ask you something?"
    mc "我能问你件事吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9661
translate chinese story05_5_6_b18f716a:

    # mc "How… did you remember us?"
    mc "你……是怎么想起我们的？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9664
translate chinese story05_5_6_da3fdbf1_1:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9666
translate chinese story05_5_6_3e57af02:

    # Mi "When you began following me… something felt strange."
    Mi "你开始跟着我的时候……感觉有点怪。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9667
translate chinese story05_5_6_5d07cbe2:

    # Mi "Like we had met before."
    Mi "像我们以前见过。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9671
translate chinese story05_5_6_c80d323e:

    # Mi "Even though I was seeing you for the first time…"
    Mi "虽然我明明是第一次见你……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9672
translate chinese story05_5_6_507bf0dd:

    # Mi "It felt wrong."
    Mi "可就是不对劲。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9673
translate chinese story05_5_6_501fdd76:

    # Mi "I knew bringing you to the camp was reckless… but the feeling wouldn’t leave me."
    Mi "我知道带你们来营地太鲁莽……可那种感觉赶不走。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9677
translate chinese story05_5_6_2aa612f2:

    # Mi "And then…"
    Mi "然后……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9678
translate chinese story05_5_6_637c8de7:

    # Mi "When you said my name…"
    Mi "当你说出我名字的时候……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9679
translate chinese story05_5_6_0c36fd62:

    # Mi "Everything just… went foggy."
    Mi "一切就……变得雾蒙蒙的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9680
translate chinese story05_5_6_a3c2c28a:

    # Mi "…and fragments of memory began to surface."
    Mi "……然后记忆的碎片开始浮上来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9684
translate chinese story05_5_6_eb994151:

    # mc "And you believed right away?"
    mc "你立刻就信了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9686
translate chinese story05_5_6_43322abd:

    # Mi "Not completely."
    Mi "不完全是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9687
translate chinese story05_5_6_d9584bc7:

    # Mi "I thought maybe it was just my imagination…"
    Mi "我想也许只是我的想象……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9688
translate chinese story05_5_6_4ad2a403:

    # Mi "But after speaking with my teacher…"
    Mi "可跟老师谈过之后……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9689
translate chinese story05_5_6_5f6ce5c9:

    # Mi "(whispering) …yes."
    Mi "（低声）……是的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9691
translate chinese story05_5_6_051ee3b4:

    # Mi "I-in any case, we’re here."
    Mi "总、总之，我们到了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9693
translate chinese story05_5_6_777b3d8c:

    # Mi "Straight ahead, then left. You’ll find the infirmary there."
    Mi "一直往前，然后左转。医务室就在那儿。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9694
translate chinese story05_5_6_40d87a72:

    # Mi "I… should go warn the others."
    Mi "我……该去通知其他人了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9695
translate chinese story05_5_6_fd734325:

    # Mi "And see if I can find something for you."
    Mi "再看看能不能给你们找点东西。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9696
translate chinese story05_5_6_bc8c48e2:

    # mc "Thanks, Mir."
    mc "谢了，米尔。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9697
translate chinese story05_5_6_1b43e661:

    # Mi "Don’t mention it."
    mi "别客气。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9701
translate chinese story05_5_6_2587af90:

    # "A moment later, inside the camp’s infirmary."
    "片刻之后，营地医务室内。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9704
translate chinese story05_5_6_0efe8f9c:

    # k "So… how is it?"
    k "那……怎么样？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9706
translate chinese story05_5_6_f2384581:

    # mc "Hard to say."
    mc "不好说。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9707
translate chinese story05_5_6_5de908a8:

    # mc "Looks better than before."
    mc "比之前看着好点了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9709
translate chinese story05_5_6_487c4ee4:

    # k "You know, old man… I’ve been thinking."
    k "你知道吗，老头……我一直在想。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9711
translate chinese story05_5_6_35ef0978:

    # mc "Oh? About what?"
    mc "哦？想什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9714
translate chinese story05_5_6_c341be47:

    # k "How fragile we really are."
    k "我们到底有多脆。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9715
translate chinese story05_5_6_7be13e1c:

    # k "Just one blow, and I was gone."
    k "一下就没了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9716
translate chinese story05_5_6_1b6b80dd:

    # k "Funny, isn’t it?"
    k "好笑吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9717
translate chinese story05_5_6_0009550b:

    # k "Years of training… and it all means nothing."
    k "练了那么多年……全没用。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9718
translate chinese story05_5_6_3b9aa239:

    # mc "Sometimes there are limits you simply can’t push past."
    mc "有些极限，你就是推不过去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9721
translate chinese story05_5_6_8fcbeecb:

    # k "Hey, hey."
    k "喂，喂。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9722
translate chinese story05_5_6_708b61e2:

    # k "Aren’t you supposed to be encouraging me?"
    k "你不是该鼓励我吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9724
translate chinese story05_5_6_c6e878ec:

    # mc "I could."
    mc "我可以。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9725
translate chinese story05_5_6_6e06bc32:

    # mc "But I doubt that’s what you need."
    mc "但我觉得你不需要那个。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9726
translate chinese story05_5_6_82091822_1:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9727
translate chinese story05_5_6_dd4dd131:

    # mc "You’re scared."
    mc "你怕了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9729
translate chinese story05_5_6_e2950a83:

    # k "And if I am?"
    k "是又怎样？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9730
translate chinese story05_5_6_7a76895c:

    # k "So what?"
    k "那又怎样？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9732
translate chinese story05_5_6_7f8634a5:

    # mc "People treat fear of death like it’s a flaw."
    mc "人们把怕死当成一种缺陷。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9733
translate chinese story05_5_6_2e1ea064:

    # mc "“You’re a coward,” they say."
    mc "“你是懦夫，”他们这么说。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9734
translate chinese story05_5_6_7973272c:

    # mc "But there’s nothing wrong with valuing your life."
    mc "可珍惜自己的命，没什么错。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9736
translate chinese story05_5_6_02c4c5b6:

    # k "Easy for you to sa—"
    k "你说得倒轻——"

# game/Story04.rpy:9739
translate chinese story05_5_6_01028063:

    # k "Ah~~"
    k "啊~~"

# game/Story04.rpy:9740
translate chinese story05_5_6_b0b29fce:

    # "A soft breath escapes her."
    "一声轻叹从她唇边逸出。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9742
translate chinese story05_5_6_6389feea:

    # mc "What I see… is a frightened girl."
    mc "我看到的……是个害怕的姑娘。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9743
translate chinese story05_5_6_3a313078:

    # mc "Someone who’s afraid to open up to others."
    mc "一个不敢对别人敞开心的人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9747
translate chinese story05_5_6_f110a669:

    # k "Oh, screw you."
    k "哦，去你的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9750
translate chinese story05_5_6_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9751
translate chinese story05_5_6_df2200c3:

    # k "Why’d you go quiet?"
    k "你怎么不说话了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9752
translate chinese story05_5_6_0ef06fc7:

    # mc "You have a lot of scars."
    mc "你身上疤不少。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9753
translate chinese story05_5_6_ec170f8c:

    # k "Oh, I know."
    k "哦，我知道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9754
translate chinese story05_5_6_15a1bf39:

    # k "Ugly, right?"
    k "很难看，是吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9757
translate chinese story05_5_6_94a74d26:

    # mc "I’ve told you what I think of them."
    mc "我跟你说过我怎么看它们。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9758
translate chinese story05_5_6_7bf1b6f8:

    # k "You’re a damn weirdo if you find them attractive, old man."
    k "你要是觉得那玩意儿好看，你就是个怪胎，老头。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9760
translate chinese story05_5_6_2034c056:

    # mc "Maybe."
    mc "也许吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9761
translate chinese story05_5_6_2c1cf9d4:

    # mc "But every scar is a memory."
    mc "可每一道疤都是记忆。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9762
translate chinese story05_5_6_c09e0610:

    # mc "A story."
    mc "一个故事。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9763
translate chinese story05_5_6_35a2c34c:

    # mc "Experience."
    mc "一段经历。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9764
translate chinese story05_5_6_88444da5:

    # mc "Nothing to be ashamed of."
    mc "没什么可羞耻的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9766
translate chinese story05_5_6_698186b1:

    # k "(Afraid? What nonsense. I’m an Inquisitor. I don’t feel fear!)"
    k "（怕？胡扯。我是审判官。我不知道什么叫恐惧！）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9768
translate chinese story05_5_6_fa158edb:

    # k "(And yet… I’m sitting here naked in front of him.)"
    k "（可……我就这么光着坐在他面前。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9769
translate chinese story05_5_6_0d648640:

    # k "(And he’s not even looking at me like a woman.)"
    k "（而他根本没把我当女人看。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9771
translate chinese story05_5_6_81c7cb8e:

    # k "(What’s the catch? What does he get out of this?)"
    k "（有什么条件？他图什么？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9772
translate chinese story05_5_6_74ff01f4:

    # k "(No… I don’t want him looking at me like that.)"
    k "（不……我不想让他那样看我。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9775
translate chinese story05_5_6_df1310b3:

    # k "(It’s… uncomfortable.)"
    k "（这……难受。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9777
translate chinese story05_5_6_2ed83991:

    # mc "Something wrong?"
    mc "怎么了？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9779
translate chinese story05_5_6_e8ef540f:

    # k "Just… thought you’d jump me."
    k "就……以为你会扑上来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9780
translate chinese story05_5_6_1e1ebeb5:

    # k "Not… this."
    k "不是……这样。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9782
translate chinese story05_5_6_a66b2e65:

    # mc "Sometimes simple care can do more than anything else."
    mc "有时候简单的关心，比什么都管用。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9784
translate chinese story05_5_6_aeef74c6:

    # k "Hmph…"
    k "哼……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9785
translate chinese story05_5_6_9680a338:

    # mc "(Her worldview’s not that different from Olivia’s. Both expect a trap in even the simplest kindness…)"
    mc "（她跟奥利维亚看世界的方式差不多。哪怕最简单的善意，她们都觉得里头有陷阱……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9787
translate chinese story05_5_6_58942dfd:

    # mc "(Because opening up is terrifying.)"
    mc "（因为敞开心扉太吓人了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9791
translate chinese story05_5_6_4ee8e6f7:

    # mc "You need rest."
    mc "你需要休息。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9792
translate chinese story05_5_6_7d63d63c:

    # mc "So relax at the festival tonight."
    mc "今晚的庆典，就放松点。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9795
translate chinese story05_5_6_b31dd769:

    # mc "I’ll handle the rest."
    mc "剩下的我来。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9800
translate chinese story05_5_6_9790cac2:

    # mc "Alright?"
    mc "行吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9803
translate chinese story05_5_6_5dd070ef:

    # k "Mhm..."
    k "嗯……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9806
translate chinese story05_5_6_7881f9e6:

    # Mi "How is she?"
    Mi "她怎么样？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9807
translate chinese story05_5_6_014d4242:

    # mc "Better."
    mc "好多了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9809
translate chinese story05_5_6_55ac4c18:

    # Mi "I’m glad to hear that."
    Mi "很高兴听你这么说。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9811
translate chinese story05_5_6_9969bdbf:

    # mc "So… how are things here?"
    mc "那……这儿情况怎么样？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9813
translate chinese story05_5_6_3dff179e:

    # Mi "The camp has mostly accepted your presence."
    Mi "营地基本接受了你们的存在。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9814
translate chinese story05_5_6_0e927f2b:

    # Mi "There were a few objections, but I handled them."
    Mi "有几个人反对，但我处理了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9816
translate chinese story05_5_6_bc8c48e2_1:

    # mc "Thanks, Mir."
    mc "谢了，米尔。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9817
translate chinese story05_5_6_da3fdbf1_2:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9819
translate chinese story05_5_6_09752471:

    # mc "Something bothering you?"
    mc "有心事？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9821
translate chinese story05_5_6_63450149:

    # Mi "How did you—"
    Mi "你怎么——"

# game/Story04.rpy:9823
translate chinese story05_5_6_30c3fa28:

    # k "Your face gives you away."
    k "你脸出卖你了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9824
translate chinese story05_5_6_da3fdbf1_3:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9826
translate chinese story05_5_6_16765f0d:

    # Mi "I… would like to know more about you."
    Mi "我……想多了解了解你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9827
translate chinese story05_5_6_31bd81a8:

    # Mi "But I also understand this may not be the right moment."
    Mi "可我也明白，现在可能不是时候。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9829
translate chinese story05_5_6_ea6752a0:

    # k "Why not?"
    k "怎么不是？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9830
translate chinese story05_5_6_0b47e122:

    # k "We’ve got plenty of time."
    k "我们时间多的是。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9832
translate chinese story05_5_6_d799eefe:

    # Mi "Because of the ceremonial dance."
    Mi "因为典礼舞。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9833
translate chinese story05_5_6_9818d7d1:

    # Mi "Speaking of which… would you like to join?"
    Mi "说到这个……你们要参加吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9835
translate chinese story05_5_6_732420f7:

    # k "I don’t really care either way. If the old man’s in, so am I."
    k "我无所谓。老头参加，我就参加。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9836
translate chinese story05_5_6_843215c2:

    # k "What do you say?"
    k "你说呢？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9838
translate chinese story05_5_6_56c3991c:

    # mc "Why not?"
    mc "有何不可？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9840
translate chinese story05_5_6_8b18a527:

    # Mi "But… you’ll need to change your clothes."
    Mi "不过……你们得换身衣服。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9841
translate chinese story05_5_6_d1598945:

    # Mi "I understand you came here with good intentions, but to the others, you’re still outsiders."
    Mi "我知道你们是带着好意来的，可对其他人来说，你们仍是外人。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9843
translate chinese story05_5_6_77777dba:

    # mc "Just clothes?"
    mc "只是换衣服？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9844
translate chinese story05_5_6_0dff760d:

    # mc "Or anything else?"
    mc "还有别的吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9846
translate chinese story05_5_6_866f6a16:

    # Mi "Under no circumstances are you to draw your weapon."
    Mi "任何情况下都不许拔武器。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9847
translate chinese story05_5_6_ce373602:

    # Mi "No matter what happens… please don’t."
    Mi "不管发生什么……都别拔。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9848
translate chinese story05_5_6_2df38b83:

    # Mi "That’s my promise to the camp."
    Mi "这是我对营地的承诺。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9850
translate chinese story05_5_6_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9851
translate chinese story05_5_6_cfe22840:

    # mc "Even if my life’s at risk?"
    mc "哪怕我的命有危险？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9853
translate chinese story05_5_6_e48d80fb:

    # Mi "I’ll handle it."
    Mi "我来处理。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9855
translate chinese story05_5_6_6651ab87_1:

    # mc "Alright."
    mc "行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9857
translate chinese story05_5_6_b8de4dad:

    # "([mc] steps away to change.)"
    "（[mc] 退下去换衣服。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9860
translate chinese story05_5_6_07e30edc:

    # k "Tell me, pointy-ears… what is really going on?"
    k "告诉我，尖耳朵……到底怎么回事？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9862
translate chinese story05_5_6_1df40c71:

    # Mi "I don’t see what you mean."
    Mi "我不明白你什么意思。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9864
translate chinese story05_5_6_199a57cc:

    # k "You could’ve taken his weapon."
    k "你本可以收了他的武器。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9865
translate chinese story05_5_6_039ac7fe:

    # k "Why didn’t you?"
    k "为什么没这么做？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9866
translate chinese story05_5_6_da3fdbf1_4:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9868
translate chinese story05_5_6_2835b587:

    # k "Got me thinking."
    k "让我琢磨了一下。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9869
translate chinese story05_5_6_48ef58b4:

    # k "You sure you can protect us?"
    k "你确定能护住我们？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9871
translate chinese story05_5_6_61458f41:

    # mc "We’re not children."
    mc "我们不是小孩。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9872
translate chinese story05_5_6_16392823:

    # mc "We can handle ourselves."
    mc "我们自己能应付。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9876
translate chinese story05_5_6_850ef128:

    # b "..."
    b "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9878
translate chinese story05_5_6_11455b53_1:

    # mc "What?"
    mc "怎么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9880
translate chinese story05_5_6_d1474e3e:

    # k "Pointy-ears… I’ll give you this, you’ve got great taste."
    k "尖耳朵……这我得承认，你品味不错。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9881
translate chinese story05_5_6_047e35a3:

    # Mi "Yes. Thank you."
    Mi "嗯。谢谢。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9885
translate chinese story05_5_6_cadbfc1a:

    # "A moment later, they stepped out of the infirmary, making their way toward the center of the camp.."
    "片刻之后，他们走出医务室，往营地中心走去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9889
translate chinese story05_5_6_c1278d33:

    # k "Why the long face? We’re at a festival, at least pretend to smile."
    k "干嘛板着脸？我们在过节，至少装个笑。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9891
translate chinese story05_5_6_e29810e6:

    # mc "I am happy."
    mc "我挺高兴的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9893
translate chinese story05_5_6_6c3c49b9:

    # k "My ass you are."
    k "高兴个屁。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9894
translate chinese story05_5_6_1af8690e:

    # k "Talk. What’s wrong? You were fine a minute ago."
    k "说吧。怎么了？你刚才还好好的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9895
translate chinese story05_5_6_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9897
translate chinese story05_5_6_91e98007:

    # mc "The thought that I ran off and left them there…"
    mc "一想到我就这么跑了，把她们扔在那儿……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9898
translate chinese story05_5_6_7d8489e9:

    # mc "It won’t leave me alone."
    mc "就甩不掉。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9899
translate chinese story05_5_6_bb7453a6:

    # mc "Feels… wrong."
    mc "感觉……不对。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9901
translate chinese story05_5_6_80e357f5:

    # k "We’re all in the same boat."
    k "我们都在同一条船上。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9902
translate chinese story05_5_6_cbd1e4e9:

    # k "Only difference, you don’t have a hole in your chest."
    k "唯一的区别，是你胸口没个洞。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9905
translate chinese story05_5_6_b535bada:

    # k "You know… you should try it sometime. It really changes how you see things."
    k "你知道吗……你也该试试。那真能改变你看事情的方式。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9907
translate chinese story05_5_6_7a83341a:

    # mc "Funny, coming from you."
    mc "这话从你嘴里说出来，真好笑。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9909
translate chinese story05_5_6_cecfedf4:

    # k "I admit, you’re a bad influence."
    k "我承认，你是个坏影响。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9910
translate chinese story05_5_6_0d8dd6d4:

    # k "Before, I’d charge straight into the slaughter without thinking."
    k "以前，我会不想后果就直冲进屠杀里。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9911
translate chinese story05_5_6_4333a3ed:

    # k "Now…"
    k "现在……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9912
translate chinese story05_5_6_70f6980c:

    # k "I still do, just with a thought."
    k "我还是冲，只是会先想一下。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9914
translate chinese story05_5_6_ae106357:

    # mc "Progress—"
    mc "有进步——"

# game/Story04.rpy:9916
translate chinese story05_5_6_2f11cca2:

    # k "You okay?"
    k "你没事吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9923
translate chinese story05_5_6_6556f98b:

    # k "…Damn. She’s practically naked."
    k "……妈的。她几乎等于没穿。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9928
translate chinese story05_5_6_50e9ed7a:

    # mc "Didn’t think that would surprise you."
    mc "没想到这还能让你吃惊。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9929
translate chinese story05_5_6_dde4a57c:

    # k "Old man, anyone would be surprised."
    k "老头，谁都会吃惊。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9930
translate chinese story05_5_6_731d2643:

    # k "You’ve seen how modest pointy-ears usually dresses."
    k "你也见过尖耳朵平时穿得多保守。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9931
translate chinese story05_5_6_3475db9b:

    # k "Now compare that to {b}this."
    k "现在拿那个跟{b}这个{/b}比比。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9934
translate chinese story05_5_6_7008eaa4:

    # mc "Don’t forget, we’re still in the past."
    mc "别忘了，我们还在过去。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9935
translate chinese story05_5_6_e72ecbea:

    # k "Which makes it even more interesting."
    k "那就更有意思了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9936
translate chinese story05_5_6_3cf640dc:

    # k "People don’t just flip their worldview like that."
    k "人不会就这么把世界观翻个面。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9939
translate chinese story05_5_6_6bef1101:

    # mc "Didn’t expect to see you like this…"
    mc "没想到会看你这样……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9941
translate chinese story05_5_6_b19aaea8:

    # Mi "Is something wrong?"
    Mi "有什么问题吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9943
translate chinese story05_5_6_fc842b4e:

    # mc "You’re always so reserved… but right now there’s none of that left."
    mc "你一直那么内敛……可现在一点都看不到了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9945
translate chinese story05_5_6_7f2d3858:

    # Mi "I don’t understand."
    Mi "我不明白。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9947
translate chinese story05_5_6_c2e63e73:

    # k "Your outfit, pointy-ears. It barely covers anything."
    k "你的衣服，尖耳朵。什么都遮不住。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9948
translate chinese story05_5_6_f456be65:

    # Mi "Does it?"
    Mi "是吗？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9949
translate chinese story05_5_6_babe1c96:

    # Mi "Everything essential is concealed."
    Mi "该遮的都遮住了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9951
translate chinese story05_5_6_43b4df7b:

    # mc "If you’re comfortable, who are we to judge?"
    mc "你要是自在，我们凭什么评判？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9952
translate chinese story05_5_6_a53fe81e:

    # mc "But… what is this?"
    mc "不过……这是什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9953
translate chinese story05_5_6_f1af92db:

    # Mi "We only wear it on special occasions."
    Mi "我们只在特殊场合穿。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9954
translate chinese story05_5_6_0fc246e8:

    # Mi "It’s a tradition passed down from ancient times."
    Mi "这是从远古传下来的传统。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9960
translate chinese story05_5_6_4aa34161:

    # k "Sounds like your ancestors were just perverts."
    k "听着像你祖宗就是群色鬼。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9962
translate chinese story05_5_6_732c19c3:

    # Mi "People see what troubles their own hearts."
    Mi "人看见的，是自己心里不安的东西。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9963
translate chinese story05_5_6_293d740e:

    # Mi "They were pure of spirit."
    Mi "他们心灵纯净。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9964
translate chinese story05_5_6_6fe4a46f:

    # Mi "Unlike you, pervert."
    Mi "不像你，色鬼。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9967
translate chinese story05_5_6_cf7897a9:

    # Mi "You are guests here. So as I respect your culture…"
    Mi "你们在这儿是客人。既然我尊重你们的文化……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9968
translate chinese story05_5_6_347572aa:

    # Mi "please respect mine."
    Mi "也请尊重我的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9970
translate chinese story05_5_6_74a4ec79:

    # mc "(She’s right. Who am I to judge another culture?)"
    mc "（她说得对。我凭什么评判别的文化？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9971
translate chinese story05_5_6_0f247129:

    # mc "You’re right. That was tactless of us."
    mc "你说得对。是我们不懂分寸。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9973
translate chinese story05_5_6_55ac4c18_1:

    # Mi "I’m glad to hear that."
    Mi "很高兴听你这么说。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9974
translate chinese story05_5_6_4754f092:

    # Mi "Enjoy yourselves, I need to check on something."
    Mi "你们玩得开心，我去看看点东西。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9977
translate chinese story05_5_6_3c1b17a7:

    # k "(whispering) “Pervert”?"
    k "（低声）“色鬼”？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9978
translate chinese story05_5_6_a6d10dc0:

    # k "(whispering) Hearing that from her… must’ve hit a nerve."
    k "（低声）从她嘴里听到这词……肯定戳到你了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9980
translate chinese story05_5_6_3b89b2a0:

    # mc "Next time, choose your words more carefully."
    mc "下次说话注意点。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9981
translate chinese story05_5_6_b9ef785c:

    # mc "Last thing we need is to damage relations with her."
    mc "我们最不需要的，就是跟她把关系搞僵。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9982
translate chinese story05_5_6_176c1585:

    # mc "It wasn’t the outfit that surprised you."
    mc "让你吃惊的不是那身衣服。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9983
translate chinese story05_5_6_ae0ee8d6:

    # mc "It was how open she was."
    mc "是她那份坦然。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9985
translate chinese story05_5_6_82091822_2:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:9986
translate chinese story05_5_6_8a22ffaf:

    # k "I’m not promising anything."
    k "我可保证不了什么。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9988
translate chinese story05_5_6_209eed3d:

    # k "So, what now?"
    k "那，现在干嘛？"

# game/Story04.rpy:9989
translate chinese story05_5_6_f327d0d2:

    # k "I’m bored."
    k "我无聊。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9991
translate chinese story05_5_6_e9ddcfa8:

    # mc "Sounds like they’re having trouble."
    mc "听着像他们遇到麻烦了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:9993
translate chinese story05_5_6_7cb88b91:

    # elf "Ú-istam si. Hi dîr tolatha erchir. Garo nin i FEB hi danna. \n(We don’t know, she should’ve arrived by now. We’re worried the FEB may have taken her.)"
    elf "Ú-istam si. Hi dîr tolatha erchir. Garo nin i FEB hi danna. \n（我们不知道，她早该到了。我们担心 F.E.B. 把她带走了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9994
translate chinese story05_5_6_fa7d22ed:

    # elf "Rau veleg danna o lû si… \n(They’ve been getting more aggressive lately…)"
    elf "Rau veleg danna o lû si… \n（他们最近越来越凶了……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9996
translate chinese story05_5_6_bd1029ad:

    # Mi "An i sen angen nin i mereth hen veleg. \n(That’s exactly why we need this festival.)"
    Mi "An i sen angen nin i mereth hen veleg. \n（所以我们才需要这场庆典。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9997
translate chinese story05_5_6_1ad0bc4e:

    # Mi "Ae ú-badam hen… rand veleg danna na nin. \n(Without it… problems may arise.)"
    Mi "Ae ú-badam hen… rand veleg danna na nin. \n（没有它……可能会出问题。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:9999
translate chinese story05_5_6_126d1caa:

    # elf "Mir, melin chen, ach… \n(Mir, I love you, but…)"
    elf "Mir, melin chen, ach… \n（米尔，我爱你，可是……）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10000translate chinese story05_5_6_9787a67a:

    # elf "Ú-beria i narn oen nin an i lû hen. \n(Instruments alone won’t carry us.)"
    elf "Ú-beria i narn oen nin an i lû hen. \n（光靠乐器撑不住我们。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10002
translate chinese story05_5_6_a15b8202:

    # Mi "Tegil nin beria hen oen. \n(Then we’ll have to.)"
    Mi "Tegil nin beria hen oen. \n（那就得撑住。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10004
translate chinese story05_5_6_d840dc58:

    # elf "..."
    elf "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:10005
translate chinese story05_5_6_b78e0fb0:

    # elf "Nae… badam. \n(Alright.)"
    elf "Nae… badam. \n（好吧。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10008
translate chinese story05_5_6_73d15fcd:

    # mc "Hey, is everything okay?"
    mc "喂，没事吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:10010
translate chinese story05_5_6_1e90b45f:

    # Mi "It’s fine. I’ll handle it."
    Mi "没事。我来处理。"

# game/Story04.rpy:10011
translate chinese story05_5_6_ee1d5b11:

    # Mi "But thank you."
    Mi "不过谢谢你。"

# game/Story04.rpy:10012
translate chinese story05_5_6_2b35b6fe_4:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:10014
translate chinese story05_5_6_2bf5d17e:

    # mc "Kali?"
    mc "卡莉？"

# game/Story04.rpy:10016
translate chinese story05_5_6_2b1456e4:

    # k "Hm?"
    k "嗯？"

# game/Story04.rpy:10018
translate chinese story05_5_6_2687e3cf:

    # mc "You used to be an ido—"
    mc "你以前是个偶——"

# game/Story04.rpy:10020
translate chinese story05_5_6_bf832a13_1:

    # k "No."
    k "不行。"

# game/Story04.rpy:10022
translate chinese story05_5_6_56c3991c_1:

    # mc "Why not?"
    mc "为什么不行？"

# game/Story04.rpy:10024
translate chinese story05_5_6_d883636b:

    # k "That was a long time ago."
    k "那是很久以前的事了。"

# game/Story04.rpy:10025
translate chinese story05_5_6_38852c7c:

    # k "And they wouldn’t approve."
    k "而且他们不会同意的。"

# game/Story04.rpy:10026
translate chinese story05_5_6_5d3eea10:

    # k "These pointy-ears barely like their own kind. What makes you think they’d welcome someone like me?"
    k "这些尖耳朵连自己人都看不上。你凭什么觉得他们会欢迎我这种？"

# game/Story04.rpy:10028
translate chinese story05_5_6_81507a0f:

    # mc "You won’t know unless you try."
    mc "不试试怎么知道。"

# game/Story04.rpy:10030
translate chinese story05_5_6_82091822_3:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:10035
translate chinese story05_5_6_141392ab:

    # mc "Come on, I’m curious to hear how good you really were."
    mc "来吧，我挺好奇你当年到底多厉害。"

# game/Story04.rpy:10038
translate chinese story05_5_6_ed4bd9f8:

    # k "If I embarrass myself, I’m dragging you down with me."
    k "我要是丢人，就拉你一起。"

# game/Story04.rpy:10040
translate chinese story05_5_6_d477af33:

    # mc "(That’s the spirit.)"
    mc "（这才对嘛。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10043
translate chinese story05_5_6_7a8127e2:

    # keep3 "(Don’t forget why we’re here.)"
    keep3 "（别忘了我为什么来这儿。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10044
translate chinese story05_5_6_3b83b1e8:

    # mc "(If I had the option to go back, I would.)"
    mc "（要是能回去，我早回去了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10045
translate chinese story05_5_6_28ecbed6:

    # keep3 "(I know.)"
    keep3 "（我知道。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10047
translate chinese story05_5_6_0b2086a3:

    # keep3 "(And keep your weapon on you. I don’t like the atmosphere here.)"
    keep3 "（武器带着。我不喜欢这儿的气氛。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10048
translate chinese story05_5_6_bc9998ee:

    # mc "(Why?)"
    mc "（为什么？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10049
translate chinese story05_5_6_76151b58:

    # keep3 "(Call it a feeling.)"
    keep3 "（就当是直觉。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10051
translate chinese story05_5_6_61d983b0:

    # mc "(Didn’t know implants had feelings.)"
    mc "（没想到植入体还有直觉。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10052
translate chinese story05_5_6_c1747343:

    # keep3 "(I’m not an implant.)"
    keep3 "（我不是植入体。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10053
translate chinese story05_5_6_b299f4be:

    # mc "(Then what are you? You’re in my head.)"
    mc "（那你是什么？你在我的脑子里。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10054
translate chinese story05_5_6_0085e033_1:

    # keep3 "..."
    keep3 "……"

# game/Story04.rpy:10056
translate chinese story05_5_6_73dd9d58:

    # keep3 "(You don’t have sufficient clearance.)"
    keep3 "（你的权限不够。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10057
translate chinese story05_5_6_5430396f:

    # mc "Suit yourself."
    mc "随你吧。"

# game/Story04.rpy:10058
translate chinese story05_5_6_0dd976f0:

    # Mi "…Are you sure?"
    Mi "……你确定？"

# game/Story04.rpy:10061
translate chinese story05_5_6_399ee959:

    # k "Wasn’t my idea."
    k "不是我的主意。"

# game/Story04.rpy:10062
translate chinese story05_5_6_009cfd33:

    # k "All the applause goes to the old man."
    k "掌声全归老头。"

# game/Story04.rpy:10063
translate chinese story05_5_6_575aac9b:

    # k "Go on, refuse already, and I’ll return to him looking tragic, making sure to mention how awful you all are."
    k "行啊，你倒是拒绝啊，我就回去一脸悲情地告诉他你们有多差劲。"

# game/Story04.rpy:10065
translate chinese story05_5_6_fceab88e:

    # Mi "Why not give it a try?"
    Mi "何不试试？"

# game/Story04.rpy:10067
translate chinese story05_5_6_0937e324:

    # k "You’re kidding, right?"
    k "你开玩笑吧？"

# game/Story04.rpy:10068
translate chinese story05_5_6_48567651:

    # k "Do you see what I am?"
    k "你看看我是什么？"

# game/Story04.rpy:10069
translate chinese story05_5_6_6e0d7284:

    # k "Human."
    k "人类。"

# game/Story04.rpy:10070
translate chinese story05_5_6_f355650f:

    # k "Hu-man."
    k "人——类。"

# game/Story04.rpy:10072
translate chinese story05_5_6_8897c9d2:

    # Mi "Better that… than a ruined festival."
    Mi "这……总比毁掉庆典好。"

# game/Story04.rpy:10075
translate chinese story05_5_6_cfd9a82e:

    # k "You’re actually insane…"
    k "你是真疯了……"

# game/Story04.rpy:10077
translate chinese story05_5_6_6b30e884:

    # k "(Then again, I’m no better.)"
    k "（不过话说回来，我也没好到哪儿去。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10078
translate chinese story05_5_6_152246fc:

    # k "(A singer? Me?)"
    k "（唱歌？我？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10081
translate chinese story05_5_6_34267ec1:

    # k "(For the past few decades all I’ve done is tear bodies apart.)"
    k "（过去几十年我干的全是把人撕开。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10082
translate chinese story05_5_6_381c3cbe:

    # k "(And now… after all this time… they’re asking me to sing?)"
    k "（现在……过了这么久……他们让我唱歌？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10089
translate chinese story05_5_6_a54e8492:

    # k "(Hah… guess it’s been a while since I’ve humiliated myself.)"
    k "（哈……我大概有阵子没丢过人了。）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10091
translate chinese story05_5_6_19becd43:

    # k "(Doesn’t matter. The old man wanted to see what I can do?)"
    k "（无所谓。老头想看我本事？）"

# game/Story04.rpy:10093
